INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `description`, `short_description`, `price`, `sale_price`, `sku`, `stock_quantity`, `status`, `main_image_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (2186,'FMS Filter Bags','fms-filter-bags','<h3>About FMS Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Materials</strong>: FMS filter bags are often made from materials like polyester, polypropylene, aramid (Nomex), or other specialized fibers depending on the application’s temperature and chemical requirements.</li><li><strong>Efficiency</strong>: These filter bags are designed to provide high filtration efficiency, capturing fine particles and ensuring clean air or fluid output.</li><li><strong>Design</strong>: They come in various designs, including different shapes, sizes, and types of closures (snap bands, rings, etc.), to fit different types of baghouses or filtration systems.</li><li><strong>Temperature Resistance</strong>: Depending on the material, FMS filter bags can withstand varying temperature ranges, making them suitable for different industrial environments.</li><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: Some FMS filter bags are treated or made from materials that offer resistance to chemicals, ensuring longevity and performance in harsh conditions.</li></ul><hr /><h3>VS  Fiberglass Felt Filter Bags</h3><ul><li>Excellent temperature resistance, up to 260 degrees.</li><li>Wear resistance, resistance to winding, and excellent folding resistance.</li><li>Significant improvement in mechanical strength.</li><li>Initial resistance and reduced running resistance.</li><li>Filtration efficiency is improved.</li><li>Filter wind speed increase.</li><li>Significantly improved service life.</li><li>Adaptability to dust.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td>Material</td><td>Alkali-free glass fiber chopped yarn, aramid, P84.</td></tr><tr><td>Weight (g/㎡)</td><td>800</td></tr><tr><td>Thickness (mm)</td><td>2.6</td></tr><tr><td>Working temperature (instant)</td><td>280℃</td></tr><tr><td>Working temperature (long-term)</td><td>100～200℃</td></tr><tr><td>Breaking strength (warp)</td><td>400N/5×20cm</td></tr><tr><td>Breaking strength (weft)</td><td>1600N/5×20cm</td></tr><tr><td>Diameter size (mm)</td><td>100, 125, 130, 150, 18, 250, ect.</td></tr><tr><td>Filter precision (µm)</td><td>5, 10, 25, 50, 80, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300, 400, 600, 800, 1,000, 1,250.</td></tr><tr><td>Acidity</td><td>Excellent</td></tr><tr><td>Alkalinity</td><td>Excellent</td></tr><tr><td>Breathability (m³/㎡.min)</td><td>12～16</td></tr><tr><td>Post-processing method</td><td>Impregnation, drying, lamination, waterproofing.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Post-treatment</strong></h3><p>For the material of FMS filter bag, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p><ul><li>PTFE Impregnation.</li><li>PTFE Membrane.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-membrane-FMS-filter-bags-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-详情1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-详情1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-详情1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flumes-FMS-Filter-Bags-详情1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Philite® Processing Technology for FMS Filter Bags</h3><h4>Filter Bag Mouth</h4>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-head-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<ul><li>A stainless steel spring ring is installed, the bag head is the external interface, the vertical seam edge and the oblique seam line, and the outer layer is wrapped with filter material.</li></ul><h4>Filter Bag Body</h4>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-body-02-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<ul><li>The filter bag mouth and the filter bag body are connected with a single single needle thread and two double needle threads.</li><li>The bag body is sewn by a filter material crimper with three needles and six threads, the stitch length is 28-35 stitches/10cm, and the width is 6-9mm.</li><li>The bottom material of the bag body should be turned outward and upward and have a 100mm bag bottom reinforcement layer.</li><li>The edge material of the reinforcement layer is turned inward and sewn with double needles.</li><li>The three-needle seam on the seam surface of the filter bag body should be vertical to the bag mouth without bending.</li></ul><h4>Filter Bag Bottom</h4>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-bottom-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<ul><li>The filter bag body and the filter bag bottom are sewn with double or three needles.</li><li>The bottom edge of the bag body and the bag bottom are 10-12mm apart.</li><li>The bottom of the bag body can stand upright, and there is a reinforcement layer at the bottom of the filter bag.</li></ul><h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3><p>FMS filter bags are widely used in various industries where high temperatures and chemically aggressive dust collection conditions exist, making them a reliable choice for industrial filtration applications. These include air filtration, liquid filtration, petrochemicals, food and beverage production, pharmaceutical industries, electronic manufacturing, and more. They are used to remove different types of pollutants such as dust, smoke, chemicals, microorganisms, and more.</p>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-p61.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-p61.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-p61-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-p61-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Quality Assurance</h3><p>If there have any quality problems with products, we are willing to be replaced free. We collaborates with professionals from various higher education institutions to overcome technological barriers. Each engineer in our team tailors the best quality technical solutions and guidance for clients. We consider product quality as the sole factor for the survival of the enterprise, strictly controlling the factory testing process, and providing customers with world-class products. In the production process, we strive for excellence and pay attention to every detail. Every key aspect of the product undergoes 100% testing, ensuring that each delivered product is of the highest quality, allowing customers to use our products with confidence.</p> 		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情10.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情10.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情10-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情10-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-03-p81.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-03-p81.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-03-p81-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-03-p81-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-04-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-04-详情8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-04-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-04-详情8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','FMS filter bags are a new type of high temperature resistant filter material developed for dry dust removal of blast furnace gas. They are made of two or more high temperature resistant fibers mixed or layered to achieve higher and newer physical and chemical properties. Usually, P84 fiber is added to the glass fiber needle felt to make the felt layer denser, the entanglement between fibers is enhanced, and it can cope with higher filtration wind speeds. It has the characteristics of high strength, acid and alkali corrosion resistance, wear resistance, and bending resistance. After different surface chemical treatments and post-processing technologies, it also has the functions of easy cleaning, waterproof, and oil resistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2187,'2024-11-17 22:59:49','2024-11-24 20:17:47'),(2203,'Nomex Filter Bags','nomex-filter-bags','<img width=\"1024\" height=\"536\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-详情1-1024x536.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-详情1-1024x536.jpg 1024w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-详情1-300x157.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-详情1-768x402.jpg 768w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-详情1-600x314.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-详情1.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<h3>Properties of Nomex Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Heat Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>Nomex filter bags can withstand continuous operating temperatures up to 200°C (392°F) and short-term peaks up to 250°C (482°F).</p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>They offer good resistance to acids and alkalis, making them suitable for use in environments with harsh chemicals.</p><ul><li><strong>Mechanical Strength</strong></li></ul><p>Nomex fibers provide excellent mechanical strength, ensuring durability and a longer service life.</p><ul><li><strong>Abrasion Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>The inherent abrasion resistance of Nomex fibers helps the bags withstand the rigors of dust collection processes.</p><h3><strong><b>Specifications</b></strong></h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Weight (g/m2)</td><td>450</td><td>500</td><td>550</td></tr><tr><td>Thickness (mm)</td><td>2.0</td><td>2.2</td><td>2.4</td></tr><tr><td>Air permenability(m3/m2/min)</td><td>21</td><td>17</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>Tensile strength/ warp</td><td>&gt; 800</td><td>&gt; 800</td><td>&gt; 800</td></tr><tr><td>Tensile strength/ weft</td><td>&gt; 1100</td><td>&gt; 1200</td><td>&gt; 1300</td></tr><tr><td>Tensile elongation/ warp</td><td>&lt; 35</td><td>&lt; 35</td><td>&lt; 35</td></tr><tr><td>Tensile elongation/ weft</td><td>&lt; 55</td><td>&lt; 55</td><td>&lt; 55</td></tr><tr><td>Broke strength (Mpa/min)</td><td>2.55</td><td>2.40</td><td>2.35</td></tr><tr><td>Working temperature (℃)</td><td>≤ 204</td><td>≤ 204</td><td>≤ 204</td></tr><tr><td>Peak temperature (℃)</td><td>250</td><td>250</td><td>250</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"121\">Acid Resistance</td><td width=\"124\">Alkali Resistance</td><td width=\"148\">Hydrolytic Resistance</td><td width=\"154\">Oxidation Resistance</td><td width=\"147\">Abrasion Resistance</td></tr><tr><td>Good</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Technical Advantages in Manufacturing Nomex Filter Bags in Philite®</h3><ul><li>The base fabric of the aramid needle felt filter bag is made of high-quality, high-strength aramid long fibers to ensure that the filter bag has sufficient mechanical strength. It is pretreated and heat-set to form an aramid base fabric with stable size and performance.</li><li>The manufacturing process for Nomex filter bags involves a series of carefully controlled steps to ensure the final product meets the stringent requirements for industrial filtration applications. From the production of Nomex fibers to the cutting, sewing, and finishing of the filter bags, each step is designed to produce durable, high-performance filter bags capable of withstanding high temperatures and harsh chemical environments.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情2.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-详情3.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Processing Detail of Nomex Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Seam Design</strong></li></ul><p>Double-stitched seams using high-temperature resistant threads.</p><ul><li><strong>Top and Bottom Configurations</strong></li></ul><p>Available in various designs, including snap band, ring top, and flange top for easy installation and secure fitting.</p><ul><li><strong>Support Rings</strong></li></ul><p>Integrated support rings or other reinforcement structures to maintain bag shape and ensure optimal airflow.</p><ul><li><strong>Ground Wire</strong></li></ul><p>Optional grounding wire to prevent static build-up in certain applications.</p><ul><li><strong>Finish Treatment</strong></li></ul><p>Singeing, Calendering, Heat Setting, Anti-static, Water&amp;Oil Repellent, PTFE Membrane, PTFE Impregnation and so on special treatment can be chosen.</p><hr /><h3><strong><b>Application of Nomex Filter Bags</b></strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Cement Kilns and Clinker Coolers</strong></li></ul><p>Handling high-temperature and abrasive dust.</p><ul><li><strong>Steel Plants</strong></li></ul><p>Used in electric arc furnaces and other high-temperature applications.</p><ul><li><strong>Power Plants</strong></li></ul><p>Effective in fly ash collection and flue gas desulfurization units.</p><ul><li><strong>Asphalt Production</strong></li></ul><p>Suitable for hot mix asphalt production dust collection.</p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Processing</strong></li></ul><p>Employed in environments with corrosive chemicals and high temperatures.</p>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情4.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情5.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-详情6.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情8.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-02-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-02-详情9.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-02-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Manufacturing-Plant-02-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','Nomex filter bags, also known as Aramid filter bags, are known for their excellent thermal resistance, mechanical strength and chemical stability. They are commonly used in industrial applications where high temperatures and abrasive dust are present. These properties make them suitable for a variety of demanding industrial applications. Because of their resistance to high temperatures and chemicals, Nomex filter bags last longer than other filter media.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High temperature resistant.</li>\r\n 	<li>Resists flexing and abrasion.</li>\r\n 	<li>Effect of moisture.</li>\r\n 	<li>Chemical resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Dimensional stability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Flame resistance.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2204,'2024-11-17 23:11:25','2025-01-16 17:17:58'),(2290,'Pleated Filter Bags','pleated-filter-bags','<p>Ordinary bag-type dust collectors cannot meet the environmental protection requirements and must be modified to reduce the wind speed and increase the filter area of the dust collectors so as to meet the required emission standards. Pleated filter bag, also called star filter bag, is a new type of dust filter bag that can be applied to pulse bag filter. And there is a supporting dust removal framework. It is a cost-effective filtration solution that can significantly reduce costs and solve bag house capacity problems.</p><p>An innovative product from Philite®, the unique pleat design of the pleated filter bag doubles the usable fabric filter area in the same space compared to conventional cylindrical and oval filter bags. The pleats are gathered at snap-on straps at the top of the filter bag, so the pleated filter bag fits into the same cell plate holes as a standard bag of the same diameter. Horizontal bands sewn into the fabric ensure that the pleats are retained throughout its service life.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-详情1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-详情1_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-详情1_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-详情1_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-04-详情1_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-详情2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-详情2_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-详情2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-详情2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-详情2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n		<h3>Material Selection</h3><table style=\"height: 771px;\" width=\"1108\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td>Fiber Type</td><td>Continuous Operation Temperature</td><td>Max Operation Temperature</td><td>Resistance to Abrasion</td><td>Resistance to Hydrolysis</td><td>Resistance to Acid</td><td>Resistance to Alkali</td><td>Resistance to Oxidation</td></tr><tr><td>Polyvinylchloride(PVC)</td><td>75℃</td><td>80℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Polypropylene(PP)</td><td>90℃</td><td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">100℃</td><td>Good</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Poor</td></tr><tr><td>Polyamide(Nylon)</td><td>110℃</td><td>115℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Poor</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td><td>Moderate</td></tr><tr><td>Copolymer Acrylics (PAN)</td><td>120℃</td><td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">130℃</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td><td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\">Moderate</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Temp.resis.Polyolefin</td><td>125°℃</td><td>130℃</td><td>Good</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Poor</td></tr><tr><td>Homopolymer Acrylics (PAN)</td><td>125℃</td><td>140℃</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Polyester(PE/PET)</td><td>130℃</td><td>150℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Poor</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Poor</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Polyphenylenesulfide(PPS/Ryton)</td><td>190℃</td><td>200℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Poor</td></tr><tr><td>Aramid(Nomex)</td><td>204℃</td><td>220℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Poor</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Polyimide(P84)</td><td>240℃</td><td>260℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Poor</td><td>Excellent</td></tr><tr><td>Polytertra Fluoroethylene (PTFE/Telfon)</td><td>260℃</td><td>280℃</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Fiberglass</td><td>260℃</td><td>290℃</td><td>Poor</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td><td>Poor</td><td>Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>Features and Benefits of Pleated Filter Bags    </strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Significantly increase the air volume of existing dust collectors to increase production capacity</strong></li></ul><p>The use of pleated bags to retrofit existing precipitators eliminates the need to retrofit precipitator bodies and replaces existing bags and keels directly, increasing system filtration area by 50-150%, which is the best improvement program for improving the production efficiency and capacity of dedusting systems.</p><ul><li><strong>Greatly improve the collection efficiency of dust collectors, especially PM2.5 and PM10 ultrafine dust</strong></li></ul><p>The use of wrinkled bag instead of ordinary round or oval bag can greatly increase the system filter area, can directly reduce the air-cloth ratio, significantly reduce the system pressure and pulse frequency, thereby significantly reducing the system’s dust emissions, especially ultra-fine dust emissions .</p><ul><li><strong>Significantly reduce system operation energy consumption and maintenance costs</strong></li></ul><p>The use of wrinkled bag instead of ordinary round or oval bag, the pressure drop of the system is greatly reduced, the energy consumption of the fan is greatly reduced; the injection frequency is significantly reduced, and thus the compressed air usage is significantly reduced, and the loss of the injection system components is also greatly reduced.</p><ul><li><strong>Extend the life of the bag</strong></li></ul><p>The use of pleated bags instead of ordinary round or oval bags, the unique combination of filter bags and keel completely avoids the fatigue damage to the filter bags caused by the ordinary keel transverse support rings. Combined with the lower running pressure and blowing frequency, the bag fatigue damage is greatly reduced. , life expectancy is greatly extended.</p><ul><li><strong>Using a new dust collector to significantly reduce the volume of the dust collector housing</strong></li></ul><p>The new dust collector uses a fold bag instead of an ordinary round or oval cloth bag. Under the same air-batch ratio, the dust collector box and pulse injection system can be greatly reduced, and the initial equipment investment of the injection system can be reduced while ensuring or improving the system efficiency. And floor area.</p><h3>Filter Cages</h3><p>The cage of the pleated filter bag is different from the common cage, and a special cage is required due to the support requirements of pleated filter bags. A cage is an essential component in industrial filtration systems, particularly in baghouse dust collectors. Typically, it is made of metal (carbon steel, galvanized steel, or stainless steel) for durability and corrosion resistance. <strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=filter-bag-cages-2\">Learn more</a></strong>.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bag-Cages-详情3-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bag-Cages-详情3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bag-Cages-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bag-Cages-详情3-768x512.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bag-Cages-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bag-Cages-详情3.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<h3>Application of Pleated Filter Bags</h3><p>Pleated filter bags are commonly used for gas and liquid filtration in industrial and commercial applications. They are designed with a pleated structure that provides a larger filtration surface area, thereby increasing filtration efficiency and capacity.</p><ul><li><strong>Particle filtration</strong>: It can filter tiny particles in the air and liquid, such as dust, bacteria, viruses, sediment, etc. This type of filtration is commonly used in areas such as air purification systems, industrial emissions control, and drinking water treatment.</li><li><strong>Oil-water separation</strong>: In industry, it is often used to separate oil and water. They can effectively separate oil-water mixtures, protect equipment from oil contamination, and avoid oil contamination of the environment.</li><li><strong>Chemical Filtration</strong>: It can be used to filter chemicals and corrosive substances. In the chemical industry, precise filtration of liquids and gases is an important step to ensure production quality and safety.</li><li><strong>Food and Beverage Processing</strong>: During food and beverage processing, solid particles, microorganisms and other impurities need to be removed from liquids. It meets the needs of these industries for efficient, reliable filtration.</li><li><strong>Pharmaceutical production</strong>: In the pharmaceutical industry, efficient filtration of pharmaceuticals is key to ensuring product quality and compliance with regulatory requirements. It can be used in these applications to ensure cleanliness and safety during production.</li><li><strong>Liquid Handling</strong>: It is also commonly used in liquid handling processes such as liquid waste treatment, sewage treatment and industrial liquid handling. They can help remove contaminants and bring liquids to certain environmental standards.</li></ul>','Our pleated filter bags are made of high-quality and efficient fabrics with proven advantages in a variety of chemical and temperature environments. The filter bag series can be constructed in a variety of needle punched and woven forms, using a variety of fiber materials and structural designs to meet your application requirements.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dimension</strong>: Customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Combination Method: </strong>3-stitch sewing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Quality of Pleats</strong>：8 or 12.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Finish</strong>: Singeing, Heat Set, Calendering, Coating, Soaking.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Treament</strong>: Needle hole membrane covering.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2274,'2024-11-19 23:50:01','2024-12-08 10:12:46'),(2299,'RABH Filter Bags','rabh-filter-bags','<p>In a reverse air baghouse, the dirty air flows from the inside-to-outside, so that the dust collects on the inside of the filter bag. The filter bags are tubular, open at the bottom and connected to a tubesheet. They are supported from the top through a spring or J-bolt suspension system. The gas flow is reversed to initiate filter bag cleaning. Anti-collapse rings are sewn onto the outside of the bags at 3 to 4 foot intervals to prevent total collapse of the bags during the reverse air cleaning. Filter bags are cleaned one compartment at a time in the off-line mode. The reverse air cleaning mechanism in RABH systems uses low-pressure air to inflate the filter bags and dislodge the accumulated dust, enhancing filter life by reducing abrasion.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"500\" height=\"310\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Principle-of-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Principle-of-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-detail1.jpg 500w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Principle-of-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-detail1-300x186.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" />													\n		<h3>Why choose fiberglass RABH filter bags?</h3><p>The filter bag made of glass fiber is the most cost-effective dust collector filter bag in high temperature working condition dust removal filtration system in different industries. It has the advantages of heat resistance, high strength and corrosion resistance. After chemical treatment and finishing, it also has the functions of easy cleaning, waterproof and antistatic.</p>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-cloth-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-cloth-detail2.jpg 800w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-cloth-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-cloth-detail2-768x513.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-cloth-detail2-600x401.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n		<h3><b>Product specifications</b></h3> <table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Code</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Material</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Finish Treatment</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Weight<br />(g/m²)</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Thickness<br />(mm)</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Fabric Structure</td><td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Yarn Density<br />(pc/cm)</td><td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">Breaking Strength<br />(N/25mm)</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Air Permeability<p> </p>(L/m².s)(@200Pa)</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Working Temp<br />(ºC)</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Peak Temp<br />(ºC)</td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">Cleaning Method</td></tr><tr><td>Lengh</td><td>Cross</td><td>Lengh</td><td>Cross</td></tr><tr><td>350g</td><td>Alkali Free Fiber Glass</td><td>Acid Resistance +PTFE membrane</td><td>≥350</td><td>0.35±0.05</td><td>1/3 Twill</td><td>20±1</td><td>13±1</td><td>≥1800</td><td>≥1100</td><td>30-50</td><td>≤260</td><td>≤280</td><td>Reverse Air</td></tr><tr><td>450g</td><td>Alkali Free Fiber Glass</td><td>Acid Resistance +PTFE membrane</td><td>≥420</td><td>0.42±0.05</td><td>1/3 Twill</td><td>20±1</td><td>12±1</td><td>≥1800</td><td>≥1600</td><td>25-45</td><td>≤260</td><td>≤280</td><td>Reverse Air</td></tr><tr><td>550g</td><td>Alkali Free Fiber Glass</td><td>Acid Resistance +PTFE membrane</td><td>≥550</td><td>0.55±0.05</td><td>1/3 Twill</td><td>20±1</td><td>14±1</td><td>≥2400</td><td>≥1800</td><td>25-45</td><td>≤260</td><td>≤280</td><td>Reverse Air</td></tr><tr><td>750g</td><td>Alkali Free Fiber Glass</td><td>Acid Resistance +PTFE membrane</td><td>≥750</td><td>0.75±0.05</td><td>Double Weave</td><td>18±1</td><td>16±1</td><td>≥2400</td><td>≥2400</td><td>20-40</td><td>≤260</td><td>≤280</td><td>Pulse Jet</td></tr><tr><td>800g</td><td>100%PTFE</td><td>PTFE Full Bath +PTFE Membrane</td><td>≥800</td><td>1.0-1,3</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>≥800</td><td>≥800</td><td>30-50</td><td>≤260</td><td>≤280</td><td>Pulse Jet</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Application of RABH Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Organosilicone Industry</strong>: Philite specialized in RABH Filter Bags for Organosilicone Industry, which is widely used in the field of New Energy. From photovoltaic cells and lithium battery separators to supercapacitors, organosilicones play an important role.</li><li><strong>Carbon Black Industry</strong>: Carbon black, very small particles, high viscosity, easy to paste bags, the filter is mainly stable at 270℃-280℃, large water vapor, the filter bag are used to collect carbon black particles.</li><li><strong>Iron &amp; Steel Industry</strong>: The steel plant has many dust collectors in different area, such as blast furnace, coking, converter, lime kiln, etc. The high temperature dust collectors can use fiberglass filter media.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-detail3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-detail4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Carbon-Black-Industry-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Carbon-Black-Industry-detail5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Carbon-Black-Industry-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Carbon-Black-Industry-detail5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Philite® Quality Assurance</h3><ul><li>Our three-needle six-thread sewing machine for producing dust bags can process filter bags of various shapes such as round, trapezoidal, flat, and special-shaped according to user requirements.</li><li>Engineers tailor the best technical solutions and guidance for customers. We strictly abide by the processing quality standards, strictly follow the design drawings and follow the operating procedures.</li><li>In the production process, we pay attention to every detail, and the products are 100% tested in every key link.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-detail6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-detail6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-detail7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-detail7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-detail7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-02-detail8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-02-detail8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-02-detail8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Reverse-Air-Baghouse-Filter-Bags-02-detail8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','The Reverse Air Bag house (RABH) is a bag dust collector that uses the reverse air flow (opposite to the dust-containing air flow) to force the filter bag to deform (bulge or shrink) and clean the dust. Using reverse blowing, the bag diameter can reach 300 mm, the bag length can reach 10 meters or even 15~18 meters.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust filter bag length</strong>: Customizable.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Common sizes</strong>: diameter 100mm, 125mm, 130mm, 150mm, 180mm, 250mm, 300mm, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Fiberglass, PTFE.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong><em>Note: </em></strong><em>If the filter bag you need is different from our usual filter bags, please send us your drawings and select the material you need, as we also produce non-standard filter bags.</em>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2300,'2024-11-20 09:23:49','2024-12-08 10:27:43'),(2317,'Polyester Filter Bags','polyester-filter-bags','<p>Polyester filter bags are most common materials in the filter bag family. Polyester needle felt filter bags are made of needle punched many times and properly rolled. The short fibers are laid into a fiber web, and then the fiber web is reinforced into a cloth by needles with barbs, and the fiber web is repeatedly punctured to reinforce the fibers to form a needle-punched non-woven fabric. Non-woven fabrics have no distinction between warp and weft, the fibers are messy, and there is little difference in radial and weft properties. The air permeability of the polyester filter bag is more than 50% higher than that of the ordinary calendered filter material, the surface is smooth, the air permeability is good, and the resistance is low.</p>		\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-详情1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-详情1_syy.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-详情1_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-详情1_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-详情1_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-详情2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-详情2_syy.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-详情2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-详情2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-详情2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n		<h3>Specification of Polyester Filter Bags</h3><table width=\"716\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"72\">Heat resistance℃/℉</td><td width=\"72\">up to 130/266</td></tr><tr><td>Fabric</td><td>100% polyester</td></tr><tr><td>Length &amp; diameter</td><td>No limited</td></tr><tr><td>Area weight (g/m2)</td><td>350~650</td></tr><tr><td>Working lifetime</td><td>8000 hours and more</td></tr><tr><td>MOQ</td><td>50pcs</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Physical properties</h3><table><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Air permeability(L/m2.s) @200pa</td><td colspan=\"2\">Tensile strength(N/5cm)</td><td colspan=\"2\">Temperature(℃/℉)</td></tr><tr><td>warp</td><td>weft</td><td>continue</td><td>instant</td></tr><tr><td>200~300</td><td>1300</td><td>1500</td><td>130/266</td><td>150/302</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Chemical properties</h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Acid Resistance</td><td>Alkali Resistance</td><td>Hydrolytic Resistance</td><td>Oxidation Resistance</td><td>Abrasion resistance</td></tr><tr><td>Moderate</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Poor</td><td>Good</td><td>Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Working Principle</h3><p>The working principle of the polyester filter bag is the so-called “depth filtration” technology, that is, the “primary dust layer” (powder filter cake) is formed on the surface through the capture of the filter material fibers, and then the subsequent dust is filtered out through the powder filter cake. During the initial use of the polyester filter bag, due to its own large gap, some dust will be discharged through the filter material. Only when the powder cake is formed can the filtration process actually begin. After continuous use, the dust on the surface of the polyester filter bag will gradually penetrate into the filter material, causing the pores of the filter material to be blocked, increasing the running resistance of the equipment until the filter material must be replaced.</p><h3>In The Non-Woven Category, PET(Polyester) Needle Punched Non-Woven Material Has The Following Characteristics:</h3><ul><li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Polyester filter bags can efficiently capture fine dust, particles, and contaminants due to their dense fiber structure.</li><li><strong>Durability and Strength</strong>: Polyester fibers are strong and resistant to tearing and abrasion, which extends the lifespan of the filter bags.</li><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: Polyester fibers exhibit good resistance to many acids and alkalis, making them suitable for use in harsh chemical environments.</li><li><strong>Solvent Resistance</strong>: Polyester fibers are resistant to a wide range of solvents, enhancing their applicability in various industrial processes.</li><li><strong>Thermal Stability</strong>: Polyester fibers can operate effectively in temperatures up to approximately 130°C(266℉) .</li><li><strong>Moisture Resistance</strong>: Polyester fibers inherently repel water, making these filter bags effective in applications where moisture is present.</li><li><strong>Cleanability</strong>: Polyester filter bags can be cleaned and reused multiple times, reducing operational costs.</li></ul><h4>Technical Advantages of  Polyester Filter Bags in Philite®</h4><ul><li>To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors.</li><li>System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance.</li><li>Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.</li></ul><h3>Post-treatment of Polyester Filter Bags</h3><p>For polyester filter bags, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:<br />1. Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type).<br />2. Anti-Spark.<br />3. Water &amp; Oil Repellent.<br />4. Anti-Abrasion (Acrylic coating).<br />5. PTFE Membrane.<br />6. PTFE Impregnation.</p><h4>Shapes and Types</h4><p><strong>Polyester filter bags can be made into different shapes, which can be mainly divided into the following three types:</strong><br />1. Round type.<br />2. Flat type.<br />3. Star/pleated type.</p>		\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3_syy.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Round Type</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情4_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情4_syy.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情4_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Flat Type</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-详情5_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-详情5_syy.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-详情5_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-详情5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-详情5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Pleated Type</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<p><strong>According to different working principles, polyester filter bags can also be made into the following three types:</strong><br />1. Pulse jet filter bag.<br />2. Reverse air filter bag.<br />3. Shaker filter bag.</p><h3>Application of Polyester Filter Bags</h3><p>Because polyester filter bags have high tensile strength, chemical resistance, and the ability to operate at moderately high temperatures, they are versatile and reliable in a variety of industrial environments.</p><ul><li><strong>Cement and Asphalt Production</strong>: Helps in capturing dust and particulates emitted from kilns and dryers.</li><li><strong>Water Treatment</strong>: Utilized in municipal and industrial water treatment plants for removing contaminants from water.</li><li><strong>Chemical Processing</strong>: Used to filter liquids in chemical manufacturing processes, ensuring product purity and protecting equipment.</li><li><strong>Food and Beverage Industry</strong>: Applied in the production of beverages, syrups, and other consumables to filter out impurities and particulates.</li><li><strong>Air Filtration</strong>: Incorporated in heating, ventilation, and air conditioning systems to improve indoor air quality by trapping dust, pollen, and other airborne particles.</li><li><strong>Pharmaceutical Industry</strong>: Used to filter and collect fine powders during the production of pharmaceuticals, ensuring compliance with health and safety regulations.</li><li><strong>Air Purification</strong>: Helps maintain sterile conditions in production and packaging areas.</li><li><strong>Tailings Management</strong>: Employed to manage and treat slurry from mining operations.</li><li><strong>Agriculture</strong>: Used in grain elevators and processing plants to filter dust and fine particulates generated during handling and milling.</li><li><strong>Paint and Coatings Industry</strong>: Helps in collecting overspray and maintaining clean air within coating booths.</li><li><strong>Mixing and Blending</strong>: Ensures air quality during the mixing and blending of raw materials.</li><li><strong>Metalworking</strong>: Filters out welding fumes and metal particles as well as metal dust generated during grinding and polishing operations.</li><li><strong>Woodworking</strong>: Essential in woodworking shops to capture sawdust and wood particles, improving air quality and reducing fire hazards.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-详情6.jpg 600w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情8_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情8_syy.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情8_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情8_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情9.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情10.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情10.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情10-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情10-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情11.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情11.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情11-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-Felt-Polyester-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情11-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','Polyester (PE/PET) filter bags are made by needle punching and are used to filter dust, liquids, and gases.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High Filtration Efficiency.</li>\r\n 	<li>Durability and Strength.</li>\r\n 	<li>Chemical Resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Solvent Resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Thermal Stability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Moisture Resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Cleanability.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2318,'2024-11-20 10:02:59','2025-01-22 11:41:09'),(2339,'Anti-static Filter Bags','anti-static-filter-bags','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-02-详情1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-02-详情1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-02-详情1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-02-详情1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-03-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-03-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-03-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-03-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-04-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-04-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-04-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-static-Polyester-Filter-Bags-04-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Why Use Antistatic Filter Bags?</h3><p>When the concentration of industrial dust reaches a certain level (that is, the explosion limit), if it encounters electrostatic discharge sparks or external ignition, it will easily cause explosion and fire. Such as: flour dust, chemical dust, coal dust, etc. may explode in case of electrostatic discharge. In the field of bag dust removal, if the dust needs to be collected with a cloth bag, the filter material for making the dust bag is required to have anti static properties. The anti-static filter bags are all made of anti-static needle-punched felt, which has excellent anti-static performance and is the most ideal choice for explosion-proof dust collection.</p><h3>Antistatic Principle of Anti-static Filter Bags</h3><p>Conductive fibers or stainless steel conductive materials are mixed into the chemical fibers used to produce needle felt to produce antistatic needle felt with excellent antistatic properties. The results of comparing antistatic dust filter bags with ordinary dust filter bags in terms of physical properties, charge and dust removal efficiency have confirmed the superiority of antistatic dust filter bags.</p><h3>Anti-static filter bags have the following characteristics</h3><ul><li>Conductive fibers are not affected by the environment.</li><li>When the fabric is charged, it discharges through its own weak corona and leaks to the ground.</li><li>When weaving, long filaments are used for warp yarns and short filaments are used for weft yarns.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Main Type of Anti-static Filter Bags</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material</td><td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Conductivity\">Conductivity</td><td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance\">Temperature Resistance</td><td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Chemical Resistance\">Chemical Resistance</td><td id=\"sjs-E1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Abrasion Resistance\">Abrasion Resistance</td><td id=\"sjs-F1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Durability\">Durability</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester (PET) with Conductive Fibers\">Polyester (PET) with Conductive Fibers</td><td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 150°C (302*F)\">Up to 150°C (302°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td><td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polypropylene (PP) with Conductive Fibers\">Polypropylene (PP) with Conductive Fibers</td><td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 90*C (194*F)\">Up to 90*C (194°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td><td id=\"sjs-E3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td><td id=\"sjs-F3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyimide (P84)\">Polyimide (P84)</td><td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td><td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260*C (500*F)\">Up to 260*C (500°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very Good\">Very Good</td><td id=\"sjs-E4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)\">PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)</td><td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-C5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 250*C (482*F)\">Up to 250*C (482°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td><td id=\"sjs-E5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Aramid (Nomex)\">Aramid (Nomex)</td><td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td><td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 200*C (392*F)\">Up to 200*C (392°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td><td id=\"sjs-E6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>','Anti-static filter bags are specially designed for flammable dust. They are made of flame-retardant anti-static needle-punched felt. The production of various coal powders, chemical dusts, flour, aluminum powder, coke, carbon black, woodworking dust, etc. requires flame-retardant anti-static dust removal filter bags. Philite® provide the filter bags with excellent performance of anti-static. We can offer blending type , square type, stripe type for your choices. The customized service can also be provided.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Materials</strong>: Polyester, Polypropylene, P84, PTFE, Nomex punched needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Types: </strong>Blending type , Square type, Stripe type.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Reach to 99.5%.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2340,'2024-11-20 18:27:39','2024-11-25 09:50:56'),(2352,'P84 Filter Bags','p84-filter-bags','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-详情5_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-详情5_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-详情5_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-详情5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-详情5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-详情6_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-详情6_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-详情6_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-详情6_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-详情6_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n		<p>P84 filter bags are a type of filter media commonly used in industrial applications, especially in air pollution control systems. They are resistant to high temperatures, have good corrosion resistance, and are acid resistant. Under the condition of 240℃, the mechanical properties of P84 polyimide fiber filter material will not change, and the maximum temperature resistance can reach 260℃. P84 fiber filter material has no melting point temperature and is naturally golden yellow. P84 polyimide fiber filter material is not a hygroscopic fiber filter material (at 65% relative humidity, about 3% water absorption).</p><h3>Main Features</h3><ul><li><strong>High temperature resistance</strong>: Max. Operating temperature: 240℃/464℉; Ultimate temperature: 260℃/500℉.</li><li><strong>Excellent filtration efficiency</strong>: Due to it’s leaf-shaped cross section, It’s 80% increase in filtration area than other filter Media.</li><li><strong>Chemical stability</strong>: P84 material has good chemical stability and can resist erosion and corrosion from many chemicals, thereby extending the service life of the filter bags.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Physical Properties</h3><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Air permeability(L/m2.s) @200pa</td><td colspan=\"2\">Tensile strength(N/5cm)</td><td colspan=\"2\">Temperature(℃ / ℉)</td></tr><tr><td>warp</td><td>weft</td><td>Operating</td><td>Ultimate</td></tr><tr><td>150~300</td><td>1000</td><td>1100</td><td>220 / 428</td><td>260 / 500</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Chemical Properties</h3><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td>Acid Resistance</td><td>Alkali Resistance</td><td>Hydrolytic Resistance</td><td>Oxidation Resistance</td><td>Abrasion resistance</td></tr><tr><td>Moderate</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Moderate</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Specification of P84 Filter Bags</h3><table width=\"611\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"123\" height=\"22\">Heat resistance℃/℉</td><td width=\"362\">Up to 260/500</td></tr><tr><td>Fabric</td><td>100% P84 fiber (polyimide)</td></tr><tr><td>Length &amp; diameter</td><td>No limited</td></tr><tr><td>Area weight (g/m2)</td><td>350~700</td></tr><tr><td>Working lifetime</td><td>8000 hours and more</td></tr><tr><td>MOQ</td><td>50pcs</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>How does Philite® improve filtration efficiency and reduce production costs?</h3><ul><li>To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors.</li><li>System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance.</li><li>Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-01-详情7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-01-详情7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-01-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-01-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-filter-bag-details-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-filter-bag-details-详情8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-filter-bag-details-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-needle-punched-filter-felt-filter-bag-details-详情8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Recommendations</h3><ul><li>The hydrolysis and oxidation resistance of P84 filter bags are moderate. It is recommended that the water vapor content is less than 35% Vol and the O2 content is less than 16% Vol.</li><li>Oxidized sulfides will shorten the service life of P84 bags. The oxidized sulfide content is recommended to be less than 700 mg/Nm3.</li><li>Waste incinerators should be equipped with desulfurization devices.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Post-treatment for P84 Filter Bags</h3><p>We can treat P84 filter bags with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p><ul><li>Water&amp;Oil Repellent.</li><li>PTFE Membrane.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Shapes and Types</h3><p>P84 filter bags can be made into different types of filter bags, which can be mainly divided into the following three types:</p><ul><li>Round type.</li><li>Flat type.</li><li>Star/pleated type.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Application  of  P84 Filter Bags</h3><p>P84 filter bags are mainly used in flue gas purification in gypsum plants, cement plants, liquid fluidized bed boilers, coal-fired boilers and waste incineration processes, and are widely used in processes with high emission concentration requirements.</p><ul><li><strong>Cement Production</strong>: In cement plants, P84 filter bags are used in dust collection systems to capture cement dust and other particulates generated during the production process.</li><li><strong>Metal Smelting and Foundries</strong>: They are utilized in metal smelting and foundry operations to filter out metal oxides, dust, and fumes produced during the melting and casting processes.</li><li><strong>Waste Incineration</strong>: Waste incineration plants use them in their filtration systems to control emissions of particulate matter and pollutants generated from burning waste materials.</li><li><strong>Power Generation</strong>: In thermal power plants, they are employed in boiler systems and flue gas cleaning units to remove ash and other particulates from the exhaust gases.</li><li><strong>Chemical and Pharmaceutical Industries</strong>: They are also used in chemical processing plants and pharmaceutical manufacturing facilities where there is a need to control emissions of fine particulates and hazardous substances.</li><li><strong>Incineration of Hazardous Waste</strong>: Facilities that incinerate hazardous waste materials rely on them to ensure compliance with environmental regulations by capturing hazardous particulates and preventing their release into the atmosphere.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情10.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情10.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情10-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情10-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情11.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情11.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情11-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情11-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>','<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Common Size:</strong> Diameter 100mm, 125mm, 130mm, 150mm, 180mm, 250mm ect.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Process Method</strong>: Automatic sewing or welded.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Prodction Details</strong>: Double bottoms and reinforcement to make abrasion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Sewing Thread</strong>: PTFE thread, polyester thread.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Inspection</strong>: Inspection: Filter bags are inspected according to international standards, industry standards and enterprise standards.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: 20000 per month (standard product).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf the filter bags you require are different from our usual ones, then please send us your drawing and select the material you require, as we also produce non-standard filter bags.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2353,'2024-11-20 18:38:28','2024-11-25 09:55:56'),(2371,'Acrylic Filter Bags','acrylic-filter-bags','<p><strong>Homopolymer acrylic filter bags are a specific type of filter bag made from homopolymer acrylic fibers. Due to their unique material properties, homopolymer acrylic filter bags offer significant advantages and unique performance in many industrial applications.</strong></p><h3>How Do Homopolymers Differ From Regular Polymers</h3><p>The molecular weight distribution of traditional polymers is relatively wide, and the particles and structures also need to be controlled through a variety of technologies, making it difficult to achieve uniformity. Homopolymers, on the other hand, are polymer materials with high purity and consistency achieved by controlling factors such as the polymerization reaction temperature, ratio, monomer addition, type and amount of initiators, as well as highly precise control of parameters such as molecular weight and morphology.</p><hr /><h3>Product Features</h3><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>Homopolymer acrylic acid needle-punched filter bags have good corrosion resistance and are resistant to organic agents, oxidants, inorganic acids and organic acids and will not hydrolyze.</p><ul><li><strong>Temperature Tolerance</strong></li></ul><p>Homopolymer acrylic filter bags can typically operate in temperatures up to 125°C (257°F), allowing for use in high-temperature applications.</p><ul><li><strong>Durability</strong></li></ul><p>They have good abrasion resistance and mechanical strength, ensuring a longer lifespan compared to other types of filter materials.</p><ul><li><strong>Low Energy Consumption</strong></li></ul><p>Homopolymer acrylic filter bags are soft in texture, require low cleaning pressure, have good vibration during cleaning, and are easy to remove dust, effectively reducing the consumption of compressed air, reducing maintenance, and saving operating costs.</p><hr /><h3>Physical Properties and Chemical Properties (500gsm)</h3><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"289\" height=\"29\">Weight</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"392\">300-600g/m2 ± 10%</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Diameter</td><td colspan=\"2\">No limited</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Air permeability</td><td>l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td>200 ~ 350</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"58\">Tensile strength (N/5cm)</td><td>Warp</td><td>800</td></tr><tr><td>Weft</td><td>850</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"58\">Tensile elongation (%)</td><td>Warp</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Weft</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" height=\"29\">Temperature (℃/℉)</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Continuos temperature</td><td>C°</td><td>120/248</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Instant temperature</td><td>C°</td><td>140/284</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\">Good</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\">Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Post-Treatment</h3><p>For acrylic filter bags, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>							<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type)</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>Water &amp; Oil Repellent</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>PTFE Membrane</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<h3>How Philite® Improve the Performance of Acrylic Filter Bags</h3><ul><li>To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors.</li><li>System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance.</li><li>Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Applicable Industries</h3><p>Acrylic filter bags have good anti-chemical and anti-hydrolysis performances in filter bag family. It is widely used in the detergent, waste incinerators, asphalt, dance spray dryer, cement factories, coal mill and power plant for dust collection.</p><ul><li><strong>Smoke filtration</strong></li></ul><p>Acrylic filter bags can filter out particulate matter in the smoke, purify the smoke and protect the environment. They are commonly used in smoke purification systems, combustion equipment and other fields.</p><ul><li><strong>Liquid filtration</strong></li></ul><p>Acrylic filter bags can filter out impurities and solid particles in liquids, and are commonly used in water treatment, chemical and other industries. It can effectively remove suspended matter, impurities and microorganisms, making the liquid purer and cleaner.</p><ul><li><strong>Dust filtration</strong></li></ul><p>Acrylic filter bags can also be used in industrial dust filtration, such as cement plants, metallurgical plants, etc. It can effectively capture dust and prevent it from entering the air and polluting the environment.</p><ul><li><strong>Solid-liquid separation</strong></li></ul><p>Acrylic filter bags can be used to separate solid-liquid mixtures and separate solid particles from solutions. Common application scenarios include chemical, pharmaceutical and other industries.</p>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"499\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-详情5-600x399.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-03-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Philite®-factory-10-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-详情8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-详情8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Acrylic-filter-bag-factory-02-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Use and Maintenance</h3><ul><li>In order to ensure its efficient operation and extend its service life, acrylic filter bags need to be maintained and cleaned regularly.</li><li>Check the appearance of the filter bag regularly to see if there is any damage, wear or holes. If any damage is found in the filter bag, it should be replaced in time.</li><li>The filter bag should be stored in a dry place to avoid mold growth, and avoid direct sunlight to prevent aging of the acrylic material.</li></ul>','Philite® manufactures high performance homopolymer acrylic filter bags and provides reliable filtration solutions. Customized sizes are available In addition to the standard sizes.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong> : 100% Acrylic staple fiber.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Scrim</strong>: With Acrylic staple yarn.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length &amp; diameter</strong>: No limited.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 300 -600g/m2 ±10%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Temperature (℃/℉)</strong>: Continue: 120/248, Instant: 140/284.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish-treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Anti-acid and alkali</strong>: PH ranges from 3-11.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Reach to 99.5%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Stable working time</strong>: Up to more than 3000 hours. Could be used cyclically.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2372,'2024-11-20 18:52:44','2024-11-25 10:03:31'),(2389,'Acrylic Needle Felt Filter Cloth','acrylic-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<p>Acrylic needle felt is a kind of fine fiber cloth using non-woven needle punching technology. The acrylic fibers are arranged in a staggered manner, the gaps are evenly distributed and large, the air permeability is good, and the chemical resistance is stable. It can not only filter normal temperature gas, but also filter medium temperature gas (150°C), it is an ideal choice for filtering acid, alkali and corrosive gases. Compared with polyester needle felt, the biggest feature of acrylic is that it has better hydrolysis resistance than polyester needle felt.</p><h3>Physical Properties and Chemical Properties</h3><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"289\" height=\"29\">Weight</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"392\">300-600g/m2 ± 10%</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Diameter</td><td colspan=\"2\">No limited</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Air permeability</td><td>l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td>200 ~ 350</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"58\">Tensile strength (N/5cm)</td><td>Warp</td><td>800</td></tr><tr><td>Weft</td><td>850</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"58\">Tensile elongation (%)</td><td>Warp</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Weft</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" height=\"29\">Temperature (℃/℉)</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Continuos temperature</td><td>C°</td><td>120/248</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Instant temperature</td><td>C°</td><td>140/284</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\">Good</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\">Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table><h4><strong><b>Post-treatment:</b></strong></h4><p>For acrylic needle punched felt, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p><ol><li>Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type)</li><li>Waterproof and oilproof</li><li>PTFE Membrane</li></ol><h4><strong><b>Application</b></strong></h4><p>Filter bags made of acrylic needle punched felt are widely used in many industries:</p><ol><li>Cement Plant.</li><li>Lime Stone.</li><li>Asphalt Plant…</li></ol>','Acrylic needle punched felt is one of the most common materials used to make filter bags, which has good hydrolytic stability.\r\n<h4>Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The continuous working temperature is 130 degrees, and the moment does not exceed 140 degrees.</li>\r\n 	<li>Good acid and alkali resistance, PH value between 3-11.</li>\r\n 	<li>The relative humidity is less than 30%, pay attention to oxidation.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2390,'2024-11-20 22:45:25','2024-11-20 22:49:27'),(2399,'Anti-static Aramid Needle Felt','anti-static-aramid-needle-felt','<h3>Why Use Antistatic Filter Felts?</h3><p>Usually, when the concentration of industrial dust reaches a certain level, if it encounters factors such as electrostatic discharge sparks or external ignition, such as flour dust, chemical dust, explosive dust, etc., it will easily lead to explosion and fire. In case of electrostatic discharge, there is a possibility of explosion. sex. If these dusts need to be collected by cloth bags, it is required that the manufactured cloth bags themselves have anti-static function. In addition to the production of ordinary needle-punched felt, the production of anti-static filter materials also requires the incorporation of conductive fiber yarn or chemical fiber mixed with conductive fiber, etc.</p><hr /><h3>Our Quality</h3><p>We have the leading technology in the Anti-static Needle Felt, each material must be experimented thousands of times before being put into production. Through these processes, we guarantee the stability of it, and prolong its service life.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-05-详情1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-05-详情1_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-05-详情1_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-05-详情1_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情2_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情2_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-03-详情2_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<p> </p><h3>Physical and Chemical Properties of Aramid Needle Felt: (Customization Of Feature And Size)</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Product name </b></strong><strong> </strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"><strong><b>Anti-static </b></strong><strong><b>Aramid needle felt 500 g/m²</b></strong><strong><b>, cross line type</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong>Product Code</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"><strong><b>ES-</b></strong><strong><b>AS</b></strong><strong><b>AMD500</b></strong><strong><b>X</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Aramid staple fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Aramid staple yarn, cross electric yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"222\">500</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"222\">2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">m</td><td width=\"222\">≤2,2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td width=\"222\">250</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp</td><td width=\"222\">800</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"> </td><td width=\"231\">Weft</td><td width=\"222\">900</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp</td><td width=\"222\">20</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"> </td><td width=\"231\">Weft</td><td width=\"222\">30</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td><td width=\"231\"> </td><td width=\"222\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continuos temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"222\">204</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"222\">240</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Applications</h3><p>Blast furnace gas, coal mill dust collection, cement plant coal mill dust collection and explosion-proof dust collection in other industries.</p>','We use leading technology in the anti-static needle felt and guarantee the stability of our products. Main Anti-static types include blending type, square type and stripe type.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Supply Ability</strong>: 5000 ㎡/day.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Reach to 99.5%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Working Life</strong>: &gt;3000 hours.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Surface Resistance(Ω.cm)</strong>: 10<sup>3</sup>-10<sup>8.</sup></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2400,'2024-11-20 22:52:30','2024-11-20 22:56:34'),(2434,'Filter Bag Cap','filter-bag-cap','Bag cap is the patron saint of dust bag protection, in the process of equipment back to soot blowing, making to receive strength evenly in the filter pocket, cleaning thoroughly, effectively improve the dust removal efficiency and the service life of filter bag. Bag cap is mainly used to shoot suction, such as cloth bag dust collector, powder conveying, cooler, flowmeter, dryer, etc.\r\n<h2>Table of the Bag cap:</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"63\">D1（mm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">H1（mm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"68\">D2（mm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">H2（mm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"63\">T（mm）</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"199\">Materials</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø300</td>\r\n<td>Ø300</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">65</td>\r\n<td>Ø300</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">65</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">1</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\">Carbon steel Galvanized sheet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø250</td>\r\n<td>Ø250</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">50</td>\r\n<td>Ø250</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">55</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">1</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\">Carbon steel Galvanized sheet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø190</td>\r\n<td>Ø190</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">45</td>\r\n<td>Ø190</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">45</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">1</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\">Carbon steel Galvanized sheet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Table of the Ring:</h2>\r\n<table width=\"727\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\"> D1（mm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\"> D2（mm）</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Materials</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø300</td>\r\n<td>Ø310</td>\r\n<td>Ø300</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø240</td>\r\n<td>Ø265</td>\r\n<td>Ø240</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø200</td>\r\n<td>Ø300</td>\r\n<td>Ø200</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø180</td>\r\n<td>Ø220</td>\r\n<td>Ø180</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø160</td>\r\n<td>Ø175</td>\r\n<td>Ø160</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø140</td>\r\n<td>Ø160</td>\r\n<td>Ø140</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø110</td>\r\n<td>Ø130</td>\r\n<td>Ø110</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\">Stainless steel  Silicone Spray</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Table of the spring:</h2>\r\n<table width=\"716\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">D（mm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">L1(mm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">L2（mm）</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø5</td>\r\n<td>Ø5</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">210</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">500、1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø5</td>\r\n<td>Ø5</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">185</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">500、1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Ø4</td>\r\n<td>Ø4</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">135</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">500、1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','The bag cap can help dust bag to receive strength strength evenly in the filter pocket, cleaning thoroughly, effectively improve the dust removal efficiency and the service life of filter bag. The design structure of bag cap is strong and reliable , longer life.\r\nCapacity: 500 Pieces per Day\r\nPhilite® surpply full range of bag cap, made of steel sheet (common carbon steel,stainless steel)by punching. It is used to hang and seal the internal filtration ring bag. Bag cap can be galvanized according to customer requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2435,'2024-11-20 23:24:14','2024-11-21 10:41:48'),(2437,'Automatic Depressurization-Dedusting Integrated Device of the Conveying System','automatic-depressurization-dedusting-integrated-device-of-the-conveying-system','The automatic depressurization-dedusting integrated series of the conveying system integration, the dust removal environmental protection equipment, is independently developed by our company, based on large dust emission, scattered distribution, limited space and other factors of belt transit stations in steel mills, power plants, mines, ports and so on. The product technical standards strictly comply with the provisions of GB16248-1996 <em>Hygiene Standard for Respirable Dust in the Air of Workplace</em>.\r\n\r\nAfter emerging, the automatic depressurization-dedusting integrated series of the conveying system integration, the dust removal environmental protection equipment, not only solves the problems of the traditional filters in the conveying system, such as large occupied area, large energy consumption, large maintenance load and investment, high operating cost, secondary pollution and non-compliance, but has the advantages of no space limit, no secondary pollution, unmanned guarding, free maintenance, small power, etc.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Purpose</h2>\r\nThe product is widely used for dust control of transit points (transfer stations) in the belt conveying system of steel mills, coal-fired power plants and other industries; or that of the metallurgical industry, coking plants, pelletizing plants, mixture sintering, etc.Purpose\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Operating Principle</h2>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe materials from the upstream of belt transport and transit point (transfer station) generate a lot of dust in the dropping process; at the same time, under the action of material dropping and impact, the pressure which makes dust flow is produced between the bottom and upper part of the dust-collecting hood. Under the action of the draught fan, the negative pressure is formed within the dust-collecting hood. Most of dust enter into the filter, and are adsorbed on the surface of the filter bag.\r\n\r\nThe sealing device is set up between the bottom of the dust-collecting hood and the moving belt (except material outlet). It effectively prevents dust spilling over on both sides of the belt and on the tail of the dust-collecting hood. Usually, only the sealing device cannot prevent spillover, so we install the soft curtain with the function of dust collection in the material falling outlet and in the belt front, so that most of flying dust can be adsorbed by the dust-collecting soft curtain. Dust unable to be absorbed by the soft curtain is blocked and absorbed by the surrounding sealing device and the dust-collecting soft curtain in the belt front.\r\n\r\nFlying dust successfully flows back to the material incoming place along the curve of featured dust-collecting hood (with the principle of bionics), and falls on the secondary belt together with new incoming materials. Please note that, in order to improve the cohesive effect between dust particles, the micro-sealing device is set up in the places such as material falling place and dust-collecting hood. Under its action, the relative humidity of dusty air can be improved, but moisture content of material cannot be increased greatly. The device opens or closes the SMC solenoid valve according to dust concentration of dusty air detected, so as to realize its shutdown or running. All devices are intelligently controlled by the PLC in the electronic control system, to realize the full automatic operation.\r\n\r\nThe equipment adopts the patented technology, and makes reasonable use of material conversion between potential energy and kinetic energy. So it greatly reduces external energy consumption required in dust removal.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Equipment Structure</h2>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe equipment is composed of the following devices:\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Double dust-collecting hood: to make dust flow back along the curve of the volute under the pressure action of material dropping and impact.</li>\r\n 	<li>Double soft sealing device: be the sealing device around the inner and outer layer of the dust-collecting hood.</li>\r\n 	<li>Dust-collecting soft curtain: to effectively adsorb the dust spilling over.</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatic reflux device: to effectively reduce the impacted positive pressure in the hood.</li>\r\n 	<li>Guiding device: to make dust smoothly flow in the dust-collecting hood.</li>\r\n 	<li>Follow pressure-reducing device: to effectively control uniform pressure distribution in the dust-collecting device.</li>\r\n 	<li>Dust control device: to effectively collect dust in the outer cover of the dust-collecting hood, to eliminate the positive pressure in the outer cover.</li>\r\n 	<li>Atomization device: to improve dust cohesion.</li>\r\n 	<li>PLC electric control device: to realize the automatic detection and automatic control.</li>\r\n</ol>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2438,'2024-11-20 23:28:12','2024-11-20 23:28:12'),(2442,'Automatic Electrical Control Painting Equipment','automatic-electrical-control-painting-equipment','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2443,'2024-11-20 23:32:35','2024-11-20 23:32:35'),(2492,'Air Permeable Fabric','air-permeable-fabric','<h3>There are two kinds of Air Permeable Fabric：</h3><ul><li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=filament-polyester-air-slide-fabric\">Filament Polyester Air Permeable Fabric.</a></li><li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=spun-polyester-air-slide-fabric\">Spun Polyester Air Permeable Fabric.</a></li></ul><p>Spun polyester air permeable fabric has advantages on the performances of tensile strength, air permeability, and high temperature resistance. But filament polyester air permeable fabric is superior to spun polyester air permeable babric on the above performances.</p><h3>Technical parameter of air permeable fabric:</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Product Name\">Product Name</td><td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Filament Polyester Air Slide Fabric\">Filament Polyester Air Slide Fabric</td><td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Spun Polyester Air Slide Fabric\">Spun Polyester Air Slide Fabric</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A2\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thickness( mm)\">Thickness( mm)</td><td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td><td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A3\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Gram Weight( gsm )\">Gram Weight( gsm )</td><td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"3900\">3900</td><td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"3600\">3600</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A4\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air permeabilitl( Ym2.s)\">Air permeabilitl( Ym2.s)</td><td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"85\">85</td><td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"75\">75</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A5\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Tensile strength(kg/c/m?)\">Tensile strength(kg/c/m?)</td><td id=\"sjs-C5\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 4px; border-width: 1px 0px 1px 1px; border-image: initial; outline: 0px; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: top; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; white-space: normal; min-width: 100px; border-color: #e8eaec initial #e9e9e9 #e8eaec; border-style: solid initial solid solid;\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"&gt; 500\">&gt; 500</td><td id=\"sjs-D5\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 4px; border-width: 1px 0px 1px 1px; border-image: initial; outline: 0px; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: top; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; white-space: normal; min-width: 100px; border-color: #e8eaec initial #e9e9e9 #e8eaec; border-style: solid initial solid solid;\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"&gt; 470\">&gt; 470</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A6\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Elongation (Strength: 2000 N/2 cm)\">Elongation (Strength: 2000 N/2 cm)</td><td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Warp\">Warp</td><td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2.1%\">2.1%</td><td id=\"sjs-D6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2.3%\">2.3%</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weft\">Weft</td><td id=\"sjs-C7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.0%\">1.0%</td><td id=\"sjs-D7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.1%\">1.1%</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A8\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Max. Operating Temp.\">Max. Operating Temp.</td><td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"160 C (320 F)\">160 C (320 F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"160 C( 320 F)\">160 C( 320 F)</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A9\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Ultimate Temp. (Instant)\">Ultimate Temp. (Instant)</td><td id=\"sjs-C9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"200 C( 392 F)\">200 C( 392 F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"200 C(392 F)\">200 C(392 F)</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A10\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"[ Number of plies\">[ Number of plies</td><td id=\"sjs-C10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td><td id=\"sjs-D10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Ps:</strong> Average errors of thickness is +/- 0.3mm , gram weight is +/- 5%, air permeability is +/- 10%</p><h3>Customized Services</h3><p>We can weave fabrics according to customers’ specific requirements for water permeability and mechanical strength.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail1_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail1_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-05-detail1_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail2_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail2_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-04-detail2_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Applications of Air Permeable Fabric:</h3><ul><li><strong>Cement industry:</strong> Cement bulk cement trucks, boats;</li><li><strong>Mining:</strong> Alumina, lime, fly ash, phosphate;</li><li><strong>Chemical industry:</strong> soda;</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> Fly ash, desulfurization;</li><li><strong>Food industry:</strong> Flour.</li></ul><p> </p><h3>Precautions</h3><ul><li>Air permeable fabrics should be handled with care during transportation and should not be loaded or unloaded roughly. The transportation tools should be clean and should not be mixed with oils and chemicals. At the same time, measures should be taken to protect them from the sun, rain, and snow.</li><li>It should be stored in a dry, well-ventilated warehouse away from heat sources, separated from oils and chemicals, and protected against moisture.</li></ul>','Air permeable fabric is also named as air slide fabric, Air slide cloth, Air slide membrane, air slide canvas, canvas cloth, and fluidization cloth, fluidizing fabric, etc. The main purpose of air permeable fabric is to discharge, drop and transport homogenized powdery or small granular materials in a static state. It is made of high-quality heat-resistant and corrosion-resistant chemical synthetic fibers and is woven on special equipment according to specific requirements.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: 500 m<sup>2</sup>/month.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>The max. length per roll</strong>: 50 M.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: 0.10 M ~ 2.6 M.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 4~10 MM.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max. Operating Temp</strong>.: 160 ℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ultimate Temp. (Instant)</strong>: 200 ℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Can be customized by specific demands.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2493,'2024-11-21 09:38:38','2024-12-08 12:21:10'),(2506,'Airslide Canvas','airslide-canvas','<p>Airslide canvas are the ideal fluidizing fabric for work processes at high temperature,which mainly used for pneumatic transmission of cement, bauxite, carbon black, gypsum, flour, etc. Philite® supply airslide canvas of first grade quality and competitive price using the most advanced technology. Our products has great performances of tensile strength, air permeability, service life, and heat-resistance.  They are available in four varieties with thicknesses ranging from 4mm to 10mm, with custom widths available to suit your requirements.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-01-detail05_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-01-detail05_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-01-detail05_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-01-detail05_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-02-detail06_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-02-detail06_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-02-detail06_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-02-detail06_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-03-detail07_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-03-detail07_syy.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-03-detail07_syy-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Airslide-Canvas-03-detail07_syy-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Specification of Airslide Canvas (Air Slide Fabric)</h3><table width=\"623\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"112\">Air filter media</td><td width=\"120\">Picture</td><td width=\"201\">Features</td><td width=\"162\">Applications</td></tr><tr><td>Spun polyester air slide fabric</td><td><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Spun-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabrics-300x300-detail1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></td><td>High reststance to wear&amp; degradation high abrasion resistance</td><td><p>Cement industry</p><p>Mining: alumina, lime, fly ash, phosphate</p></td></tr><tr><td>Filament polyester air slide fabric</td><td><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filament-Polyester-Air-Slide-Fabrics-300x300-detail2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></td><td>Constant air permeability high abrasion performance</td><td><p>Cement industry</p><p>Food industry: flour</p><p>Mining: alumina, lime, fly ash, phosphate</p></td></tr><tr><td>Kevlar/Aramid(Nomex) air slide fabric</td><td><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Air-Slide-Belt-nomex-300x300-detail3_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></td><td>High temperature resistance, good sstability</td><td>Mining: alumina, lime, fly ash, phosphate</td></tr><tr><td>Basalt air slide fabric</td><td><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Basalt-Air-Slide-Fabric-Belt-01-300x300-detail4_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></td><td>Heat resistance, corrosion resistance, high tensile strength</td><td>Thermal power plant, alumina, bauxite, soda ash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Technical parameters of spun polyester airslide canvas:</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Product Name\">Product Name</td><td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Spun polyester air slide\">Spun polyester air slide</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A2\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thickness (mm)\">Thickness (mm)</td><td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"6+0.3\">6+0.3</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A3\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weight (gsm)\">Weight (gsm)</td><td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"4000土5%\">4000土5%</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A4\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air permeabilitl( /m?.s)\">Air permeabilitl( L/m².s)</td><td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"70\">70</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A5\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Elongation (Strength: 2000 N/2 cm)\">Elongation (Strength: 2000 N/2 cm)</td><td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Warp\">Warp</td><td id=\"sjs-C5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2.1%\">2.1%</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weft\">Weft</td><td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1. .0%\">1. .0%</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A7\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Working temperature\">Working temperature</td><td id=\"sjs-C7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"160 C(320 F)\">160 C(320 ℉)</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A8\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Number of plies\">Number of plies</td><td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Technical parameters of filament polyester airslide canvas:</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Product name\">Product name<