d=\"sjs-C7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"280C\">280°C</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Number of plies\">Number of plies</td><td id=\"sjs-B8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td><td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Technical parameters of basalt airslide canvas：</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Product Name\">Product Name</td><td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Basalt Air Slide Fabric\">Basalt Air Slide Fabric</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thickness (mm)\">Thickness (mm)</td><td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5\">5</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Gram Weight (gsm)\">Gram Weight (gsm)</td><td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"8000\">8000</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air permeability (L/m2.s)\">Air permeability (L/m2.s)</td><td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"50\">50</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Tensile strength(kg/cm?)\">Tensile strength(kg/cm?)</td><td id=\"sjs-B5\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; border-top: 1px; border-right: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e9e9e9; border-left: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 4px; border-image: initial; outline: 0px; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: top; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; white-space: normal; min-width: 100px;\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"&gt; 600\">&gt; 600</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Max. Operating Temp.\">Max. Operating Temp.</td><td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"780 C\">780 C</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Ultimate Temp. (Instant)\">Ultimate Temp. (Instant)</td><td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"800 C\">800 C</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Benefits of Airslide Canvas in Philite®</h3><p>• Uniform high quality raw synthetic materials used in weaving process.<br />• Full synthetic smooth fibers- 100% Polyester multi-filament fabric.<br />• Smooth weave and even pores.<br />• High tension weaving.<br />• Robust &amp; stable weave.<br />• High weight per M² Air slide fabric is made of polyester filament or polyester spun filament, they are mainly used in air transport flume of cement, alumina, etc, as well as used in other conveying appliance for some other dry particles, such as Bulk haulers, Barges, etc, which with a perfect fluid, will improve the convey efficiency, they can uniform the raw material if they are used in raw material Blending Bed Equipment.</p>','Airslide canvas also named air slide fabric, It also can be called air permeable fabric, air slide cloth, air slide membrane, air slide canvas, canvas cloth, and fluidizing fabric, etc.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Our capacity</strong>: 500 ㎡/ month.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>:  4mm-10mm and other customized thickness.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: can be customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heat resistance</strong>: 160 ℃ ~ 200 ℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>We also accept customization.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2507,'2024-11-21 09:44:05','2024-11-29 16:51:38'),(2523,'Anti-static ,oil and water proof filter cartridge','anti-static-oil-and-water-proof-filter-cartridge','<h2>Properties and features</h2>\r\n1.Using polyester film material\r\n2. Can effectively medium dust in the charge by equipment grounding export\r\n3. to prevent the occurrence of blast accicdent, dealing with large air flow, high filtration accuracy\r\n4.Filter material through special chemical treatment, the gas in the medium of oil, water molecules have gas一liquid separation. filter cylinder overall drainage oil, water performance is strong, achieve the expected filtration effect.\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"145\">External diameter</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"144\">Inner diameter</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"72\">Length</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"149\">Surface filtration</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"217\">Surface resistance value</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\">Type 1</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ320mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ213mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">660mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">9.4m²</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"4\">≤109 Ω</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\">Type 2</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ320mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ213mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">100mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">15m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\">Type 3</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ352mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ241mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">660mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">9.4m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"left\">Type 4</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ352mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">φ241mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">100mm</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">15m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Anti-static,oil and water proof filter cartridges in our company use polyester film material and can  prevent the occurrence of blast accident, deal with large air flow, high filtration accuracy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2524,'2024-11-21 10:00:10','2024-11-21 10:00:10'),(2526,'Flame retardant dust collector cartridge','flame-retardant-dust-collector-cartridge','<h2>Product use</h2>\r\n1.Suitable for filtration of flammable and explosive dust, such as rubber, carbon, coal, chemical industry etc.\r\n2.Efficient filtration for all kinds of dust removal system.\r\n3.Suitable for dry dust, dust removal effect is obvious.\r\n<h2>Properties and Features</h2>\r\n1.Imported polyester fiber flame retardant treatment, no fire.\r\n2.The wide fold design increases the filtering area.\r\n3.Excellent chemical resistance.\r\n4.Replacement and installation of quick and convenient.','Using the latest technology, we produce Flame retardant dust collector cartridge which has excellent chemical resistance and is suitable for dry dust with high efficiency.\r\n\r\nSize:φ324*16*600\r\nFiltration level:F8\r\nFiltration area: 9 m ²\r\nTest wind speed:  0.8m/s\r\nHighest temperature:120℃',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2527,'2024-11-21 10:02:16','2024-11-21 10:02:16'),(2546,'Mesh Filter Bags','mesh-filter-bags','<h3><strong><b>Specifications</b></strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Material: multiple options.</li>\r\n 	<li>Weaving: Plain weave.</li>\r\n 	<li>Mesh Count: 13mesh~420 mesh/inch.</li>\r\n 	<li>Max Width: 365cm (143 inch).</li>\r\n 	<li>Color: White(Customized).</li>\r\n 	<li>Mesh Opening:30-1500um.</li>\r\n 	<li>Packing: PVC bag inside for each roll, then carton,then waterproof bag outside</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><b>Features</b></strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>A wide range of filter materials in different micron ratings and designs.</li>\r\n 	<li>Plastic flanges or metal rings for wide temperature compatibility.</li>\r\n 	<li>Material are FDA compliant.</li>\r\n 	<li>Silicone free construction.</li>\r\n 	<li>High dirt holding capacity..</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><b>Advantages</b></strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Faster turnaround time from the screen room to the press room.</li>\r\n 	<li>Good diathermancy.</li>\r\n 	<li>High air permeability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Acid resistance and Alkali resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long working life.</li>\r\n 	<li>Hard wear.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><b>Applications</b></strong></h3>\r\nWidely used in areas as filtration and separation industry. Such as food industry for milling filtering and flour milling, milling and other grains milling. Like glucose production, milk powder, soybean milk etc.','Philite® offers a wide range of mesh filter bags in different filter materials such as nylon monofilament, nylon multifilament, polyester multifilament and polypropylene monofilament. Philite® filter bags are available with plastic or metal rings. Filter bags of mesh fabric are suitable for surface filtration (separation of particles larger than the respective pore size).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2547,'2024-11-21 10:54:23','2024-11-21 10:54:23'),(2550,'Nylon Filter Bags','nylon-filter-bags','<img width=\"734\" height=\"448\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1.jpg 734w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1-300x183.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail1-600x366.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 734px) 100vw, 734px\" />													\n		<p>Nylon mesh filter bags are a specific type of fabric filter bag made from nylon (polyamide) material. These bags are known for their durability, chemical resistance, and versatility. They are widely used in various industrial applications for liquid filtration, rather than air filtration, where their unique properties are particularly beneficial.</p><h3>Features of Nylon Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Mechanical Properties</strong></li></ul><p>Nylon (Polyamide): Known for its strong mechanical properties, abrasion resistance, and good chemical compatibility with many substances.</p><ul><li><strong>Filtration Efficiency</strong></li></ul><p>Micron Ratings: Nylon filter bags come in various micron ratings, typically ranging from 1 to 200 microns, allowing for precise filtration levels according to the application needs.<br />Durability:</p><ul><li><strong>Strength</strong></li></ul><p>Nylon is a tough material that can withstand high-pressure conditions and is less likely to tear or break compared to other filter materials.<br />Temperature Resistance: Nylon can generally handle temperatures up to around 120°C (248°F), making it suitable for a variety of industrial processes.</p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>Compatibility: Nylon filter bags are resistant to many chemicals, including oils, hydrocarbons, and organic solvents, though they may not be suitable for strong acids or alkalis.</p><h3>Choose Philite®</h3><p>Philite® nylon monofilament filter bags are made of woven fabric. Monofilament mesh filter bags have super strength and wear resistance, no fiber shedding, and have uniform pore size. With its excellent performance and wide applicability, it has become an important tool in the field of industrial filtration.</p><ul><li><strong>High-quality material</strong>: high-quality nylon monofilament, high toughness, multiple mesh options to choose from.</li><li><strong>Fine processing</strong>: It adopts three-needle and five-thread industrial sewing technology, and uses high-strength sewing thread to thicken the edge, which is strong and reliable.</li><li><strong>Bag top options</strong>: There are a variety of rings to choose from, including stainless steel rings and plastic rings.</li></ul>		\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />											<figcaption>Plastic Ring</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stainless-Steel-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stainless-Steel-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail3.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stainless-Steel-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stainless-Steel-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />											<figcaption>Stainless Steel Ring</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<h3>Our Product Quality</h3><ul><li>Food-grade nylon filter bag has fine mesh, is not easy to block, and can filter liquids finely.</li><li>Reusable and easy to clean, reducing usage costs.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-02-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-02-detail4.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-02-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-02-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"501\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail5.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail5-600x401.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Nylon Filter Bag Model</h3><ul><li><strong>01</strong></li></ul><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"65\">Item</td><td width=\"70\">material</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"143\">mesh count</td><td width=\"94