"72\">380</td><td width=\"72\">153</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG52</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">20</td><td width=\"72\">50</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">338</td><td width=\"72\">48</td><td width=\"72\">270</td><td width=\"72\">98</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG54</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">22</td><td width=\"72\">55</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">315</td><td width=\"72\">46</td><td width=\"72\">275</td><td width=\"72\">103</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG60</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">23</td><td width=\"72\">58</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">285</td><td width=\"72\">43</td><td width=\"72\">280</td><td width=\"72\">110</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG62</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">23.5</td><td width=\"72\">60</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">275</td><td width=\"72\">42</td><td width=\"72\">285</td><td width=\"72\">112</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG64</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">26</td><td width=\"72\">66</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">267</td><td width=\"72\">41</td><td width=\"72\">285</td><td width=\"72\">115</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG66</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">28</td><td width=\"72\">71</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">251</td><td width=\"72\">51</td><td width=\"72\">163</td><td width=\"72\">61</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG68</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">29</td><td width=\"72\">74</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">245</td><td width=\"72\">50</td><td width=\"72\">165</td><td width=\"72\">63</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG70</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">30</td><td width=\"72\">76</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">239</td><td width=\"72\">50</td><td width=\"72\">166</td><td width=\"72\">64</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG72</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">30.5</td><td width=\"72\">77</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">227</td><td width=\"72\">47</td><td width=\"72\">168</td><td width=\"72\">66</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">JMG74</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">32</td><td width=\"72\">81</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">213</td><td width=\"72\">46</td><td width=\"72\">170</td><td width=\"72\">69</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">DMP6</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">34</td><td width=\"72\">86</td><td width=\"72\">80</td><td width=\"72\">80</td><td width=\"72\">178</td><td width=\"72\">41</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">55</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">DMP7</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">42</td><td width=\"72\">106</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">100</td><td width=\"72\">150</td><td width=\"72\">36</td><td width=\"72\">180</td><td width=\"72\">85</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">DMP9</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">44</td><td width=\"72\">111</td><td width=\"72\">80</td><td width=\"72\">80</td><td width=\"72\">152</td><td width=\"72\">43</td><td width=\"72\">140</td><td width=\"72\">70</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">DMP10</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">47</td><td width=\"72\">120</td><td width=\"72\">80</td><td width=\"72\">80</td><td width=\"72\">130</td><td width=\"72\">38</td><td width=\"72\">138</td><td width=\"72\">75</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">DMP11</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">54</td><td width=\"72\">137</td><td width=\"72\">60</td><td width=\"72\">60</td><td width=\"72\">120</td><td width=\"72\">44</td><td width=\"72\">104</td><td width=\"72\">40</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">DMP12</td><td width=\"72\">PA6</td><td width=\"72\">58</td><td width=\"72\">147</td><td width=\"72\">60</td><td width=\"72\">60</td><td width=\"72\">110</td><td width=\"72\">42</td><td width=\"72\">104</td><td width=\"72\">42</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Common Uses of Nylon Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Water Treatment</strong></li></ul><p>Used in industrial and municipal water treatment facilities to filter out particulate matter from water.</p><ul><li><strong>Food and drinks</strong></li></ul><p>Used to filter products such as beer, wine, juices and syrups to ensure they are clean and pure.</p><ul><li><strong>Pharmaceutical</strong></li></ul><p>Used to keep liquid pharmaceuticals and intermediates clean and pure.</p><ul><li><strong>Vehicle</strong></li></ul><p>Used to filter oil, coolant and other fluids in automotive manufacturing and maintenance.</p><ul><li><strong>Chemical processing</strong></li></ul><p>Used in all stages of chemical production to filter impurities and ensure the quality of the final product.</p>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"507\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Common-Uses-of-nylon-filter-bag-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Common-Uses-of-nylon-filter-bag-detail6.jpg 750w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Common-Uses-of-nylon-filter-bag-detail6-300x203.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Common-Uses-of-nylon-filter-bag-detail6-600x406.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Precautions</h3><ul><li>Temperature limit: Nylon has limited high temperature resistance and is generally not suitable for long-term use in environments exceeding 100°C.</li><li>Acidic environment: Nylon has poor resistance to strong acids and may degrade in strong acidic environments.</li><li>Regular inspection and maintenance: In order to ensure the filtration effect and the life of the filter bag, the integrity of the filter bag needs to be checked regularly and necessary cleaning and maintenance must be performed.</li></ul>','Nylon filter bags are a versatile and reliable choice for a wide range of liquid filtration needs, offering strong performance and durability across many industrial applications.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Monofilament nylon.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mesh size</strong>: 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 150, 200, 400, 500, 600, 800µm or Customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Generic specifications</strong>: 12″x12″, 11″x16″,10″x12″,26″x22″or customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag top types</strong>: Plastic ring top, Metal ring top, Drawstring top.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum operating temperature</strong>: 90℃.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2551,'2024-11-21 10:56:29','2025-01-22 00:15:24'),(2567,'Acid-Resistant Fiberglass Filter Fabric','acid-resistant-fiberglass-filter-fabric','<h3>Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Corrosion Resistance</strong>: Can withstand exposure to a variety of acidic substances without degrading.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thermal Resistance</strong>: Can tolerate high temperatures, making it suitable for high-heat environments.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mechanical Strength</strong>: Offers good tensile strength and dimensional stability.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Electrical Insulation</strong>: Maintains insulating properties in acidic conditions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product  Specification</h3>\r\n<table width=\"618\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">ES-S810IM</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Treatment</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">PFFE,PTFE membrane</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Weight</strong><strong>（gsm）</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">810</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Warp and weft density(cm)</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">18.8X15.7</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Thickness(mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">0.75</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Air permeability(cm</strong><strong>³/cm²/s)</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">2-4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"231\"><strong>Tensile strength(N/25mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"306\">2400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\">weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"306\">2800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"231\"><strong>Temperature(</strong><strong>°C/°F)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">Continue</td>\r\n<td width=\"306\">260/500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\">Instant</td>\r\n<td width=\"306\">300/572</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Anti-acid</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"231\"><strong>Anti-alkali</strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"387\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Application</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Thermal power plants.</li>\r\n 	<li>Coal-fired boilers for heating.</li>\r\n 	<li>Waste incineration plants.</li>\r\n 	<li>Metallurgical plants.</li>\r\n 	<li>Chemical industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Carbon black plants.</li>\r\n 	<li>Cement plants.</li>\r\n</ul>','Acid-resistant fiberglass cloth is designed to withstand corrosive environments, particularly those involving exposure to acids. This type of cloth is typically used in industries such as chemical processing, wastewater treatment, and in environments where strong acids or other corrosive substances are present. The fiberglass material is coated or treated with acid-resistant resins or chemicals, such as fluoropolymers or silicone, to enhance its ability to resist degradation when exposed to acidic environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2568,'2024-11-21 11:11:22','2025-02-18 14:59:05'),(2575,'Belt Filter Cloth','belt-filter-cloth','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fb546cf5-4332-47c7-9e00-9425ad39454d-main1_syy.jpeg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fb546cf5-4332-47c7-9e00-9425ad39454d-main1_syy.jpeg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fb546cf5-4332-47c7-9e00-9425ad39454d-main1_syy-300x300.jpeg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fb546cf5-4332-47c7-9e00-9425ad39454d-main1_syy-150x150.jpeg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fb546cf5-4332-47c7-9e00-9425ad39454d-main1_syy-100x100.jpeg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-01-main2_syy.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-01-main2_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-01-main2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-01-main2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-01-main2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-03-main3_syy.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-03-main3_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-03-main3_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-03-main3_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Belt-Filter-Cloth-03-main3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" />\r\n\r\nWoven filter cloth is a material that can be used for filtration and separation, with a wide range of applications in various industries, including metallurgy, chemical, non-ferrous metal, food processing, and more. The fabric weave is how the warp and weft yarns are interlaced, The repeat is the smallest weave unit, when repeated, will produce the design required in the fabric.\r\n<h3>There are Three Basic Weaves  for Belt Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-content{width:100%}@media (min-width:768px){.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper,.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{display:flex}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:end;flex-direction:row-reverse}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:start;flex-direction:row}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-top .elementor-image-box-img{margin:auto}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-top .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-start}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-middle .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-bottom .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-end}}@media (max-width:767px){.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;margin-bottom:15px}}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-title a{color:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-description{margin:0}</style>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Plain-Weave-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"358\" /></figure>\r\n<h3>Plain Weave</h3>\r\nThe plain weave is the simplest and the most used weave. Each warp yarn passes alternately over one and then under one weft yarn, Two adjacent warp yarns interlace the exact opposite, Therefore, the plain weave makes one repeat by two ends and two picks, There is only one plain weave, but there are many different twill and satin weaves. Unless colors is printed onto the surface, plain weave fabrics are generally considered to be reversible.\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Twill-Weave-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"344\" /></figure>\r\n<h3>Twill Weave</h3>\r\nThe twill weave is characterized by a diagonal line on the cloth . In a right hand twill, the diagonals run upward to the right. In a left hand twill, the lines run upward to the left. Filtration cloth for belt filter press yarns used in making twill weave fabrics frequently are tightly twisted and exhibit good strength, In general, twill weave fabrics are strong and durable.\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Satin-Weave-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"366\" /></figure>\r\n<h3>Satin Weave</h3>\r\nSatin weaves are characterized by having long floats of either warp or weft yarn and nonadjacent interlacing points. Filtration cloth for belt filter press the satin weave fabric has a smooth and lustrous surface, However, the long floats tend to be snagged and abraded easily, Thus, satin fabrics are not as durable as plain or twill weave fabrics.\r\n<h3>The Uniqueness of Philite® Belt Filter Cloth</h3>\r\nOur Double Layer Weave fabrics are designed for belts filter. Double weave technology combines fine filter fabric laminated with sturdy supporting fabric. Best filtration results and enhanced lifetime is achieved by combining the functions of a fine filtration layer and a support drainage layer. This concept is recognized as being the most successful standard for vacuum belt filters.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Best permeability due to optimal fabric design.</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of pore sizes (7-150 µm).</li>\r\n 	<li>Optimum particle retention, due to special pore structure.</li>\r\n 	<li>Excellent cake release, resulting from the special surface treatment of the fabrics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/3-570x375-detail1.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/3-570x375-detail1.png 570w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/3-570x375-detail1-300x197.png 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"375\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/4-570x404-detail2.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/4-570x404-detail2.png 570w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/4-570x404-detail2-300x213.png 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"404\" />\r\n\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>\r\n<h2>Diagrammatic Sketch</h2>\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-1024x283.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-1024x283.png 1024w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-300x83.png 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-768x212.png 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-1536x424.png 1536w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-1320x365.png 1320w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3-600x166.png 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1-detail3.png 1882w\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"283\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2-detail4.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 370px) 100vw, 370px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2-detail4.jpg 370w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/2-detail4-300x94.jpg 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"116\" />\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemicals</strong>: Polymers, silicates, pigments, fertilizer, sulfuric acid, PTA, phosphoric acid, soda bicarbonate, zeolite, catalysts.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Minerals</strong>: Phosphoric rock washing, rare earth, tailings, iron, zinc, coal, copper.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Life science</strong>: Active pharmaceutical ingredients, nutraceuticals, agrochemicals, intermediates.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food</strong>: Caffeine, coffee, glutamate, citric acid, starch, gluten, lecithin, spirulina.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Environmental</strong>: Flue gas desulfurization, fly ash, wastewater, coolant purification.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Technical Parameters</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">Product Code</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Yarn Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">Weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">Air Permeability (L/m²/S @200pa)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-08</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">630</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">40</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-20</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">630</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">80</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">550</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-50</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">550</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-85</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">550</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.13</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-120</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">550</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">1200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-PDW-150</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">770</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">1500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-EDW-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-EDW-40</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-EDW-50</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-EDW-85</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-EDW-120</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">ES-EDW-150</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"97\">Mono/Mono</td>\r\n<td width=\"81\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">1200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Belt filter cloth is a type of fabric used in industrial filtration processes, especially for solid-liquid separation. It is designed to support the filtration process in belt filter presses, which are widely used in various industries such as wastewater treatment, mining, paper production, and food processing. They are mostly made of synthetic fibers with good filtration properties and durability.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material:</strong> PP(Polypropylene), PET(Polyester) , Nylon, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weaving Methods:</strong> Plain, Twill, Satin.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cloth Codes Most Widely Used:</strong> PDW series, EDW series.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2648,'2024-11-21 11:23:27','2024-11-21 13:10:04'),(2596,'Filter Mesh in Flour Mill','filter-mesh-in-flour-mill','<h2>Certificate:</h2>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2599\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/UKAS-detail1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"256\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2598\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/SGS-detail2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" />\r\n<h2>Specification Data:</h2>\r\n<table width=\"792\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">No.</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Mat