/td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">39</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">104</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">45</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">DMP14</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">62/69</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">157/175</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">48+40*2</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">48</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">97</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">40</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">40</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">DMP15</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">65/74</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">165/188</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">48+40*2</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">48</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">90</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">38</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">42</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2597,'2024-11-21 11:43:43','2024-11-21 11:43:44'),(2601,'Industry Mesh','industry-mesh','<h2>1.Printing</h2>\r\nWe are the only industrial company in the world to simultaneously manufacture and sell both textiles and chemical products for the screen-printing process. This synergy helps ensure the best quality, an extensive range and the highest performance levels in the application phase.\r\n\r\nSpecialized experience, dedicated laboratories and exclusive production technologies result in screen fabrics which, thanks to a continuously improving weaving process and proprietary finishing treatments, achieve excellent levels of performance.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2603\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/printing-mesh-300x199-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" />\r\n<h2>2.Chemicals</h2>\r\nChemicals Division offers frame adhesives, mesh degreasers, photosensitive emulsions, capillary films, blockouts and fillers, and reclaim chemistry.\r\n\r\nThe innovation promoted  is aimed at offering products that are developed specifically for the different industry segments: glass, textile, Computer To Screen, ceramics and hi-end industrial applications.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2604\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemicals-mesh-detail2-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n<h2>3.Filtration</h2>\r\nWe has perfected the technology of manufacturing fabrics to a high degree of precision. Every phase of the production process is carefully monitored, employing frequent in-house testing and rigorous inspection to ensure consistent quality. We have Class 10,000 Clean Rooms in accordance with UNI ISO 9001 regulations and certified to USP Class VI. Filtration is committed to creating innovative, customized solutions. Our engineers can modify fabric surfaces to enhance performance, dye to virtually any color, and create quality custom fabricated parts, in order to provide solutions to the most demanding applications.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2605\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filtration-mesh-300x199-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" />\r\n<h2>4.Protection</h2>\r\nProtection Division is a global leader manufacturer of the most advanced textiles and textile based products designed for ballistic and multi-threat protection fulfilling the most demanding requests from all Law Enforcement and Military sectors.\r\n\r\nOur mission is to constantly update its product portfolio in close cooperation with customers, suppliers and through employing a well-equipped and comprehensive research and development department.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2606\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Protection-mesh-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"185\" />','Philite industrial mesh is highly appreciated at compact and liquid separation in the membrane technology, industries like food/beverage, automotive, chemical and pharma areas– built a solid reputation due to their enormous diversity for industrial processes.\r\nCustomization accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2602,'2024-11-21 11:48:36','2024-11-21 11:48:36'),(2609,'Arc Screen Filter Elements','arc-screen-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nThe arc screen is an economical and practical solid-liquid separation device, particularly widely used in the pulp and paper industry as well as in livestock farming. Its V-shaped screen surface with a water-cut design enhances the filtration area and effectiveness during operation.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The stainless steel V-shaped wire grid type arc screen plate features slot widths ranging from 20 to 3500 micrometers.</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatic cleaning of sieve plates and feeding ports,convenient, economical and practical.</li>\r\n 	<li>With a compact structure, it is convenient for installation operation, and maintenance, devoid of rotating components, ensuring reliable operation.</li>\r\n 	<li>Featuring a continuous slot design, it boasts a large open area with excellent filtration performance. Selection can be tailored according to the specific requirements of the application process.</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507、TA2、904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2610,'2024-11-21 11:51:15','2024-11-21 11:51:15'),(2615,'Centrifuge Conical Screen Basket Filter Elements','centrifuge-conical-screen-basket-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nConical screen baskets are typically made from nick-el-chromium woven mesh or laser perforation, whereas the conical screen baskets manufactured by Idess using wedge wire mesh offer a superior alternative. The V-shaped wire centrifuge screen baskets provide precise, customized slot sizes to meet customer needs and enhance starch refining processes.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Compared to nickel-chromium mesh, it enhances fiber dewatering.</li>\r\n 	<li>It has a longer service life and is more convenient for cleaning.</li>\r\n 	<li>The minimum slot opening can reach 20 microns.</li>\r\n 	<li>Superior V-shaped wires are selected for anti-clogging properties, capable of withstanding high backwashing pressures.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Application Area</h3>\r\nThey are generally widely used in applications such as potato fiber separation, potato refining, cassava starch processing, and in horizontal decanter centrifuges.','<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507、TA2、904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2616,'2024-11-21 11:53:23','2024-11-21 11:53:23'),(2620,'Beverage Liquid Filter Housing','beverage-liquid-filter-housing','Philite®  filter housings are designed for filtration of beverages and other liquids such as process water, mineral water, beer, wine, soft drinks, juice and other products. The housing is a cost-effective stainless steel housings.  It is built using 304 SS, mil finish inner and bead blast exterior, equipped with two pressure gauges and either FNPT or Flanged connections, depending on the housing size. All housings are built to accept Code 7 filter elements.\r\n<h2>Technical Data</h2>\r\nHousing Material :304L SS (316 SS available upon request)\r\nGasket Material  :(other gasket materials are available upon request)\r\nMax. Operating Pressure :150 psig at 300°F\r\nMax. Inlet Temperature :Up to 300°F\r\nConnection Types :FNPT and Flange, depending on size\r\nInner Surface Finish :Mill Finish Stainless Steel\r\nOuter Surface Finish :Bead Blast','Designed for filtration of liquids such as process water, mineral water, beer, wine, soft drinks, juice and other liquids. It is mill finished inside with a two-part paint exterior. The housing is equipped with a vent and clean and dirty drain ports. All housings are built to accept Code 7 filter elements using 226 o-rings, bayonet locking tabs and locating fins. Custom housings are available upon request.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2621,'2024-11-21 11:55:26','2024-11-21 11:55:26'),(2623,'Corrosion Resistant Housing','corrosion-resistant-housing','<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3>Tantaline Corrosion Resistant Housing Range</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>A selection of housings ranges can be modified to provide a surface that is composed of pure Tantalum metal. This produces a product that has far greater resistance to many corrosive chemicals than nickel alloys such as Hastelloy and a significantly more robust surface finish than coated housings.</div>\r\n<div>The use of Tantaline vapour deposition for protection against chemical attack is already being used for a range of process equipment including valves, pipework fittings, couplings and pump impellers. Amazon Filters is the first company to offer stainless steels housings that utilise this technology.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>It is more suitable than nickel alloys for a range of chemicals including:</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>hydrogen iodide</li>\r\n 	<li>hydrogen sulphide</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>and various acids such as :</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>hydrochloric</li>\r\n 	<li>sulphuric</li>\r\n 	<li>nitric</li>\r\n 	<li>phosphoric</li>\r\n 	<li>formic</li>\r\n 	<li>acetic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Unlike coating technology the deposition process produces a surface that does not suffer from separation, peeling or flaking. The Tantaline alloy deposition is approximately 50 µm deep and typically a depth of only 10 µm is needed for protection, therefore significant safety margin is built into the design.</div>\r\n<div>Price is available on application, but generally lead times and prices are similar to existing hastelloy variants.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3>PTFE Housings</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Housings are manufactured from PTFE so exhibit exceptional resistance to the widest range of chemicals. This range consists of two variants, one made from pure unfilled PTFE and one made from carbon filled PTFE. The carbon filled PTFE housing is conductive so reduces the risk of static build-up and discharge and therefore is particularly attractive for processes operated in potentially explosive atmospheres.</div>','Philite is a leading supplier of filter housings to a wide range of industries including many where effective filtration of chemical products is critical to their operations. Where highly corrosive chemicals such as concentrated acids are being processed, specialised housings such as those manufactured with an internal coating or made from exotic alloys such as hastelloy may be considered.\r\nCustomization accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2624,'2024-11-21 11:57:12','2024-11-21 11:57:12'),(2626,'Cellulose Filter Paper','cellulose-filter-paper','<h3>Qualitative Cellulose Filter Papers</h3>\r\nWaterfiltech offers a wide choice of qualitative cellulose filter papers with different levels of purity, hardness, flow rate, loading capacity, and chemical resistance. Two formats are available: standard filters and wet-strengthened filters.\r\n<h3>Specifications of Standard Products</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Complete Pack Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">100 Pieces</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Customized</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Particle Retention in Liquid</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">2-25µm1)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Thickness</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">150–350 µm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Basic Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">68-161 g/m2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Air Flow Rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">13 – 32 s/100 ml/in2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Ash Content</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">0.06–0.15%2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Cellulose</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Trace Element Levels</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Aluminium 3.6 µg/g&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAntimony &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nArsenic &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nBarium &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nBoron &lt;1 µg/g\r\n\r\nCalcium 27.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nChromium 1 µg/g\r\n\r\nCopper 0.9 µg/g\r\n\r\nIron 13.7 µg/g\r\n\r\nLead &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nMagnesium 21 µg/g\r\n\r\nManganese &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nMercury &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nPotassium 6.2 µg/g\r\n\r\nSilicon 8.8 µg/g\r\n\r\nSodium 32.3 µg/g\r\n\r\nZinc 58.3 µg/g</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"568\">1)Particle retention rating at 98% efficiency.&nbsp;\r\n\r\n2)Ash is determined by ignition of the cellulose filter at 900°C in air.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Specifications of Wet Strengthened Products</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Complete Pack Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">100 Pieces</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Customized</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Particle Retention in Liquid</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">2-30µm1)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Thickness</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">140–420 µm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Basic Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">65-125 g/m2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Air Flow Rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">2- 7 s/100 ml/in2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Cellulose</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Trace Element Levels</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Aluminium 3.6 µg/g&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAntimony &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nArsenic &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nBarium &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nBoron &lt;1 µg/g\r\n\r\nCalcium 27.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nChromium 1 µg/g\r\n\r\nCopper 0.9 µg/g\r\n\r\nIron 13.7 µg/g\r\n\r\nLead &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nMagnesium 21 µg/g\r\n\r\nManganese &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nMercury &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nPotassium 6.2 µg/g\r\n\r\nSilicon 8.8 µg/g\r\n\r\nSodium 32.3 µg/g\r\n\r\nZinc 58.3 µg/g</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"568\">1)Particle retention rating at 98% efficiency.&nbsp;\r\n\r\n2)Ash is determined by ignition of the cellulose filter at 900°C in air.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Quantitative Cellulose Filter Papers</h3>\r\nWaterfiltech Cellulose Filter Papers are very pure filters suitable for a wide range of critical analytic filtration procedures.They are designed to meet your various specific needs.\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Complete Pack Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">100 Pieces</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Format</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Circles</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Particle Retention in Liquid</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">2.5-22µm1)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical water flow rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">5-453 ml/min2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Thickness</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">115–220 µm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Basic Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">78-100 g/m2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Air Flow Rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">3 – 144 s/100 ml/in2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Ash Content</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">0.01–0.015%2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">High-quality Cotton Linters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Trace Element Levels&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Aluminium 2.5 µg/g&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAntimony &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nArsenic &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nBarium &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nBoron &lt;1 µg/g\r\n\r\nCalcium 8.3 µg/g\r\n\r\nChromium 1.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nCopper 2 µg/g\r\n\r\nIron 12 µg/g\r\n\r\nLead &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nMagnesium 4 µg/g\r\n\r\nManganese &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nMercury &lt;0.5 µg/g\r\n\r\nPotassium 2.3 µg/g\r\n\r\nSilicon 6.2 µg/g\r\n\r\nSodium 16.8 µg/g\r\n\r\nZinc 64.5 µg/g</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"568\">1)Particle retention rating at 98% efficiency.&nbsp;\r\n\r\n2)Ash is determined by ignition of the cellulose filter at 900°C in air.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Philite® qualitative and quantitative cellulose filters papers are manufactured from high quality cellulose and cotton linters which have been treated to achieve a minimum alpha cellulose content of 98% to maintain guaranteed quality, reproducibility, and uniformity. The filters are tested for basic weight, thickness, air flow, and mechanical strength. They are mainly used for sample clarification or precipitate recovery before material identification or quantification in areas such as pharmaceutical, chemical, environmental testing, food and beverage, mining, cement and many other industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2627,'2024-11-21 11:58:59','2024-11-21 11:58:59'),(2629,'Glass Microfiber Filter Paper','glass-microfiber-filter-paper','Waterfiltech offers glass microfiber filters manufactured from 100% borosilicate glass, with or without binder. Filters without binder are chemically inert.\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Complete Pack Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">100 pieces</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Air Flow Rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">3.7–40 s/100 ml/in2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Thickness</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">260–730 µm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Basis Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">53–145 g/m2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Max recommended temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">500 °C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Borosilicate glass</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical Particle Retention in Liquid</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">0.7–2.7 µm1)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Typical water flow rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">41–681ml/min2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"568\">1)Particle retention rating at 98% efficiency.&nbsp;\r\n\r\n2)Normalized for 9 cm diameter. Measured under gravity for comparative purposes</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Philite® glass fiber filters are world-renowned as a standard for laboratory filtration and are associated with quality, reliability and reproducibility. These depth filters combine fast flow rates with high loading capacity, retention of very fine particles, and can be used at temperatures up to 500ºC. Our glass microfiber filters are mainly used in applications such as air or water monitoring and can be used as pre-filters for membranes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2630,'2024-11-21 12:00:25','2024-11-21 12:00:25'),(2632,'Belt Filter Press','belt-filter-press','The Belt Filter Press is a broadly applicable product for dewateringmunicipal and industrial sludge\r\n\r\nABelt Filter Press is a biosolids/sludge dewatering device that appliesmechanical pressure to a chemically conditioned slurry, which is sandwichedbetween two tensioned belts, by passing those belts through a serpentine ofdecreasing diameter rollers. The machine can actually be divided into three zones:\r\n\r\n（1）gravityzone, where free draining water is drained by gravity through a porous belt;\r\n\r\n（2）wedgezone, where the solids are prepared for pressure application;\r\n\r\n（3） pressure zone, where medium, thenhigh pressure is applied to the conditioned solids.\r\n\r\nTypically,a belt filter press receives a slurry ranging from 1-4% feed solids andproduces a final product of 12-35% cake solids. Performance depends on thenature of the solids being processed.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2633,'2024-11-21 12:02:58','2024-11-21 12:02:59'),(2636,'Polymer Preparation Unit','polymer-preparation-unit','<h2><strong>Basic Composition</strong></h2>\r\n1 set of three tankdevices- preparation, maturing and storage units, standard material adoptstainless steel, polypropylene (PP) material can also be adopted.\r\n\r\n1 set of powder feedingdevice: screw conveyor, hopper, dosage is controlled by frequency conversion.\r\n\r\n1 set of wetting device:wetting funnel and related connecting accessories for thinning and wettingpowder.\r\n\r\n1 sets of water inletsystem: Flow meter and electromagnetic valve can automatically control theinlet water.\r\n\r\n1 sets of controlcabinet: for the whole system, optional automatic powder feeding system.\r\n<h2><strong>Feature</strong></h2>\r\nA combination of threetanks contributes to the continuous preparation process, easy operation,convenient maintenance, and the great reduction of labor cost. The machineoperation is safe and reliable, with automatic protection and alarm function.The material has good corrosion resistance, and parts in contact with themedium all adopt the stainless steel material. Liquid solubility can bearbitrarily adjusted according to the actual demand. (generally 0.05% – 0.5%)with heating function, which can effectively avoid the wet powder agglomerationor deterioration. The machine can be automaticly intermittent and stopcross-mixing with standby time, so the mixing liquid level sensor (can senselow, medium and high level)automatic powder conveying system(optional).\r\n<h2><strong>Application</strong></h2>\r\nMunicipal sewage andindutrial wastewater flocculation preparing.\r\n\r\nSludge dewateringtreatment sector\r\n\r\nWater plants usingsurface water as water source\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2638\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/11-detail1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"128\" />\r\n<h2><strong>Benefits</strong></h2>\r\nLow maintenancerequirement\r\n\r\nImproving operationefficiency\r\n\r\nLow polymer consumption\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2639\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/22-detail2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"129\" />\r\n<h2>Technical Data</h2>','Dissolving and dosingsystem is a key factor to save the cost of sludge treatment!\r\n\r\nWith many years ofsuccessful experience in water treatment industries, we have developed theHPL3 series dry-powder preparation and dosing equipment dedicated forpreparing, storing, and dosing the powder and liquids. Serving as flocculatingagent or other powder can be prepared continuously and automatically incompliance with the required concentration. In addition, the continuousmeasurement of dosing of the prepared solution is available during theindustrial process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',2637,'2024-11-21 12:05:38','2024-11-21 12:05:38'),(3067,'PTFE Filter Bags','ptfe-filter-bags','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */<br />.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Wholesale-PTFE-Filter-Bags-详情1-1024x536.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Wholesale-PTFE-Filter-Bags-详情1-1024x536.jpg 1024w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Wholesale-PTFE-Filter-Bags-详情1-300x157.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Wholesale-PTFE-Filter-Bags-详情1-768x402.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Wholesale-PTFE-Filter-Bags-详情1-600x314.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Wholesale-PTFE-Filter-Bags-详情1.jpg 1200w\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"536\" />\r\n\r\nPTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene), also known as Teflon, is a polymer material with excellent properties. This material is resistant to acids, alkalis, and various organic solvents, and is almost insoluble in all solvents. It is also resistant to high temperatures and has an extremely low friction coefficient.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Feature of PTFE Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Excellent high temperature resistance</strong>: Withstands continuous operating temperatures up to 260°C (500°F) and can reach up to 300°C (572°F).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Excellent acid and alkali resistance</strong>: PTFE can withstand almost all chemicals, making it an ideal material for filtering corrosive substances.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High filtration efficiency</strong>: Low coefficient of friction helps prevent particles from sticking and effectively captures fine particles.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Hydrophobicity</strong>: PTFE naturally repels water and other liquids, helping to control humidity in critical applications</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable</strong>: The service life can reach 6 years under normal operating conditions in the temperature range of 66°C to 204°C.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Filtration Principle of PTFE Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Physical filtration</strong>: PTFE filter bag filters particles with its microporous structure, and its pore size is usually between 0.1 micron and 1 micron. When gas or liquid passes through the filter bag, larger particles will be blocked by the pore size of the filter bag, while smaller particles can pass through the pore size of the filter bag, thus achieving the purpose of filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Surface filtration</strong>: Its porous surface can capture and aggregate particles to form a dense filter layer to prevent smaller particles from passing through. When the filter layer formed in the early stage is thick enough, its filtration effect will be better.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Inertial interception</strong>: Inertial interception refers to the inertia of particles in gas or liquid that prevents them from directly passing through the pore size of the filter bag and being intercepted. When particles flow through the filter bag, the inertial force will cause larger and heavier particles to deviate from the direction of the airflow and be intercepted on the surface of the filter bag.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Electrostatic adsorption</strong>: Due to the charged nature of the surface of the PTFE filter bag, when there are charged fine particles in the gas, they will be adsorbed by the static electricity on the surface of the filter bag, thereby increasing the filtration effect.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Physical Properties</h3>\r\n<table width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Air permeability(L/m².s) @200pa</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Tensile strength(N/5 cm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Temperature(℃ / ℉)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>warp</td>\r\n<td>weft</td>\r\n<td>Operating</td>\r\n<td>Ultimate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>100~200</td>\r\n<td>1000</td>\r\n<td>1100</td>\r\n<td>260 / 500</td>\r\n<td>300 / 572</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Chemical Properties</h3>\r\n<table width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Acid Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Alkali Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Hydrolytic Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Oxidation Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Abrasion resistance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n<table width=\"681\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Heat resistance</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Up to 300℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Fabric</td>\r\n<td>100% PTFE fiber</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Length &amp; diameter</td>\r\n<td>No limited</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Thickness</td>\r\n<td>1.0-1.8mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Air permeability</td>\r\n<td>30-80mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Area weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td>700~800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Working lifetime</td>\r\n<td>12000 hours and more</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Breaking elongation (%)</td>\r\n<td>(Warp): &lt;40\r\n(Weft): &lt;60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Breaking strength</td>\r\n<td>(Warp): &gt;1350\r\n(Weft): &gt;1450</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Surface Treatment of PTFE Filter Bags</h3>\r\nThere are 2 kinds of treatment : “PTFE film” and “PTFE dipping”\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>PTFE film:</strong> Improve filtration precision: ≤10mg/m³, but lower the filtration efficiency; and a substantial increase in acid-base resistance property.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>PTFE dipping:</strong> Improve filtration precision: ≤25mg/m³, does not lower the filtration efficiency; and a small increase in acid-base resistance property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\nPTFE filter bags can provide excellent filtering effects in various harsh filtering environments. The application of this material not only improves the filtering efficiency, but also brings more possibilities to industrial production and promotes the progress and development of the industry.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical Processing</strong>: Used in environments where aggressive chemicals are handled.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pharmaceuticals</strong>: Ensures product purity and compliance with stringent industry standards.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food and Beverage</strong>: Maintains high standards of hygiene and product quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mining and Metals</strong>: Effective in dust collection systems where high temperatures and corrosive gases are present.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Waste Incineration</strong>: Withstands high temperatures and corrosive gases produced during incineration.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cement Plants</strong>: Used in kiln and mill processes where temperatures are high.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情2.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pulse-Jet-Filter-详情3.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pulse-Jet-Filter-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pulse-Jet-Filter-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Pulse-Jet-Filter-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industr-详情4.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industr-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industr-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industr-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Food-and-Beverage-Industry-详情5.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Food-and-Beverage-Industry-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Food-and-Beverage-Industry-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Food-and-Beverage-Industry-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<h3>How Philite® Improves The Performance of PTFE Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Advanced needle punching technology, cross-laying, the number of layers is controlled between 6 and 8. The frequency of needle punching reaches 21,000 needles/min.</li>\r\n 	<li>Thickened PTFE microporous membrane with a porosity of more than 80%, high-precision filtration and breathability.</li>\r\n 	<li>The modern professional filter material coating machine can film filter materials of all materials, and the coating is firm and even.</li>\r\n 	<li>In order to prevent dust from entering through the suture needle space, the sutures and interfaces are glued and sealed, and the bag body is film-breaking and hot-melted.</li>\r\n 	<li>Increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collector.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-filter-bag-factory-详情7.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-filter-bag-factory-详情7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-filter-bag-factory-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/ptfe-filter-bag-factory-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-filter-bags-详情6.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-filter-bags-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-filter-bags-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-filter-bags-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li>\r\n 	<li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li>\r\n 	<li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li>\r\n 	<li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li>\r\n</ul>','PTFE filter bags have perfect filtration performance during water pre-treatment and post-treatment. As an upgraded version of PTFE, ePTFE is more flexible, breathable and filterable.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: PTFE Needle Punched Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Shape</strong>: Round or Pleat.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Post-treatment</strong>: Calendering, heat setting, singeing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Application</strong>: Dust, gas, liquid filtration.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3068,'2024-11-25 10:31:45','2024-12-01 11:16:45'),(3083,'Fiberglass Filter Bags','fiberglass-filter-bags','<h3>What is Fiberglass？</h3><p>The fiberglass is an inorganic fiber whose main component is SiO2. It is obtained by melting the glass frit at a temperature of 1300-1600 ° C, drawing filaments from the molten state and rapidly quenching. There are two kinds of filter materials: C glass (medium-alkali glass or soda calcium silicate glass) and E glass (alkali-free glass or aluminoborosilicate glass). The most advantages of fiberglass is high temperature resistance, good dimensional stability, and high tensile breaking strength. In terms of chemical corrosion resistance, glass fiber is stable to other media except hydrofluoric acid and high temperature and strong alkali.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-yarn-详情1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-yarn-详情1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-yarn-详情1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/fiberglass-yarn-详情1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Features of Fiberglass Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>Can withstand temperatures up to 260°C (500°F) or higher, depending on the specific treatment and construction.</p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong></li></ul><p>Excellent resistance to acids, alkalis and other corrosive substances.</p><ul><li><strong>Mechanical Strength</strong></li></ul><p>Durable and wear-resistant, extending the service life of the filter bag, generally &gt; 4500 hours.</p><ul><li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong></li></ul><p>Capable of capturing fine particles and providing efficient filtration performance.</p><ul><li><strong>Dimensional Stability</strong></li></ul><p>Maintains shape and structure even under high temperature conditions, ensuring consistent filtration performance.</p><hr /><h3>Woven Fiberglass Filter Bags VS Non-woven Fiberglass Filter Bags</h3><p>Woven fiberglass and non-woven fiberglass have obvious differences in manufacturing processes and application characteristics. Woven fiberglass filter bags are more suitable for high temperature and harsh environments, with high mechanical strength and durability. Non-woven fiberglass filter bags are softer and have good air permeability, and are suitable for medium and low temperature and light dust environments.</p>		\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Non-woven-fiberglass-needle-felt-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />											<figcaption>Non-woven fiberglass needle felt</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Woven-fiberglass-cloth-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Woven-fiberglass-cloth-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Woven-fiberglass-cloth-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Woven-fiberglass-cloth-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />											<figcaption>Woven fiberglass cloth</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td>Item</td><td><h3>Non-woven Fiberglass Filter Bags</h3></td><td><h3>Woven Fiberglass Filter Bags</h3></td></tr><tr><td>Manufacturing process</td><td>Glass fibers are combined physically or chemically using non-woven processes such as needle punching, meltblowing or spunbonding.</td><td>Glass fiber yarn is woven into cloth. The yarn is arranged in a certain warp and weft to form a regular fabric structure.</td></tr><tr><td>High temperature resistance</td><td>Higher, slightly lower than woven type.</td><td>Extremely high, can withstand high temperature environment, suitable for use under high temperature conditions.</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanical strength</td><td>Low, but better softness and adaptability.</td><td>Strong, wear-resistant, suitable for harsh working environment.</td></tr><tr><td>Filtration efficiency</td><td>High, good air permeability, suitable for capturing fine particles.</td><td>High, but relatively poor air permeability.</td></tr><tr><td>Applicable environment</td><td>Medium temperature, low corrosion and fine dust particles environment.</td><td>High temperature, high corrosion and high wear environment.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Properties of Non-woven Fiberglass Filter Bags</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Fiberglass fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Fiberglass yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"218\">850</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"218\">2,4</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">m</td><td width=\"218\">≤2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">PTFE impregnation</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 /S @200pa</td><td width=\"218\">200 ~ 300</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp (N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"218\">1300</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft(N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"218\">1500</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"218\">8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"218\">8</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continue temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"218\">230</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"218\">250</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Properties of  Woven Fiberglass  Filter Bags</h3><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Type</td><td width=\"60\">EWTF450</td><td width=\"60\">EWTF550</td><td width=\"60\">EWTF800</td><td width=\"61\">CWTF450</td><td width=\"123\">CWTF550</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Weight (g/m2 )</td><td width=\"60\">450</td><td width=\"60\">550</td><td width=\"60\">800</td><td width=\"61\">450</td><td width=\"123\">550</td></tr><tr><td width=\"160\">Tensile strength (N/25mm)</td><td width=\"35\">warp</td><td width=\"60\">＞1750</td><td width=\"60\">＞2200</td><td width=\"60\">＞2400</td><td width=\"61\">＞1700</td><td width=\"123\">＞1700</td></tr><tr><td width=\"160\"> </td><td width=\"35\">weft</td><td width=\"60\">＞1000</td><td width=\"60\">＞1500</td><td width=\"60\">＞2100</td><td width=\"61\">＞1900</td><td width=\"123\">＞1200</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Permeability(cm/s)</td><td width=\"60\">20~55</td><td width=\"60\">15~35</td><td width=\"60\">10~30</td><td width=\"61\">20~40</td><td width=\"123\">20~40</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Service temperature(℃)</td><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"182\">≤280</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"184\">≤260</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Recommended  air flow(m/min)</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"121\">＜0.5</td><td width=\"60\">＜0.7</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"184\">＜0.5</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Remark</td><td colspan=\"5\" width=\"366\">Description include PSI、 FCA、 RH、 BI 、ST,width range 400-1000mm,filter bag diameter rangeΦ120-300mm</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Surface Treatment</h3><ul><li><strong>PTFE Coating</strong></li></ul><p>PTFE coating allows dust to remain on the surface of the film and not enter the fibers of the filter material, thereby extending the service life of the filter material.</p><ul><li><strong>PTFE Impregnation</strong></li></ul><p>The filter material is impregnated in a PTFE solution and then dried to improve the filter material’s resistance to temperature and chemical corrosion.</p><ul><li><strong>Silicone coating</strong></li></ul><p>Enhances wear resistance and anti-sticking properties, reduces dust adhesion, and improves cleaning effect.</p><ul><li><strong>Graphite coating</strong></li></ul><p>Improve the high temperature resistance and oxidation resistance of the filter bag, while enhancing acid and alkali resistance.</p><ul><li><strong>Calendering</strong></li></ul><p>Calendering makes the filter material surface smooth and uniform in thickness, making it denser, smoother, and easier to clean. It can also reduce the pore size, making it difficult for dust to enter the deep layer of the filter material, thereby increasing the service life of the filter material.</p><hr /><h3>Application of Fiberglass Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Cement Plants</strong></li></ul><p>For kiln and clinker coolers.</p><ul><li><strong>Metal Processing</strong></li></ul><p>For furnaces and smelters.</p><ul><li><strong>Power Plants</strong></li></ul><p>For flue gas desulfurization.</p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Processing</strong></li></ul><p>For handling corrosive gases and materials.</p><ul><li><strong>Waste Incineration</strong></li></ul><p>For controlling emissions from incinerators.</p>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Steel-factory-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-filter-bag-factory-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-filter-bag-factory-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-filter-bag-factory-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-filter-bag-factory-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7-1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/filter-bag-workshop-06-详情7-1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Fiberglass-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-bag-factory-inspection-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-bag-factory-inspection-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-bag-factory-inspection-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-bag-factory-inspection-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','Fiberglass filter bags are specialized filtration products used primarily in industrial settings for dust collection and filtration applications. They are known for their high temperature resistance, chemical stability, and mechanical strength, making them suitable for challenging environments such as metal processing, power plants, and cement manufacturing.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type</strong>: Non-woven fiberglass filter bag; Woven fiberglass filter bag.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish-treatment</strong>: Surface treatment: PTFE coating; PTFE impregnation; Silicone coating; Graphite coating; Calendering.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diameter &amp; Length</strong>: Customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Applications</strong>: Cement Plants, Metal Processing, Power Plants, Chemical Processing, Waste Incineration, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3106,'2024-11-25 11:16:31','2024-11-25 11:28:30'),(3085,'PPS Filter Bags','pps-filter-bags','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"536\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情1-1024x536.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情1-1024x536.jpg 1024w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情1-300x157.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情1-768x402.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情1-600x314.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-详情1.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<h3>Main Characteristics of  PPS Filter Bags</h3><p>It is a new type of thermoplastic resin material, which has the advantages of high mechanical strength, high temperature resistance, chemical resistance, non-combustibility, good thermal stability, and good electrical properties.</p><ul><li><strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong>: PPS needle felt can withstand continuous operating temperatures up to 190°C (374°F) and short-term peak temperatures up to 230°C (446°F).</li><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: PPS needle felt is resistant to acids, alkalis, and organic solvents, making it suitable for use in harsh chemical environments.</li><li><strong>Mechanical Strength</strong>: PPS needle felt has good mechanical strength and dimensional stability, ensuring durability and long life in demanding applications.</li><li><strong>Hydrolysis Resistance</strong>: PPS needle felt is resistant to hydrolysis, which is useful in applications involving moisture or water vapor.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Therefore, the application advantages of PPS filter bags are reflected in:</h3><ul><li><strong>Longevity</strong>: Due to their durability and resistance to high temperatures and chemicals, PPS filter bags have a long service life.</li><li><strong>Efficiency</strong>: They provide high filtration efficiency, capturing fine particulates and ensuring cleaner emissions.</li><li><strong>Cost-Effective</strong>: While the initial cost may be higher than some other materials, the extended lifespan and reduced maintenance costs make them cost-effective over time.</li></ul><hr /><h3>How Philite® improves the efficiency of PPS filter bags</h3><ul><li>To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors.</li><li>System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance.</li><li>Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Needle-Punched-Felt-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Needle-Punched-Felt-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Needle-Punched-Felt-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Needle-Punched-Felt-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-02-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-02-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-02-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-02-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-03-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-03-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-03-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-filter-bag-factory-03-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Technical Specifications</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"144\">Weight（gsm）</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">500</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Thickness(mm)</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">1.8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Air permeability(L/m2.s)</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">200-300</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Tensile strength(N/5 cm)</td><td width=\"203\">warp</td><td width=\"102\">≥1100</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">weft</td><td width=\"102\">≥1500</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Tensile  elongation(%)</td><td width=\"203\">warp</td><td width=\"102\">≤15</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">weft</td><td width=\"102\">≤20</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Heat shrinkage(%)</td><td width=\"203\">warp</td><td width=\"102\">≤1.5</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">weft</td><td width=\"102\">≤1.0</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Temperature(°C/°F)</td><td width=\"203\">Continue</td><td width=\"102\">190/374</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">Instant</td><td width=\"102\">220/428</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Post-Treatment</h3><p>For PPS filter bags, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p>		\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情6.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情6-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情6-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type)</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情7.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情7-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情7-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>Water &amp; Oil Repellent</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情8.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情8-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情8-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>PTFE Membrane</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<h3>Application of PPS Filter Bags</h3><ul><li><strong>Power Plants</strong>: Used in coal-fired power plants to filter flue gases and reduce particulate emissions.</li><li><strong>Cement Industry</strong>: Employed in cement kilns and mills to control dust and particulate emissions.</li><li><strong>Chemical Industry</strong>: Suitable for processes involving aggressive chemicals and high temperatures.</li><li><strong>Waste Incineration</strong>: Used in waste-to-energy plants to filter flue gases and control emissions.</li><li><strong>Metallurgy</strong>: Applied in metal smelting and refining processes to capture particulate matter.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-详情10.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-详情10.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-详情10-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-详情10-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情11.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情11.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情11-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-02-详情11-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12-1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-to-Energy-详情12-1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>We Pay Attention to Every Processing Detail:</h3><ul><li>Accurately design the size of the filter cloth required for the filter bag. The filter cloth will be larger than the actual design size to leave enough operating space.</li><li>Choose the right filter bag accessories and check their quality.</li><li>We draw, cut and sew the filter bags on an automatic production line. When the filter bag needs to be processed manually, we open it on the operating platform and use a certain pulling force to keep it flat.</li><li>We maintain strict processing quality standards in accordance with design drawings and operating procedures. Our workers dress in compliance with safe construction requirements and are prohibited from smoking.</li></ul>','PPS filter bags are also known as polyphenylene sulfide fiber bags or ryton fiber bags, the physical properties of its fiber are obviously better than other high temperature resistant acid and alkali resistant filter bag products. Commonly used in industrial applications where high temperature and chemical resistance are required. They are designed to filter dust, particulate matter, and other contaminants from air or gases in various processes.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Polyphenylene Sulfide needle punch felt.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag rings</strong>: Stainless steel ring, Plastic ring.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Shapes</strong>: Round type, Flat type, Star/pleated type.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diameter &amp; Length</strong>: Accept customization.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Process</strong>: Sewing or hot welding.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Post-processing</strong>: Water &amp; Oil repellent, PTFE membrane, PTFE impregnation.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish-treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3086,'2024-11-25 11:00:03','2024-11-25 11:13:45'),(3125,'Anti-static Polyester Needle Punched Felt','anti-static-polyester-needle-punched-felt','<p>Anti-static needle PE/Polyester punched felt is one of the most common materials used to make filter bags, which always used in environments prone to dust explosions. There are mainly 2 types: line type, cross type and blend/mixed type.</p><h4><strong><b>PE/Polyester Properties</b></strong></h4><table width=\"825\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"116\">Material</td><td width=\"88\">Working<br />Temperature</td><td width=\"84\">Instant<br />Temperature</td><td width=\"88\">Abrasion<br />Resistance</td><td width=\"85\">Hydrolysis<br />Resistance</td><td width=\"81\">Acid<br />Resistance</td><td width=\"110\">Alkali<br />Resistance</td><td width=\"107\">Oxidation<br />Resistance</td></tr><tr><td width=\"116\">PE/Polyester Needle Felt</td><td>130℃</td><td>150℃</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Middle</td><td>Middle</td><td>Middle</td><td>Good</td></tr></tbody></table><h4><strong><b>Post-treatment</b></strong></h4><p>For Anti-static needle PE/Polyester needle punched felt, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p><ol><li>Water&amp;OilRepellent</li><li>PTFE Membrane</li><li>PTFE Impregnation</li></ol><h4><strong><b>Shapes and Types</b></strong></h4><p>Anti-static needle PE/Polyester needle felt can be made into different types of filter bags, which can be mainly divided into the following three types according to different shapes:</p><ol><li>Roundtype</li><li>Flat type</li><li>Star/pleated type</li></ol>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"943\" height=\"214\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/shapes-4-详情1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/shapes-4-详情1.png 943w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/shapes-4-详情1-300x68.png 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/shapes-4-详情1-768x174.png 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/shapes-4-详情1-600x136.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 943px) 100vw, 943px\" />													\n		<h4><strong><b>Application</b></strong></h4><p>Filter bags made of Anti-static needle PE/Polyester needle punched felt are widely used in many industries:</p><ol><li>Cement Plant</li><li>Lime Stone</li><li>Iron&amp;Steel Plant…</li></ol>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3126,'2024-11-25 11:38:31','2024-11-25 11:43:43'),(3136,'FMS Needle Felt Filter Cloth','fms-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<p><strong>Philite® FMS needle felt filter cloth is made of  composite short fiberglass, P84 fiber and Nomex fiber. It has excellent acid and alkali resistance and a service life of more than 4500 hours.</strong></p><ul><li>Can withstand higher temperatures. Under normal circumstances, the operating temperature can be controlled at 260℃-300℃, and some varieties can withstand high temperatures of 350℃ instantly.</li><li>It can bear high filtration load, and the gas filtration load can reach 60-90m3/㎡ hour.</li><li>It has very low operating resistance and is more adaptable to changes in blast furnace fan air volume.</li><li>The filtration efficiency is high, and the dust content of the purified and filtered gas is generally less than 3-5mg/nm3.</li><li>It has a long service life and is much more cost-effective than glass fiber needle felt filter media. Its cost is about 10-20% higher than that of glass fiber needle felt, but its service life is more than twice as long under similar working conditions.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-详情1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-详情1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-详情1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-详情1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/FMS-Filter-Bag-Manufacturer-02-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Physical Properties and Chemical Properties</h3><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> Properties</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Mixed fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">fiberglass yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"218\">850</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"218\">2.4</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">m</td><td width=\"218\">≤2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">PTFE impregnation</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td width=\"218\">200 ~ 300</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp (N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"218\">1300</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft(N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"218\">1500</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"218\">8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"218\">8</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continue temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"218\">240</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"218\">280</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Post-treatment of FMS Needle Felt</h3><p>The post-treatment of FMS needle felt is crucial for enhancing its performance and durability in industrial filtration applications. After different surface chemical treatments and post-finishing technologies, FMS needle-punched felt also has the characteristics of easy cleaning, water and oil repellency, and anti-static. Common post-treatments for FMS needle felt include:</p><ul><li><strong>Singeing.</strong></li><li><strong>Calendering.</strong></li><li><strong>Heat Setting.</strong></li><li><strong>PTFE Membrane Laminating.</strong></li><li><strong>PTFE Impregnation.</strong></li></ul><hr /><h3>Applications of FMS Needle Felt</h3><p>FMS needle felt is commonly used in bag filters and is an effective way to capture fine particles when operating in harsh environments. It can withstand high wind speeds and is highly efficient for dust bags, saving a lot of costs and creating huge economic benefits. The service life of FMS filter bags can be extended to more than two years, which can significantly reduce production costs. It plays an important role in the following industries.</p><ul><li>Copper and iron (high furnace gas, electric furnace, converter, sintering workshop).</li><li>Metallurgy (copper, zinc and aluminum).</li><li>Carbon black.</li><li>Cement (kiln, mill, vertical window, packaging workshop).</li><li>ferroalloy.</li><li>Carbide stove.</li><li>Power plant coal-fired boiler.</li><li>Waste incinerator (clean waste, industrial waste, medical waste).</li><li>Asphalt mixing.</li><li>Others (pesticides, dyes, lime kilns, titanium dioxide, asbestos).</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blast-furnace-gas-purification-and-filtration-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blast-furnace-gas-purification-and-filtration-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blast-furnace-gas-purification-and-filtration-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blast-furnace-gas-purification-and-filtration-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','FMS needle felt is a specialized type of filter media used for industrial filtration applications. “FMS” typically refers to a blend of fibers, including Fluorine, Meta-Aramid (like Nomex), and Silica, designed to provide excellent resistance to high temperatures, chemicals, and mechanical stress. FMS needle felt has the characteristics of high strength, acid and alkali corrosion resistance, wear resistance, and bending resistance. After different surface chemical treatments and post-finishing technologies, it also has the functions of easy dust removal, water and oil repellency, it is dimensionally stable, high strength and cheaper than other chemical fibers.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High temperature resistant.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High strength.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Acid and alkali corrosion resistant.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wear resistant.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bending resistant.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn more about <a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=fms-filter-bags\"><strong>FMS Filter Bags</strong></a>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3137,'2024-11-25 11:48:12','2024-11-25 11:54:13'),(3154,'Heat Resistance Needle Felt Filter Cloth','heat-resistance-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>Comparison of Heat Resistance Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<h4>1. Heat-resistance:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"294\" height=\"29\">Fabric</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">P84</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">FMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Max. operating temperature</td>\r\n<td>260℃</td>\r\n<td>260℃</td>\r\n<td>190℃</td>\r\n<td>204℃</td>\r\n<td>240℃</td>\r\n<td>240℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Instant temperature</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>220℃</td>\r\n<td>220℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>2. Acid and Alkali resistance:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"289\" height=\"29\">Fabric</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">P84</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">FMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Acid resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Alkali resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>3. Hydrolytic and Oxidation resistance:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"289\" height=\"29\">Fabric</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">P84</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">FMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Hydrolytic resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Oxidation resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>4. Comparison of cost:</h4>\r\n<h4>    PTFE ＞ P84 ＞ PPS ＞ Aramid ＞ <strong>FMS</strong> ＞ Fiberglass</h4>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>PTFE</strong>: Cement factory, Iron &amp; Steel factory, Power Plant factory, Waste Incineration factory.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>P84</strong>: Cement factory, Iron &amp; Steel factory.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>PPS</strong>: Cement factory, Power Plant factory.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Aramid</strong>: Cement factory, Iron &amp; Steel factory, Power Plant factory, Asphalt factory, Lime factory.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fiberglass</strong>: Cement factory, Iron &amp; Steel factory.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>FMS</strong>: Cement factory, Iron &amp; Steel factory, Power Plant factory.</li>\r\n</ul>','Heat-resistant needle felt filter cloth is designed to withstand high temperatures and is commonly used in industrial filtration processes. These materials are engineered from fibers that have excellent thermal stability and durability, making them suitable for applications such as dust collection and gas filtration in industries like cement, metallurgy, and power plants.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Fabric</strong>: PTFE, P84, PPS, Aramid, Fiberglass, FMS needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heat-resistance</strong>: Max. Temp. 280℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Process</strong>: Sewing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Accept customization.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn About <strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=high-temperature-filter-bags\">Heat-resistant Filter Bags</a>.</strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3151,'2024-11-25 12:24:49','2024-12-08 12:09:05'),(3159,'Needle Felt with PTFE Membrane','needle-felt-with-ptfe-membrane','<h3>Main Types of Needle Felt with PTFE Membrane:</h3><ol><li>Polyester Needle Felt with PTFE membrane</li><li>Nomex Needle Felt with PTFE membrane</li><li>PTFE Needle Felt with PTFE membrane</li></ol><p>Note: Various materials of needle felts with PTFE membrane you can choose; Accept customization, let us know your requirement !</p><hr /><h3><strong>Features of needle felt with PTFE membrane:</strong></h3><ol><li>Excellent chemical stability</li><li>Corrosion resistance</li><li>High filtration efficiency</li><li>Low running resistance and high filtering wind speed</li></ol><hr /><h3>PTFE membrane polyester needle felt 500 g/m²</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"397\"><strong><b>Product name</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\"><strong><b>PTFE membrane</b></strong><strong><b> polyester needle felt 500 g/m²</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\"><strong>Product Code</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\"><strong><b>ES-PE500M</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Polyester staple fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Polyester filament yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Weight</td><td width=\"274\">g/m²</td><td width=\"216\">500</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Thickness</td><td width=\"274\">mm</td><td width=\"216\">1.8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Width</td><td width=\"274\">m</td><td width=\"216\">≤2,2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting,PTFE membrane</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"274\">l / m2 / s  @200pa</td><td width=\"216\">40 ~ 80</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"274\">Warp</td><td width=\"216\">1100</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\"> </td><td width=\"274\">Weft</td><td width=\"216\">1200</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"274\">Warp</td><td width=\"216\">20</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\"> </td><td width=\"274\">Weft</td><td width=\"216\">30</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td><td width=\"274\"> </td><td width=\"216\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Continuous temperature</td><td width=\"274\">C°</td><td width=\"216\">130</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"274\">C°</td><td width=\"216\">150</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Middle</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Middle</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"397\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><p> </p><h3>Aramid needle felt 500 g/m² with PTFE membrane</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Product name </b></strong><strong> </strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"><strong><b>Aramid needle felt 5</b></strong><strong><b>0</b></strong><strong><b>0 g/m²</b></strong><strong><b> with PTFE membrane</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong>Product Code</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"><strong><b>ES-AMD5</b></strong><strong><b>0</b></strong><strong><b>0M</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Aramid staple fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Aramid staple yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"222\">500</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"222\">1.8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"222\">≤2,2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting,PTFE membrane</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td width=\"222\">45 ~ 85</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp</td><td width=\"222\">800</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"> </td><td width=\"231\">Weft</td><td width=\"222\">900</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp</td><td width=\"222\">20</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"> </td><td width=\"231\">Weft</td><td width=\"222\">30</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td><td width=\"231\"> </td><td width=\"222\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continuous temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"222\">204</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"222\">240</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr></tbody></table><p> </p><h3>PTFE membrane PTFE needle felt 750g/m²</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>P</b></strong><strong><b>roduct Name</b></strong><strong><b> </b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\"><strong><b>PTFE</b></strong><strong><b> membrane</b></strong><strong><b> PTFE needle felt </b></strong><strong><b>750</b></strong><strong><b>g/m²</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong>Product Code</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\"><strong><b>ES</b></strong><strong><b>-PTFE</b></strong><strong><b>750</b></strong><strong><b>TF</b></strong><strong><b>M</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"892\"><strong>Physi</strong><strong>c</strong><strong>a</strong><strong>l</strong><strong> properties</strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">PTFE fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">PTFE yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"220\">750</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"220\">1.1</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">m</td><td width=\"220\">≤2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">PTFE impregnation, PTFE membrane</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 / S @200pa</td><td width=\"220\">30 ~ 80</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp (N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"220\">＞800</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft(N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"220\">＞800</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">10</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">15</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Shrinkage (250℃)</td><td width=\"231\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">＜1</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">＜1</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"892\"><strong>Temperature</strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continue temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"220\">250</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"220\">280</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"892\"><strong>Chemical Properties</strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table>','Main Types of Needle Felt with PTFE Membrane:\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Polyester Needle Felt with PTFE membrane</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex Needle Felt with PTFE membrane</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE Needle Felt with PTFE membrane</li>\r\n</ol>\r\nNote: Various materials of needle felts with PTFE membrane you can choose; Accept customization, let us know your requirement !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3160,'2024-11-25 12:30:09','2024-11-25 12:34:18'),(3168,'Polyester Needle Felt Filter Cloth','polyester-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>Polyester Needle Felt Filter Fabrics Offer a Number of Key Properties</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Polyester has excellent particle retention, effectively capturing fine particles and dust.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong>: Polyester can withstand moderate temperatures, typically up to about 130-150°C (266-302°F).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mechanical Strength:</strong> It has good tensile strength and dimensional stability.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Abrasion Resistance</strong>: The fabric is resistant to abrasion, prolonging its service life even in demanding filtration applications.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ease of Cleaning</strong>: Polyester needle felt can be cleaned and maintained easily, either through mechanical shaking, air pulsing, or washing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Physical Properties</h3>\r\n<table width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Air Permeability</td>\r\n<td>L/(dm2*min)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">130-180</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Surface Resistivity</td>\r\n<td>MΩ</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">310-335</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Volume Resistivity</td>\r\n<td>MΩ</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">57-63</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Tensile Strength</td>\r\n<td>MD（N）</td>\r\n<td>≥</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CD（N）</td>\r\n<td>≥</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">1300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Break Elongation</td>\r\n<td>MD（%）</td>\r\n<td>&lt;</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">35</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CD（%）</td>\r\n<td>&lt;</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">35</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Working Temp</td>\r\n<td>Continu ous （℃）</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\">130</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Peak （℃）</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\">150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Chemical Properties</h3>\r\n<table width=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Acid-resistant</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Alkali-resistant</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Bad</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Oxidation-resistant</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Hydrolysis-resistant</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Bad</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Ultraviolet resistant</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Heat Setting</td>\r\n<td>Singe</td>\r\n<td>Calendar</td>\r\n<td>Chemical Coating</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong><b>Post-Treatment of </b></strong><strong><b>Polyester Needle Felt</b></strong></h3>\r\nWe can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type).</li>\r\n 	<li>Anti-Spark.</li>\r\n 	<li>Water &amp; Oil Repellent.</li>\r\n 	<li>Anti-Abrasion (Acrylic coating).</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE Membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE Impregnation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Surface Treatment</h3>\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-1.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-1.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-1-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /><figcaption>Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type)</figcaption></figure>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-1.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-1.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-1-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /><figcaption>Water &amp; Oil Repellent</figcaption></figure>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-1.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-1.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-1-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /><figcaption>PTFE Membrane</figcaption></figure>\r\n<h3>Anti-Static <strong><b>Polyester Needle Felt</b></strong></h3>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情4.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" /><figcaption>Stripe Line Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt</figcaption></figure>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情5.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" /><figcaption>Blending Fiber Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt</figcaption></figure>\r\n<figure><img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情6.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cross-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" /><figcaption>Cross Line Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt</figcaption></figure>\r\n<h3>Advantages of Philite® Polyester Needle Felt</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The pores of polyester needle punched filter felt are evenly distributed, with a porosity of 70%, which is twice that of woven filter cloth. High dust removal efficiency and low gas emission concentration.</li>\r\n 	<li>The surface of the polyester needle-punched filter felt is hot-rolled, singed or coated, making it smooth and smooth, not easy to block or deform, easy to clean, and has a long service life.</li>\r\n 	<li>Anti-static needle punched felt has the function of preventing corrosion and discharging electrostatic discharge generated by blast furnace gas and cement plant coal mill.</li>\r\n 	<li>The capable of manufacturing 15,000 square meters per day (standard PE product). You can choose pure PE needle felt, PE blending needle felt , anti-static needle felt and water and oil proof needle felt. We also have SGS Qualifications of PE series product.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><b>Application of Polyester Needle Felt</b></strong></h3>\r\nSome common applications include:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust Collection</strong>: Used in baghouse systems to capture dust and particulate matter in industries such as cement manufacturing, asphalt production, and woodworking.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Pollution Control</strong>: Deployed in air filtration systems to reduce emissions from industrial processes and power generation facilities.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wastewater Treatment</strong>: Employed in filter presses and other filtration equipment to separate solids from liquids in municipal and industrial wastewater treatment plants.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical Processing</strong>: Used for filtering and separating chemicals and pharmaceutical products in manufacturing processes.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food and Beverage</strong>: Used in filtration systems for clarifying liquids, such as wine, beer, and fruit juices, to remove impurities and improve product quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Metal Processing</strong>: Applied in metalworking industries to filter coolant fluids and remove metal fines and debris from cutting and grinding operations.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Power Generation</strong>: Utilized in power plants for filtering ash and particulates from flue gases in coal-fired boilers and other combustion processes.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Environmental Protection</strong>: Used in environmental remediation projects to filter contaminants from soil and groundwater.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical Industry</strong>: Applied in pharmaceutical manufacturing for sterile filtration and clarification of liquids and gases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情7.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-详情8.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-详情8.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情9.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情10.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情10.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情10-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-详情10-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<h3>Why Choose Philite®?</h3>\r\nPhiliete® has first-class production equipment and a strong scientific research team, and is in a leading position in the production, research and development, and application of industrial fabrics. We produce staple fiber, silk, and monofilament filter fabrics made of polypropylene, nylon, polyester, vinylon, and other raw materials. Our products are widely used in liquid-solid separation, gas-solid separation, etc. in the petroleum, chemical, smelting, mineral processing, environmental protection, carbon black, pharmaceutical, dye, and food industries.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-02-详情11.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-02-详情11.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-02-详情11-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-02-详情11-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-详情12.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-详情12.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-详情12-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-详情12-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-04-详情13.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-04-详情13.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-04-详情13-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-04-详情13-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-03-详情14.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-03-详情14.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-03-详情14-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polyester-Needle-Felt-03-详情14-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />','Polyester needle felt is a filter cloth made of polyester fiber, which is made by non-woven needle punching process. The polyester staple fibers are combed and laid on the fiber cloth and then needled into felt. The dense fabric is formed by mechanical needle punching. Due to its high filtration efficiency, good wear resistance and chemical compatibility with a variety of substances, this fabric is widely used in solid-liquid separation processes in various industries.\r\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: ≤2.2 m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 1.7 mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 300 -650g/m2 ±10%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diameter &amp; Length</strong>: Accept customization.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish-treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn about Polyester <a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=polyester-filter-bags-2\"><strong>Needle Felt Filter Bags</strong></a>.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3169,'2024-11-25 12:38:37','2024-12-08 12:11:01'),(3196,'PTFE Needle Felt Filter Cloth','ptfe-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>The Performance of PTFE Needle Felt is Specifically Reflected in:</h3><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: PTFE has excellent chemical resistance and can resist the erosion of a variety of corrosive substances such as strong acids, strong alkalis, and solvents.</li><li><strong>High Temperature resistance</strong>: PTFE can work in a higher temperature range, usually able to withstand temperatures above 200°C (392°F).</li><li><strong>Low Coefficient of Friction</strong>: The surface of PTFE has a very low coefficient of friction, which makes the surface of the filter felt not easy to adhere to pollutants and easy to clean.</li><li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Due to the fine nature of PTFE fibers, PTFE needle punched felt can effectively capture fine particles and particulates.</li><li><strong>Long Life</strong>: PTFE needle punched felt typically have a long life due to their chemical and temperature resistance.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Blending PTFE Needle Felt Reduces Manufacturing Costs</h3><p>Blended PTFE filter felt involves combining PTFE fibers with other materials to enhance specific properties while maintaining the core benefits of PTFE, such as chemical resistance and high temperature performance. It can provide advantages such as increased durability, strength or cost-effectiveness. After a clear understanding of your factory environment, we will provide you with the most suitable fabric recommendations. Blended filter felt is more economical, and we have calculated that it can reduce costs by 10% – 30% compared to pure PTFE filter felt.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"1000\" height=\"479\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blend-Needle-Felt-详情1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blend-Needle-Felt-详情1.jpg 1000w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blend-Needle-Felt-详情1-300x144.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blend-Needle-Felt-详情1-768x368.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blend-Needle-Felt-详情1-600x287.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />													\n		<h4>Common Materials Blended with PTFE Needle Felt Include:</h4><ul><li><strong>Glass fiber</strong>: Adding glass fiber can increase mechanical strength and dimensional stability while maintaining heat resistance.</li><li>P<strong>PS (polyphenylene sulfide)</strong>: Blending PTFE with PPS enhances chemical resistance and temperature stability and is often used in high-performance filtration applications.</li><li><strong>P84 (polyimide)</strong>: P84 fibers can improve thermal stability and filtration efficiency, especially in hot gas filtration.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Philite® – Professional Filter Cloth Manufacturer in China</h3><p>Our PTFE needle felt is supplied to the global market, including Europe, North America, South America, Africa, Southeast Asia, the Middle East, Japan, South Korea, etc. Our products meet the most stringent quality standards and adopt a confident free sample use policy.</p><ul><li>High-quality high-leveling fine-denier Teflon fiber.</li><li>We have a complete set of filter cloth production lines including the world’s top opening, carding, web-forming machines, needle punching machines, online scanning systems, etc.</li><li>We strictly follow the ISO9001 quality management system for production. The filter cloth must pass various performance indicators such as fiber composition, gram weight, thickness, air permeability, etc. to ensure that the qualified rate of factory products is 100%.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-详情2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-详情2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-详情2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-详情2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-详情3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-详情3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-详情3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-详情3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-02-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-02-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-02-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-02-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Physical and Chemical Properties</h3><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"892\"><strong>Physi</strong><strong>c</strong><strong>a</strong><strong>l</strong><strong> properties</strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">PTFE fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">PTFE yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Weight</td><td width=\"451\">g/m²</td><td width=\"220\">750</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Thickness</td><td width=\"451\">mm</td><td width=\"220\">1.1</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Width</td><td width=\"451\">m</td><td width=\"220\">≤2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">PTFE impregnation, PTFE membrane</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"451\">l / m2 / S @200pa</td><td width=\"220\">30 ~ 80</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"892\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"451\">Warp (N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"220\">＞800</td></tr><tr><td width=\"451\">Weft(N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"220\">＞800</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"892\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"451\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">10</td></tr><tr><td width=\"451\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">15</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"892\">Shrinkage (250℃)</td><td width=\"451\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">＜1</td></tr><tr><td width=\"451\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"220\">＜1</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"892\"><strong>Temperature</strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Continue temperature</td><td width=\"451\">C°</td><td width=\"220\">250</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"451\">C°</td><td width=\"220\">280</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"892\"><strong>Chemical Properties</strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"892\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"451\">Excellent</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong><b>Post-treatment of  PTFE Needle Felt</b></strong></h3><p>For PTFE filter felt, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:</p><ul><li><strong>Heat Setting</strong>: Stabilizes the dimensions of the felt, reducing shrinkage and ensuring consistent thickness and density.</li><li><strong>Calendering</strong>: Increases the density and smoothness of the felt, which can enhance filtration efficiency.</li><li><strong>Singeing</strong>: Removes surface fibers and fuzz to create a smoother surface, reducing the potential for clogging and improving cake release in filtration applications.</li><li><strong>Coating</strong>: Enhances specific properties like chemical resistance, hydrophobicity, or filtration efficiency, such as PTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene) or other chemical-resistant materials.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Applications <strong><b>of  PTFE Needle Felt</b></strong></h3><p>It is widely used in high temperature flue gas purification, corrosive gas filtration, high temperature liquid filtration and other fields. In these applications, they can effectively capture and filter out solid particles and liquid droplets in the air, protecting the environment and equipment from pollution and corrosion. Such as：</p><ul><li>Dust collection in incinerators.</li><li>Chemical filtration systems.</li><li>Flue gas desulfurization in power plants.</li><li>Harsh industrial environments involving corrosive gases or liquids.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-incineration-filtration-application-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-incineration-filtration-application-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-incineration-filtration-application-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Waste-incineration-filtration-application-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7-1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-详情7-1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-Filtration-02-详情8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-Filtration-02-详情8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-Filtration-02-详情8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-Filtration-02-详情8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-filtration-详情9.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-filtration-详情9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-filtration-详情9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Liquid-filtration-详情9-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','PTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene also known as Teflon) needle felt filter cloth is one of the most excellent chemical fiber fabrics and is almost insoluble in all solvents. It is known for its excellent chemical resistance, high temperature resistance and low friction. It is one of the most commonly used materials for making high-temperature resistant industrial filter bags.Be composed of 100% pure PTFE.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Width:</strong> 2.2 m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum Operating Temperature</strong>: 270℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Standard Weight</strong>: 750gsm, 800gsm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish Treatment</strong>: Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Our Capacity</strong>: 5000㎡/day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn About <a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=ptfe-filter-bags\"><strong>PTFE Filter Bags</strong></a>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3197,'2024-11-25 21:32:58','2024-11-25 21:44:46'),(3215,'Nomex Needle Felt Filter Cloth','nomex-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<p><strong>The advantages of aramid/nomex needle filter felt cloth mainly include high temperature resistance, dimensional stability, fire retardant, chemical corrosion resistance and good wear resistance.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>High temperature resistance</strong>: Nomex needle-punched felt can be used in various dust collectors within 200℃, can work continuously at a temperature of 180℃, and the instantaneous working temperature can reach 220℃.</li><li><strong>Dimensional stability</strong>: At a high temperature of 230℃, the expansion rate of aramid needle-punched felt is only 1%.</li><li><strong>Fire retardant</strong>: It starts to decompose and carbonize at 400℃, and the limiting oxygen index (LOI) is 30. It does not spontaneously ignite or support combustion.</li><li><strong>Chemical corrosion resistance</strong>: It is not easy to react with chemicals such as acids and alkalis.</li><li><strong>Wear resistance</strong>: Nomex needle-punched felt also has good wear resistance and can adapt to various types of high-efficiency and high-intensity filtering work.</li><li>In addition, nomex needle-punched felt also has the advantages of good air permeability, high dust collection efficiency, large dust holding capacity, and long service life.</li></ul><h3>Processing and Surface Treatment</h3><p>Philite® uses high-quality aramid fibers as raw materials, adopts international advanced standards, and uses advanced production equipment to manufacture aramid high-temperature resistant needle-punched filter felts. The aramid fiber filter material is combined with the surface layer and the base cloth layer through multiple needle punching, and then after singeing and calendering, the whole is impregnated with PTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene), and then its surface is sintered at high temperature to form a dense protection membrane. Thereby greatly improving the overall performance of the filter material.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>							<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-2.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Anti-Static-详情1-2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type)</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-2.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Water-Oil-Repellent-详情2-2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>Water &amp; Oil Repellent</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-2.jpg 200w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Membrane-Treat-详情3-2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" />											<figcaption>PTFE Membrane</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<h3>Physical and Chemical Properties of Aramid/Nomex Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Product name </b></strong><strong> </strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"><strong><b>Aramid needle felt 500 g/m²</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong>Product Code</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"><strong><b>ES-AMD500N</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Aramid staple fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Aramid staple yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"222\">500</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"222\">2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">m</td><td width=\"222\">≤2,2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td width=\"222\">250</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp</td><td width=\"222\">800</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"> </td><td width=\"231\">Weft</td><td width=\"222\">900</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp</td><td width=\"222\">20</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"> </td><td width=\"231\">Weft</td><td width=\"222\">30</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td><td width=\"231\"> </td><td width=\"222\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continuos temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"222\">204</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"222\">240</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"454\">Good</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Specifications of Aramid Fiber</h3><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"5\" width=\"794\" height=\"29\">Aramid Fiber Specification</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Type</td><td>A</td><td>Color</td><td colspan=\"2\">white</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Danier</td><td>22dtex</td><td>Length</td><td colspan=\"2\">51mm</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Quantity</td><td>3025.1kgs</td><td> </td><td colspan=\"2\"> </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"5\" height=\"29\"> </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"58\">Test Items</td><td rowspan=\"2\">Units</td><td colspan=\"3\">Test Results</td></tr><tr><td>Max.</td><td>Min.</td><td>Ave.</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Txtre</td><td>dtex</td><td>2.38</td><td>2.33</td><td>2.36</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Tensile Strength</td><td>cN/dtex</td><td>3.9</td><td>3.7</td><td>3.8</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Elongation</td><td>%</td><td>42.23</td><td>38.34</td><td>39.91</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Staple Length</td><td>mm</td><td>54</td><td>48</td><td>52</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Oil Pick-Up</td><td>%</td><td>0.62</td><td>0.54</td><td>0.58</td></tr><tr><td height=\"29\">Shrikage at 300℃</td><td>%</td><td>2.9</td><td>1.6</td><td>2.2</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Application of Aramid/Nomex Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><ul><li><strong>High-temperature flue gas filtration</strong>: It is used in industrial flue gas treatment systems, especially in industries such as cement production, metallurgical processes, and waste incineration, to filter solid particles in high-temperature flue gas.</li><li><strong>Chemical industry</strong>: Due to its good chemical stability and corrosion resistance, aramid fiber is widely used in the filtration process for treating corrosive gases and chemicals in the chemical industry.</li><li><strong>Environmental protection</strong>: In the environmental protection field, it is used in industrial waste gas treatment systems to help filter and capture particulate matter and pollutants in industrial waste gas, protect the environment and improve air quality.</li><li><strong>Automotive industry</strong>: In the automotive industry, aramid needle felt filter cloth is used in vehicle exhaust treatment systems to help reduce emissions and meet emission standards.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Aramid-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-详情4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Aramid-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-详情4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Aramid-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-详情4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Aramid-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-详情4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/aramid-needle-felt-详情5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Asphalt-Filtration-Plant-详情6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Nomex-Filter-Bags-for-Asphalt-详情7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','Aramid/Nomex needle felt is a high performance filter material used in industrial filtration applications requiring high temperature, chemical resistance and tensile strength.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Width</strong>: Down below 2.2m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Thickness</strong>: 1.2mm ~ 20mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Weight</strong>: 300g/m² ~ 650g/m² (±8%)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Different treatment methods</strong>: waterproof and oil-proof treatment, PTFE coating, PTFE impregnation treatment, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: 15,000 square meters per day (standard Nomex(Aramid) product)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn About <strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=nomex-filter-bags\">Nomex/Aramid Filter Bags.</a></strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3216,'2024-11-25 21:50:02','2024-11-25 22:04:55'),(3233,'Micron Needle Felt','micron-needle-felt','<h2><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Description of PE Micron Needle Felt: (Can be customized)</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h3>1. Technical parameter of PE Micron Needle Felt</h3>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"1353\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"253\" height=\"29\">Performance Parameter</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"247\">Filtration Accuracy (μm)</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" colspan=\"2\" width=