dding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"253\" height=\"29\">Performance Parameter</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"247\">Filtration Accuracy (μm)</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"187\">Weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"177\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"268\">Air Permeability (mm/s)</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"221\">Temperature (<span class=\"font0\">℃</span><span class=\"font1\">)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Model</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\"></td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Min.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Max.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Min.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Max.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Min.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Max.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Min.</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Max.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP-01</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">1</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">500</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">550</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">3.2</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">3.6</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">200</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">350</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" rowspan=\"6\">90</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" rowspan=\"6\">120</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP-05</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">5</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">400</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">440</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.6</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">3.2</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">300</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">550</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP-10</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">10</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">360</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">400</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.5</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.9</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">650</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">900</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP-25</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">25</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">330</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">380</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.3</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.7</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">950</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">1300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP-50</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">50</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">330</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">380</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.3</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.7</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">1300</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">1600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP-100</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">100</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">330</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">380</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.3</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2.7</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">1500</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">1850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>2. Filter Materials Physical and Chemistry Performance: (Superior to PE)</h3>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"1177\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"122\" height=\"29\">Fiber</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"215\">Abrasion resistance</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"148\">Weakly acid</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"162\">Strongly acid</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"152\">Weakly alkali</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"180\">Strongly alkali</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"198\">Temperature (<span class=\"font0\">℃</span><span class=\"font1\">)</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">PP</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Good</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Good</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Poor</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Poor</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Poor</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">90-120</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Our PE Micron Needle Felt provides 5000 square meters/day, and we can supply different advice according to your circumstances.\r\n\r\nFiltration accuracy: 1μm-500μm, customized accepted.\r\nHighly featured in high-grade PP felt, long working life, three-dimensional filtration, in-depth filtration and better filtration efficiency.\r\nPP needle felt’s performance vary in singing, calendaring, heat set, coating and etc.\r\n\r\nCustomization Accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3234,'2024-11-25 22:10:59','2024-11-25 22:11:43'),(3240,'PPS Needle Felt Filter Cloth','pps-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>Main Features of PPS Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><ul><li><strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong>: PPS has excellent high temperature resistance and is able to work in high temperature environments, usually up to temperatures above 190°C (374°F).</li><li><strong>Chemical Stability</strong>: PPS material shows strong stability to a variety of chemical corrosive substances, so it is suitable for some filtering environments with corrosive gases or chemical substances.</li><li><strong>Low Hygroscopicity</strong>: PPS material has very low hygroscopicity and can maintain stable performance in humid environments.</li><li><strong>Abrasion Resistance</strong>: PPS needle-punched filter felt is relatively wear-resistant and suitable for industrial filtration environments that require long-term use.</li><li><strong>Good Mechanical Strength</strong>: PPS material has good mechanical strength to a certain extent, and can withstand certain tension and pressure during the filtration process.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Types of PPS (Rayton) Fabrics</h3><ul><li><strong>PPS Filament</strong>: Thickness 2.2-0.3mm; Weight 1150-200g.</li><li><strong>PPS Short Fiber</strong>: Thickness 2.2-0.3mm; Weight 1150-200g.</li><li><strong>PPS Monofilament</strong>: Thickness 0.8-0.15mm; Weight 550g-80g.</li></ul><hr /><h4><strong><b>Physical and Chemical Properties of PPS (Rayton) Needle Felt: (Customization is accepted in terms of feature and size)</b></strong></h4><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"144\">Air permeability(L/m2.s)</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">200-300</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Tensile strength(N/5 cm)</td><td width=\"203\">warp</td><td width=\"102\">≥1100</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">weft</td><td width=\"102\">≥1500</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Tensile  elongation(%)</td><td width=\"203\">warp</td><td width=\"102\">≤15</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">weft</td><td width=\"102\">≤20</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Heat shrinkage(%)</td><td width=\"203\">warp</td><td width=\"102\">≤1.5</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">weft</td><td width=\"102\">≤1.0</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"144\">Temperature(°C/°F)</td><td width=\"203\">Continue</td><td width=\"102\">190/374</td></tr><tr><td width=\"203\">Instant</td><td width=\"102\">220/428</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"144\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"203\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Application of PPS Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><p>PPS needle felt filter cloth is often used in high-temperature flue gas purification equipment, coal power plants, cement plants, oil refineries, metallurgical industries and other fields that require gas filtration and particle separation in high-temperature and corrosive environments. Due to its special properties, it can effectively capture tiny particles and pollutants, ensuring a clean and safe production environment.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-detail3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-detail4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/application-01-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3><strong>Services in Philite® </strong></h3><p>The raw material of Philite® PPS Needle Felt is environmentally friendly polypropylene fine denier yarn, which has low relative density, high strength, good elasticity, wear resistance, easy cleaning, and longer service life. We can customize it according to your needs to minimize your costs and improve economic benefits.</p><ul><li>We have a professional technical team to design according to customer requirements and ensure good performance.</li><li>The discharge meets the requirements, the initial resistance is low, and it is not easy to be blocked.</li><li>Provides operation suggestions, is not easy to break and is durable.</li><li>All sizes and finishes available, immediate delivery.</li><li>Aftersale service provided.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-detail5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PTFE-Filter-Felt-Manufacturer-in-China-02-detail5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/needle-punched-felt-rolls-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/needle-punched-felt-rolls-detail6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/needle-punched-felt-rolls-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/needle-punched-felt-rolls-detail6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Rayton-needle-felt-detail7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Rayton-needle-felt-detail7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Rayton-needle-felt-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PPS-Rayton-needle-felt-detail7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-filter-felt-packaging-detail8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-filter-felt-packaging-detail8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-filter-felt-packaging-detail8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-filter-felt-packaging-detail8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','PPS (polyphenylene sulfide or Rayton) needle felt is a high-performance filter material, mainly used in applications that require resistance to high temperatures and corrosive chemicals. PPS is a special synthetic polymer that can maintain stability under high temperature and chemical corrosion conditions, so it is often used in industrial flue gas purification and high-temperature gas filtration.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Temperature Resistance.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical Stability.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Low Hygroscopicity.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Abrasion Resistance.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Good Mechanical Strength.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn more about <strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=pps-filter-bags\">PPS(Rayton) Filter Bags</a></strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3241,'2024-11-25 22:15:53','2024-11-25 22:23:05'),(3257,'Fiberglass Needle Felt Filter Cloth','fiberglass-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>Advantages of Fiberglass Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><ul><li><strong>Temperature resistance</strong>: Glass fiber has high temperature resistance, so it can maintain stable performance in high temperature environment and is suitable for high temperature working conditions.</li><li><strong>Chemically inert</strong>: It is inert to many chemical substances and not susceptible to corrosion, so it is suitable for handling various chemical liquids and gases.</li><li><strong>Mechanical strength</strong>: Needle-punching process can form a strong mechanical connection between the fiber layers of the glass fiber felt, which improves the mechanical strength and durability of the filter felt.</li><li><strong>Microfiltration</strong>: The diameter of the glass fiber is finer, which can produce a filter mat with a denser fiber structure, thereby achieving a more efficient microfiltration effect.</li><li><strong>Adsorption performance</strong>: Due to the microstructure of the fiber surface, it has a certain adsorption capacity and can be used in some occasions that need to remove suspended particles and particles.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-04-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-04-detail1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-04-detail1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-04-detail1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-detail2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-02-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-02-detail3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-02-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-felt-filter-cloth-factory-02-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-felts-for-export-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-felts-for-export-detail4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-felts-for-export-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-felts-for-export-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<h3>Features of  Nonwoven Fiberglass Needle Felt in Philite®</h3><ul><li>Excellent anti-acid and anti-alkali.</li><li>High temperature resistance: 240-280℃/464-536℉.</li><li>Long service life: &gt;4500 hours.</li><li>Abrasion resistance, high tensile strength.</li><li>Single fiber, high porosity, gas filtration resistance.</li><li>Low resistance of filtration.</li><li>Can be used in a variety of complex situation and harsh environmental conditions</li></ul><hr /><h3>Physical Properties of Nonwoven Fiberglass Needle Felt</h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Product Name</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\"><strong><b>Fiberglass needle felt 850g/m²</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\"><strong>Product Code</strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\"><strong><b>ES</b></strong><strong><b>-FB850TFI</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> properties</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">fiberglass fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">fiberglass yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Weight</td><td width=\"231\">g/m²</td><td width=\"218\">850</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Thickness</td><td width=\"231\">mm</td><td width=\"218\">2-4</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Width</td><td width=\"231\">m</td><td width=\"218\">≤2.2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">PTFE impregnation</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"231\">l / m2 /S @200pa</td><td width=\"218\">200 ~ 300</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"231\">Warp (N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"218\">1300</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft(N/5×20cm)</td><td width=\"218\">1500</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"440\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"231\">Warp  (%)</td><td width=\"218\">8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"231\">Weft  (%)</td><td width=\"218\">8</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Continue temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"218\">230</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"231\">C°</td><td width=\"218\">250</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"890\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Good</td></tr><tr><td width=\"440\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"449\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Applications</h3><p><strong>Fiberglass needle felts are widely used in the industrial field, mainly as filter materials for the separation, filtration and capture of liquid, gas and solid particles.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Air Filtration</strong><br />Fiberglass needle felts are often used in air filters to capture particles and particulates in the air to keep indoor air clean and purified, such as in homes, commercial buildings, medical institutions, etc.</li><li><strong>Liquid Filtration</strong><br />It can be used in liquid filtration, such as water treatment, chemical production, food processing and other fields, to remove suspended particles, impurities, pollutants, etc. to obtain pure liquid products.</li><li><strong>Petrochemical industry</strong><br />In the petrochemical industry, it can be used in the production process of petroleum and chemical products to help separate and purify raw materials or products.</li><li><strong>Metallurgical industry</strong><br />In the field of metallurgy, it can be used in steelmaking, ironmaking and other processes to remove slag and impurities and ensure the purity and quality of metals.</li><li><strong>Environmental protection equipment</strong><br />It can be applied to environmental protection equipment such as flue gas desulfurization and denitrification to help remove harmful substances in exhaust gas and reduce environmental pollution.</li><li><strong>Food processing</strong><br />In the field of food processing, it can be used in the production process of beverages, edible oils and other products to remove impurities and particles to ensure the hygiene and quality of food.</li><li><strong>Medicine and pharmacy</strong><br />It is used in the pharmaceutical field to filter liquid medicines and solutions to ensure the purity and stability of medicines.</li><li><strong>Sewage treatment</strong><br />It can be used in sewage treatment to remove solid particles and suspended matter in wastewater, so that wastewater can be purified.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"499\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-detail6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-01-detail6-600x399.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<p><strong><em>For more information about fiberglass needle felt filter cloth please contact us.</em></strong></p>','Fiberglass needle felt is a filter material with reasonable structure and good performance. Fiberglass has outstanding dimensional stability, high tensile strength at break , corrosion resistance, smooth surface, good water-repellent, breathable, easy cleaning, chemical stability. Fiberglass is used as raw material, and the carded chopped fiberglass is needle-punched. The fibers between the fiberglass and between the fiberglass and the base cloth are entangled with each other by mechanical methods to make a non-woven filter material.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Our Capacity</strong>: 15000 square meter per day (standard Fiberglass product).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: ≤2.2m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length</strong>: ≤100m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish-treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3258,'2024-11-25 22:26:21','2024-11-25 22:32:31'),(3274,'Polypropylene Needle Felt Filter Cloth','polypropylene-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>Features of Polypropylene Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical Stability</strong>: It has strong chemical stability and can work in various chemical environments without being corroded.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Abrasion Resistance</strong>: Polypropylene fiber is relatively wear-resistant, so that the filter needle felt can maintain good performance in long-term use.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Low Water Absorption</strong>: It has very low water absorption, so it maintains stable filtration performance even in wet conditions.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dimensional Stability</strong>: It is less sensitive to changes in temperature and humidity, which helps filter needle felt maintain stable dimensions and performance in various environments.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ease of Cleaning</strong>: Since it does not pick up contaminants easily, it is relatively easy to clean.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong><b>Physical and Chemical </b></strong><strong><b>Properties</b></strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Weight(gs/m)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">500</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Thickness(mm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">2~3.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Width(mm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">≤2.2 m</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Finish treatment</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">Singeing, Calendaring, Heat setting, Coating.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Air permeability(L/m2.s)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">150-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"154\">Tensile strength(N/5 cm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">≥1700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"123\">weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">≥2200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"154\">Tensile  elongation(%)</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">≤20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"123\">weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">≤30</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"154\">Heat shrinkage(%)</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">≤1.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"123\">weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">≤1.0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"154\">Temperature(°C/°F)</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Continue</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">90 /194</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Instant</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">120 /248</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Anti-acid</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Anti-alkali</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">Anti-abrasion</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"154\">hydrolysis stability</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"248\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong><b>Specifications </b></strong><strong><b>of Polypropylene Needle Felt</b></strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">Para</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">Weight (g/sm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">Thickness (mm )</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">Air Permeability (m3/m2/min)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"92\">Tensile Strength (N/5×20cm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"95\">Tensile Elongation(%)</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">Operating Temp.(°C/℉)</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">Max Surge Temp.(°C/℉)</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Suitable P.H. value</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">Model</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">Warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">Weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">Warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">Weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">/</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-01</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">550</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">3.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">10</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">1500</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">50</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">50</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"8\" width=\"78\">130/266(Dry Heat)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"8\" width=\"59\">150/302 (Dry Heat)</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-05</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">20</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">60</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">60</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-10</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">2.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">24</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">80</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">80</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-25</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">35</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">85</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">85</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-50</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">320</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">3.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">600</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">80</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-75</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">320</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">3.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">130</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">600</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">80</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-100</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">350</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">3.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"60\">PP-200</td>\r\n<td width=\"58\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"62\">3.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"98\">130</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"46\">600</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">110</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1~12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong><b>Polypropylene Needle Felt </b></strong>in Philite®</h3>\r\nIn addition to some of the advantages of ordinary needle-punched felt filter cloth, the high-quality polypropylene needle-punched felt produced by Philite® has better acid and alkali resistance and lower softening point than polyester fiber. It is used in smoke and dust temperatures below 100°C and Areas with high acidity and alkalinity. Used in conjunction with plate and frame rolling filters, vacuum suction filters, bag filters, centrifugal filters and other liquid filtration and separation equipment.\r\n\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-02-detail1.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-02-detail1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-02-detail1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-02-detail1-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail2.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail3.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Shipping-detail4.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Shipping-detail4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Shipping-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Filter-Bag-Shipping-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<h3>Post Processing</h3>\r\nPost-processing of polypropylene needle felt involves various treatments to enhance its performance, durability, and suitability for specific applications.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heat Setting</strong>: Stabilizes the dimensions of the felt, reducing shrinkage and ensuring consistent thickness and density.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Calendering</strong>: Increases the density and smoothness of the felt, which can enhance filtration efficiency.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Singeing</strong>: Removes surface fibers and fuzz to create a smoother surface, reducing the potential for clogging and improving cake release in filtration applications.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Coating</strong>: Enhances specific properties like chemical resistance, hydrophobicity, or filtration efficiency, such as PTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene) or other chemical-resistant materials.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Product Advantages</h3>\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-03-300x300-detail5.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-03-300x300-detail5.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-03-300x300-detail5-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-03-300x300-detail5-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-04-300x300-detail6.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-04-300x300-detail6.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-04-300x300-detail6-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-04-300x300-detail6-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-05-300x300-detail7.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-05-300x300-detail7.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-05-300x300-detail7-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-05-300x300-detail7-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-06-300x300-detail8.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-06-300x300-detail8.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-06-300x300-detail8-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-06-300x300-detail8-100x100.jpg 100w\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\nThe fiber is thin         The surface area is large       The filtration coefficient is large        The adsorption effect is better\r\n<h3><strong><b>Applications</b></strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Filtration</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nPolypropylene needle felt is widely used in air filtration, such as air conditioning systems, clean rooms, ventilation systems, etc. It can effectively remove dust, smoke, pollen and other particulate matter in the air and improve air quality.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Liquid Filtration</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nPolypropylene needle felt is widely used in liquid filtration, such as water treatment, chemical production, food and beverage production and other fields. It can effectively remove suspended matter, microorganisms, bacteria, etc. in the liquid to ensure the purity of the liquid.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust Collection</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIn many industrial production processes, a large amount of dust will be generated, such as mining, metallurgy, wood processing, etc. It can effectively collect these dusts to prevent them from causing harm to the environment and the environment.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Control</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIt has good sound absorption and can be used in noise control fields, such as automotive interiors, building sound insulation, etc.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Medical Field</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIt is also widely used in the medical field, such as medical masks, protective clothing, etc. It can effectively block the spread of viruses and bacteria and protect the safety of medical staff and patients.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Agricultural Field</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIt can also be used in the agricultural field, such as soil improvement, plant protection, etc. It can effectively prevent the occurrence of pests and diseases and improve the yield and quality of crops.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Filter-Bag-Manufacturers-02-detail9.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Filter-Bag-Manufacturers-02-detail9.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Filter-Bag-Manufacturers-02-detail9-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Polypropylene-Filter-Bag-Manufacturers-02-detail9-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail10.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail10.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail10-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Application-of-liquid-filter-bag-03-detail10-600x401.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"501\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industry-detail11.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industry-detail11.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industry-detail11-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Chemical-Industry-detail11-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<img src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-polypropylene-filter-press-cloth-detail12.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-polypropylene-filter-press-cloth-detail12.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-polypropylene-filter-press-cloth-detail12-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Needle-punched-polypropylene-filter-press-cloth-detail12-600x400.jpg 600w\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />','Polypropylene needle felt filter cloth is one of the most commonly used materials for making liquid filter bags. Polypropylene needle felt is a specific type commonly used in industrial filtration applications.  It is a non-woven fabric made by mechanically needling polypropylene fibers, which has good filtration performance and durability. This type of needle felt is mainly used for the filtration and separation of solid particles, liquids or gases. Its production process is similar to the general needle felting production, but the material of choice is polypropylene fiber.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Non Woven Polypropylene Fabric.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 2.0-3.8mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtration accuracy</strong>: 0.2/1/5/10/25/50/100/150/200/300um.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Color</strong>: White.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Usage</strong>: Liquid Filter.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type</strong>: Non-woven Filter.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diameter &amp; Length</strong>: Accept customization.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: Capable of manufacturing standard PP needle felt 15,000 m²/day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn More About <strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=polypropylene-filter-bags\">Polypropylene Filter Bags</a></strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3275,'2024-11-25 22:37:14','2024-12-08 12:13:05'),(3295,'Anti-static Needle Felt Filter Cloth','anti-static-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<h3>Why use Anti-static Needle Felt Filter Cloth？</h3><p>Usually, when the concentration of industrial dust reaches a certain level (that is, the explosion limit), it is very easy to cause explosion and fire if it encounters factors such as electrostatic discharge sparks, such as: flour dust, chemical dust, coal dust, etc. If these dusts need to be collected by cloth bags, the manufactured filter bags are required to have anti-static function. In addition to the process of producing ordinary needle felt, the production of antistatic filter material also requires the incorporation of conductive fibers into the warp yarn of the base fabric for the production of needle felt or the mixing of conductive fibers into chemical fibers.</p><h3>Comparison of properties of different anti-static needle felt</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material</td><td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Conductivity\">Conductivity</td><td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance\">Temperature Resistance</td><td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Chemical Resistance\">Chemical Resistance</td><td id=\"sjs-E1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Abrasion Resistance\">Abrasion Resistance</td><td id=\"sjs-F1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Durability\">Durability</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester (PET) with Conductive Fibers\">Polyester (PET) with Conductive Fibers</td><td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 150°C (302*F)\">Up to 150°C (302°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td><td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polypropylene (PP) with Conductive Fibers\">Polypropylene (PP) with Conductive Fibers</td><td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 90*C (194*F)\">Up to 90*C (194°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td><td id=\"sjs-E3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td><td id=\"sjs-F3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyimide (P84)\">Polyimide (P84)</td><td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td><td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260*C (500*F)\">Up to 260*C (500°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very Good\">Very Good</td><td id=\"sjs-E4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)\">PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)</td><td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-C5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 250*C (482*F)\">Up to 250*C (482°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td><td id=\"sjs-E5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Aramid (Nomex)\">Aramid (Nomex)</td><td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td><td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 200*C (392*F)\">Up to 200*C (392°F)</td><td id=\"sjs-D6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td><td id=\"sjs-E6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td><td id=\"sjs-F6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Polyester</h3><h3>anti-static needle felt has a wide range of uses in industrial applications. It has the following advantages:</h3><ul><li><strong>Excellent antistatic performance</strong>: Polyester antistatic needle felt has good antistatic performance through special process treatment or adding antistatic materials. It can effectively prevent static electricity accumulation and discharge, and is suitable for industrial environments that require antistatic.</li><li><strong>Wear resistance and durabilit</strong>y: Polyester needle felt is made of polyester fiber, which has excellent wear resistance and durability. It is not easy to wear or deform after long-term use, and is suitable for long-term work in high-intensity use environments.</li><li><strong>Strong chemical stability</strong>: Polyester has good chemical stability, good acid and alkali resistance, and is not easily corroded by chemical substances. It is suitable for filtration and separation in a variety of industrial environments.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Types of Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>							<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Stripe-Line-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />											<figcaption>Stripe Line Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail2.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Blending-Type-Polyester-Anti-static-Needle-Felt-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />											<figcaption>Blending Fiber Polyester Anti-static Needle Felt</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" s