/tr><tr><td width=\"341\"><strong><b>Product Code</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\"><strong><b>ES-ASPE500X</b></strong></td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\"><strong><b>Physi</b></strong><strong><b>c</b></strong><strong><b>a</b></strong><strong><b>l</b></strong><strong><b> properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Fiber</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">Polyester staple fiber</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Scrim</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">polyester staple yarn, cross electric yarn</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Weight</td><td width=\"330\">g/m²</td><td width=\"240\">500</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Thickness</td><td width=\"330\">mm</td><td width=\"240\">1,8</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Width</td><td width=\"330\">m</td><td width=\"240\">≤2,2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Finish treatment</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">Singeing, Calendering, Heat setting</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Air permeability</td><td width=\"330\">l / m2 / s @200pa</td><td width=\"240\">240</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Tensile strength</td><td width=\"330\">Warp</td><td width=\"240\">1100</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\"> </td><td width=\"330\">Weft</td><td width=\"240\">1200</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Tensile elongation</td><td width=\"330\">Warp</td><td width=\"240\">20</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\"> </td><td width=\"330\">Weft</td><td width=\"240\">25</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\"><strong><b>Temperature</b></strong></td><td width=\"330\"> </td><td width=\"240\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Continuos temperature</td><td width=\"330\">C°</td><td width=\"240\">130</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Instant temperature</td><td width=\"330\">C°</td><td width=\"240\">150</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\"><strong><b>Chemical Properties</b></strong></td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\"> </td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">Middle</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">Middle</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width=\"341\">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan=\"2\" width=\"571\">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Applications</h3><p>Anti-static needle felt is mainly used in dust bag products, the main application industries:</p><ul><li>Cement raw meal grinding, packaging and transportation links.</li><li>Smelters (sintering machines, continuous casting).</li><li>Mine (collects limestone powder).</li><li>Non-ferrous metal factory (alumina transportation, electrolytic aluminum).</li><li>Furniture factory (grinding workshop),</li><li>Dust collection for grain processing,</li><li>Dust collection in pharmaceutical and other industries.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flour-factory-dust-removal-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flour-factory-dust-removal-detail4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flour-factory-dust-removal-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Flour-factory-dust-removal-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Furniture-factory-dust-removal-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Furniture-factory-dust-removal-detail5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Furniture-factory-dust-removal-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Furniture-factory-dust-removal-detail5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail7.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />','Antistatic needle punched filter felt is usually used in situations where it is necessary to filter tiny particles in the air or liquid, while also requiring the product to prevent static electricity accumulation. This type of filter felt usually uses special fiber materials or adds antistatic agents to ensure that during the filtration process, static electricity will not absorb more particles or cause harm to the product.\r\n\r\n<strong>We use leading technology in the Anti-static needle punched filter felt and guarantee the stability of our products：</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Polyester needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Reach to 99.5%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Working Life</strong>: &gt;3000 hours.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Surface Resistance(Ω.cm)</strong>: 10<sup>3</sup>-10<sup>8.</sup></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Anti-static types</strong>: Blending type, Cross type, Line type.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3296,'2024-11-25 22:50:49','2024-11-25 22:57:34'),(3311,'P84 Needle Felt Filter Cloth','p84-needle-felt-filter-cloth','<p>P84 needle felt is remarkable for its fiber fineness, and the irregular fiber cross section increases the fiber surface area and provides many tiny pores, making the surface filtration effect better than the depth filtration. The dust only stays on the surface of the filter felt and cannot penetrate into the filter felt, so the filter cake ejection efficiency is significantly improved.</p><h3>Advantages of P84 Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><ul><li><strong>High Temperature Stability</strong>: P84 has excellent high temperature stability and is able to maintain its physical and chemical properties under high temperature conditions. This makes P84 filter felt ideally suited for high-temperature gas filtration applications such as cement flue gas cleaning, the metallurgical industry and coal-fired power plants.</li><li><strong>Excellent Chemical Resistance</strong>: P84 has good resistance to chemical attack and can therefore be used in a variety of chemical conditions, including acidic and alkaline environments.</li><li><strong>Good Filtration Efficiency:</strong> P84 filter felts are generally effective at capturing tiny particles and dust, providing excellent filtration performance. This helps improve the capture and separation of particulate matter in the air or gas.</li><li><strong>Long Life and Wear Resistance:</strong> P84 generally have excellent wear resistance, which allows them to maintain a long service life under conditions of high flow rates and high particle loads.</li><li><strong>Low Shrinkage</strong>: The low shrinkage of P84 means it maintains its dimensional and shape stability even under high temperature conditions, ensuring continued filtration performance.</li><li><strong>Low Maintenance Cost</strong>: Due to the long life and high performance of P84 filter felt, its maintenance cost is relatively low as less replacement and repair work needs to be performed.</li><li><strong>Environmentally Friendly</strong>: P84 is a synthetic fiber that generally does not contain environmentally harmful substances, so it can be used in environmentally friendly applications.</li></ul><hr /><h3><strong>Specifications</strong></h3><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Compositions</td><td colspan=\"3\">P84/P84 scrim</td><td colspan=\"3\">P84 / glass scrim</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Weight (g/m2)</td><td>450</td><td>500</td><td>550</td><td>800</td><td>850</td><td>900</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Thickness (mm)</td><td>2.0</td><td>2.2</td><td>2.4</td><td>2.5</td><td>2.8</td><td>3.0</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Air permeability (m2m2/min)</td><td>19</td><td>15</td><td>12</td><td>16</td><td>13</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Tensile strength (N/5×20cm)</td><td>Warp</td><td>650</td><td>700</td><td>800</td><td>1800</td><td>1800</td><td>1800</td></tr><tr><td>Weft</td><td>1150</td><td>1200</td><td>1300</td><td>1800</td><td>1800</td><td>1800</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Tensile Elongation (%)</td><td>Warp</td><td>&lt;35</td><td>&lt;35</td><td>&lt;35</td><td>&lt;10</td><td>&lt;10</td><td>&lt;10</td></tr><tr><td>Weft</td><td>&lt;55</td><td>&lt;55</td><td>&lt;55</td><td>&lt;10</td><td>&lt;10</td><td>&lt;10</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Working Temperature(°C)</td><td>Continues</td><td colspan=\"3\">≤260</td><td colspan=\"3\">≤260</td></tr><tr><td>Instant</td><td colspan=\"3\">300</td><td colspan=\"3\">300</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Anti-acid</td><td colspan=\"3\">Excellent</td><td colspan=\"3\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan=\"3\">Medial</td><td colspan=\"3\">Medial</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan=\"3\">Excellent</td><td colspan=\"3\">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">The stability of water solution</td><td colspan=\"3\">Medial</td><td colspan=\"3\">Medial</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Finishing treatment</td><td colspan=\"3\">Singeing,High temperature hot pressing</td><td colspan=\"3\">Singeing,High temperature hot pressing</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong><b>Application of </b></strong><strong><b>P84 Needle Felt</b></strong></h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-03-详情1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-03-详情1_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-03-详情1_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-03-详情1_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-03-详情1_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail2_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Needle-Felt-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-in-China-detail2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-detail3_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-detail3_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-detail3_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-detail3_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-11-detail3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-detail4_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-detail4_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-detail4_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-detail4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/P84-Filter-Bag-01-detail4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n		<p><strong>Filter bags made of P84 needle felt are widely used in many industries:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cement Industry</strong>: Used in kiln exhaust filtration systems.</li><li><strong>Power Generation</strong>: Employed in coal-fired power plants for flue gas filtration.</li><li><strong>Waste Incineration</strong>: Helps in the filtration of gases from waste combustion processes.</li><li><strong>Chemical Processin</strong>g: Utilized in environments with corrosive gases.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Applicable-Industries-02-detail5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6-1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gypsum-factory-detail6-1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8-1.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Coal-Filtration-detail8-1-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />','P84 needle felt filter cloth is one of the most common materials used to make filter bags, made from polyimide fibers. And has high temperature resistance, good corrosion resistance and acid resistance. P84 needle punched felt provides a unique and cost-effective solution for many demanding industrial baghouse applications.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: ≤2.2m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length</strong>: ≤100m.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>High-efficiency filtration</strong>: Reach to 99.6%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Good Temperature-Resistance. Max. Temp.</strong>: 280°C /536°F.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Service Life</strong>: &gt;6000 hours.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Our Capacity</strong>: 15000 square meter per day (standard Aramid Nomex product).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\nLearn About <a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=p84-filter-bags\"><strong>P84 Filter Bags</strong></a>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3312,'2024-11-25 23:02:37','2024-11-25 23:12:56'),(3328,'Homopolymer Acrylic Needle Felt','homopolymer-acrylic-needle-felt','<h3>Advantages of Acrylic Needle Felt<strong>:</strong></h3>\r\n1. Excellent anti-acid and alkali: PH ranges from 3-11\r\n\r\n2. High Filtration Efficiency: reach to 99.5%\r\n\r\n3. Hydrolysis Stability\r\n\r\n4. Stable working time: up to more than 3000 hours. Could be used cyclically\r\n\r\n5. Variety of finish treatments:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Water&amp;Oil proof</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE Membrane</li>\r\n 	<li>Anti-static</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE Impregnation</li>\r\n 	<li>Carbon Coating</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n6. Customized by order.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Specification of Homopolymer Acrylic Needle Felt:</h3>\r\n1. Material : 100% Acrylic staple fiber\r\n2. Scrim: Acrylic staple yarn\r\n3. Width:≤2.2 m\r\n4. Thickness:1.2-2.0 mm\r\n5. Weight:300 -600 g/m2 ±10%\r\n6. Temperature (℃): Continue: 140, Instant: 160.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Features of  Homopolymer Acrylic Needle Felt:</h3>\r\n1. Excellent hydrolysis stability\r\n2. Good anti-acid and alkali, PH ranges from 3-11\r\n3. Relative humidity less than 30%, beware of the oxidation\r\n4. High quality and economical\r\n5. Can be customized.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Physical and Chemical Properties of Homopolymer Acrylic Needle Felt</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"440\"><strong><b>Product name </b></strong><strong> </strong></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"456\"><strong><b>Acrylic needle felt 500 g/m²</b></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td widt