<td width=\"101\">0.58</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">601</td><td width=\"69\">2500</td><td width=\"61\">1776</td><td width=\"60\">60</td><td width=\"58\">29.8</td><td width=\"112\">223.6</td><td width=\"101\">0.49</td></tr><tr><td width=\"72\">301</td><td width=\"69\">2016</td><td width=\"61\">1981</td><td width=\"60\">67</td><td width=\"58\">62.4</td><td width=\"112\">114.4</td><td width=\"101\">0.22</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Applications</h3><p>Nylon filter fabric is widely used in alcohol filtration, medicine residue filtration, milk filtration, edible oil filtration, water filtration, industrial particle filtration, dust filtration, etc.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"263\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applications-of-Nylon-Filter-Cloth-detail1-1024x263.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applications-of-Nylon-Filter-Cloth-detail1-1024x263.jpg 1024w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applications-of-Nylon-Filter-Cloth-detail1-300x77.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applications-of-Nylon-Filter-Cloth-detail1-768x197.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applications-of-Nylon-Filter-Cloth-detail1-600x154.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applications-of-Nylon-Filter-Cloth-detail1.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<h3>Choose Philite®</h3><p>We’re professional manufacturer &amp; supplier of nylon filter fabrics. As a leading exporter of filter media, Philite®’s  filter cloth was export to lots of countries covering  Asia, Europe and America and enjoy a good reputation among our customers. Despite our conventional items, we also welcome other customized order.</p>		\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-03-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-03-detail2.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-03-detail2-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-03-detail2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-03-detail2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail3.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail3-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail3-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail3-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />													\n													<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nylon-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />','Nylon filter cloth is made of polyamide fiber. It has many advantages, such as high temperature resistance, chemical corrosion resistance, high tensile strength, etc. Nylon filter fabrics are commonly used in a variety of industrial applications, including liquid filtration, gas filtration, powder filtration, etc. Its fine fiber structure captures tiny particles and impurities for effective filtration.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>:100% nylon.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mesh Opening</strong>: 32-1931um.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mesh Count</strong>: 13~380 Mesh/inch.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: 100cm, 127cm, 150cm, 160cm, 175cm, 183cm, 365cm or customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length</strong>: 30-100m/roll or customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>FAW</strong>: 200-850gsm and other customized weight.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weave</strong>: plain, twill, satin.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Certificat</strong>e: ISO9001, ROHS, SGS, LFGB.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>:2000 m²  a day.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3969,'2024-12-01 17:10:17','2024-12-01 17:15:16'),(3981,'Polyester Filter Cloth','polyester-filter-cloth','<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microporous structure</strong>: Polyester woven filter cloth has a microporous structure, which can effectively capture and filter tiny particles.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durability</strong>: Polyester fiber has high strength and wear resistance, giving the woven filter cloth a long service life and the ability to withstand long-term use and high-pressure environments.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical stability</strong>: Polyester has good chemical resistance and can withstand the erosion of a variety of chemicals. It is suitable for various industrial filtration occasions.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Easy to clean</strong>: Polyester woven filter cloth is easy to clean and maintain, and can be reused many times, reducing usage costs.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Adaptability</strong>: According to different needs, polyester woven filter cloth can adopt different weaving structures and processing techniques to meet the filtration requirements of different industrial occasions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Type of  Woven Polyester Filter Cloth</h3>\r\nWe supply two kinds , one is polyester filament yarn filter cloth, and the other one is Polyester staple yarn filter cloth.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Polyester filament yarn filter cloth: Long and smooth, good air permeability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Polyester staple yarn filter cloth: Short and not smooth, not good air permeability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Weave Types</strong>\r\n\r\nPolyester woven fabrics can have different textures such as plain weave, twill weave, and satin weave.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3986\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Weave-Types-detail1-300x100.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"507\" height=\"169\" />\r\n<h3>Specification 01</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Model No\">Model No</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weaving\">Weaving</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Density (radlx/10cm)\">Density (radlx/10cm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Warp\">Warp</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weft\">Weft</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Warp\">Warp</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weft\">Weft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"120-7\">120-7</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Twill\">Twill</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Staple fiber\">Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=