s-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Not\">Not</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Alkali resistance\">Alkali resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weak\">Weak</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Strong\">Strong</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Electrical conductivity\">Electrical conductivity</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very poor\">Very poor</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fairly good\">Fairly good</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Medium\">Medium</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Elongation at break\">Elongation at break</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"30%-40%\">30%-40%</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"18%-45%\">18%-45%</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Better than polyester\">Better than polyester</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"12%-25%\">12%-25%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Wear resistance\">Wear resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fairly good\">Fairly good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thermal endurance\">Thermal endurance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"170 °C\">170 °C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"130°C\">130°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"90°C\">90°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"100°C\">100°C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Softening point\">Softening point</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"240°C\">240°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"180°C\">180°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"150°C\">150°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"200°C\">200°C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"M.P.\">M.P.</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"265 °C\">265 °C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"215。C\">215。C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"170°C\">170°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"220°C\">220°C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Applications of Woven Polyester Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Environmental protection</strong>: used for filtration and separation in water treatment, waste gas treatment and solid waste treatment</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical industry</strong>: used for solvent recovery, liquid separation and waste liquid treatment in the chemical production process.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food processing field</strong>: used for liquid filtration, clarification and separation in food production.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical field</strong>: used for solvent recovery, liquid clarification and waste liquid treatment in the drug production process</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Automobile industry</strong>: Used for liquid filtration in automobile manufacturing, such as engine oil, lubricating oil, coolant, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Electronics industry</strong>: Used for liquid filtration in electronic product manufacturing processes, such as ultrapure water filtration in semiconductor production.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mining field</strong>: used for solid-liquid separation and waste liquid treatment in processes such as ore extraction, mineral leaching and wastewater treatment.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Construction and municipal engineering</strong>: Used for filtration and wastewater treatment in facilities such as sedimentation tanks, drainage pipes and pumping stations in construction sites and municipal engineering.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Choose Philite®</h3>\r\nPhilite® is comitted to filtration solution. As a professional manufacturer, our products are exported to Europe, America, southeast Asia and even all over the world. Our polyester filter cloth has a good performance of strong acid resistance and high efficiency filtration.','Woven polyester filter cloth has high porosity, good air permeability, wide range of uses, and stable chemical resistance. It can not only filter room temperature gases, but also filter acidic gases and alkaline corrosive gases, and can filter oil and water. It is Ideal filter material for solid-liquid separation and other fields under normal temperature conditions.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Color: </strong>White, Blue or Customized</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Operating temperatur</strong>e: 80℃-150℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Function: </strong>Liquid filter, air filter,dust filter.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Precision: </strong>1um,5um,10um,20um，25um, 75um , 100um , 150um,etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>FAW</strong>: 200-850gsm and other weight is also welcomed.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weave</strong>: Plain, twill, satin.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish</strong>: Oil-proof, water-proof.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3982,'2024-12-01 17:29:55','2024-12-01 17:29:56'),(3988,'Polypropylene Filter Fabric','polypropylene-filter-fabric','<h3>Features</h3><ul><li><strong>High-efficiency filtration</strong>: The fiber structure of the filter fabric can effectively capture impurities such as suspended solids and particles, providing a high-efficiency filtration effect.</li><li><strong>Chemical resistance</strong>: Polypropylene has good chemical resistance, so polypropylene filter fabric can be used to handle many kinds of chemical liquids.</li><li><strong>High temperature resistance</strong>: Polypropylene filter fabric can maintain stable performance within a certain temperature range and is suitable for filtration processes in high temperature environments.</li><li><strong>Abrasion resistance</strong>: Polypropylene fiber has good abrasion resistance, allowing the filter fabric to maintain its service life for a long time.</li><li><strong>Easy to clean and maintain</strong>: Polypropylene filter fabric is generally easy to clean and maintain and can be cleaned by washing or other methods to extend its service life.</li></ul><p> </p><h3>Models and Parameters (Accept customization)</h3><table><tbody><tr><td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Name\">Name</td><td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Breaking strength (N/5* 20cm)\">Breaking strength (N/5* 20cm)</td><td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thread count (root/10cm)\">Thread count (root/10cm)</td><td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thickness (mm)\">Thickness (mm)</td><td id=\"sjs-E1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weight (g/m2)\">Weight (g/m2)</td><td id=\"sjs-F1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air Perm (L/m2.s)\">Air Perm (L/m2.s)</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"521\">521</td><td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2608/2050\">2608/2050</td><td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"214.8/150.8\">214.8/150.8</td><td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"0.79\">0.79</td><td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"302.7\">302.7</td><td id=\"sjs-F2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"216.5\">216.5</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"522\">522</td><td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2104/1633\">2104/1633</td><td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"244/173\">244/173</td><td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"0.41\">0.41</td><td id=\"sjs-E3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"155\">155</td><td id=\"sjs-F3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"73.44\">73.44</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"534\">534</td><td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2501/1894\">2501/1894</td><td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"193.6/100.0\">193.6/100.0</