0\">430</td><td id=\"sjs-F20\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"21.49\">21.49</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A21\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1500-1\">1500-1</td><td id=\"sjs-B21\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"5628/3701\">5628/3701</td><td id=\"sjs-C21\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"251/118\">251/118</td><td id=\"sjs-D21\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.42\">1.42</td><td id=\"sjs-E21\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"725\">725</td><td id=\"sjs-F21\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"29.38\">29.38</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A22\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"108B\">108B</td><td id=\"sjs-B22\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"8721/4642\">8721/4642</td><td id=\"sjs-C22\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"503/133\">503/133</td><td id=\"sjs-D22\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.1\">1.1</td><td id=\"sjs-E22\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"600\">600</td><td id=\"sjs-F22\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"13.6\">13.6</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A23\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"108C\">108C</td><td id=\"sjs-B23\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"8367/4797\">8367/4797</td><td id=\"sjs-C23\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"504/177\">504/177</td><td id=\"sjs-D23\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.03\">1.03</td><td id=\"sjs-E23\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"600\">600</td><td id=\"sjs-F23\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"22.96\">22.96</td></tr><tr><td id=\"sjs-A24\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"3927(120-16)\">3927(120-16)</td><td id=\"sjs-B24\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"4598/3154\">4598/3154</td><td id=\"sjs-C24\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"156/106\">156/106</td><td id=\"sjs-D24\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"0.9\">0.9</td><td id=\"sjs-E24\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"524\">524</td><td id=\"sjs-F24\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"18\">18</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Fiber Types of PP Woven Filter Cloth</h3><ul><li><strong>Filament yarn</strong>: Long and smooth, good air permeability.</li><li><strong>Staple yarn</strong>: Short and rough, not good air permeability.</li><li><strong>Mono-filament: </strong>High strength.</li></ul><p> </p><h3>Weave Types of PP Woven Filter Cloth</h3>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"800\" height=\"267\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Weave-Types-detail1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Weave-Types-detail1-1.jpg 800w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Weave-Types-detail1-1-300x100.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Weave-Types-detail1-1-768x256.jpg 768w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Weave-Types-detail1-1-600x200.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													\n		<ul><li><strong>Plain Weave</strong>: This is the simplest weave structure, with each weft thread passing through each warp thread alternately, forming a staggered grid pattern. Plain weave fabric generally has a uniform structure and high strength, making it suitable for general filtration applications.</li><li><strong>Twill Weave</strong>: In twill, each weft thread alternates across two or more warp threads, creating a diagonal texture. This braided structure provides better strength and wear resistance and is suitable for filtration applications that require higher performance.</li><li><strong>Satin Weave</strong>: Satin Weave has a smoother surface. Due to its interweaving method, there are fewer intersection points between the weft threads, so the surface is smoother. This kind of braided structure is usually used in situations that have strict requirements on filter materials, such as environments that require higher precision filtration.</li></ul><p> </p><h3>Applications</h3><p>Woven polypropylene filter fabrics are widely used in the fields of liquid-solid separation and dust removal. It is mainly used in precision chemicals, sugar, pharmaceuticals, alumina industries, etc., and is used in plate and frame filter presses, belt filters, and mixing belt filters. Filters, disc filters, drum filters, centrifugal filters and other equipment.</p><p><strong>These industries include:</strong></p><ul><li>Grain, rice, wheat, corn seeds and other agriculture.</li><li>Fertilizers and other chemical products.</li><li>Cement, sand and other building materials.</li><li>Flour.</li><li>Sugar making.</li><li>Pharmaceuticals.</li><li>Aluminum oxide.</li><li>Industrial garbage bags, etc.</li></ul>		\n													<img width=\"759\" height=\"592\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PP-application-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PP-application-detail2.jpg 759w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PP-application-detail2-300x234.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PP-application-detail2-600x468.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 759px) 100vw, 759px\" />													\n		<h3>Choose Philite®</h3>		\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-05-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-05-detail3.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-05-detail3-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-05-detail3-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-01-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-04-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-04-detail5.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-04-detail5-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-04-detail5-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n													<img width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail6.jpg 750w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woven-Polypropylene-Filter-Fabric-Cloth-Manufacturers-02-detail6-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" />													\n		<ul><li><strong>Fabrication</strong><br />We use internationally advanced heavy-duty looms and the best yarn materials, with a daily output of 2000 m2.</li><li><strong>Quality Assurance Test</strong><br />In-house testing centers and laboratories continuously check fabric quality before shipment.</li><li><strong>Packing</strong><br />All goods are shipped in sea-worthy packaging to withstand long distances and harsh transportation. Card boxes and pallets are also available if required.</li></ul>','Woven polypropylene filter fabric is a filter material made of polypropylene fiber as raw material and processed by textile processing. Polypropylene filter cloth has good water solubility and is designed to provide optimal filtration performance. It is mainly used in industrial applications such as liquid filtration, gas filtration, and particle capture. Especially the complex operation of filtering food-grade liquids containing impurities.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Materials</strong>: 100% virgin polypropylene woven fabric roll.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Color</strong>: White, red, yellow or as per customer’s requirements.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: 23-400cm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mesh</strong>: 7~14.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length</strong>: 1000-4000m/roll ,or as customers’ requirements.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Working temperature</strong>: normal working temperature 88 ℃, 110 ℃  peak working temperature.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Certification</strong>: SGS, BV, TUV, ISO9001, ISO14001.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>FAW</strong>: 200-850gsm and other customized weight.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weave</strong>: plain, twill, satin.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',3989,'2024-12-01 17:37:35','2024-12-01 17:43:58'),(4004,'Seamless Woven Cloth Tube','seamless-woven-cloth-tube','<h3>Type</h3>\r\n1. Polyester filament yarn filter cloth\r\n2.Polyester staple yarn filter cloth\r\n<h3>Polyester filament yarn filter cloth compared with polyester staple yarn filter cloth</h3>\r\n<strong>Filament yarn filter cloth</strong>: long and smooth, good air permeability.\r\n<strong>Staple yarn filter cloth</strong>: short and not smooth, not good air permeability.\r\n<h3>Specification of Polyester Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\"> MODEL NO</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WEAVING</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">MATERIAL</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">DENSITY   (radlx/10cm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WARP</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WEFT</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WARP</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WEFT</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>120-7</td>\r\n<td>Twill</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>256.4</td>\r\n<td>212</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>734</td>\r\n<td>Twill</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>231.6</td>\r\n<td>168</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>3927</td>\r\n<td>Plain</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>152</td>\r\n<td>102</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>208 Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>Twill</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>271</td>\r\n<td>286</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>740</td>\r\n<td>Satin</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>Staple fiber</td>\r\n<td>306</td>\r\n<td>206.2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\"> MODEL  NO</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WEIGHT (g/m2)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">SPLITTING STRENGTH (N/5╳20cm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">SPLITTING AND ELONGATION(%)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">AIR PERMEABILITY (mm/s)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">THICKNESS (mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WARP</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\"> WEFT</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WARP</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">WEFT</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>120-7</td>\r\n<td>627.6</td>\r\n<td>4498</td>\r\n<td>4044</td>\r\n<td>36.3</td>\r\n<td>27.5</td>\r\n<td>53.9</td>\r\n<td>1.42</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>734</td>\r\n<td>245.9</td>\r\n<td>2072</td>\r\n<td>1633</td>\r\n<td>25.6</td>\r\n<td>23.2</td>\r\n<td>316</td>\r\n<td>0.62</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>3927</td>\r\n<td>524.1</td>\r\n<td>4598</td>\r\n<td>3154</td>\r\n<td>46.8</td>\r\n<td>24.8</td>\r\n<td>&lt;20.7</td>\r\n<td>0.9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>208 Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>410.8</td>\r\n<td>2788</td>\r\n<td>1930</td>\r\n<td>39.1</td>\r\n<td>29</td>\r\n<td>68</td>\r\n<td>1.43</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>740</td>\r\n<td>324.6</td>\r\n<td>3175.8</td>\r\n<td>2184.6</td>\r\n<td>23.5</td>\r\n<td>21.3</td>\r\n<td>126.7</td>\r\n<td>0.71</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Property of polyester filter cloth</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Properties</td>\r\n<td>Polyester</td>\r\n<td>Kapron</td>\r\n<td>Polypropylene</td>\r\n<td>Vinylon</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Acid resistance</td>\r\n<td>Strong</td>\r\n<td>Poor</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Not</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Alkali resistance</td>\r\n<td>Weak</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>High</td>\r\n<td>Strong</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Electrical conductivity</td>\r\n<td>Very poor</td>\r\n<td>Fairly good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Medium</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Elongation at break</td>\r\n<td>30%-40%</td>\r\n<td>18%-45%</td>\r\n<td>Better than polyester</td>\r\n<td>12%-25%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Wear resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Fairly good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Thermal endurance</td>\r\n<td>170 °C</td>\r\n<td>130 °C</td>\r\n<td>90 °C</td>\r\n<td>100 °C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Softening point</td>\r\n<td>240 °C</td>\r\n<td>180 °C</td>\r\n<td>150 °C</td>\r\n<td>200 °C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>M.P.</td>\r\n<td>265 °C</td>\r\n<td>215 °C</td>\r\n<td>170 °C</td>\r\n<td>220 °C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Performance of Polyester Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n(1) Resist strong acid and weak alkali.\r\n(2) It’s stable to thick abioacid in low temperature,not dissolved in organic acid, but can be dissolved in thick vitriol and heated cresol.\r\n(3) It’s easily hydrolyzed in strong alkali.\r\n<h3>Applications of Polyester Filter Cloth</h3>\r\nDust collector or liquid-solid separation. Mainly used in food and beverage industry,  pharmaceutical industry, non-ferrous metallurgy, chemical plant, building section,mining industry,etc., for the equipment of filter presses, centrifuge filters, vacuum filters,  belt filter presses, etc.','We can supply Seamless woven cloth tube for your customized need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4005,'2024-12-01 17:48:35','2024-12-01 17:48:35'),(4008,'Silica Fiberglass Fabric','silica-fiberglass-fabric','Silica fiberglass fabric is a new fiberglass composite material, the silica it contains guarantees the excellent heat resistance. We can produce the regular silica fabric, besides your customized order is welcomed.\r\n<h3>Type:</h3>\r\n1) High silica fabrics\r\n2) Silica fabrics\r\n<h3>Properties:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>No asbestos or ceramic, no harm to human body;</li>\r\n 	<li>Low thermal conductivity, excellent thermal insulation;</li>\r\n 	<li>Superb electric insulation;</li>\r\n 	<li>Insert to majority of chemical reagents. Silica fabrics has better tensile strength and abrasion resistance than high silica fabric.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Specification of high silica fabrics:</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Product code</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Weave</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">Weight g/㎡</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Width cm</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Thickness mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Warp N/INCH</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Weft N/INCH</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">SiO2 %</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">Operation temperature ℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-300</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Twill 3*1</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">300+/-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92+/-1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">0.35+/-0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;300</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;250</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-500</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Satin 8HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">500+/-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92+/-1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">0.6+/-0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;500</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;400</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-600</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Satin 8HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">600+/-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92+/-1 100+/-1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">0.7+/-0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;600</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;500</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-880</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Satin 12HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">880+/-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92+/-1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">1.0+/-0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;800</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;600</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-1100</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Satin 12HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">1150+/-50</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">92+/-1 100+/-1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">1.3+/-0.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;750</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-660-S</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Satin 8HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">650+/-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">84-86</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">0.7+/-0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;500</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;400</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-1100-S</td>\r\n<td width=\"95\">Satin 12HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"79\">1250+/-50</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">84-86</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">1.3+/-0.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;750</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;600</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">≥96</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">1000℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Specification of silica fabrics:</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Product code</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Weave</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Weight g/㎡</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Width cm</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Thickness mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Warp N/INCH</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Weft N/INCH</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">SiO2 %</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Operation temperature ℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-600</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Satin 8HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">600+/-30</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;92</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">0.75+/-0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1200</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">70%+/-5%</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">800℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-80</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Satin 12HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">880+/-40</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;92</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">1.00+/-0.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1300</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1100</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">70%+/-5%</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">800℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">ES-1100</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Satin 12HS</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">1100+/-50</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;92</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">1.30+/-0.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1500</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">&gt;1200</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">70%+/-5%</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">800℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Application:</h3>\r\nWith the first-rate high-temperature stability, they are widely used in high temperature thermal insulation, industrial protection, aerospace, energy saving, environmental protection, fire production and etc. <strong><em>PS:More information about high temperature resistance filter media, please</em> </strong>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5567\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4010\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/click-100x100-detail1-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>','Our silica fiber glass guarantees the excellent heat resistance , low thermal conductivity, excellent thermal insulation and superb electric insulation. With the first-rate high-temperature stability, silica fiberglass fabrics are widely used in high temperature thermal insulation, industrial protection, aerospace, energy saving, environmental protection, fire production and etc…\r\nThe heat resistant fiberglass composite fabric, which can be used for a long period of time without changing its properties at the temperature 1000 ℃. Excellent high temperature resistance is its biggest advantage. Therefore it can be used for high temperature thermal insulation, industrial protection, aerospace, energy saving, environmental protection, fire production.\r\n<strong>Our capacity</strong>:2000m a day.\r\n<strong>FAW</strong>:200-850gsm. and we welcome other customized weight.\r\n<strong>Weave</strong>: plain, twill, satin.\r\nAny questions, please <em><strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\">contact us</a></strong></em> freely!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4009,'2024-12-01 17:52:28','2024-12-08 18:31:25'),(4012,'Silicone Coated Fabric','silicone-coated-fabric','<h2>Physical Properties:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Thickness : 1 mm</li>\r\n 	<li>Total weight (g/m2) :1500</li>\r\n 	<li>Weight of fiberglass fabric (g/m2) : 852</li>\r\n 	<li>Double side with silicone coated</li>\r\n 	<li>Tensile strength (N/5 cm )      Warp :  ≥5500  Weft :  ≥ 5000</li>\r\n 	<li>Width ( m ) : 1.5</li>\r\n 	<li>Operation temperature range ( ℃ ) ： – 50 ～ 250</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4016\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/IMG_1549_2345看图王-detail1-300x172.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"716\" height=\"410\" />\r\n<h2><strong><b>Features &amp; Benefits :</b></strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Excellent dimensional stability at high temperature</li>\r\n 	<li>(No distortion, shrinkage/expansion at 260℃ continuous usage condition.)</li>\r\n 	<li>Superior adhesion and holding power of silicone adhesive</li>\r\n 	<li>No adhesive residue after removal</li>\r\n 	<li>Longer life time of silicone resin side</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy cleaning using cleaning roller allows extended lifetime</li>\r\n 	<li>Good surface flatness allows the whole area of FPC to be fixed</li>\r\n 	<li>Adhesion level of silicone compound can be controlled for customer’s requirement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n(Low – Moderate – Standard – High – High2 – High3)\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Excellent cut &amp; die-cut properties</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy fixing and easy removal</li>\r\n 	<li>Provides flexibility for carrier design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong><b>Applications</b></strong><strong><b>  </b></strong></h2>\r\n<h3><strong><b>1. </b></strong><strong><b>SMT Process</b></strong></h3>\r\n– Reflow Soldering of FPC, Thin Rigid PCB &amp; Rigid-flex PCB, etc\r\n<h3><strong><b>2.Assembly Process (including curing, wire bonding, etc)</b></strong><strong><b> </b></strong></h3>\r\n– MEMS Microphone\r\n\r\n– Camera Module, Vibration Motor\r\n\r\n– Wireless LAN Module, GPS Module\r\n\r\n– RF Module\r\n\r\n– Accelerometer Sensor, Gyro Sensor\r\n\r\n– Humidity Sensor, Temperature Sensor, etc.\r\n\r\n– Flip Chip Mounting Process\r\n\r\n– Flip Chip Mounting\r\n<h3><strong><b>3.LED Packaging Process</b></strong></h3>\r\n– LED Chip Bonding, Wire Bonding, Molding, etc.\r\n<h3><strong><b>4.Display Panel Process</b></strong></h3>\r\n– Carrier of LCD Panel, OLED Panel\r\n\r\n– Temporary Fixing of Touch Panel\r\n\r\n– Detaching Protection Films from LCD Panel\r\n\r\nor Polarizing Film\r\n\r\n– Probe Station\r\n\r\n– Fixing of Electrostatic Chuck\r\n<h3><strong><b>5.Substrate Manufacturing Process</b></strong></h3>\r\n– Dicing of LTCC, CSP or Inductor substrates\r\n\r\n– MLCC Termination\r\n\r\n– Micro-polishing of Thin Package Substrate','<strong><b>Product Name</b></strong><strong><b> </b></strong>:  SILICONE COATED FABRIC\r\n\r\n<strong><b>Product Code</b></strong><strong><b> </b></strong> :  ES-SCCF1500\r\n\r\nES-SCCF1500 is a double-sided silicone tape coated with a reusable silicone compound and heat resistive silicone adhesive. It is specifically designed to temporarily fix FPC or tiny components to carrier jig during SMT processing. Easy-to-clean silicone coated fabric is cost-effective due to its reuse even in high temperature environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4013,'2024-12-01 17:55:42','2024-12-01 18:00:02'),(4020,'Supply Woven Filter Cloth','supply-woven-filter-cloth','<h3>1.<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=polyester-filter-cloth\">Polyester filter cloth</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Type:</strong> (1)Polyester filament yarn filter cloth (2)Polyester staple yarn filter cloth\r\n<p class=\"p0\"><strong>Performance:</strong> (1) Resist strong acid and weak alkali.\r\n(2) It’s stable to thick abio-acid in low temperature,not dissolved in organic acid,but can be dissolved in thick vitriol and heated cresol.\r\n(3) It’s easily hydrolyzed in strong alkali.\r\n(4) The temperature used within 120℃and the instant temperature can be up to 150℃.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p0\"><strong>Applications:</strong> Dust collector or liquid-solid separation. Mainly used in food and beverage industry, pharmaceutical industry, non-ferrous metallurgy, chemical plant, building section and mining industry,etc, for the equipment of filter presses, centrifuge filters, vacuum filters, belt filter presses, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2.<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=polypropylene-filter-fabric\">PP(polypropylene) filter cloth</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Type:</strong>\r\n(1)Polypropylene filament yarn filter cloth\r\n(2)Polypropylene staple yarn filter cloth\r\n(3)PP Monofilament Filter Cloth\r\n<p class=\"p0\"><strong>Applications</strong>: Liquid-solid separation and dust collection. Mainly used in precision chemical industry, Sugar-refinery, Pharmaceutical, alumina industries, etc, for equipments of frame filter presses, belt filters blend belt filter, disc filters, drum filters, centrifuge filters, etc.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p0\"> <strong>Performance</strong>:\r\n(1) It can resist strong alkali and acid except chlorine-sulphur acid and thick nitric acid.\r\n(2) The general temperature applied is less 100℃,the tensility will fall off and shrink when it’s over 100℃.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3.<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=polyamide-nylon-filter-cloth\">PA(nylon) filter cloth</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Features:</strong>\r\n(1) Great strength,especially its anti-abrasion is top-ranked in all general fibers.\r\n(2) Resist strong alkali and weak acid. (3) The strength expense can be ignored after dealt with NaoH(10%), as Polyamide is used 16h in the state of 90℃. (4) It’s continual applied temperature within 120℃ and the instant applied temperature can be up to 150℃.\r\n<p class=\"p0\"><strong>Applications</strong>: Mainly used for liquid-soild separation. Mainly used in the industries of chemical, coal mining,building materials, melting, for equipments in the strong alkali operating conditions, such as frame filter press, disc filters, and centrifuge filter.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4.<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=fiberglass-filter-cloth\">Fiberglass filter cloth</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Type</strong>: (1)Flat fiberglass filter cloth (2)Textured fiberglass filter cloth\r\n<p class=\"p0\"><strong>Features:</strong> Fiberglass filter cloth has high covering capacity and good air permeability,thus providing higher filtration efficiency,lower filtration resistance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p0\"><strong>Application:</strong> Widely used in industry of carbon black, steel and non-ferrous metal processing, cement industry, chemical plant, power plant, etc, for dust collection, air filtration.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3> 5.<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=cotton-filter-cloth\">Cotton filter cloth</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Features: </strong>(1)Weight: 300gsm-600gsm (2)Air permeability:20-100L/M2.s@200Pa (3)Filtering : 0.5-100micron\r\n\r\n<strong>Application:</strong> The special industry of nickel cathode.\r\n<h3>6.<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=basalt-filter-cloth\">Basalt filter cloth</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Features: </strong>Basalt filter cloth not only has a perfect performance in resisting high temperature,but also can be degraded totally. It is a eco-friendly industrial material. <strong>Performance:</strong> (1) It can resist strong alkali and acid except chlorine-sulphur acid and thick nitric acid. (2) The general temperature applied is less 650℃,the tensility will fall off and shrink when it’s over 960℃. <em><strong>Please click here<a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=4025\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4023\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/click-100x100-detail1-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>for more information. Any other questions, please contact us freely!</strong></em>','Philite® produces all kinds material of woven filter cloth for industrial filtration. As a professional manufacturer in filtration products, our products share a good reputation among our customers all over the world. We have advanced equipments and experiences engineers to develop new filtration products to meet the new market demands.\r\nFilter cloth have a good performance of strong acid resistance and high efficiency filtration.\r\n<strong>Material</strong>: PA, PET, PP, cotton, fiberglass, basalt, silica fiberglass.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',6146,'2024-12-01 18:05:18','2025-02-19 10:44:22'),(4031,'Tear Resistance Series of fiberglass','tear-resistance-series-of-fiberglass','Specific Details\r\n<table width=\"983\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"63\">NO.</td>\r\n<td width=\"224\">Style</td>\r\n<td width=\"195\">Width Item,cm</td>\r\n<td width=\"153\">Weight,g/m2</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Thickness,mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"215\">Weaving type</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>1</td>\r\n<td>108</td>\r\n<td>107 127 157</td>\r\n<td>48.0±3.0</td>\r\n<td>0.061</td>\r\n<td>Plain</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n<td>112</td>\r\n<td>107 127 157</td>\r\n<td>70.5±6.0</td>\r\n<td>0.091</td>\r\n<td>Plain</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>113</td>\r\n<td>107 127 157</td>\r\