\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JFP39</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">39</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">100</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">60*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">135</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">28</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">120</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">58</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JFP42</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">42</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">107</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">60*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">116</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">24</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">120</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">62</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JFP46</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">46</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">120</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">50*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">118</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">29</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">105</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">48</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JFP50</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">50</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">127</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">50*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">101</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">25</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">105</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">52</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JFP54</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">54</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">137</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">40*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">99</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">29</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">85</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">36</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JFP58</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">58</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">147</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">40*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">86</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">25</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">87</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">38.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\">JPP62</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" width=\"72\">PA6</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">62</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">157</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">40*2</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">75</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">22</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">88</td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" width=\"72\">41</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Being widely appreciated in filtration industry worldwide, Fabricated as per the International standard,high quality,durable,reliable and optional in Single and Multi layer (DLW) weave designs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4094,'2024-12-01 20:06:40','2024-12-01 20:06:40'),(4096,'Distributor & Middle Row Device Filter Elements','distributor-middle-row-device-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nThe distribution system component comprises a series of screen tube laterals connected to a central collection hub or central outlet, a design that effectively supports the media.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>It uniformly collects or distributes gas and liquid flows through the reaction medium, without any dead zones.</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for reactors of various sizes and shapes, it can be positioned at the edge, center, top, or bottom of inlet pipes.</li>\r\n 	<li>The number of lateral components and their outer diameters can be customized based on the direction of fluid flow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Connection Method</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Threaded coupling</li>\r\n 	<li>Flange method</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n304、304L、316L、321、2205、250、TA2、904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4097,'2024-12-01 20:10:51','2024-12-01 20:10:51'),(4102,'Johnson Grille Filter Elements','johnson-grille-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nJohnson Screens are available in both cylindrical and flat panel forms, with the flat panels fabricated into various shapes such as rectangular, square, sector, circular, andarc-shaped screen plates.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The slot size is adjustable, making it suitable for direct media support.</li>\r\n 	<li>High strength, easy to clean, excellent mechanical properties, and resistant to damage,</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy and quick to install, low maintenance, and durable.</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>Material</h3>\r\n304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507.\r\n\r\nTA2、904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4103,'2024-12-01 20:12:21','2024-12-01 20:12:22'),(4107,'Pressure Bend Screen Filter Elements','pressure-bend-screen-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nPressure bend screens come in two varieties: gravity bend screens and pressure bend screens. The 120 “dehydrators and fiber separation screens are commonly utilized in the raw material production process of cornstarch. Philite’s welded pressure bend screens are fabricated by resistance welding the surface wedge wires to supporting ribs using precision machinery High-quality CNC equipment guarantees the slot openings are exceedingly accurate and uniform.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Technical Parameter</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Screen surface curvature: 120℃ or specified curvature,</li>\r\n 	<li>Material processing capacity: 30-52 m3/h.</li>\r\n 	<li>Feeding pressure: 0.2-0.4Mpa.</li>\r\n 	<li>Screen width: 375mm,585mm, 710mm, 825mm.</li>\r\n 	<li>Screen gap width: 50um,75um、100um,120um, 150um, 200um.300um.</li>\r\n 	<li>Sieve plate arc radius: 762mm, arc length 1592mm or 1595mm.</li>\r\n</ul>','<strong>Material</strong>: 316L.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4108,'2024-12-01 20:14:05','2024-12-01 20:14:05'),(4112,'Punching Composite Filter Elements','punching-composite-filter-elements','Stainless steel filter cartridge, simple multi-layer spot welding filter cartridge, filter mesh, has good filtration performance for 1-500um particles and liquids, and can be reused after cleaning with a large flow rate per unit area. With different porosities (28%-50%), the pores criss-cross vertically and horizontally, and are resistant to high temperature, rapid cooling, and corrosion, suitable for various types of acid, alkali, and other corrosive media, stainless steel filter element can withstand general acid, alkali and organic corrosion, especially suitable for sulfur-containing gas filtration. It has high strength and good toughness, is suitable for welding in high-pressure environments, is easy to load and unload, and has a stable and evenly distributed pore shape, ensuring stable filtration performance. Good regeneration performance, with filtration performance restored to over 90% after repeated cleaning and regeneration.','<h3>Material</h3>\r\n304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507.\r\n\r\nTA2、904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4113,'2024-12-01 20:36:59','2024-12-01 20:37:39'),(4117,'Sintered Mesh Filter Elements','sintered-mesh-filter-elements','<h3>Material</h3>\r\n304, 304L, 316L. 321, 2205, 2507,TA2, 904L, C276etc.','<h3>Product Introduction</h3>\r\nIt is a new type of filtering material with high strength and overall rigidity, which is made of multi-layer metal sintered mesh, special laminated stainless steel mesh, and vacuum sintered.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Mix</h3>\r\nIt is generally a five layer structure, divided into a protective layer, a filtering layer, a separation layer, a strengthening layer, and a support layer. This type of filter material has both stable filtration accuracy and high strength and stiffness, requiring high compressive strength and uniform filtration force in a filtration envi-ronment. It is a new type of ideal filter material.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4118,'2024-12-01 20:41:35','2024-12-01 20:41:35'),(4122,'Slot Separator Filter Elements','slot-separator-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nGap separator, also known as sand mill discharge screen, was first used in fields such as coatings, inks,chemicals, cosmetics, pesticides, etc. A discharge screen used on a horizontal sand mill. it is now widely used for grinding positive and negative electrode materials in lithium batteries.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Clog-resistant, the w-shaped wires form wedge-shaped slots ensuring unobstructed flow,</li>\r\n 	<li>Large open area with a variety of V-wire diameters avail.able for selection</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy cleaning, with zirconia beads less prone to clogging, and capable of self-cleaning through back washing.</li>\r\n 	<li>It features low pressure loss, high mechanical performance, and excellent wear resistance, with a maximum hardness achievable up to HV1600.</li>\r\n 	<li>It offers high precision slot openings, with automatic welding ensuring uniformity in slot size accuracy.</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>Material</h3>\r\n304.304L,316L、321.2205. 2507.\r\n\r\nTA2.904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4123,'2024-12-01 21:03:34','2024-12-01 21:03:34'),(4127,'Water Cap & Spray Nozzle Filter Elements','water-cap-spray-nozzle-filter-elements','<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4131\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Water-Cap-Spray-Nozzle-Filter-Elements-04-detail1_syy-300x180.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"602\" height=\"361\" />\r\n<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nStainless steel water caps are utilized for the separation of solids, liquids, gases, or solid-liquid mixtures, with their design and quantity tailored to the specific application and the client’s flow rate requirements.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Application</h3>\r\nCommonly used in desalination devices, water softeners, pressure and gravity sand filters, commonly used flow rates include 0.5Th, 1.0T/h, 2.0T/h, etc. PHILITE can design non-standard customization according to customer requirements.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4128,'2024-12-01 21:09:51','2024-12-01 21:09:51'),(4133,'Wedge Wire Screen Filter Elements','wedge-wire-screen-filter-elements','<h3>Structural Principles</h3>\r\nEdith Wedge Wire Screens are composed of wedge-shaped (V-profile) surface wires and support rods resistance-welded together, They serve as metallic mesh-like filter elements designed for screening and filtration purposes, characterized by high mechanical strength, clog-resistant surfaces, large open area, allowing for backwashing, incurring no operational costs, requiring no maintenance, and minimizing downtime.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Clog-resistant, the V-shaped wires form wedge-shapedslots ensuring unobstructed flow.</li>\r\n 	<li>Large open area with a variety of V-wire diameters available for selection, ensuring high water flow efficiency.</li>\r\n 	<li>Low pressure loss, high mechanical performance, and wear resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>High precision slot openings, with automatic welding en-suring uniform slot size accuracy.</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>Material</h3>\r\n304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507.\r\n\r\nTA2、904L、C276etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4134,'2024-12-01 21:11:19','2024-12-01 21:11:19'),(4138,'Quartz Filter Paper','quartz-filter-paper','<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Complete Pack Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">50 Pieces</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">25-42.5 mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Air Flow Rate</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">6.3–12s/100ml/in2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Basis Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">85–170 g/m2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Max recommended temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">800 °C</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Quartz/High-purity quartz</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nominal Thickness</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">430–475µm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Philite® high-purity quartz microfiber filters are mainly used in air pollution monitoring. They can be used for air sampling in acidic gases, stacks, flues and aerosols, particularly at high temperatures (up to 500ºC), and for PM10 and PM2.5 air sampling testing. Quartz filters are suitable for critical analyses and trace level determinations, atomic absorption spectroscopy, and flame emission spectrometry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4139,'2024-12-01 21:15:36','2024-12-01 21:15:36'),(4141,'Filter Housing for Liquid Filter Bags','filter-housing-for-liquid-filter-bags','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>							<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Side-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Side-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail1.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Side-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail1-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Side-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Side-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail1-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Side Inlet Filter Housing</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Top-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Top-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail2.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Top-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail2-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Top-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Top-Inlet-Filter-Housing-detail2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Top Inlet Filter Housing</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Full-Plastic-Filter-Housing-detail3_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Full-Plastic-Filter-Housing-detail3_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Full-Plastic-Filter-Housing-detail3_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Full-Plastic-Filter-Housing-detail3_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Full-Plastic-Filter-Housing-detail3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Full Plastic Filter Housing</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Rocker-Arms-Filter-Housing-detail4_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Rocker-Arms-Filter-Housing-detail4_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Rocker-Arms-Filter-Housing-detail4_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Rocker-Arms-Filter-Housing-detail4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Rocker-Arms-Filter-Housing-detail4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Rocker Arms Filter Housing</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Quick-Opening-Filter-Housing-detail5_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Quick-Opening-Filter-Housing-detail5_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Quick-Opening-Filter-Housing-detail5_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Quick-Opening-Filter-Housing-detail5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Quick-Opening-Filter-Housing-detail5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Quick Opening Filter Housing</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n										<figure>\n										<img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Clamshell-Type-Filter-Housing-detail6_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Clamshell-Type-Filter-Housing-detail6_syy.jpg 600w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Clamshell-Type-Filter-Housing-detail6_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Clamshell-Type-Filter-Housing-detail6_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Clamshell-Type-Filter-Housing-detail6_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />											<figcaption>Clamshell Type Filter Housing</figcaption>\n										</figure>\n		<p><strong>Applications</strong></p><ul><li>Food and beverage sterilisation filtration.</li><li>High- purity water terminal filtration.</li><li>Fine chemical product filtration.</li><li>Wine canning filtration.</li><li>Liquo/ Wine canning filtration.</li><li>Electronics.</li><li>Petroleum, Automobile.</li><li>Pharmacy.</li></ul>','We have different kinds of filter housings to meet different working conditions and applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4142,'2024-12-01 21:49:10','2024-12-01 21:54:11'),(4158,'Industrial Bag Filter Housing','industrial-bag-filter-housing','<h2>Product Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Designed for flow rates up to 6.5 m<sup>3</sup>/hr</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for liquids and gases</li>\r\n 	<li>Flat bolted closure for high pressure rated at full vacuum and 10 bar g up to 150°C</li>\r\n 	<li>Internally and externally electropolished as standard</li>\r\n 	<li>Robust bag support basket assembly fabricated from perforated sheet rather than wire mesh for extra strength</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of options available for connection sizes and types and materials of construction</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in 316L stainless steel</li>\r\n 	<li>PED and Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n1.Integral vent to aid efficient filter changeout\r\n2.Each housing is etched with a unique serial number for full traceability\r\n3.Full housing customisation service available\r\n4.Internally and externally electropolished as standard\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<strong>Maximum Operating Conditions</strong> Pressure Range: Liquid: Vee clamp: 8.5 bar Screw clamps: FV / 10 bar g Gases: Screw clamps: FV / 10 bar g Temperature Range: Vee clamp: -10ºC / 110ºC Screw clamps: -10ºC / 150ºC\r\n<strong>Materials of Construction</strong> Body: 316L St.Steel Closure: Vee clamp – 304 St. Steel Screw clamps – Zinc plated carbon steel (Optional stainless steel)\r\n<strong>Finish</strong> Vessel: Electropolished Basket: Pickled Connections Inlet/Outlet: 1”, 11 /2” or 2” BSPM Vent: ¼” BSP','Bag housing is available in both single and double lengths. The top opening style is equipped with a Vee clamp as standard for pressures up to 8.5 bar g.\r\nThese housings are widely used where low cost is of prime importance and this makes them the ideal choice to replace conventional cast stainless steel strainers. The side inlet and bottom outlet configuration is perfectly suited to duties where product changes demand a simple to clean, easy access housing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4159,'2024-12-01 21:55:55','2024-12-01 21:55:56'),(4161,'Multi Cartridge Housing','multi-cartridge-housing','<h2>Product Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Free standing, easy to install design</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal cup allows the use of plug in or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing</li>\r\n 	<li>Vee clamp closures use unique ‘W’ style seal for reliable leak free operation</li>\r\n 	<li>High quality cast Vee band clamps for safety and security</li>\r\n 	<li>Cast compression nut with integral PTFE washer for easy, hand tight cartridge sealing</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of connection sizes and types, cartridge lengths and materials of construction</li>\r\n 	<li>PED and ATEX Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n1.Integral vent, clean and dirty drain sockets to aid efficient filter changeout\r\n2.Universal cup enables choice of plug in (Code 3, Code 8 and Code A) or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing\r\n3.Bolted closure options available\r\n4.Every housing is etched with a unique serial number for full traceability\r\n5.Available in 316L Stainless Steel\r\n6.Full housing customisation service available\r\n7.Internally and externally electropolished as standard','These housings are widely used where low capital cost is of prime importance. Being floor mounted and therefore free standing, these housings will suit most process applications. Bolted closures are an option available for all models.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4162,'2024-12-01 21:57:14','2024-12-01 21:57:14'),(4165,'Pipeline Filter Housing','pipeline-filter-housing','<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Pipeline filter is used as a pre-filter and is suitable for various applications.</li>\r\n 	<li>The equipment is designed according to the pressure vessel manufacturing specifications, durable and easy to install.</li>\r\n 	<li>Mechanically polished perforated baskets make cleaning easier.</li>\r\n 	<li>Filtration accuracy is as low as 25 microns and the design pressure is from 6bar-21bar.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nFood and beverage sterilisation filtration, High-purity water terminal filtration, Chemical industry, Liquor/Wine canning filtration, Electronics, Petroleum, Automobile, Pulp and paper, Pharmaceutical industry.','<strong>Materials</strong>\r\n\r\nCarbon steel, 304 stainless steel, 316 stainless steel and other specific materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4166,'2024-12-01 21:58:51','2024-12-01 21:58:51'),(4168,'Plastic Housing(Big Blue)','plastic-housingbig-blue','<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n• Minimal operator and environmental exposure to process fuid\r\n• Quick and easy change-out of cartridge\r\n• Reduced cleaning time and costs between product changes\r\n• Fluid contact shell components manufactured from FDA/NSF\r\n• Low capital costs\r\n• Choice of depth and pleated flters\r\n• Available with a wide range of micron ratings\r\n• All polypropylene wetted parts for maximum compatibility\r\n• No adhesives used – all thermal weld construction\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<strong>Maximum Operating Conditions</strong> Maximum Temperature: 40°C Maximum Pressure: 6 bar g\r\n<strong>Materials of Construction</strong> Manifold Head: Glass flled polypropylene Assembly Shell: Polypropylene Seals: Viton <strong>Connections</strong> Inlet/Outlet: ¾” NPT Female Drain ports: ¼” NPT Male (Can be supplied blanked off) Width: 137 mm Length: 10” – 318 mm 20” – 572 mm\r\n<h2>Application</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Heavy Sediment Applications</li>\r\n 	<li>High-Flow Applications</li>\r\n</ul>','Offering the versatility to meet all of your large-capacity filtration needs, including high-flow and heavy-sediment applications. The extra large housing allows for greater cartridge capacity, reducing the number of vessels required for high flow-rate applications.\r\nWe offer and extensive range of plastic housings suitable for single and multiple cartridges, bag filters and large bore high flow cartridges.\r\nCustomization accepted.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?product=polyester-fiber-dust-collector-cartridge\">There is the link about the big blue cartridge.</a>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4169,'2024-12-01 22:00:09','2025-01-26 23:08:05'),(4172,'Sanitary Housing','sanitary-housing','<h2>Product Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Crevice free construction with hygienic single polished inlet/outlet port</li>\r\n 	<li>Quick release Vee clamp closure for ease of access – no seal required</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight easy lift dome</li>\r\n 	<li>No loose internals for trouble free operation</li>\r\n 	<li>ATEX compliant</li>\r\n 	<li>Specifically designed as a vent filter</li>\r\n 	<li>Single inlet/outlet that can be directly mounted onto tank</li>\r\n 	<li>Rated up to 150°C and available for 10” or 20” cartridges.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n1.Bayonet lock code 7 cartridge fitting as standard for forward and reverse flow\r\n2.316L construction for maximum corrosion resistance\r\n3.Every housing is etched with a serial number for full traceability\r\n4.Wide range of options available for the connection size and style, cartridge lengths and materials of construction\r\n5.Full housing customisation service available\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<strong>Maximum Operating Conditions</strong> Temperature Range: -10 / 150ºC\r\n<strong>Materials of Construction</strong> Body and Closure: 316L St. Steel Clamp: 304 St. Steel\r\n<strong>Finish</strong> Vessel: Base 0.8µm Ra (clean side) with electropolish Dome internally pickled with external bright polish Connections Inlet/Outlet: 1 ½” Tri Clamp','The single common inlet / outlet connection is suited for direct mounting on to most sealed storage vessels, whilst the quick release seal-less V-clamp closure allows for rapid filter change-outs. These housings are ideal where free movement of clean air is of prime importance.\r\nCustomization accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4173,'2024-12-01 22:02:21','2024-12-01 22:02:21'),(4176,'Single Cartridge Housing','single-cartridge-housing','<h2>Product Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Quick release Vee Clamp Closure for easy opening</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight, high specification investment cast head</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to use tie rod assembly design ensures cartridge centralisation (for a reliable knife edge seal) that enables the use of either 9.75” or 10” cartridge length configurations (or multiples) in the same housing</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual purpose head accepts SOE code 3 and DOE cartridges</li>\r\n 	<li>SOE code 7 and code B adaptors available</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in 316L stainless steel or Alloy 22 for maximum compatibility</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of connection size and types, cartridge lengths and materials of construction</li>\r\n 	<li>PED Compliant to Sound Engineering Practice</li>\r\n 	<li>Full traceability on all parts, material certification packs available</li>\r\n 	<li>Rated at full vacuum and 10 bar g in liquid and gases</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be supplied with a differential pressure gauge</li>\r\n 	<li>WRAS approved product</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n1.Investment Cast head (avoids the porosity &amp; inclusion problems associated with lower quality sand castings)\r\n2.Integral vent and drain sockets to aid efficient filter changeout complete with PTFE washer\r\n3.Unique interchangeable configuration enables choice of SOE or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing\r\n4.Every housing is etched with a serial number for full traceability\r\n5.Full housing customisation service available\r\n6.Available in both 316L Stainless Steel and Alloy 22\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<strong>Maximum Operating Conditions</strong> Pressure Range: Liquid: FV / 10 bar g Gas: FV / 10 bar g Temperature Range: -10ºC / 150ºC\r\n<strong>Materials of Construction</strong> Body and Closure: 316L St.Steel Alloy 22 Clamp: 304 St.Steel Seal: Ethylene Propylene\r\n<strong>Finish</strong> Vessel: Externally polished sump, bead blast head Connections Inlet/Outlet: 1” BSPF Vent: ¼” BSPF with Plug Drain: ¼” BSPF with Plug','We offer a wide range of housings suitable for smaller process flows where a single filter cartridge is required. This range includes high pressure versions, housings with integral viewing sections and housings with a unique closure to ensure operation is as easy as possible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4177,'2024-12-01 22:04:56','2024-12-01 22:04:57'),(4179,'Special and Custom Designs of Housing','special-and-custom-designs-of-housing','Philite Filters offers one of the widest ranges of standard filter housings available today and with many in stock for immediate shipping. We also have the capability to fully support the Process Industries and their Engineering Contactors in to large and specialised projects. We have the design and project management capability to deliver both large and complex systems where required. We have delivered small one-off laboratory rigs for pharmaceutical applications, bespoke housings specially designed to fit perfectly into OEM’s machines, large skid or container based solutions for water treatment and oil &amp; gas end users and many more.\r\n<h3>Example successful projects include:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Six-off 2m diameter vessels, 10 Barg rated in carbon steel with glass flake lining and super duplex internals. These were also designed with a user friendly quick opening closure. These were for an injection water filtration project on a major offshore floating oil facilities in South America.</li>\r\n 	<li>40-foot container fitted out with multiple filter housings manifolded together and fitted with control valves and autovents. The container was also installed with instrumentationand control interface, electrical supply, lighting and ventilation. This is being used to ensure drinking water supplied in the UK meets public health and regulatory standards.</li>\r\n 	<li>750mm diameter titanium filter housing used as part of the water injection system on a North Sea fixed platform. The titanium construction provided superior corrosion resistance in one of the harshest environments along with a significant weight reduction.</li>\r\n 	<li>Development of a bespoke housing with a unique closure design that provide significant benefits in ease of use. This provided a solution tailored to the customer’s requirements where no alternatives were commercially available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Full Life Cycle Support – the Amazon Difference</h3>\r\nFull support is offered in delivering a cost effective, fully functioning and optimal solution, from the moment of first enquiry. During initial discussions our experienced applications team liaise with the client to ensure they fully understand the project targets with the aim of offering the best solution. Following this Amazon prepares a detailed technical and commercial proposal for evaluation. Once agreement to proceed is obtained, a dedicated project engineer is appointed to act a co-ordinator and point of contact for the duration of the contract. Our documentation team shall ensure that a bespoke package to suit your individual requirements is supplied, which for large projects can run into hundreds of pages of material certificates, calculations, procedures, and test reports. As an expert in the design and manufacture of pressure vessels and supporting systems, as well as a manufacturer of filter media, Amazon are ideally placed to provide an optimal solution, ensuring cost, design and performance targets are fully realised.\r\n<h3>Capabilities</h3>\r\nOur experienced design team use the latest 3D modelling software to present a layout to the client prior to the commencement of manufacture. Pressure vessel calculations are carried our using a combination of proprietary and industry standard software, and housings can be offered to ASME VIII, ASME X, PD:5500, or EN:13445. For skid or container mounted systems full lift, load, and motion calculations can be carried out to meet with the most stringent requirements.','Engineering Contractors and project teams in Process Companies commonly will find an off the shelf solution when looking for filtration systems. Where the project is very large or unusual, standard products may be far from the ideal so a bespoke system is needed. Waterfiltech Filters is well placed to satisfy both of these requirements.\r\nCustomization accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4180,'2024-12-01 22:06:22','2024-12-01 22:06:22'),(4183,'Stainless steel cartridge housing','stainless-steel-cartridge-housing','<h2>Single Cartridge Housing Product Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Quick release Vee Clamp Closure for easy opening</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight, high specification investment cast head</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to use tie rod assembly design ensures cartridge centralisation (for a reliable knife edge seal) that enables the use of either 9.75” or 10” cartridge length configurations (or multiples) in the same housing</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual purpose head accepts SOE code 3 and DOE cartridges</li>\r\n 	<li>SOE code 7 and code B adaptors available</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in 316L stainless steel or Alloy 22 for maximum compatibility</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of connection size and types, cartridge lengths and materials of construction</li>\r\n 	<li>PED Compliant to Sound Engineering Practice</li>\r\n 	<li>Full traceability on all parts, material certification packs available</li>\r\n 	<li>Rated at full vacuum and 10 bar g in liquid and gases</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be supplied with a differential pressure gauge</li>\r\n 	<li>WRAS approved product</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n1.Investment Cast head (avoids the porosity &amp; inclusion problems associated with lower quality sand castings)\r\n2.Integral vent and drain sockets to aid efficient filter changeout complete with PTFE washer\r\n3.Unique interchangeable configuration enables choice of SOE or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing\r\n4.Every housing is etched with a serial number for full traceability\r\n5.Full housing customisation service available\r\n6.Available in both 316L Stainless Steel and Alloy 22\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<strong>Maximum Operating Conditions</strong> Pressure Range: Liquid: FV / 10 bar g Gas: FV / 10 bar g Temperature Range: -10ºC / 150ºC\r\n<strong>Materials of Construction</strong> Body and Closure: 316L St.Steel Alloy 22 Clamp: 304 St.Steel Seal: Ethylene Propylene\r\n<strong>Finish</strong> Vessel: Externally polished sump, bead blast head Connections Inlet/Outlet: 1” BSPF Vent: ¼” BSPF with Plug Drain: ¼” BSPF with Plug\r\n<h2>Multi Cartridge Housing Product Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Free standing, easy to install design</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal cup allows the use of plug in or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing</li>\r\n 	<li>Vee clamp closures use unique ‘W’ style seal for reliable leak free operation</li>\r\n 	<li>High quality cast Vee band clamps for safety and security</li>\r\n 	<li>Cast compression nut with integral PTFE washer for easy, hand tight cartridge sealing</li>\r\n 	<li>Wide range of connection sizes and types, cartridge lengths and materials of construction</li>\r\n 	<li>PED and ATEX Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Features and Benefits</h2>\r\n1.Integral vent, clean and dirty drain sockets to aid efficient filter changeout\r\n2.Universal cup enables choice of plug in (Code 3, Code 8 and Code A) or DOE cartridge styles in the same housing\r\n3.Bolted closure options available\r\n4.Every housing is etched with a unique serial number for full traceability\r\n5.Available in 316L Stainless Steel\r\n6.Full housing customisation service available\r\n7.Internally and externally electropolished as standard','We offer a wide range of housings suitable for smaller process flows where a single filter cartridge is required. This range includes high pressure versions, housings with integral viewing sections and housings with a unique closure to ensure operation is as easy as possible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4184,'2024-12-01 22:07:39','2024-12-01 22:07:39'),(4186,'Top closure housing-V-clamp','top-closure-housing-v-clamp','Top closure housings 3round/4&amp;5round/7round\r\n● Design for Industrial &amp; commercial applications with Non-Code.\r\n● Side in,Side out &amp; Band V-clamp top closure\r\n● Max. working pressure &amp; temperature: 150psi &amp; 250°F\r\n● Material grade: SS304/316L heavy duty construction\r\n● O-ring: Standard is Buna-N; EPDM, Viton, Teflon is option\r\n● Finish: standard is poly coat, electro polished is option.\r\n● Connection: standard is 2″MNPT thread, MBSP/ Flange/Victaulic/Tri-clamp is option\r\n● Cartridge: DOE , 10-40″melt blown &amp; wound cartridge\r\n● 1/2″drain &amp; 1/4″ NPT vent or gauge.','Designed for industrial and commercial water treatment, specially projected for easy cartridge change out, side in and side out for easy pipe works, various pipe fitting options.\r\nCustomization accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4187,'2024-12-01 22:08:51','2024-12-01 22:08:52'),(4190,'Water Softening Equipment','water-softening-equipment','<h2>Technical data</h2>\r\nDesign pressure :0.34mpa(50psi)\r\nWorking temperature:25℃\r\nTank material :FRP/SUS 304\r\nDesign Flow:0.5-10 m³/h\r\nOperating ways:automatic\r\nRaw water hardness:≤8mmol/L\r\n<h2>Feature</h2>\r\nSafe and environmental protection:pump body of lead free brass or without salt. Electrical saving and easy installation Anti corrosion body:adopt stainless steel,FRP, steel lining plastic material to avoid Avoid resin pollution\r\n<h2>Application</h2>\r\nDrinking water desalting,household water softening Boiled feed water supply and other soft water use House ,villa,office , cafe,restaurant,etc.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4191,'2024-12-01 22:10:15','2024-12-01 22:10:15'),(4193,'Water Tank','water-tank','<h2>Technical data</h2>\r\nDesign pressure:ordinary Working temperature:5-45℃ Surface treatment:wire drawing and mirror polishing Inside treatment:rubber lining/plastic lining/mirror polishing\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\nFood grade materials ,no corrosion, no secondary pollution Girth weld,without dead angle,easy to wash Well sealed to guarantee no water leakage\r\n<h2>Application</h2>\r\nchemical manufacturing Irrigation agricultural food preparation fire suppression drinking water','Durable, flexible fit out designs, wide variety of outlet sizes, various materials available to suit application.\r\nCustomization accepted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4194,'2024-12-01 22:11:23','2024-12-01 22:11:24'),(4200,'Mobile Integrated Sludge Dewatering System','mobile-integrated-sludge-dewatering-system','<h2>consisting of</h2>\r\nbeltpress\r\n\r\npolymer preparation / dosing system\r\n\r\nsludge feeding pump\r\n\r\npolymerdosing pump\r\n\r\ncleaning water pump\r\n\r\nair compressor\r\n\r\noutside customized container\r\n\r\nrelevant pipelines\r\n\r\ncontrol cabinet\r\n<h2>Technical data</h2>\r\nThroughput:                                     1.9 – 50 m3/hr\r\n\r\nBelt width:                                        300-1500 mm\r\n\r\nDried sludge handling capacity:       30-460kg/hr\r\n\r\nOutlet-DS:                                        18 – 35%\r\n\r\nPolymer consumption:                      3 – 7 kg/t DS\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\nOpen construction completely enclosed\r\n\r\nLow-wear and low-noise operation modedue to slow running of the machinery\r\n\r\nContinuous and fully automaticoperation\r\n\r\nLow labour costs\r\n\r\nHigh DS-concentration of the productsenables a reduction of disposal costs\r\n\r\nMaintenance-friendly design\r\n\r\nLow energy consumption\r\n<h2>Applications</h2>\r\nSmall wastewater treatment plants\r\n\r\nTemporary slurry centralized treatment site\r\n\r\nWastewater treatment plantsseasonally insufficient in sludge dewatering ability\r\n\r\nMechanical dewatering of sludge fromtunnelling ,drilling and river\r\n\r\nTest run available for dewatering ofmunicipal and industrial sewage','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',NULL,'2024-12-01 22:15:50','2024-12-01 22:15:50'),(4207,'Screw Conveyor WLS series','screw-conveyor-wls-series','<h2>Screw conveyor consists of</h2>\r\nSpiral\r\ninlet and outlet mouth\r\na trough or tube\r\ncover plates, base\r\ninside liner andmotor unit\r\n<h2>The working principle of screw conveyor</h2>\r\nScrew conveyors in modern industry are often used horizontally or at a slight inclineas an efficient way to move semi-solid materials, including food waste, woodchips, aggregates,cereal grains,animal feed, boiler ash, meat and bone meal, municipal solid waste, and many others.\r\n\r\nThey usually consist of a trough or tube containing either a spiral blade coiledaround a shaft, driven at one end and held at the other, or a “shaftlessspiral”, driven at one end and free at the other. The rate of volumetransfer is proportional to the rotation rate of the shaft. In industrialcontrol applications the device is often used as avariable rate feeder by varying therotation rate of the shaft to deliver a measured rate or quantity of materialinto a process.\r\n<h2>Features of screw convey</h2>\r\nSimplestructure\r\n\r\nReliable\r\n\r\nGoodsealing\r\n\r\nEasyto load and unload','Screw conveyors in modern industry are often used horizontally or at a slight inclineas an efficient way to move semi-solid materials, including food waste, woodchips, aggregates,cereal grains,animal feed, boiler ash, meat and bone meal, municipal solid waste, and many others.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',NULL,'2024-12-01 22:19:57','2024-12-01 22:19:57'),(4210,'Sludge Thickener','sludge-thickener','<h2>Features</h2>\r\n1. Drum sieve with spiralblades, arranged in a certain angle. Only in this way can increase drag and time for sludge to stay on the screen, and then achieve better effect of thickening. (Drum Thickener)\r\n\r\n2. Drum sieve can adopt belt cloth because our products are sometimes related to food, such as sodiumchloride, if using stainless steel, screen will be corroded. (Drum Thickener)\r\n\r\n3. Drive bearings adoptt in bronze (graphite) self-lubrication copper sleeve, thereby reducing the operation fault of the machine. (Drum Thickener)\r\n\r\n4. Nylon oil tug service life is 10 times more than ordinary PP round and small noise when operating.(Drum Thickener)\r\n\r\n5. Bearing, belt cloth adopt international brands, to ensure the normal operation of equipment. ( Belt Filter Type Thickener)\r\n\r\n6. Requirements for PAMselection are not too strict, the amount of dosing can moderately be reduced.In the late run, costs can be well controlled. (Belt Filter Type Thickener)\r\n<h2>Applications</h2>\r\nSewage treatment, chemical\r\n\r\nTextile, printing and dyeing, paper making\r\n\r\nLeather, pharmaceuticals, wine\r\n\r\nFarms, etc., to replace the traditional thickener','we develp anautomatic sludge thickener which can continuously thicken the sludge steadilyin place of conventional sludge thickening pool in the long-term practice.\r\n\r\nSludge thickeners aredivided into two types: rotary drum sludge thickener and gravity belt sludgethickener. Haibar adopts international advanced technology and design conceptsto meet the needs of the different natures of sewage in different industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4211,'2024-12-01 22:21:09','2024-12-01 22:21:10'),(4213,'Thickeners (HNS& HBT Series)','thickeners-hns-hbt-series','<h2>1.HNS Series Rotary Drum Thickener</h2>\r\nAn HNS series thickeners works with a rotary drum thickening process to obtain a high solid content treatment effect.\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Higher than 96% solid recovery rate</li>\r\n 	<li>Steady operation with little to no noise</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy operation and maintenance ensures a long service life</li>\r\n 	<li>The perfect thickening effect can easily even out the varying sludge concentrations</li>\r\n 	<li>A 40% output capacity is larger than other machines that occupy the same amount of floor space</li>\r\n 	<li>The costs of land, construction and labor are all saved as this machine takes up less floor space with its simple structure, small flocculent requirements and fully automatic operation.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2>Working Principle</h2>\r\nThe slurry and flocculating polymer are poured into the conditioning tank of the rotary drum sludge thickener for uniform agitation. Then, the hardly dehydrated floc granules are formed, and flow into a drum for sludge-water separation. The conditioned sludge is guided into the fine mesh of the drum. A large amount of supernatant free water will be filtered, when a centrifuge rotates slowly under conditions of the rotational speed of 22r. p. m. and power of 0.37kW per unit.\r\n\r\nAs a result, the slurry is thickened. The processing capacity of our rotary drum sludge thickener is improved, and the operating time is shortened. The separated sludge can highly reduce the load of the belt for permeating water. Meanwhile, the sludge group is constructed firmly. No sheet-flood or side-overflow phenomenon will occur. Then, the dehydration efficiency is enhanced, and the water content rate is lowered. After separation, the solids content of the free water varies from 0.5‰ to 1‰, which is closely related with the dosage and types pf the polymer.\r\n\r\nThe semi-centrifugal rotary drum thickener can filter the free water by means of external force. It has high requirements for the polymer and the binding force of sludge. In comparison with the belt thickening machine, our rotary drum sludge thickener can offer the thickened sludge with lower water content. The sludge with its water content of over 1.5% is a better choice.\r\n\r\n<strong>Belt Cleaning Device of the HNS Conditioning Tank</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4216\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/belt-cleaning-device1-300x225-detail1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4217\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/belt-cleaning-device2-300x226-detail2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"226\" />\r\n\r\nThe filter cloth imported from Germany features great air permeability, practical use, and long lifespan.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4218\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/conditioning-tank-300x225-detail3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />\r\n\r\nThe sludge outlet and perspective window of the HNS-80 series rotary drum sludge thickener are specially designed for observing the operation of our equipment.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4219\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/sludge-outlet-300x225-detail4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4220\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/perspective-window-300x226-detail5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"226\" />\r\n<h2>Application:</h2>\r\nFor the various Industry Waste Slurry pre-thickening Treatment.\r\n\r\nFor the solid and liquid separation of the industrial processing treatment of the paper&amp;pulp, Fiber, Chemical, Food, Plastic, Metallurgy, Mining… etc. Industries.\r\n\r\nFor the raw material processing filtering-recovering of the brewing, flavoring, stuffing, starch factory and the various food-processing factory.\r\n\r\nThe filtering before tap-water intaking, the filtering-recovering of the rainwater.\r\n\r\nThe solid and liquid separation of the fruit processing industry, vegetable processing industry.\r\n\r\nThe engineering drainage and large-size water treatment of the municipal sewage, paper&amp;pulp industry sewage, fiber industry sewage, chemical industry sewage… etc.\r\n\r\nThe filter- removing of the dross pellet of the winery industry, pickled industry.\r\n<h2>Technical Data</h2>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4221\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/technical-data-detail6-300x165.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"731\" height=\"402\" />\r\n<h2>2. HBT Series Gravity Belt Thickener</h2>\r\nAn HBT series thickener works with a gravity belt type thickening process in order to obtain a high solid content treatment effect. Polymer costs are reduced due to the lowered number of flocculants required than a rotary drum thickener, through this machine takes up a slightly larger floor space. It is ideal for sludge treatment when the sludge concentration is below 1%.\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for a variety of sludge types, even when the moisture content within the sludge is 99.6%.</li>\r\n 	<li>Greater than 96% solid recovery rate.</li>\r\n 	<li>Steady operation with little to no noise.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy operation and maintenance ensures the long service life.</li>\r\n 	<li>The sludge thickener perfects the thickening process even when the sludge concentration varies.</li>\r\n 	<li>There is a 40% larger output capacity than other machines that occupy the same amount of floor space.</li>\r\n 	<li>Costs for land, construction, operation and labor are lowered due to the smaller space occupation, simple structure, less flocculants required and fully automatic operation.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2>Components</h2>\r\nOur gravity belt sludge thickener comes with superior quality gearmotor, rollers, filtering belt, and robust construction. It is also installed with stainless steel nozzles to clean the belt during operation, which can guarantee the continual performance of the belt thickener. The belt is aligned by the air cylinders automatically during the operation. It is tensioned either by mechanical springs with low investment, or by air cylinders for automatic operation.\r\n<h2>Working Principle</h2>\r\nThe gravity belt sludge thickener depends on the gravity force to remove water from the sludge through a single woven cloth belt. Firstly, the slurry and flocculating polymer are evenly mixed in the conditioning tank. They become solid floc granules that can be easily dewatered after agitation. Then, they flow into the gravity drainage zone.\r\n\r\nThe flocculated sludge is uniformly distributed on the filtering belt. During the operating of belt, free water is removed from sludge by gravity through a fine mesh of the filtering belt. During the moving of sludge, special plows continuously turn and distribute the sludge across the width of the belt. The residual free water is further eliminated to achieve the sludge thickening process. In this way, the gravity belt sludge thickener allows both processing time and water content rate to be greatly reduced.\r\n\r\nAfter filtration, the solids content of free water ranges from 0.5‰ to 1‰, which is closely related with the types and dosage of the polymer purchased.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4222\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/HBT2-detail7-300x69.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"161\" />\r\n<h2>Applications:</h2>\r\nFor the various industrial waste slurry pre-thickening treatment.\r\n\r\nFor the solid and liquid separation of the industrial processing treatment of the paper&amp;pulp ,fiber, chemical, food, plastic, metallurgy, mining…etc. Industries.\r\n<h2>Technical Data</h2>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4223\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/hbt-technical-data-detail8-300x113.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"279\" />','First, now the landresources are more precious, traditional thickening pool covers a relatively large area, construction cost is high,thickening effect is not very stable, which needs more polymer amount. The costof running in the late phase will be very high. The thickener covers arelatively small area, the construction cost and the flocculant requirement areboth small, thus the operation cost will be reduced.\r\n\r\nSecond, now the laborcost is the most expensive. The biggest advantage of thickeners is achievingfully automatic operation, without the need for personnel on duty, but also toensure the work efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4214,'2024-12-01 22:27:23','2024-12-01 22:27:23'),(4226,'Folding Filter Cartridge','folding-filter-cartridge','<h3>Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Deep filtration, excellent filtration performance, high precision and the interception efficiency, high pollution absorption, long service life, high flow rate, low pressure loss.</li>\r\n 	<li> Good chemical compatibility, suitable for a variety of liquid filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Without adding any adhesive and active agent, effectively reduce the risk of precipitation of the filter element itself, to ensure the use of safety.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nSewage treatment, Electronics industry, Beverage industry, Pharmaceutical industry, Chemical industry, Organic solvent, Ink, Plating solution and other liquid filtration.','<strong>Materials</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>PP (polypropylene).</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass.</li>\r\n 	<li>PES.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nylon.</li>\r\n 	<li>PVDF.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4227,'2024-12-01 22:30:54','2024-12-01 22:30:54'),(4229,'FT dust collector high efficiency long filter cartridge','ft-dust-collector-high-efficiency-long-filter-cartridge','<h2>Properties and features</h2>\r\n1 .Matching with filterbag tubeplate aperture\r\n2.Imported polyester non-woven filter material, air flow, low resistance filtration efficiency.\r\n3.PTFE film filter filtration efficiency of 99%\r\n4 .The filter cartridge installation is simple and convenient , reliable seal\r\n5.According to the needs of customers,can choose a different form of installation, so that the replacement of the filter can be the most simple,the fastest.\r\n<h2>Application scope</h2>\r\nMainly apply to electric power, Metallurgy,chemical industry,machinery manufacturing industry’s dust management.\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"145\">Filtration area</td>\r\n<td width=\"144\">Temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Length</td>\r\n<td width=\"149\">Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"217\">Air permeability</td>\r\n<td width=\"263\">Material</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 1</td>\r\n<td>2.3m²</td>\r\n<td>135℃</td>\r\n<td>1m</td>\r\n<td>270g/m²</td>\r\n<td>1.2m³/m²/min@12mmWC</td>\r\n<td>spun bond polyester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 2</td>\r\n<td>4.6m²</td>\r\n<td>135℃</td>\r\n<td>2m</td>\r\n<td>270g/m²</td>\r\n<td>1.2m³/m²/min@12mmWC</td>\r\n<td>spun bond polyester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 3</td>\r\n<td>2.3m²</td>\r\n<td>135℃</td>\r\n<td>1m</td>\r\n<td>270g/m²</td>\r\n<td>1.2m³/m²/min@12mmWC</td>\r\n<td>Anti-static spun bond polyester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 4</td>\r\n<td>4.6m²</td>\r\n<td>135℃</td>\r\n<td>2m</td>\r\n<td>270g/m²</td>\r\n<td>1.2m³/m²/min@12mmWC</td>\r\n<td>Anti-static spun bond polyester</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 5</td>\r\n<td>2.3m²</td>\r\n<td>135℃</td>\r\n<td>1m</td>\r\n<td>270g/m²</td>\r\n<td>1.2m³/m²/min@12mmWC</td>\r\n<td>spun bond polyester+PTFE</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 6</td>\r\n<td>4.6m²</td>\r\n<td>135℃</td>\r\n<td>2m</td>\r\n<td>270g/m²</td>\r\n<td>1.2m³/m²/min@12mmWC</td>\r\n<td>spun bond polyester+PTFE</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Our FT dust collector long filter cartridge boasts for its long life and high filtration efficiency, up to 99%. Matching with filterbag tubeplate aperture, it is mainly applied to electric power, Metallurgy,chemical industry,machinery manufacturing industry’s dust management.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4230,'2024-12-01 22:32:05','2024-12-01 22:32:05'),(4232,'Gas turbine filter cartridge','gas-turbine-filter-cartridge','<h2>Properties and Features</h2>\r\n1.Imported superfine fiberglass filter material ,double-layer design,stiffness ,good air permeability,dust nano filtration,efficiency more than F9, to ensure the normal operation of gas turbine.\r\n2.The rubber sealing ring of stability ,good rebound to ensure the sealing effect.\r\n3.Metal end cap and frame electric galvanized treatment, acid and alkali corrosion,not rust\r\n4.Adopt the wide range design, the max of the filter cylinder air permeability\r\n5.The bottle of rubber seal installed with the gasket, so that the performance more reliable\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Shape</td>\r\n<td width=\"145\">External diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"144\">Inner diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Length</td>\r\n<td width=\"149\">Surface filtration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 1</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>559mm</td>\r\n<td>18m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 2</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ352mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>660mm</td>\r\n<td>21m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 3</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>700mm</td>\r\n<td>22.3m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 4</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>735mm</td>\r\n<td>23.5m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 5</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ408mm(φ445mm)</td>\r\n<td>φ293mm(φ330mm)</td>\r\n<td>875mm</td>\r\n<td>33.2m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 5</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ408mm(φ445mm)</td>\r\n<td>φ293mm(φ330mm)</td>\r\n<td>559mm</td>\r\n<td>21.6m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 5</td>\r\n<td>Cylinder</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>865mm</td>\r\n<td>25m²</td>\r