 resistance and dust release properties . The filtration surface of our products range from 9.4m² to 13.4m². <a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=plastic-housingbig-blue\">There is a link for big blue.</a>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4256,'2024-12-01 22:44:26','2024-12-01 22:44:27'),(4258,'PU dust collector filter cartridge','pu-dust-collector-filter-cartridge','<h2>Properties and Features</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>the use of polyurethane integration pouring, the solidity of the colloid can be adjusted</li>\r\n 	<li>the central skeleton of  the use of plastic production, good intensity, conductive to recycling</li>\r\n 	<li>the filter material, anti-acid, oil, water proof, anti-static,</li>\r\n 	<li>folding design, cleaning effect better</li>\r\n 	<li>good sealing performance, low deformation rate, cleaning and reuse,</li>\r\n 	<li>adaptation bag board hole,substitute for hop-pocket installation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"145\">Filtration area</td>\r\n<td width=\"144\">Length</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"149\">Air permeability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 1</td>\r\n<td>2.1m²</td>\r\n<td>1m</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"3\">≤93℃</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"3\">1.2m³/m²/min</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 2</td>\r\n<td>4.2m²</td>\r\n<td>2m</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 3</td>\r\n<td>1.2m²</td>\r\n<td>0.5m</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4259,'2024-12-01 22:45:35','2024-12-01 22:45:35'),(4262,'Sheet Depth Filter Modules','sheet-depth-filter-modules','<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Can be washed under certain conditions to prolong the service life.</li>\r\n 	<li>Simple, quick installation and servicing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Heat disinfection or hot filter fluid has no effect on the filter board.</li>\r\n 	<li>Increased filtration security: Separator board support the filter board enhances the stability of the filter cartridge.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nBeer, Wine, Enzymes filtration.','Deep membrane reactor filter core with deep filter cardboard as filter material, through mechanical interception, electrostatic adsorption and other actions to filter impurities and micro-organisms in the liquid.\r\n\r\n<strong>Material: </strong>Cellulose fibers, Kieselguhr, PerliteKieselguhr, Resi.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4263,'2024-12-01 22:46:57','2024-12-01 22:46:57'),(4265,'Stainless Steel Sintered Filter Cartridge','stainless-steel-sintered-filter-cartridge','<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Strong acid and alkali resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>High temperature and pressure resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be washed and regenerated repeatedly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nSteam filtration, Strong acid and alkali filtration, Filtration of highly corrosive materials, Filtration of high temperature and high pressure materials, Liquid decarburization filtration.','<strong>Material: </strong>SUS304, SUS316L.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4266,'2024-12-01 22:48:02','2024-12-01 22:48:03'),(4268,'Titanium Rod Filter Cartridge','titanium-rod-filter-cartridge','<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Good permeability, good chemical stability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Strong acid and alkali resistance, strong oxidation resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>High temperature and pressure resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be washed and regenerated repeatedly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nDecarbonization filtration; Steam filtration; Filtration of strong acid and alkali materials; High temperature gas and liquid filtration.','<strong>Material: </strong>Titanium powder.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4269,'2024-12-01 22:49:00','2024-12-01 22:49:00'),(4271,'Wire-wound Cartridge','wire-wound-cartridge','<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Wire-wound filter cartridge is composed of textile fiber yarn tightly wound on the porous skeleton, which controls the winding density of the filter layer and the shape of the filter hole to form the filter cartridge with different filtering accuracy.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can withstand high filtration pressure.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be made of a variety of materials to meet the needs of various liquid filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>The structure of the filter aperture is dense inside and sparse outside, with good deep filtering effect.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can remove suspended solids and particles in the liquid, with small pressure drop and large contaminant capacity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nElectroplating, Mining, Machining, Petrochemical, Industrial water treatment.','<strong>Material</strong>\r\n\r\nPP, Fiberglass, Absorbent cotton.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4272,'2024-12-01 22:50:03','2024-12-01 22:50:03'),(4275,'Wood pulp cellulose air filter cartridge','wood-pulp-cellulose-air-filter-cartridge','<h2>Properties and Features</h2>\r\nSuitable for the filtration of fine dust type in gas turbines, compressors, shot blast, tobacoo, pulverized and floating dust collection. .Imported cellulose fiber or synthetic fiber for base media. excellent filter efficiency. Wide plate spacing, great filter surface. Electrichemical plate top and bottom, no rust. Perforated zinc galvanized metal inner core, allows good airflow. Specialty chlorine rubber gasket to ensure airtight sealing. Applicable temperature: ≤ 80℃\r\n<h2>Application scope</h2>\r\n1.Blast-furnace air of steel companies\r\n2.Filtering the intake air of the air separation plant at the oxygen production factory\r\n3.Filtering the fresh air of gas turbine\r\n4.Filtering the fresh air of air conditioners\r\n5.Chemical engineering ,pharmacy and food etc, which have strict requirement for air quality.\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"145\">External diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"144\">Inner diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Length</td>\r\n<td width=\"149\">Surface filtration</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 1</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>660mm</td>\r\n<td>21m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 2</td>\r\n<td>φ352mm</td>\r\n<td>φ241mm</td>\r\n<td>660mm</td>\r\n<td>23m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 3</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>750mm</td>\r\n<td>26m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 4</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>880mm</td>\r\n<td>27m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Type 5</td>\r\n<td>φ324mm</td>\r\n<td>φ213mm</td>\r\n<td>1000mm</td>\r\n<td>28m²</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Our Wood pulp cellulose air filter cartridge used  cellulose fiber or synthetic fiber for base media which is excellent in filter efficiency. It is suitable for the filtration of fine dust type in gas turbines, compressors, shot blast, tobacoo, pulverized and floating dust collection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4276,'2024-12-01 22:51:09','2024-12-01 22:51:09'),(4278,'Meta-Aramid Fibers','meta-aramid-fibers','<h2>Ⅰ. Introduction</h2>\r\n1.The products are natural white fibers.\r\n\r\n2.The cross sections of the fibers are flat cashew-like. The fibers own large specific surface area, which can improve the filtration efficiency.\r\n\r\n3.The surface of the fibers is rough, which means the fibers own good dyeability, and so the fabrics therefrom are easily dyed.\r\n\r\n4.The fibers own excellent thermal stability. The fibers can be long-time serviced under the temperature of 205 degrees. The fibers carbonate near the temperature of 400 degrees, and the carbonization layer can efficiently obstruct thermal transportation.\r\n\r\n5.The fibers own good flame retardancy, and they are self-extinguishing after being deviated from fire, without\r\n\r\nmelting and dropping. So, the fibers are ingrain flame retardant material.\r\n\r\n6.The fibers own excellent electric insulation performance under various conditions, such as high or low temperature, and high humidity.\r\n\r\n7.The fibers own good mechanical properties, with low rigidity and high elongation.\r\n\r\n8.The fibers are safe, environmental-friendly, chemical corrosion-resistant. The fibers are SGS REACH certified.\r\n<h2>Ⅱ. Mechanical Properties</h2>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"9\">Mechanical properties of meta-aramid fibers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Linear density</td>\r\n<td>D</td>\r\n<td>1.0</td>\r\n<td>1.5</td>\r\n<td>2.0</td>\r\n<td>2.2</td>\r\n<td>2.5</td>\r\n<td>5.0</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"3\">Testing Standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>dtex</td>\r\n<td>1.10</td>\r\n<td>1.65</td>\r\n<td>2.20</td>\r\n<td>2.42</td>\r\n<td>2.75</td>\r\n<td>5.50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Length</td>\r\n<td>mm</td>\r\n<td>38/51</td>\r\n<td>38/51</td>\r\n<td>51/76</td>\r\n<td>51/76</td>\r\n<td>51/76</td>\r\n<td>76</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CV of Linear density</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>±12</td>\r\n<td>±12</td>\r\n<td>±12</td>\r\n<td>±12</td>\r\n<td>±12</td>\r\n<td>±12</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14335</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>CV of length</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>±3</td>\r\n<td>±3</td>\r\n<td>±3</td>\r\n<td>±3</td>\r\n<td>±3</td>\r\n<td>±3</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14336</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Strength</td>\r\n<td>cN/dtex</td>\r\n<td>≥3.50</td>\r\n<td>≥3.50</td>\r\n<td>≥3.50</td>\r\n<td>≥3.50</td>\r\n<td>≥3.50</td>\r\n<td>≥3.60</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14337</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>cN/D</td>\r\n<td>≥3.85</td>\r\n<td>≥3.85</td>\r\n<td>≥3.85</td>\r\n<td>≥3.85</td>\r\n<td>≥3.85</td>\r\n<td>≥3.96</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14337</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Elongation</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>25-45</td>\r\n<td>25-45</td>\r\n<td>25-45</td>\r\n<td>25-45</td>\r\n<td>25-45</td>\r\n<td>25-45</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14337</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Overlength fiber ratio</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>≤0.3</td>\r\n<td>≤0.3</td>\r\n<td>≤0.3</td>\r\n<td>≤0.3</td>\r\n<td>≤0.3</td>\r\n<td>≤0.3</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14336</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Weight ration of overlength fiber</td>\r\n<td>Mg/100g</td>\r\n<td>≤7</td>\r\n<td>≤7</td>\r\n<td>≤7</td>\r\n<td>≤7</td>\r\n<td>≤7</td>\r\n<td>≤7</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14336</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Crimp frequency</td>\r\n<td>Pcs/25mm</td>\r\n<td>8.0-14.0</td>\r\n<td>8.0-14.0</td>\r\n<td>8.0-14.0</td>\r\n<td>8.0-14.0</td>\r\n<td>8.0-14.0</td>\r\n<td>8.0-14.0</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14338</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Defect</td>\r\n<td>Mg/100g</td>\r\n<td>≤15</td>\r\n<td>≤15</td>\r\n<td>≤15</td>\r\n<td>≤15</td>\r\n<td>≤15</td>\r\n<td>≤15</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 14339</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Regain</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>5.0-8.0</td>\r\n<td>5.0-8.0</td>\r\n<td>5.0-8.0</td>\r\n<td>5.0-8.0</td>\r\n<td>5.0-8.0</td>\r\n<td>5.0-8.0</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 6503</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Oil content</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>0.5-1.0</td>\r\n<td>0.5-1.0</td>\r\n<td>0.5-1.0</td>\r\n<td>0.5-1.0</td>\r\n<td>0.5-1.0</td>\r\n<td>0.5-1.0</td>\r\n<td>GB/T 6504</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Drying shrinkage(300℃)</td>\r\n<td>%</td>\r\n<td>≤4</td>\r\n<td>≤4</td>\r\n<td>≤4</td>\r\n<td>≤4</td>\r\n<td>≤4</td>\r\n<td>≤4</td>\r\n<td>PZB-QM-WI-002</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Ⅲ. Shape of fibers</h2>\r\nThe cross-section of Philite meta-aramid fibers is cashew-like, confirmed by the third-party detection institution, as shown in Figure 1.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4280\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/间位芳纶显微镜图-detail1_syy-300x226.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"879\" height=\"662\" />\r\n\r\nFigure 1 The cross-section of Philite meta-aramid fibers.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4281\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/间位芳纶纤维截面图1-1536x1153-detail2_syy-300x225.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"881\" height=\"661\" />\r\n\r\nFigure 2 The surface of Philite meta-aramid fibers.\r\n<h2>IV. Thermal Decomposition Temperature</h2>\r\nThe primary thermal decomposition temperature of PHILITE meta-aramid fibers is 423.94℃, confirmed by the third-party detection institution, and the TGA curve is shown in Figure 3.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4282\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/图表-detail3-300x184.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"884\" height=\"542\" />\r\n\r\nFigure 3 TGA Curve of Philite meta-aramid fibers.\r\n<h2>V. Applications</h2>\r\nPhilite meta-aramid fibers own excellent comprehensive properties, such as high-temperature resistant, flame retardant, electric insulating, corrosion resistant, radiation resistant, easy spinning, easy dyeable, etc. The woven fabrics can be made into special protective clothing, which are widely used in metallurgy, construction, shipbuilding, petroleum, electric power, chemical industry, forestry, fire protection, etc. The fibers can also process into needled non-woven fabrics and woven filter fabrics in the application of the high temperature flue gas filtration, such as metallurgy, cement industry, construction industry. The needled non-woven fabrics can also be process into high temperature-resistance conveyor belt, such as endless conveyer belt and sleeve. They can also be made into textile high-speed printed carpet. The fibers can be process into insulation paper and honeycomb core by proper papermaking technology.\r\n<h2>VI. Product Dimensions</h2>\r\nTable 3 Dimensions of the Crimped Fibers\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"65\">Linear density</td>\r\n<td width=\"36\">D</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">5.0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"36\">dtex</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.10</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.10</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.65</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">1.65</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.20</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.20</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.42</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.42</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.75</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">2.75</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">5.50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Length</td>\r\n<td width=\"36\">mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">38</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">51</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">38</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">51</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">51</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">76</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">51</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">76</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">51</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">76</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">76</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"36\">kg</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','Philite meta-aramid fibers own excellent comprehensive properties, such as high-temperature resistant, flame retardant, electric insulating, corrosion resistant, radiation resistant, easy spinning, easy dyeable, etc. The woven fabrics can be made into special protective clothing, which are widely used in metallurgy, construction, shipbuilding, petroleum, electric power, chemical industry, forestry, fire protection, etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4279,'2024-12-01 23:02:22','2024-12-01 23:02:22'),(4285,'Oil-water separation Fiber (Super Absorbent Fiber)','oil-water-separation-fiber-super-absorbent-fiber','<h2>Useful facts</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Available in a wide range of highly absorbent grades</li>\r\n 	<li>A non-irritant</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be used in applications demanding robust toxicological profiling</li>\r\n 	<li>FDA approved</li>\r\n 	<li>Does not melt. It begins to decompose extremely slowly at temperatures &gt;200°C</li>\r\n 	<li>Fibre density is approximately 1.4g/ml</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be blended with a range of synthetic and natural fibers to meet customers end requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Main Products Specification</h2>\r\nShort staple products (for direct dosing and air-laid processing)\r\n\r\nLong staple products (for dry-laid nonwovens and yarns)\r\n<h2>Application</h2>\r\n<strong>1.Medical</strong>\r\n\r\nMedical super absorbent dressings are designed to present correct moisture conditions around wounds without resulting in actual wetting. The fabric allows for the rapid uptake and retention of exudates from the infected area. As a result, this helps promote an optimum healing environment and limits further bacterial growth. Such medical superabsorbents can aid recovery, especially when used in the treatment of wounds with high exudates.\r\n\r\nOur product has been extensively developed for use in such applications and we are already actively working with customers creating bespoke fabric and yarn solutions for the effective management of chronic wounds and burns.\r\n<strong>2.Horticulture</strong>\r\n\r\nSuper absorbent can be integrated into a wide range of nonwoven fabrics and woven constructs that can be used as both temporary and long-term water management solutions in many different horticultural and landscaping applications. Such fabrics are designed to achieve storage and delivery of water and nutrients to root systems, while significantly reducing evaporative loss and water seepage. They can be used in a wide range of applications from hanging basket liners (Basket Boosters™) to large commercial growing scale and landcsaping projects. Super absorbent can also be added directly to the soil media to enhance water containment.\r\n<strong>3.Cable</strong>\r\n\r\nCables that suffer damage can start to take on water. If Super absorbent tape or superabsorbent water-blocking yarn is incorporated into the cable during manufacture, it will rapidly absorb the liquid at the point of damage and swell to form a gel, blocking any further water ingress. Any resulting cable disruption is then minimal, fully contained and easy to locate and repair.\r\n<strong>4.Filtration</strong>\r\n\r\nA significant reason for the majority of oil and fuel system failures is the presence of water at high levels. Super absorbent fabrics offer high water absorbing capabilities for oil/fuel purfication with minimal media migration or linting. In addition, the Super absorbent component provides an antimicrobial function, it does not affect oil additives and offers full compliance to meet stringent international filtration standards.\r\n<strong>5.Hygiene</strong>\r\n\r\nSuper absorbent nonwovens fabrics provide superior fluid absorption, and low re-wet performance in disposable ultra-thin femme-hygiene, diaper and incontinence products. Washable fabrics have also been developed based on our same super absorbent technology and offer a new dimension to super absorbent use within hygiene applications.\r\n<strong>6.Food Packaging</strong>\r\n\r\nAbsorbent fabrics often sit beneath the product on a food tray, and provide a highly efficient way of keeping meat, fish, poultry and a whole range of other perishable foodstuffs packaged in optimised conditions and ultimately fresher for longer.\r\n<strong>7.Apparel</strong>\r\n\r\nOur fibre can be precisely tailored into a diverse range of fabric formats that can manage moisture, and as a result increase wearer comfort. Solutions that can be worn next to skin or over outer clothing have already been developed and are based on cooling through evaporation of absorbed water, or cooling through absorption of body perspiration.','This product can absorb up to 200 times its own weight in demineralised water and 60 times its own weight in saline at an extremely fast rate. Available in fibrous form, or integrated within a nonwoven fabric or spun yarn,  super absorbent solution to meet all of your water absorption needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4286,'2024-12-01 23:04:28','2024-12-01 23:04:28'),(4292,'PTFE Staple Fibers','ptfe-staple-fibers','Philite PTFE staple fibers are manufactured using the “film splitting” production process, which means that after the PTFE resin is mixed, it is made through processes such as film rolling, sintering, stretching, film splitting, and combing. The cross-section of a single fiber is a square or diamond-shaped fiber bundle. The fiber bundle can be curled and cut to a fixed length according to customer needs to form chopped fibers.\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: PTFE is highly resistant to a wide range of chemicals, making it ideal for environments with harsh chemicals or extreme pH levels.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thermal Stability</strong>: PTFE can withstand temperatures ranging from -200°C to +260°C, making it suitable for high-temperature applications.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Non-Stick and Low Friction</strong>: The low friction coefficient of PTFE ensures that the fibers don’t adhere to substances, making them useful in self-lubricating and non-stick applications.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water and Oil Repellency</strong>: PTFE is inherently hydrophobic and oleophobic, providing excellent resistance to moisture and oil.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durability</strong>: PTFE fibers are highly durable and resistant to abrasion, even in tough industrial environments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Technical Parameters</strong></h3>\r\n<table width=\"553\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Density</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">dtex</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">3.5±0.3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Breaking Strength</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">cN/dtex</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">≥1.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Breaking Elongation</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">%</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">≤23</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Shrinkage</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">%</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">≤3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Cutting Length</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">51±2, 60±2, 75±2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Crimp Number</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">(6-12)/25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Appearance</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"333\">White, no stains, packed well</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Continuous temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">C°</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">250</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Instant temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">C°</td>\r\n<td width=\"172\">290</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Anti-acid</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"333\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Anti-alkali</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"333\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Anti-abrasion</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"333\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Hydrolysis Resistance</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"333\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\">Abrasion Resistance</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"333\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Our Advantages</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Uniform fineness, high strength, strong combability;</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be used for the production of 100% PTFE needle-punched filter media;</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be customized to different density specifications such as 3.5d, 5d, 7d, etc;</li>\r\n 	<li>Greatly improve the filtration efficiency of filter media under the water punching process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filter Media</strong>: PTFE staple fibers are commonly used in needle felt filter bags for filtration in industries such as chemical processing, power generation, and incineration.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Textiles</strong>: They are also used in technical textiles for protective clothing and industrial fabrics that require resistance to extreme temperatures and chemicals.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Composite Materials</strong>: PTFE fibers can be incorporated into composites for applications where chemical resistance and low friction are critical.</li>\r\n</ul>','PTFE staple fibers are short-length fibers made from polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE), commonly known for its excellent chemical resistance, high-temperature stability, and non-stick properties. These fibers are widely used in the production of filter media, technical textiles, and specialty fabrics due to their unique characteristics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4293,'2024-12-01 23:07:05','2024-12-01 23:07:05'),(4298,'Cement Kiln Cellular Denitration Catalyst','cement-kiln-cellular-denitration-catalyst','<h4><strong>Brief Introduction</strong></h4>\r\nCellular Shape.\r\n\r\nOptional in 13-hole,16-hole,18-hole,20-hole,22-hole and 25-hole.\r\n\r\nSectional Size: 150*150mm, Length Adjustable.\r\n\r\nMainly made of TiO2, V2O5 and WO3.\r\n\r\nAxial/Radical compressive strength up to 2.5/0.8Mpa, Mass ratio surface area up to 60m2/g.\r\n\r\nMainly apply to Boiler Flue Gas Denitration in 120-200℃ operating conditions and NOx concentration ranges from 0-1500ppm, after dust removal.\r\n\r\nThe overall denitration efficiency beyond 90%, NH3 escaping lower than 3ppm, SO2 / SO3 conversion rate lower to 1%.\r\n\r\nStorage requirements:Humidity must be lower than 30% and defendable to rain,snow,wind,sand and ash.\r\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Item</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Holes</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">Section Area(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">Wall Thickness(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Opening(mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">15*15</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.35</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">8.45</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">18*18</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">7.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">20*20</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">21*21</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.95</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">22*22</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">5.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">25*25</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">4.9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Manufacturing Process</h4>\r\nMixing Process → Curing Process → Filtration Pre-extrusion →Extrusion Process → Primary Drying → Secondary Drying → Calcination Process → Cutting Process → End Face Hardening → Packaging Process\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Have formatted an mature and stable production process by introducing foreign advanced technology and independent research and development.</li>\r\n 	<li>According to practical fuel gas condition,customized design and lectotype available.</li>\r\n 	<li>After a number of debugging operation, our comprehensive production lines enable to optimize the core technologies.</li>\r\n 	<li>In strict accordance with international standards,Every process is controlled rigidly by Technical Department and Quality Supervision Department.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong><b>R&amp;D Technology</b></strong></h4>\r\nHas imported the United States NOVA 2200e automatic surface area and porosity analyzer, British Malvern MS-2000 laser particle size analyzer, catalyst compression test – electronic universal testing machine, moisture analyzer, Phenom scanning electron microscopy, plastic, catalyst activity evaluation device and other research and development testing equipment.\r\n\r\nEstablished innovation center and sophisticated R&amp;D team, we currently have 2 external experts with the State Council allowance, 6 senior engineers and 10 researchers with Master Degree.\r\n\r\nHave built solid cooperation with Germany Steinbeis-Transfer Center, Hefei University of Technology, Xi’an Thermal Power Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shanxi Institute of Coal Chemistry and other universities, research institutes.\r\n\r\nBy following testing on denitration catalyst’s surface shape, porosity distribution, catalyst activity, running resistance and tracking test of catalyst performance in different fields,We has created catalyst anti-clogging, anti-alkali metal poisoning and other performance enhancement technology.\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"https://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\">Look for catalog or technical support, please click here.</a></strong>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4299,'2024-12-01 23:12:03','2025-01-26 21:09:10'),(4301,'Coke-Oven Cellular Denitration Catalyst','coke-oven-cellular-denitration-catalyst','<h4><strong>Brief Introduction</strong></h4>\r\nCellular Shape.\r\n\r\nOptional in 13-hole,16-hole,18-hole,20-hole,22-hole and 25-hole.\r\n\r\nSectional Size: 150*150mm, Length Adjustable.\r\n\r\nMainly made of TiO2, V2O5 and WO3.\r\n\r\nAxial/Radical compressive strength up to 2.5/0.8Mpa, Mass ratio surface area up to 60m2/g.\r\n\r\nMainly apply to Boiler Flue Gas Denitration in 200-420℃ operating conditions and NOx concentration ranges from 0-2000ppm.\r\n\r\nThe overall denitration efficiency beyond 90%, NH3 escaping lower than 3ppm, SO2 / SO3 conversion rate lower to 1%.\r\n\r\nStorage requirements:Humidity must be lower than 30% and defendable to rain,snow,wind,sand and ash.\r\n<h4><strong>Specifications</strong></h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Item</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Holes</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">Section Area(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=