d the United States NOVA 2200e automatic surface area and porosity analyzer, British Malvern MS-2000 laser particle size analyzer, catalyst compression test – electronic universal testing machine, moisture analyzer, Phenom scanning electron microscopy, plastic, catalyst activity evaluation device and other research and development testing equipment.\r\n\r\nEstablished innovation center and sophisticated R&amp;D team, we currently have 2 external experts with the State Council allowance, 6 senior engineers and 10 researchers with Master Degree.\r\n\r\nHave built solid cooperation with Germany Steinbeis-Transfer Center, Hefei University of Technology, Xi’an Thermal Power Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shanxi Institute of Coal Chemistry and other universities, research institutes.\r\n\r\nBy following testing on denitration catalyst’s surface shape, porosity distribution, catalyst activity, running resistance and tracking test of catalyst performance in different fields,We has created catalyst anti-clogging, anti-alkali metal poisoning and other performance enhancement technology.\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\">Look for catalog or technical support, please click here.</a></strong>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4302,'2024-12-01 23:13:58','2024-12-01 23:13:58'),(4304,'Glass Kiln Cellular Denitration Catalyst','glass-kiln-cellular-denitration-catalyst','<h4><strong>Brief Introduction</strong></h4>\r\nCellular Shape.\r\n\r\nOptional in 13-hole,16-hole,18-hole,20-hole,22-hole and 25-hole.\r\n\r\nSectional Size: 150*150mm, Length Adjustable.\r\n\r\nMainly made of TiO2, V2O5 and WO3.\r\n\r\nAxial/Radical compressive strength up to 2.5/0.8Mpa, Mass ratio surface area up to 60m2/g.\r\n\r\nMainly apply to Boiler Flue Gas Denitration in 280-450℃ operating conditions.\r\n\r\nThe overall denitration efficiency beyond 90%, NH3 escaping lower than 3ppm, SO2 / SO3 conversion rate lower to 1%.\r\n\r\nStorage requirements:Humidity must be lower than 30% and defendable to rain,snow,wind,sand and ash.\r\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Item</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Holes</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">Section Area(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">Wall Thickness(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Opening(mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">15*15</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.35</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">8.45</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">18*18</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">7.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">20*20</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">21*21</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.95</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">22*22</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">5.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">25*25</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">4.9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Manufacturing Process</h4>\r\nMixing Process → Curing Process → Filtration Pre-extrusion →Extrusion Process → Primary Drying → Secondary Drying → Calcination Process → Cutting Process → End Face Hardening → Packaging Process\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Have formatted an mature and stable production process by introducing foreign advanced technology and independent research and development.</li>\r\n 	<li>According to practical fuel gas condition,customized design and lectotype available.</li>\r\n 	<li>After a number of debugging operation, our comprehensive production lines enable to optimize the core technologies.</li>\r\n 	<li>In strict accordance with international standards,Every process is controlled rigidly by Technical Department and Quality Supervision Department.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong><b>R&amp;D Technology</b></strong></h4>\r\nHas imported the United States NOVA 2200e automatic surface area and porosity analyzer, British Malvern MS-2000 laser particle size analyzer, catalyst compression test – electronic universal testing machine, moisture analyzer, Phenom scanning electron microscopy, plastic, catalyst activity evaluation device and other research and development testing equipment.\r\n\r\nEstablished innovation center and sophisticated R&amp;D team, we currently have 2 external experts with the State Council allowance, 6 senior engineers and 10 researchers with Master Degree.\r\n\r\nHave built solid cooperation with Germany Steinbeis-Transfer Center, Hefei University of Technology, Xi’an Thermal Power Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shanxi Institute of Coal Chemistry and other universities, research institutes.\r\n\r\nBy following testing on denitration catalyst’s surface shape, porosity distribution, catalyst activity, running resistance and tracking test of catalyst performance in different fields,We has created catalyst anti-clogging, anti-alkali metal poisoning and other performance enhancement technology.\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\">Look for catalog or technical support, please click here.</a></strong>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4305,'2024-12-01 23:15:26','2024-12-01 23:15:26'),(4307,'Honeycomb Catalyst Filter Device','honeycomb-catalyst-filter-device','<h2>Features</h2>\r\n1. Honeycomb catalyst from a variety of raw materials, mixing, molding, firing made, the whole body with activity, wear does not reduce the activity\r\n2. According to the actual flue gas conditions for formulation design, targeted, and wide adaptability\r\n3. High-temperature calcination process firing, anti-boiler instantaneous high-temperature capability\r\n4. Flue gas inlet side with anti-wear coating, anti-wear ability, long mechanical life\r\n5. Ultrafine TiO2 as the substrate, surface area, activity and stability\r\n6. Special formula design, excellent resistance to poisoning\r\n7. Can use a wide range of reliability\r\n<h2>Common specifications</h2>\r\n15 hole,16 hole,18 hole,20 hole,21 hole,22 hole,25 hole,30 hole,35 hole,40 hole,45 hole\r\n<h2>Application</h2>\r\nPower Plants, Cement Plant, Glass Furnaces, Chemical Plants\r\n<h2>Classic Case</h2>\r\n<strong>Power Plant</strong>\r\n\r\nUnit capacity: 600MW\r\nWay: electric bag composite dust collector\r\nInstantaneous temperature: 210 ° C\r\nTotal moisture: 18.6%\r\nReceived Ash: 40.1%\r\nContinuous operating temperature: 165 ℃\r\nTotal base sulfur received: 1.6%\r\nInlet concentration: 40 g / N mm³\r\nMaterial: PTFE + PPS / PTFE base fabric\r\nAfter treatment: PTFE coating\r\nBag specifications: φ160 * 8550mm\r\n\r\n<strong>Glass Furnaces</strong>\r\n\r\nDust concentration: 50 mg / Nm³\r\nDenitration efficiency:&gt; 93%\r\nAmmonia Escape: 0.8 ppm\r\nSO2 / SO3 conversion: 2.9%\r\nNumber of holes: 25 holes\r\nTemperature: 320 ° C\r\nInlet NOx concentration: 2600 mg / Nm³ (dry basis, 6% O2)\r\nOutlet NOx concentration: 182 mg / Nm³ (dry basis, 6% O2)','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4308,'2024-12-01 23:17:57','2024-12-01 23:17:57'),(4310,'Rare-Earth Based Cellular Denitration Catalyst','rare-earth-based-cellular-denitration-catalyst','<strong>Brief Introduction</strong>\r\n\r\nCellular Shape.\r\n\r\nOptional in 13-hole,16-hole,18-hole,20-hole,22-hole and 25-hole.\r\n\r\nSectional Size: 150*150mm, Length Adjustable.\r\n\r\nMainly made of CeO2 and La2O3.\r\n\r\nAxial/Radical compressive strength up to 2.5/0.8Mpa, Mass ratio surface area up to 60m2/g.\r\n\r\nMainly apply to Boiler Flue Gas Denitration in 250-450℃ operating conditions.\r\n\r\nThe overall denitration efficiency beyond 90%, NH3 escaping lower than 1ppm, SO2 / SO3 conversion rate lower to 1%.\r\n\r\nStorage requirements:Humidity must be lower than 30% and defendable to rain,snow,wind,sand and ash.\r\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Item</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Holes</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">Section Area(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">Wall Thickness(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Opening(mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">15*15</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.35</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">8.45</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">18*18</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">7.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">20*20</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">21*21</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.95</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">22*22</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">5.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">25*25</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">4.9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Manufacturing Process</h4>\r\nMixing Process → Curing Process → Filtration Pre-extrusion →Extrusion Process → Primary Drying → Secondary Drying → Calcination Process → Cutting Process → End Face Hardening → Packaging Process\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Have formatted an mature and stable production process by introducing foreign advanced technology and independent research and development.</li>\r\n 	<li>According to practical fuel gas condition,customized design and lectotype available.</li>\r\n 	<li>After a number of debugging operation, our comprehensive production lines enable to optimize the core technologies.</li>\r\n 	<li>In strict accordance with international standards,Every process is controlled rigidly by Technical Department and Quality Supervision Department.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong><b>R&amp;D Technology</b></strong></h4>\r\nHas imported the United States NOVA 2200e automatic surface area and porosity analyzer, British Malvern MS-2000 laser particle size analyzer, catalyst compression test – electronic universal testing machine, moisture analyzer, Phenom scanning electron microscopy, plastic, catalyst activity evaluation device and other research and development testing equipment.\r\n\r\nEstablished innovation center and sophisticated R&amp;D team, we currently have 2 external experts with the State Council allowance, 6 senior engineers and 10 researchers with Master Degree.\r\n\r\nHave built solid cooperation with Germany Steinbeis-Transfer Center, Hefei University of Technology, Xi’an Thermal Power Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shanxi Institute of Coal Chemistry and other universities, research institutes.\r\n\r\nBy following testing on denitration catalyst’s surface shape, porosity distribution, catalyst activity, running resistance and tracking test of catalyst performance in different fields,We has created catalyst anti-clogging, anti-alkali metal poisoning and other performance enhancement technology.\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\">Look for catalog or technical support, please click here.</a></strong>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4311,'2024-12-01 23:19:14','2024-12-01 23:19:14'),(4313,'Vanadium and Titanium Cellular Denitration Catalyst','vanadium-and-titanium-cellular-denitration-catalyst','<h4><strong>Brief Introduction</strong></h4>\r\nCellular Shape.\r\n\r\nOptional in 13-hole,16-hole,18-hole,20-hole,22-hole and 25-hole.\r\n\r\nSectional Size: 150*150mm, Length Adjustable.\r\n\r\nMainly made of TiO2 and V2O5.\r\n\r\nAxial/Radical compressive strength up to 2.5/0.8Mpa, Mass ratio surface area up to 60m2/g.\r\n\r\nMainly apply to Boiler Flue Gas Denitration in 300-450℃ operating conditions.\r\n\r\nThe overall denitration efficiency beyond 90%, NH3 escaping lower than 1ppm, SO2 / SO3 conversion rate lower to 1%.\r\n\r\nStorage requirements:Humidity must be lower than 30% and defendable to rain,snow,wind,sand and ash.\r\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">Item</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Holes</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">Section Area(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">Wall Thickness(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Opening(mm)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">15*15</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.35</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">8.45</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">18*18</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">7.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">20*20</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.15</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">21*21</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.95</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">6.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">22*22</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">5.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"65\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">25*25</td>\r\n<td width=\"162\">150*150</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">4.9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Manufacturing Process</h4>\r\nMixing Process → Curing Process → Filtration Pre-extrusion →Extrusion Process → Primary Drying → Secondary Drying → Calcination Process → Cutting Process → End Face Hardening → Packaging Process\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Have formatted an mature and stable production process by introducing foreign advanced technology and independent research and development.</li>\r\n 	<li>According to practical fuel gas condition,customized design and lectotype available.</li>\r\n 	<li>After a number of debugging operation, our comprehensive production lines enable to optimize the core technologies.</li>\r\n 	<li>In strict accordance with international standards,Every process is controlled rigidly by Technical Department and Quality Supervision Department.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong><b>R&amp;D Technology</b></strong></h4>\r\nHas imported the United States NOVA 2200e automatic surface area and porosity analyzer, British Malvern MS-2000 laser particle size analyzer, catalyst compression test – electronic universal testing machine, moisture analyzer, Phenom scanning electron microscopy, plastic, catalyst activity evaluation device and other research and development testing equipment.\r\n\r\nEstablished innovation center and sophisticated R&amp;D team, we currently have 2 external experts with the State Council allowance, 6 senior engineers and 10 researchers with Master Degree.\r\n\r\nHave built solid cooperation with Germany Steinbeis-Transfer Center, Hefei University of Technology, Xi’an Thermal Power Research Institute, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shanxi Institute of Coal Chemistry and other universities, research institutes.\r\n\r\nBy following testing on denitration catalyst’s surface shape, porosity distribution, catalyst activity, running resistance and tracking test of catalyst performance in different fields,We has created catalyst anti-clogging, anti-alkali metal poisoning and other performance enhancement technology.\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\">Look for catalog or technical support, please click here.</a></strong>','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4314,'2024-12-01 23:20:41','2024-12-01 23:20:41');
INSERT INTO `product` (`id`, `name`, `slug`, `description`, `short_description`, `price`, `sale_price`, `sku`, `stock_quantity`, `status`, `main_image_id`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (4316,'FILTER SHEETS FILTER PAPER CARDBOARD','filter-sheets-filter-paper-cardboard','<h1> 1. ES-K Series For Viscous Liquid Filtration</h1>\r\n<h2>  Introduction:</h2>\r\nESK series paperboard is mainly used to filter liquids with high viscosity and high particle concentration. The paperboard is bulky, the internal cavity structure and the larger internal surface area, and the high dirt holding capacity of gelatinous impurities and particles, filter larger volume, can be used for polishing and filtering viscous liquids in chemical, cosmetics, food, industrial and other industries.\r\n<h2> Advantages and characteristics:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Strong dirt holding capacity and low replacement cost;</li>\r\n 	<li>The fibers form an intricate cavity structure through interweaving, resulting in a huge internal surface area, which can be widely used under various usage conditions and purposes;</li>\r\n 	<li>Effective adsorption characteristics can ensure safety;</li>\r\n 	<li>The use of high-purity fiber raw materials has minimal impact on the filtrate;</li>\r\n 	<li>Strict quality system management is implemented from feeding to leaving the factory to ensure stable and consistent product quality.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2> Technical data:</h2>\r\n<table width=\"577\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">Series</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Filtration Accuracy/μm</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Thickness/mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">Speed<strong><b>/</b></strong>min</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">Volume/L/㎡/min (Δ=100kPa)</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Wet Resistance/kPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Ash Proportion/%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">ESK Series For Viscous Liquid Filtration</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCK-111</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">90-111</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.4-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">2″-8″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\"> 18600-22300</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">—</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCK-112</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">85-100</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">1.8-2.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">5″-20″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">12900-17730</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">—</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Application range:</h2>\r\nFine, basic chemical industry, oil, cosmetics\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4323\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/蜡烛-300x200-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4324\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/p7-蜂蜜-300x198-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"198\" />\r\n<h1>2. High-throughput ES-A series</h1>\r\n<h2>   Introduction:</h2>\r\nSeries cardboard is characterized by its low relative density, high porosity, small thickness, and large absorption capacity, which is especially suitable for rapid clarification applications. It can be used as the initial filtration process for liquids and is widely used to filter viscous liquids, haze liquids containing high concentrations of protein, and liquids containing more solid particles.\r\n<h2>  Advantages and characteristics:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Low density, large gap, it is not easy to block the cardboard when filtering viscous liquid;</li>\r\n 	<li>The cardboard has a large dirt holding capacity and a large filtering capacity, which can quickly clarify the filtrate;</li>\r\n 	<li>The porous structure can effectively adsorb suspended solids and effectively reduce the subsequent precipitation;</li>\r\n 	<li>The product is composed of plant fibers, and the dissolution of metal ions is extremely low.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2>Technical data:</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">Series</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Filtration Accuracy/μm</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Thickness/mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">Speed<strong><b>/</b></strong>min</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">Volume/L/㎡/min (Δ=100kPa)</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Wet Resistance/kPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Ash Proportion/%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nHigh-throughput ES-A Series\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCA-030</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">95-100</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">2.7-3.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">5″-15″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">16300-17730</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧150</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCA-040</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">65-85</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.4-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">10″-30″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">9210-15900</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧350</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCA-060</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">60-70</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.2-3.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">20″-40″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">8100-13500</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧350</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCA-080</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">60-70</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.5-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">25″-55″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">7800-12700</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧450</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2> Applications:</h2>\r\nFine/basic chemicals, biotechnology, pharmacy, food, syrup, fruit juice, chemistry, cosmetics.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4325\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/p8_-300x200-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4326\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/R-C-300x186-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"186\" />\r\n<h1>3. Precoat &amp; support ES-P series</h1>\r\n<h2>  Introduction:</h2>\r\nES-P series cardboard is a pure fiber support filter cardboard that can be washed and reused and is widely used in pre-coated filtration in various industries. The surface texture of the P series cardboard is rough, which can provide support for various filter aid fillers (diatomite, perlite, activated carbon, polyvinyl alcohol polypyrrolidone pvpp, etc.) during the filtration process; high strength, users The filter cake layer can be easily removed at the end of each cycle. The P series supporting cardboard has a long service life and can be reused up to 30 times, reducing the cost of use.\r\n<h2>  Advantages and characteristics:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>The pore size of the cardboard is evenly distributed, and the surface is rough so that the filter cake is evenly attached to the cardboard;</li>\r\n 	<li>It is suitable for supporting filtration of a variety of professional filter aids;</li>\r\n 	<li>With high wet strength, cardboard can be recycled to reduce costs;</li>\r\n 	<li>The interior of the cardboard is tightly deconstructed, reducing the risk of particle leakage;</li>\r\n 	<li>Very resistant to pressure transients circulating in filtration.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2>  Technical data:</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">Series</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Filtration Accuracy/μm</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Thickness/mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">Speed<strong><b>/</b></strong>min</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">Volume/L/㎡/min (Δ=100kPa)</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Wet Resistance/kPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Ash Proportion/%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">&nbsp;\r\n\r\nPrecoat&amp;Support ES-P series\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n揮列</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCP-110</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">45-60</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.6-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">30″-1´30″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">8180-11300</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧800</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCP-111</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">40-55</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.6-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">1´-2´</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">4150-6700</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCP-112</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">40-55</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.4-3.7</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">1´-1´40″</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">4380-7000</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧900</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2> Applications:</h2>\r\nWine, beer, fruit juice, spirits, food industry, chemistry, cosmetics, pharmacy, biotechnology.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4327\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/啤酒-300x208-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"208\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4328\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/fresh-orange-juice-squeezed-refreshing-citrus-158053-300x200-detail6.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />\r\n<h1>4. High-precision pure fiber C series</h1>\r\n<h2>   Introduction:</h2>\r\nThe series paperboards do not add any mineral filter aids, have extremely high cellulose purity, can adapt to different chemical environments such as acid and alkali, greatly reduce the risk of metal ions precipitation, and can well retain the filtered liquid The color and fragrance. The special internal fiber structure of the C series can complete high-precision filtration tasks, realize the removal of microorganisms, and provide protection for subsequent membrane filtration. This new filter media can provide you with excellent filtration quality, maximize filtration capacity, and have extremely high chemical compatibility.\r\n<h2>   Advantages and characteristics:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Good chemical compatibility;</li>\r\n 	<li>No mineral ingredients are added, and the content of metal ions is low;</li>\r\n 	<li>Keep the fragrance and color of the original liquid to the greatest extent;</li>\r\n 	<li>The ash content is less than 0.02%, which can achieve the greatest degree of ashing;</li>\r\n 	<li>Biodegradable;</li>\r\n 	<li>High filtration precision, which can satisfy clarification and partial sterilization filtration.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2>  Technical data:</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">Series</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Filtration Accuracy/μm</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Thickness/mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">Speed<strong><b>/</b></strong>min</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">Volume/L/㎡/min (Δ=100kPa)</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">Wet Resistance/kPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">Ash Proportion/%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\">High-precision Pure Fiber ES-C Series</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCC-210</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">15-35</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.6-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">2´-4´</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">2760-3720</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧800</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCC-220</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">10.0-30.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.7-3.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">3´-5´</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">508-830</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">—</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCC-230</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">6.0-15.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.4-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">6´-13´</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">573-875</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧700</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCC-240</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">3.0-6.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.4-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">13´-20´</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">275-532</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧700</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">SCC-270</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">0.5-0.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">3.4-4.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">40´-50´</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">70-138</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">≧800</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">≦1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2> Application:</h2>\r\nwine, beer, spirits, fruit juice, food industry, chemistry, cosmetics, pharmacy, biotechnology, cosmetics, chemical industry\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4329\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/pexels-photo-5732736-300x200-detail7.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4330\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/iinb7wOJpF_small-300x225-detail8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />','The all-cellulose depth filtration range product is made of high-purity cellulose as the basic raw material and does not contain mineral auxiliary materials. High strength, reusable; strong chemical resistance, adapt to a variety of liquid environments. This series of products have a wide range of uses. They can be used for coarse filtration of high-viscosity liquids, pre-coated support filtration of filter aid fillers, and polishing, clarification, and fine filtration in various industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4317,'2024-12-01 23:38:38','2024-12-01 23:38:38'),(4332,'Activated Carbon Panel Filters','activated-carbon-panel-filters','<h3>Benefit of Activated Carbon Panel Filters</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Odor Removal</strong>: Effective at eliminating smells from cooking, pets, tobacco, and industrial activities.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>VOC Filtration</strong>: Helps in removing harmful VOCs from paint, cleaning supplies, and off-gassing furniture.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Quality Improvement</strong>: Enhances overall air quality by addressing both particulate and gaseous pollutants.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The filter medium is made of fibrous non-woven fabric and activated carbon powder after light processing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Activated carbon powder is integrated into the fiber and has high adsorption capacity.</li>\r\n 	<li>The outer frame can be designed as a galvanized iron frame or an aluminum frame.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Work Principle</h3>\r\nActivated carbon sheet filters capture odors through a process called adsorption, where molecules attach to the outside of the surface rather than being absorbed into it. The more pores in the activated carbon, the better, which increases the surface area that contaminants can attach to as air passes through the filter.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4333\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/How-Activated-Carbon-Panel-Filter-works-detail1-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"605\" height=\"403\" />\r\n<h3>Common Specifications</h3>\r\n<table width=\"871\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Media</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"237\"><strong>                         Dimensions</strong></td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Filtering surface</strong> <strong>(m2)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Rated </strong><strong>air flow</strong> <strong>(m3/h)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"77\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Initial pressure drop(Pa)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"77\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Length (mm)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Height (mm)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"76\">\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>Depth (mm)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"3\" width=\"84\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">AC-KL</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"3\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p align=\"center\">Activated Carbon Particles