024-12-02 11:41:07'),(4435,'Pocket Air Filters','pocket-air-filters','Pocket air filter are common air purification equipment that uses bag-shaped filter material to make filter bags to capture particles and pollutants in the air. This type of air filter is typically used in industrial and commercial settings, but can also be used in home air purification systems.\r\n<h3>Work Principle of Pocket Air Filter</h3>\r\nThe working principle of the pocket air filter is that when the air flows through the filter bag, the particles are captured by the filter material in the filter bag. These filter media can be made of synthetic fiber, fiberglass or other special materials. Air bag filters usually have a larger filtration area, so they can hold more particles and extend the filter replacement cycle.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4449\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Work-Principle-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-detail1-300x166.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"792\" height=\"438\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Product Feature</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Large dust holding capacity and stable performance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Washable (Limited).</li>\r\n 	<li>Large air volume, low resistance and high efficiency.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long lifespan.</li>\r\n 	<li>100% factory inspection.</li>\r\n 	<li>”V” type pocket structure, economy and high performance cost.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong><span data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i28.52e7618bIzjElA\">Technical Parameter</span></strong></h3>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">Grades</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">Filtration effectiveness</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">Size</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\"> Air quantity(m/h)</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">Initial resistance(Pa)</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">Pockets</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F5</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">40%-45%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">595*595*500</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">3200</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">50</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F5</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">40%-45%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">495*595*500</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">2700</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">50</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F6</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">60%-65%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">595*495*500</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">3200</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">60</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F6</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">60%-65%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">495*495*500</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">2200</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">60</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F7</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">80%-85%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">595*495*600</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">3200</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">105</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F7</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">80%-85%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">595*495*600</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">3000</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">105</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F8</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">90%-99%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">595*595*600</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">3000</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">115</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"79\">F8</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"116\">90%-99%</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">595*495*600</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"106\">2700</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"147\">115</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" width=\"93\">8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Application Areas</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Industrial air treatment</strong>: Bag air filters are commonly used in industrial environments such as factories and workshops to remove dust, particles, chemical gases and odors from the air to ensure a clean production environment, improve work efficiency, and protect production equipment.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Commercial buildings</strong>: In commercial office buildings, hotels, shopping malls and other places, bag air filters are used in central air conditioning systems to filter dust, pollen, mold and bacteria in the air and provide clean and healthy indoor air.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Healthcare facilities</strong>: In places such as hospitals, laboratories and pharmaceutical plants, bag air filters are used in sensitive environments such as clean rooms, operating rooms and laboratories to ensure that the air is free of bacteria, viruses and other contaminants.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Electronics industry</strong>: In the semiconductor manufacturing and electronic assembly processes, bag air filters are used to remove tiny particles in the air to ensure the cleanliness of the production process and avoid damage to electronic components by tiny particles.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food and beverage manufacturing</strong>: During food and beverage processing, bag air filters are used to keep the production environment clean, prevent dust, bacteria and other contaminants from entering the product, and ensure product safety and quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Energy industry</strong>: In energy production fields such as power plants and petrochemical plants, bag air filters are used to remove particulate matter produced during the combustion process and reduce air pollution.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4450\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-01-detail2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"142\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4451\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-02-detail3-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"143\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4452\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-03-detail4-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"142\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4453\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-04-detail5-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"142\" />','<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Efficiency</strong>: F5 (white), F6 (green), F7 (pink), F8 (light yellow), F9 (dark yellow).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Media:</strong> Synthetic fiber.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pocket type</strong>: Ultrasonic bag/Sewing bag.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional thickness</strong>: Aluminum/GI/Plastic.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Temperature</strong>: 90℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Humidity</strong>: 100%.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4444,'2024-12-02 11:48:31','2024-12-02 11:53:57'),(4455,'Pocket Filters for HVAC Systems','pocket-filters-for-hvac-systems','Bag-type medium-efficiency filter is mainly used in central air-conditioning and centralized air supply systems, and can be used for intermediate-level filtration of air-conditioning systemsto protect the next-level filter and the system itself in places where air purification is not strictly required. The air processed by the medium efficiency filter can be sent directly to the user.\r\n\r\nBag-type medium effect filter, frame with cold plate spray, galvanized sheet and other forms, filter material, non-woven fabric, glass fiber, etc.\r\n\r\nBag-type medium efficiency filters are widely used in industrial air purification systems, pharmaceuticals, hospitals, electronics, food and other industrial purification, and can also be used as front-end filtration of high-efficiency air filters to reduce the load of high-efficiency air filters and extend their use. life. Due to the large windward surface of the bag filter, it has a large dust holding capacity and a low wind speed, and is considered to be the best medium-efficiency filter structure at present.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Standard Model Technology (Customized)</strong></h3>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Efficiency</td>\r\n<td>Size(mm)</td>\r\n<td>Air flow(m/h)</td>\r\n<td>Initial pressure drop (Pa)</td>\r\n<td>Number of bags</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F5</td>\r\n<td>595*595*500</td>\r\n<td>3200</td>\r\n<td>50</td>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F5</td>\r\n<td data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i64.1a396710j5aQHo\">495*595*500</td>\r\n<td>2700</td>\r\n<td>50</td>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F6</td>\r\n<td>595*495*500</td>\r\n<td>3200</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F6</td>\r\n<td>495*495*500</td>\r\n<td>2200</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F7</td>\r\n<td>595*495*600</td>\r\n<td>3200</td>\r\n<td>105</td>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F7</td>\r\n<td>595*495*600</td>\r\n<td>3000</td>\r\n<td>105</td>\r\n<td>8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F8</td>\r\n<td>595*595*600</td>\r\n<td>3000</td>\r\n<td>115</td>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>F8</td>\r\n<td>595*495*600</td>\r\n<td>2700</td>\r\n<td>115</td>\r\n<td>8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Philite® Specializes in High-quality Flat Air Filters</h3>\r\nOur filtration products have passed SGS and ISO9001 certification and are exported to Europe, North America, Southeast Asia, Africa and other regions. With our emphasis on quality and after-sales service, we have won a good reputation in the filtration industry.','HVAC pocket filters are essential components in air handling units, used to maintain optimal air quality and system efficiency. These filters, sometimes called bag filters, consist of multiple pockets that enhance their surface area and capture capacity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4456,'2024-12-02 11:56:57','2024-12-02 11:56:58'),(4461,'Polyester Pocket Filters','polyester-pocket-filters','<h3>Mian Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency</strong>: Polyester pocket filters capture fine particles effectively, often achieving MERV ratings between 8 and 15, depending on their design and layering.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durability</strong>: The polyester material resists moisture, wear, and tear, making them suitable for challenging environments, including those with high humidity.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Energy Efficiency</strong>: These filters are designed to allow good airflow, helping reduce energy consumption in HVAC systems.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Size and Performance</h3>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Dimensions(mm) WxHxD</td>\r\n<td>Number of pocket</td>\r\n<td> Filter classification  EN779:2012 (m3/h /Pa)</td>\r\n<td>Air Flow/Pressure drop</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×592×534</td>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n<td>G3</td>\r\n<td>3400/50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×592×534</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>G3</td>\r\n<td>2800/50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×592×534</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>G3</td>\r\n<td>1700/50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×592×534</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>G3</td>\r\n<td>2300/50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×490×380</td>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n<td>G4</td>\r\n<td>3400/60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×490×380</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>G4</td>\r\n<td>2800/60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×490×380</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>G4</td>\r\n<td>1700/60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>592×490×380</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>G4</td>\r\n<td>2300/60</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>\r\nMedium filters for ventilating and air conditioning systems for commercial and industrial clean rooms, air supply systems for clean rooms, automotive Industries, hotels and office buildings.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Philite® Specializes in High-quality Flat Air Filters</h3>\r\nOur filtration products have passed SGS and ISO9001 certification and are exported to Europe, North America, Southeast Asia, Africa and other regions. With our emphasis on quality and after-sales service, we have won a good reputation in the filtration industry.','Polyester pocket filters are commonly used in HVAC systems and industrial ventilation as they effectively capture dust, pollen, and various airborne particles. These filters are made from durable polyester fibers, which are needled into a non-woven material to create a multi-pocket structure.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Efficiency</strong>: F5 / F6 / F7 / F8 / F9.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Media</strong>: Polyester fiber.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pocket type</strong>: Ultrasonic bag; Sewing bag.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Customized.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4463,'2024-12-02 12:01:55','2024-12-02 12:01:55'),(4466,'Synthetic Air Filters','synthetic-air-filters','<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<table width=\"874\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"206\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"318\">flat mesh panel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Frame</td>\r\n<td>galvanized steel, aluminium and stainless steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Filter media</td>\r\n<td>synthetic fiber</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Grids</td>\r\n<td>aluminium mesh and stainless steel mesh</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>EN 779 Class</td>\r\n<td>G2－G4</td>\r\n