</strong>: Where moderate to high air quality levels are required.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Industrial Facilities</strong>: They help protect machinery and processes from dust and airborne contaminants.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Healthcare Settings</strong>: Effective in environments that require sterility, such as hospitals and laboratories.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Philite® Specializes in High-quality Flat Air Filters</h3>\r\nOur filtration products have passed SGS and ISO9001 certification and are exported to Europe, North America, Southeast Asia, Africa and other regions. With our emphasis on quality and after-sales service, we have won a good reputation in the filtration industry.','Synthetic pocket filters are commonly used in HVAC systems because of their durability, efficiency, and versatility. Made from synthetic fibers (like polyester or polypropylene), they are designed to handle a range of environments, including humid or corrosive conditions where natural fiber filters might degrade.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High efficiency filtration with low resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in wide range of size.</li>\r\n 	<li>Gasket products available.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4476,'2024-12-02 13:19:26','2024-12-02 13:19:26'),(4483,'V-pack Rigid Filter','v-pack-rigid-filter','<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<table width=\"874\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"206\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"318\">multi-v packs filter</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Frame</td>\r\n<td>plastic or galvanized steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Filter media</td>\r\n<td>glass fiber paper or synthetic paper</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Separators</td>\r\n<td>continuous thermoplastic cord</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>EN 779 Class</td>\r\n<td>F6－F9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Average arrestance</td>\r\n<td>99%（ASHRAE 52.1-1992）</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>MERV</td>\r\n<td>MERV 11－15（ASHRAE 52.2-1999）</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>DIN 53438 Flammability</td>\r\n<td>F1</td>\r\n</tr>\r