together. As a result, the laminates not only can perform filtration, but also provide excellent mechanical support. This class of filtration media can be worked mechanically, deformed, or welded.\r\n<h3>Standard size of Sintered filter mesh and perforated plate laminates:</h3>\r\nPhilite® routinely produces sintered filter mesh and perforated plate laminates at sizes of 500*1000mm and 1000*1200mm. For other sizes, please consult with us.','Philite® mainly produce two kinds of sintered filter mesh, including Sintered multi-layered woven filter mesh composites and Sintered filter mesh and perforated plate laminates.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4608,'2024-12-02 22:17:58','2024-12-02 22:17:59'),(4611,'Sintered metal fiber sheet , Porous metal sheet','sintered-metal-fiber-sheet-porous-metal-sheet','Our products are made of stainless steel fibers,iron-chromium-aluminum fibers,or other metal fibers. The non-woven sheets are formed by air-laid process, and sintered under high temperature with our proprietary sintering process.\r\n<strong>Optional fibers</strong>: stainless steel fibers, iron-chromium-aluminum fibers.\r\n<strong>Features</strong>: pleatable high permanence media, excellent high temperature resistance, high pressure resistance, and corrosion resistance, etc.\r\n<strong>Standard size</strong>: 1180*1500mm, also can be customizable\r\n<strong>Standard form</strong>: single-side or double-side covered meshes\r\n<h3>We mainly provide the following four kinds of product, for other demands,please <a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1902\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>contact us</strong></a><strong>!</strong></h3>\r\n<h3>Product NO.1  Normal pressure sintered metal fiber felt/sheet</h3>\r\nWith multi-layered structure and high porosity, this class of products has a high dirt holding capacity and long on-stream service life.It is suitable for various polymer filtration, and be pleated into cylindrical filters or spin packs.\r\n<h3>Specification:</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Grade</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Filtering Rating (μm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Porosity (%)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Air Permeability (l/dm²·min)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Bubble Point Pressure (Pa)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Dirt Holding Quantity (mg/cm²)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A03</td>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>975</td>\r\n<td>0.40</td>\r\n<td>72</td>\r\n<td>11</td>\r\n<td>12200</td>\r\n<td>8.0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A05</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>600</td>\r\n<td>0.38</td>\r\n<td>78</td>\r\n<td>32</td>\r\n<td>7700</td>\r\n<td>7.6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A07</td>\r\n<td>7</td>\r\n<td>600</td>\r\n<td>0.32</td>\r\n<td>71</td>\r\n<td>65</td>\r\n<td>5100</td>\r\n<td>6.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A10</td>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n<td>600</td>\r\n<td>0.35</td>\r\n<td>78</td>\r\n<td>112</td>\r\n<td>3750</td>\r\n<td>7.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A15</td>\r\n<td>15</td>\r\n<td>600</td>\r\n<td>0.42</td>\r\n<td>81</td>\r\n<td>168</td>\r\n<td>2500</td>\r\n<td>7.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A20</td>\r\n<td>20</td>\r\n<td>750</td>\r\n<td>0.52</td>\r\n<td>82</td>\r\n<td>258</td>\r\n<td>1870</td>\r\n<td>11.2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A25</td>\r\n<td>25</td>\r\n<td>1050</td>\r\n<td>0.62</td>\r\n<td>81</td>\r\n<td>340</td>\r\n<td>1520</td>\r\n<td>18.2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>1050</td>\r\n<td>0.62</td>\r\n<td>80</td>\r\n<td>465</td>\r\n<td>1240</td>\r\n<td>16.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A40</td>\r\n<td>40</td>\r\n<td>1200</td>\r\n<td>0.63</td>\r\n<td>80</td>\r\n<td>630</td>\r\n<td>970</td>\r\n<td>21.2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A60</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>750</td>\r\n<td>0.68</td>\r\n<td>85</td>\r\n<td>1280</td>\r\n<td>650</td>\r\n<td>26.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>A75</td>\r\n<td>75</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.85</td>\r\n<td>78</td>\r\n<td>1950</td>\r\n<td>470</td>\r\n<td>42.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Product NO.2  High dirt holding sintered metal fiber felt/sheet</h3>\r\nThis product has a high dirt holding capacity, high porosit and multi-layered structure. It is suitable for low-pressure filtration and plastic monomer filtration with a need for high dirt holding capacity.\r\n<h3>Specification:</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Grade</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Filtering Rating (μm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Dirt Holding Quantity (mg/cm²)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Porosity (%)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Air Permeability (l/dm²·min)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Bubble Point Pressure (Pa)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B05</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>12.8</td>\r\n<td>975</td>\r\n<td>0.84</td>\r\n<td>85</td>\r\n<td>95</td>\r\n<td>6100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B10</td>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n<td>18.4</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.75</td>\r\n<td>84</td>\r\n<td>120</td>\r\n<td>3600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B15</td>\r\n<td>15</td>\r\n<td>18.9</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.75</td>\r\n<td>84</td>\r\n<td>220</td>\r\n<td>2400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B20</td>\r\n<td>20</td>\r\n<td>22.5</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.80</td>\r\n<td>85</td>\r\n<td>350</td>\r\n<td>1720</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B25</td>\r\n<td>25</td>\r\n<td>18.6</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.80</td>\r\n<td>86</td>\r\n<td>468</td>\r\n<td>1450</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B30</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>19.2</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.80</td>\r\n<td>86</td>\r\n<td>680</td>\r\n<td>1240</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>B40</td>\r\n<td>40</td>\r\n<td>29.5</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.80</td>\r\n<td>85</td>\r\n<td>690</td>\r\n<td>940</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Product NO.3  High pressure sintered metal fiber felt/sheet</h3>\r\nThis sintered metal fiber felt can’t be compressed distortionally even if used under high-pressure condition, and very suitable for making folding column filters and discs. This product can be used in extrusion molding of film and fiber, filtration of polypropylene and polyester fusant.\r\n<h3>Specification:</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Grade</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Filtering Rating (μm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Bubble Point Pressure (Pa)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Porosity (%)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Air Permeability (l/dm²·min)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">Dirt Holding Quantity (mg/cm²)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C05</td>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>7500</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.42</td>\r\n<td>74</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>7.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C10</td>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n<td>3750</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.42</td>\r\n<td>72</td>\r\n<td>80</td>\r\n<td>9.6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C15</td>\r\n<td>15</td>\r\n<td>2420</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.43</td>\r\n<td>71</td>\r\n<td>170</td>\r\n<td>12.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C20</td>\r\n<td>20</td>\r\n<td>1870</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>0.45</td>\r\n<td>72</td>\r\n<td>240</td>\r\n<td>12.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C25</td>\r\n<td>25</td>\r\n<td>1480</td>\r\n<td>1050</td>\r\n<td>0.45</td>\r\n<td>74</td>\r\n<td>301</td>\r\n<td>12.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C40</td>\r\n<td>40</td>\r\n<td>980</td>\r\n<td>1050</td>\r\n<td>0.49</td>\r\n<td>72</td>\r\n<td>540</td>\r\n<td>23.4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Product NO.4  High temperature resistance sintered metal fiber felt/sheet</h3>\r\nThis sintered metal fiber felt is made of iron chromium aluminum metal fiber felts with excellent high temperature resistance and strong oxidation resistance. It can be continuously used under a temperature up to 1100℃. It is mainly used in filtration of high-temperature gas, car exhaust, gas oven, ect.\r\n<h3>The following table showing 316L mesh available:</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td></td>\r\n<td>Mesh</td>\r\n<td>Wire Dia(μm)</td>\r\n<td>Opening(μm)</td>\r\n<td>Weight(g/m²)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">S-mesh</td>\r\n<td>48</td>\r\n<td>0.125</td>\r\n<td>400</td>\r\n<td>300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">K-mesh/K*mesh</td>\r\n<td>40</td>\r\n<td>0.250</td>\r\n<td>400</td>\r\n<td>1220</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#E5E5E5\">N-mesh/N*mesh</td>\r\n<td>30</td>\r\n<td>0.190</td>\r\n<td>657</td>\r\n<td>573</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\"><strong>Note: </strong>*Calendered mesh</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Remark:</h3>\r\n1. Bubble point pressure determined according to ISO 4003;\r\n2. Average air permeability determined according to ISO 4022;\r\n3. Dirt holding capacity determined according to Multipass method ISO 16889, different pressure=8 times as initial differential pressure.\r\n<h3>Applications:</h3>\r\nUsed in chemical fibers, petrochemical, common chemical industry, hydraulic filtration, pharmaceutical, and power generation, ect.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4612\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/sintered-metal-fiber-sheet-detail1_syy-300x225.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"559\" height=\"419\" />','Philite® has the most advanced full-automatic product line imported from the U.S., with the leading manufacture technology, producting a series of sintered metal fiber felts, porous metal sheets and stainless steel felt.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4613,'2024-12-02 22:24:26','2025-01-26 21:23:11'),(4615,'Sintered titanium filter','sintered-titanium-filter','<h3>Technical data:</h3>\r\n<table><colgroup><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"146\">Filtration precision</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">0.45－30um</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"146\">Filtration efficiency</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">&gt;99%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"146\">Working pressure</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">&lt;0.6MP</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"146\">Working temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">&lt;300℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"146\">Workflow</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">0.15－30T/h</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\r\n1.good airtight and not easy to be damaged. It can work regularly in bad conditions.\r\n2.Without any adsorption and retention, and don’t change the previous media.\r\n3.With the Non-toxic, non-magnetic, non-shedding, biological blending performance,the titanium rod filter is widely used in the pharmaceutical industry, food and beverage industry.\r\n4.Small footprint and high temperature resistance.\r\n5.Easy assembly and disassembly.\r\n6.High filtration precision.\r\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\r\n<table><colgroup><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\"><strong>Model number</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"33\"><strong>Size</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"50\"><strong>Number</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"119\"><strong>Bore diameter(μm）</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"125\"><strong>Filter pressure(Mpa)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"113\"><strong>Water flow(T/h)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"75\"><strong>Size</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-1</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ100</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">0.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">100×600</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-2</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ180</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">1.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">280×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-3</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ220</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">320×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-4</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ280</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">7</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">3.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">440×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-5</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ300</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">9</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">4.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">480×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-6</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ350</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">12</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">540×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-7</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ400</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">15</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">7.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">580×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"89\">ES-T-8</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">φ450</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">17</td>\r\n<td width=\"119\">Optional</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"113\">8.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">650×850</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<strong>Note: The filter media’s bore diameter is usually 0.5μm-100μm. </strong>\r\n<h3>Before you choose the sintered titanium filter, please refer to the following parameters:</h3>\r\n1.Water flow\r\n2. Temperature of filter media\r\n3.Chemical property of filter media\r\n4.Viscosity of filter media\r\n5. Required accuracy\r\n<h3>Applications:</h3>\r\n• Corrosive liquids and gases • Cryogenic fluids • High viscosity solutions • Process steam • High temperature liquids and gases • Catalyst recovery\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4616\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ST3-270x270-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"358\" height=\"358\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4617\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ST4-300x250-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"293\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4618\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ST5-300x248-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"348\" height=\"288\" />','Sintered titanium filter adopts stainless ssstell 316 or 304 materials shell and sintered titanium filter cartridge. Therefore it has excellent mechanical properties, high and low temperature resistance and chemical stability. Philite ® can produce all kinds filter cartridge, besides we welcome customized order.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4619,'2024-12-02 22:26:53','2024-12-02 22:26:53'),(4621,'Sintered titanium filter cartridge','sintered-titanium-filter-cartridge','<h3>Performance：</h3>\r\n1.Well-distributed structure, narrow bore diameter, high separation efficiency.\r\n2.High porosity, low filtration resistance, efficient penetration, which can up to 95％～99.9％.\r\n3.High temperature resistance, can work regularly in the 280℃。\r\n4.Good chemical stability, acid resistance, alkali resistance, antioxidant.\r\n5.Non particle shedding, meets food grade and GMP.\r\n6.Good mechanical properties, simple operation.\r\n7.Low differential pressure, small footprint.\r\n8. Good Anti-microbial ability, doesn’t react with microbes.\r\n9. Good molding process, the overall no welding length can up to 1000 mm.\r\n10. Easy-washing, long service life.\r\n<h3>Techincal parameters( Allow ≤250°C the conditions of using)</h3>\r\n<table><colgroup><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /><col width=\"72\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">Filtering level</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">Filtering precision(μm）</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Maximum Aperture (μm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">Permeability (m3/h.m2.kpa)</td>\r\n<td width=\"92\">Thickness(mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">Compressive strength (Mpa/cm2)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T9</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">0.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">1.5</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"9\" width=\"92\">0.5-5</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T8</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">0.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T7</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T6</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">10</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">15</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T5</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">15</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">40</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">2.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T4</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">10</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">30</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">120</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">2.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T3</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">20</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">60</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">250</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">2.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T2</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">30</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">2.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"79\">T1</td>\r\n<td width=\"139\">50</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">160</td>\r\n<td width=\"90\">800</td>\r\n<td width=\"126\">2.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Advantages:</h3>\r\n1.Resistance to repated washing, long service life.\r\n2.Very good chemical stability.\r\n3.Excellent high voltage.\r\n4.High temperature resistance, corrision resistance.\r\n5.High mechanical strength, not easy to damage.\r\n<h3>Connector type:</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4623\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-1-detail1-300x129.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"633\" height=\"272\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Working environment:</strong></h3>\r\nNitric acid, sulfuric acid, acetic acid, oxalic acid, phosphoric acid, 5% hydrochloric acid, molten sodium, hydrogen, nitrogen, hydrogen sulfide, acetylene, water vapor, hydrogen, gas, carbon dioxide gas environment .\r\n<h3>Application:</h3>\r\n♦Pharmaceutical Industry\r\n♦Chemical industry\r\n♦Electronic Industry\r\n♦Water Treatment Industry\r\n♦Sewage Treatment\r\n♦Food Industry\r\n♦Oil refining industry','Sintered titanium filter cartridge also be called sintered titanium filter element. With excellent mechanical properties, high and low temperature resistance and chemical stability, it is widely used in liquid decarbonization and gas filter. Besides the standard size of length 50mm, 60mm, 70mm, Dia of 5”, 10”,20”, 30”, 40”, we welcome your customized order.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4624,'2024-12-02 22:29:03','2024-12-02 22:29:04'),(4626,'Stainless steel cartridge','stainless-steel-cartridge','Stainless steel cartridge mainly adopts stainless steel sintered fiber felt and stainless steel woven mesh, processed by folding wave technology. Stainless steel sintered cartridge can be made of multi-layer structure, has high porosity, high dirty holding capacity.\r\n<strong>Outside Dia.</strong>: 30~180mm\r\n<strong>Length</strong>: 100~1200mm\r\n<strong>Pleat Ht</strong>: 5~25mm\r\n<strong>Filter rating</strong>: 0.5~150μm\r\n<strong>Connector</strong>: Thread flange or ring sealing\r\n<strong>Filter medium</strong>: 2-layered, 3-layered or more wire mesh composites\r\n<strong>Inner support</strong>: perforated plate or spiral tube inner support\r\n<h3>Features of stainless steel cartridge：</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Stable dimensions.The ability to withstand alternative forces and shock resistance is superior to other metal filtration media;</li>\r\n 	<li>Stable filtration efficiency and permeability;</li>\r\n 	<li>Superior mechanical strength, and suitable to be used in high temperature, high pressure and strong corrosive applications; especially suitable to high temperature gas filtration;</li>\r\n 	<li> Shapes and precision can be customized according your requirements, connectors can be welded onto tubes;</li>\r\n 	<li> Good filtering performance;</li>\r\n 	<li>Good corrosion resistance, heat resistance, pressure resistance, wear resistance;</li>\r\n 	<li>Stainless steel filter pore uniform, accurate filtering precision; flow rate per unit area is large;</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitable for low temperature, high-temperature environment; can be reused after cleaning.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Specification of stainless steel cartridge ：</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Grade</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Outer dia.(mm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Length(mm)</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Connection thread</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Tail thread</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Filtration area(m²)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C-60A</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>1239</td>\r\n<td>M42*2</td>\r\n<td>M8</td>\r\n<td>0.86-1.00</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C-60B</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>1215</td>\r\n<td>M42*2</td>\r\n<td>M8</td>\r\n<td>0.84-0.97</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C-60C</td>\r\n<td>60</td>\r\n<td>900</td>\r\n<td>M36*3</td>\r\n<td>M8</td>\r\n<td>0.63-0.68</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C-35A</td>\r\n<td>35</td>\r\n<td>425</td>\r\n<td>3/4’’ 16UNF or M20*1.5</td>\r\n<td>M5 or M6</td>\r\n<td>0.17-0.20</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C-35B</td>\r\n<td>35</td>\r\n<td>485</td>\r\n<td>3/4’’ 16UNF or M20*1.5</td>\r\n<td>M5 or M6</td>\r\n<td>0.20-0.23</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>C-35C</td>\r\n<td>35</td>\r\n<td>525</td>\r\n<td>3/4’’ 16UNF or M20*1.5</td>\r\n<td>M5 or M6</td>\r\n<td>0.22-0.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Examples of main applications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Polymer filtration, petrochemical industry;</li>\r\n 	<li>Electronic high temperature gas dust removal;</li>\r\n 	<li>Machinery and equipment of various hydraulic oil, lubricating oil precision filtration;</li>\r\n 	<li>All kinds of liquid clarification filtration in medicine, biology, beverages indust</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4628\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/corrugated-candle-filter-detail1_syy-300x225.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"378\" />','Stainless steel cartridge also can be called corrugated candle filter. It is made of different diameter felt, has good strength, high temperature resistant, it not easy to fall off, easy to clean, and it is economic.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4627,'2024-12-02 22:30:58','2024-12-02 22:30:58'),(4630,'6’’-16’’ Large-Diameter Electromagnetic Pulse Valves','6-16-large-diameter-electromagnetic-pulse-valves','<h3><strong>Type Definition  </strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4632\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/5-detail-300x127.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"183\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Specification</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">No.</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Type Specification</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">Nominal Diameter</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">Diaphragm</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">Blowing Capacity (0.1Mpa, 200ms)(under standard conditions)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-N-150mm(6’’)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">150</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">1.6NM3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-N-200mm(8’’)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">2NM3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-N-250mm(10’’)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">250</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">2.4NM3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-N-300mm(12’’)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">300</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">2.7NM3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-N-350mm(14’’)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">350</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">3.1NM3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-N-400mm(16’’)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"248\">3.5NM3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Technical Data</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Operating Pressure</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">0.08MPa-0.15MPa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Air Source Medium</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">Clean Air</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Protection Grade</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">IP65</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Voltage</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">DC24V, AC220, AC110V</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">-25℃-120℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Ambient Temperature</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">-10℃-50℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"174\">Diaphragm Lifespan</td>\r\n<td width=\"394\">One million blows or 3 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>R&amp;D History</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The company has began to develop large 6’’-16’’ valves since 2005;</li>\r\n 	<li>Trial production in 2006;</li>\r\n 	<li>Mass production in 2008.</li>\r\n</ul>','<ul>\r\n 	<li>Specially developed for the rotary blowing technology.</li>\r\n 	<li>Advanced testing devices are provided.</li>\r\n 	<li>Great flow capacity, small pressure loss, great blowing performance and long lifespan.</li>\r\n 	<li>Complete specifications.Two structures for choices: one with a pulse valve body and the other without.</li>\r\n 	<li>Great switching performance, reducing unnecessary air loss and cutting down the operating costs.</li>\r\n 	<li>Large valve diaphragm components of different models may be customized.Larger valves can be used as substitutes for imported products, lifetime maintenance provided.</li>\r\n 	<li>For each large valve, a pressure test was done and a test curve chart attached.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4631,'2024-12-02 22:37:01','2024-12-02 22:37:02'),(4634,'Electromagnetic Pulse Valve and Pulse Valve','electromagnetic-pulse-valve-and-pulse-valve','<h3><strong><b>Brief Introduction</b></strong></h3>\r\nThe electromagnetic pulse valves developed, produced and sold by the Company include:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Right-angle electromagnetic pulse valves</li>\r\n 	<li>Embedded electromagnetic pulse valve and pulse valve</li>\r\n 	<li>Right-angle nut type electromagnetic pulse valves</li>\r\n 	<li>Straight-through electromagnetic pulse valves</li>\r\n 	<li>6’’-16’’ large-diameter electromagnetic pulse valves</li>\r\n 	<li>Corresponding pulse valves (pneumatic valves)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong><b>Technical Data</b></strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Operating Pressure</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"385\">0.1-0.8Mpa(Recommended 0.2-0.6 Mpa)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Working Medium</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"385\">Clean Air</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Voltage</td>\r\n<td width=\"100\">DC24V</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">AC110V</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">AC220V</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Current</td>\r\n<td width=\"100\">1A</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">0.46A</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">0.23A</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"3\" width=\"183\">Temperature Level</td>\r\n<td width=\"100\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"100\">-25℃ – 80℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">-25℃ – 230℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"100\">-13°F -176°F</td>\r\n<td width=\"142\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"142\">-13°F -446°F</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Relative Humidity of Air</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"385\">≤85%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Degree of Protection</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"385\">IP65</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"183\">Life Expectancy</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"385\">One million blows or 3 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"568\">Notes:1. Both the electromagnetic pulse valves and the pulse valves may be installed with a muffler.&nbsp;\r\n\r\n2. The electromagnetic pulse valves may be installed with a certified explosion -proof solenoid.\r\n\r\n3. The pulse valves (pneumatic valves) may be connected with hoses with a diameter of 6, 8, 10mm, etc.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong><b>Materials</b></strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Body</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Aluminum Alloy</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Clamp Spring</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Stainless Steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Pilot Component</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Stainless Steel, etc.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Diaphragm</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Nitrile RubberFluoro Rubber(High Temperature Valve)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Spring</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Stainless Steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Fastener</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">Stainless Steel</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"568\">Notes:1. According to testing results given by Shanghai Institute of Measurement and Testing Technology, the valves comply with the technical requirements in GB4208-2008.2. All the diaphragms are imported and finished with quality as high as that of imported diaphragms. All the diaphragm components are inspected during manufacturing and only those conforming are accepted in the assembly line. After electrical and compressed air components air connection, a blowing test is done for each finished valve.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','The electromagnetic pulse valve (also called the diaphragm valve) is the compressed air “switch” of the dust-cleaning jet system of the pulse bag-house. Controlled by the output signal of the pulse jet controller, they realize jetting dust cleaning for the bag filter row by row (or chamber by chamber) to keep the operating resistance of the bag-house within the set range, thus guaranteeing the high processing ability and dust-collecting efficiency of the bag-house.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4635,'2024-12-02 22:38:22','2024-12-02 22:38:22'),(4637,'Embedded Electromagnetic Pulse Valves and Pulse Valves','embedded-electromagnetic-pulse-valves-and-pulse-valves','<h3><strong>Type Definition</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4638\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2-detail-300x117.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\" height=\"183\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Specification</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">DMF-Y-25</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">DMF-Y-40S</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">DMF-Y-50S</td>\r\n<td width=\"128\">DMF-Y-62S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">Ø96</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">Ø112</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Ø160</td>\r\n<td width=\"128\">Ø188</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">28.82/33.63</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">47.36/55.27</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">62.09/72.46</td>\r\n<td width=\"128\">136.58/159.39</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">8-10</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">12-16</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">18-28</td>\r\n<td width=\"128\">27-38</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">G1’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">G1½’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Ø60</td>\r\n<td width=\"128\">Ø75</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">0.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">1.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"128\">3.0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">DMF-Y-76S</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">DMF-YA-76S</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">DMF-YB-76S</td>\r\n<td width=\"129\">DMF-Y-102S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">Ø202</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">Ø195</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Ø202</td>\r\n<td width=\"129\">Ø255</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">165.84/193.54</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">166.2/194.0</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">165.84/193.54</td>\r\n<td width=\"129\">268.29/313.09</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">37-65</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">37-65</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">37-65</td>\r\n<td width=\"129\">70-90</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">Ø89</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">Ø89</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">Ø89</td>\r\n<td width=\"129\">Ø114</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">3.7</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">2.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">2.95</td>\r\n<td width=\"129\">5.65</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"167\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">DMF-Y-102SA</td>\r\n<td width=\"122\">DMF-Y-102SE</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"167\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Ø204</td>\r\n<td width=\"122\">Ø225</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"167\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">242.35/282.82</td>\r\n<td width=\"122\">252.1/294.2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"167\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">55-80</td>\r\n<td width=\"122\">70-90</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"167\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Ø102</td>\r\n<td width=\"122\">Ø114</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"167\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">3.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"122\">5.0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','DMF-Y electromagnetic pulse valves are embedded valves (also called submerged valves) which are directly installed on the manifold box. They have better flow characteristics and operated with a reduced pressure loss. Therefore they are suitable for places with lower air pressures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4639,'2024-12-02 22:40:31','2024-12-02 22:40:32'),(4641,'Piston Valves','piston-valves','<h3><strong>Type Definition</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4642\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/6-detail-300x129.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"195\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Technical Specification</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">Operating Pressure</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"408\">0.2-0.4MPa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">Degree of Protection</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"408\">IP65</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">Ambient Temperature</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"408\">-10℃-50℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">Air Source Medium</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"408\">Those non-corrosive clean gases with adjustable pressure &amp; temperature lower than 55℃, filtered air with particles smaller than 5um and after removal of oil and moisture.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">Voltage</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">InrushVA</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">HoldingVA</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">Power consumption</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">DC24V</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">/</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">21W</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">AC220V</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">28.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">13.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">6.6W</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">AC110V</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">28.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">13.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"136\">6.6W</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Operational Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"568\">Only when used under permissible conditions can the diaphragm valves be safe and reliable and their performance guaranteed, otherwise users will be responsible for any damage and injuries caused as a result of not adhering to the service conditions.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"568\">Before installing the electromagnetic pulse valves, clean the piping systems(including the air tanks) and ensure no foreign matters such as rust and welding slag.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"568\">After continuous running, the surface temperature of the solenoids may reach up to 120℃.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"568\">Prevent the air source from freezing, otherwise the electromagnetic pulse valves will fail to run.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"568\">Make sure the power supply is disconnected when installing an electromagnetic pulse valve.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"568\">An AC solenoids used when there is no guide tube component or armature will be burnt.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Electrical Connection</strong></h3>\r\nSolenoids connection should comply with electrical rules. Make sure the cable inlet is properly sealed and the “+” and “-” signs of the terminals are correctly marked; the part with a “〨” sign is the grounding pin. If there is no sign, the supply line maybe connected with any terminal.','Piston valves are electromagnetic pulse valves too. Pistons are used as substitutes for rubber diaphragms in some special conditions.\r\n\r\nPiston pulse valves with a compact structure are suitable for some special conditions such as high temperatures, strong acids and alkaline, rubber inexistence, etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4643,'2024-12-02 22:42:56','2024-12-02 22:42:56'),(4645,'Right-angle Electromagnetic Pulse Valves and Pulse Valves','right-angle-electromagnetic-pulse-valves-and-pulse-valves','<h3><strong>Type Definition</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4648\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-detail-300x118.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"536\" height=\"211\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Specification</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">DMF-Z-20</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">DMF-Z-25</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">DMF-Z-40S</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">DMF-Z-50S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">Ø80</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">Ø96</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Ø112</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">Ø160</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">17.55/20.48</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">26.16/30.53</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">45.82/53.47</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">61.24/71.47</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">3.5-6</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">8-10</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">12-16</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">18-28</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">G3/4’’G3/4’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">G1’’G1’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">G1½’’G1½’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">G2’’G2’’</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"104\">0.65</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">0.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">1.4</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">2.4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">DMF-Z-62S</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">DMF-Z-76S</td>\r\n<td width=\"112\">DMF-Z-102S</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">DMF-2L-B</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">Ø188</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">Ø202</td>\r\n<td width=\"112\">Ø255</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">Ø90</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">129.26/150.85</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">159.95/186.66</td>\r\n<td width=\"112\">260/303</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">16.95/19.78</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">27-38</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">37-65</td>\r\n<td width=\"112\">70-90</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">3.5-6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">G2½’’G2½’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">G3’’G3’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"112\">G4’’G4’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">G3/4’’Ø27</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"133\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">3.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">4.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"112\">7.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">0.75</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Right-angle Electromagnetic Pulse Valves and Pulse Valves</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"155\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"105\">DMF-ZF-25</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">DMF-ZF-40S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"155\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"105\">Ø96</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">Ø112</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"155\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"105\">26.16/30.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">45.82/53.47</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"155\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"105\">8-10</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">12-16</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"155\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"105\">Ø34Ø34</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">Ø48Ø48</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"155\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"105\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"127\">1.6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','DMF-Z electromagnetic pulse valves are right-angle valves. The inclined angle between its air inlet and air outlet is 90°. They are suitable for connecting air tank with blowing tubes for bag filters. With a smooth air flow, they can provide efficient dust-cleaning air pulse.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4647,'2024-12-02 22:45:35','2024-12-02 22:45:35'),(4650,'Right-angle Nut Type Electromagnetic Pulse Valves','right-angle-nut-type-electromagnetic-pulse-valves','<h3><strong>Type Definition</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4652\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/3-detail-300x132.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"204\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Specification</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">DMF-ZM-20</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">DMF-ZM-25</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">DMF-ZM-40S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">Ø80</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">Ø96</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Ø114</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">17.55/20.48</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">26.16/30.53</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">45.82/53.47</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">3.5-6</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">8-10</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">12-16</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">Ø27Ø27</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">Ø34Ø34</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Ø48Ø48</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">1.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">2.0</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','DMF-ZM electromagnetic pulse valves are right-angle valves, the same as those of the “Z” series. They are suitable for connecting air tank to the blow tubes. Their inlets and outlets are provided with retaining nuts for installation purposes, for easy installation and operation of the valves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4651,'2024-12-02 22:47:24','2024-12-02 22:47:25'),(4654,'Straight-through Electromagnetic Pulse Valves','straight-through-electromagnetic-pulse-valves','<h3><strong>Type Definition</strong></h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4655\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/4-detail-300x108.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"210\" />\r\n<h3><strong>Specification</strong></h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">DMF-T-20</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">DMF-T-25S</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">DMF-T-40S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">Ø96</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">Ø112</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Ø127</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">15.78/18.42</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">18.55/21.65</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">45.62/53.24</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">3.5-6</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">8-10</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">12-16</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">G3/4’’G3/4’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">G1’’G1’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">G1½’’G1½’’</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"103\">0.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"108\">1.4</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">1.8</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">DMF-T-50S</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">DMF-T-62S</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Diaphragm Diameter (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">Ø160</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Ø202</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Flow Coefficient(Kv/Cv)</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">50.77/59.25</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">111.67/130.32</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Blowing Area (m2)</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">18-28</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">27-38</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Air Inlet/Outlet Size</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">G2’’G2’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">G2½’’G2½’’</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"156\">Weight (kg)</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">2.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"156\">4.1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','DMF-T electromagnetic pulse valves are straight-through valves.The inclined angle between its air inlet and outlet is 180°(the center line of the air inlet and that of the air outlet are on the same straight line). They are suitable for connecting the air inlets with the air cylinders, or the air outlets with the blow tubes. With a smooth air flow, they can provide an efficient, dust-cleaning air pulse.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4656,'2024-12-02 22:49:12','2024-12-02 22:49:12'),(4682,'Bag Filter for Clinker Cooler','bag-filter-for-clinker-cooler','<h4>Main working conditions and dust collection requirement of clinker cooler:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"876\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"384\" height=\"29\">Dust Collection Type</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"492\">Outer-filtering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Treatment Air Capacity</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2500T/D≈330000m3/h, 5000T/D≈670000m3/h</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Filtration Velocity</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1.0m/min</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Entrance Dust Density</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤100g/Nm3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Emission Concentration Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤30g/Nm3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Inlet &amp; Outlet Pressure Differential</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1500Pa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Working Temperature</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">180<span class=\"font0\">℃</span><span class=\"font1\">, ≤260</span><span class=\"font0\">℃</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Regular Filter Bag Size</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Dia. 160X6000-8000mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Regular Service Life Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2-3 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Commonly used filter bag fabric chosen of clinker cooler:</h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass Woven Fabric With PTFE Membrane</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex (Aramid) Needle Felt</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 Needle Felt</li>\r\n 	<li>FMS Needle Felt</li>\r\n</ol>','<strong>Working Temperature</strong>: 150℃~260℃\r\n<strong>Main Material</strong>: Nomex(Aramid), P84, FMS needle felt, Fiberglass woven fabric, etc.\r\n<strong>Finish Treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing, PTFE impregnation, PTFE membrane\r\n<strong>Diameter&amp;Length</strong>: Customized\r\n<strong>Capacity</strong>: 2000 pcs per day\r\n<strong>Customization Accepted.</strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4683,'2024-12-03 09:51:04','2024-12-03 09:51:06'),(4689,'Candle Filter Bags','candle-filter-bags','<h3>Candle Filter Working Principle</h3>\r\nCandle Filters are named based on their shape. These filter elements are usually hollow tubes with a cap on the bottom and a threaded connector on top that attaches to a header. The outer face of the tube is usually made of punch plate, expanded metal, sintered metal, or porous ceramic to provide support for the filter media.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Feed to the filter is always positioned at the lower portion of the vessel to allow up-flow of the incoming slurry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Desired for maintaining fast setting solids in a homogeneous suspension and thus ensuring that uniform cakes are formed.</li>\r\n 	<li>An uneven cake thickness that tapers up interferes with the efficiency of cake washing and reduces the effective volume of the cake that accumulates on the filtering elements.</li>\r\n 	<li>To control the up-flow velocity an overflow connection is positioned on the dished top and the selected pump must be sized to deliver a higher rate than required for the calculated material balance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4695\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Candle-Filter-Principle-detail1-300x217.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"892\" height=\"645\" />\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Candle filter bags can be used repeatedly. When the filter material is damaged or too much dirt accumulates, they need to be replaced.</li>\r\n 	<li>Candle filter bags adopt a closed design with no seams, impurities are not easy to leak out, avoiding pollution to the environment and human body, and have a long service life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4694\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Candle-Filter-Cloth-detail2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"881\" height=\"587\" />\r\n<h3>Technical Parameter of Candle Filter Bags</h3>\r\nCandle Filter fabric media is woven from high-quality polypropylene, nylon, PTFE, polyester and cotton textiles into various styles, with a filtration range from 1 to 900 microns. Fabric media also allows for higher flow rates.\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"98\">Product Code</td>\r\n<td width=\"70\">Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Yarn Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">Weight (g/m²)</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"138\">Air Permeability&nbsp;\r\n\r\n(L/m²/S @125pa)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"98\">ES-PCD18PB</td>\r\n<td width=\"70\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Multi/Multi</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">390</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">0.76</td>\r\n<td width=\"138\">22</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"98\"> ES-PCD03P</td>\r\n<td width=\"70\">PP</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Multi/Multi</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">430</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">0.71</td>\r\n<td width=\"138\">3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"98\">ES-TCD240DFB</td>\r\n<td width=\"70\">PE</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Multi/Multi</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">225</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"138\">289</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"98\"> ES-PPSCD20T</td>\r\n<td width=\"70\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Multi/Multi</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">420</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">0.85</td>\r\n<td width=\"138\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"98\">ES-PEEK</td>\r\n<td width=\"70\">PEEK</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Multi/Multi</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">430</td>\r\n<td width=\"86\">0.61</td>\r\n<td width=\"138\">12</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Application Fields</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Pharmaceutical Filters.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fine Chemistry Filters.</li>\r\n 	<li>Food Industry Filters.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fuel and Oil Additive Filters.</li>\r\n 	<li>Hazardous Materials Filters.</li>\r\n 	<li>Precious Metal and other Catalyst Recovery Filters.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4696\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Candle-Filters-01-detail3-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"288\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4697\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Chemistry-Filters-02-detail4-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"289\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Candle filter bags are a type of filtration media used in industrial applications, typically in liquid filtration systems. They are called “candle filters” because of their long, cylindrical shape, resembling candles. These bags are used in pressure or vacuum filtration systems where high-efficiency filtration is required, often in processes such as chemical, pharmaceutical, food, beverage, or water treatment industries. Candle filter bags can be designed as non-woven and woven types. Due to regeneration issues, woven filter bags are more commonly used.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material:</strong> PP, PE, PA, PTFE, PPS, PEEK.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weaving Methods:</strong> Plain, Twill, Satin.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Diameter:</strong> φ90, φ80, φ75, φ120.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4690,'2024-12-03 09:55:31','2024-12-03 09:55:31'),(4699,'Cement Filter Bags','cement-filter-bags','<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4704\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/air-slide-fabric-for-cement-02-detail2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"288\" /><img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4705\" style=\"font-weight: inherit;\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cement-plant-filtration-detail1-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"431\" height=\"287\" /><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span>\r\n<h3>Selection of Filter Bags for Dust Collectors in Cement Plants</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High temperature resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>High chemical resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Flame-proof and explosion-proof.</li>\r\n 	<li>Lime Industry:</li>\r\n 	<li>High abrasion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Discharge of electrostatic charges.</li>\r\n 	<li>Low resistance, good air permeability and good peelability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long service life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Work Process</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4706\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/fc_zement-detail3-300x198.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"605\" height=\"399\" />\r\n<table class=\"contenttable contenttable-0 legende\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-even tr-0\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">1</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Quarry</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">2</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Crusher plant</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">3</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Raw material homogenization</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">4</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Aggregates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-odd tr-1\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">5</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Raw mill feeding silo</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">6</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Main stack</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">7</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Bag filter for kiln/raw mill</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">8</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Vertical raw mill</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-even tr-2\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">9</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Raw material feeding silo</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">10</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Gas conditioning tower</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">11</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Bag filter for alkali bypass</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">12</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Bypass mixing chamber</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-odd tr-3\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">13</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Cyclone pre-heater</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">14</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Raw coal</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">15</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Vertical coal grinding mill</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">16</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Bag filter for coal grinding plant</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-even tr-4\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">17</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Tubular cooler</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">18</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Bag filter for clinker cooler</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">19</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Clinker cooler</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">20</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Rotary kiln</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-odd tr-5\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">21</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Clinker silo</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">22</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Gypsum</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">23</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Minerals</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">24</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Separator</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"tr-even tr-last\">\r\n<td class=\"td-0\">25</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-1\">Cement finish mill</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-2\">26</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-3\">Bag filter for cement finish mill</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-4\">27</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-5\">Packaging plant</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-6\">28</td>\r\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Palletization plant</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"bwfTextImage\">\r\n<h3>Filtration Solutions Expert – Philite®</h3>\r\nProduct quality and compliance with dust emission limits are core requirements for dusting in the cement, gypsum and lime industry. The choice of filter media is of paramount importance in cement kilns where there are high NOx levels due to high combustion temperatures. Philite® filter media range offers for each process in the cement, gypsum and lime industry technically sophisticated solutions.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Excellent Material Selection</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe fiber has high strength, good stability andheat resistance.and can be customized ondemand.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4707\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail4-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"431\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Lathe Sewing</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe special stitcher for normal temperature cloth bag shall be selected to seal the edges of three times without disconnection.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4708\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Philite®-factory-10-detail5-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"643\" height=\"429\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Supporting Cage Skeleton</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe supporting cage of dust removal bag iscarefully inspected before leaving the factory.It has high perpendicularity, beautiful andsmooth welding, and there is no open weldingburr, missing welding, etc.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4709\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filter-Bag-Cages-detail6-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"645\" height=\"430\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Customization</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAccording to the customer’s requirements,the products are treated with singeing, roughening, water repellent, covering, etc.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4710\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filter-bag-singeing-detail7-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"648\" height=\"432\" />\r\n<div class=\"bwfTextImage\">\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Filter Bags for Cement Plants</h3>\r\nThe material selection of filter bags in cement plants usually takes into account their performance requirements in terms of high temperature resistance, corrosion resistance, wear resistance and filtration efficiency. The following are common cement plant filter bag materials:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Polyester (PET)</strong>: Polyester fiber is a commonly used filter bag material with good high temperature resistance and chemical stability, and is suitable for the filtration needs of general cement production.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Aramid(Nomex)</strong>: Aramid fiber has a dense structure and can effectively capture fine dust particles and improve filtration efficiency. Compared with some other high-temperature fibers, aramid has better hydrolysis resistance and can be used in high-humidity environments.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Acrylic (AC)</strong>: Acrylic fiber is usually used to filter chemically corrosive gases in cement plants and has good corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)</strong>: PTFE filter bags have excellent high temperature resistance and chemical stability, and are suitable for filtration of high temperature and highly corrosive gases, but the cost is relatively high.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fiberglass</strong>: Glass fiber filter bags have good high temperature resistance and chemical stability, are suitable for high temperature gas filtration, and have high mechanical strength and wear resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>PPS (polyphenylene sulfide)</strong>: PPS is a synthetic fiber with good high temperature resistance and chemical resistance, suitable for filtration in high temperature flue gas.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>P84 (polyamide fiber)</strong>: P84 fiber has excellent high temperature resistance and chemical stability, and is suitable for high temperature gas filtration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Material Specifications</h3>\r\n<table class=\"all magic-9\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i60.71aa7cebgCvf8q\">Material Fiber</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Polyester (Dacron)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Homopolymer Acrylic</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Aramid (Nomex)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Felted Fiberglass</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Polymid (P84)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Polytetraflour ethylene PTFE Membrane(Teflon)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Polyphenylene Sulfide(Ryton) PPS</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Characteristics</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\"></div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Upper temperature-continuous dry heat(degrees C)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">132</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">140</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">204</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">260</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">260</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">260</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">190</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Maximum temperature-surge dry heat(degrees C)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">150</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">140</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">232</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">550F</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Up to 500 F</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">290</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">232</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Supports combustion (note 1)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Yes</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Yes</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">No</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">No</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">No</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">No</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">No</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Supports combustion (note 1)</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Poor</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Resistanoe to alkalis</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Very Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Resistance to mineral acids</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Resistance to organic acids</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Poor</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Not Recommended</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Resistance to oxidizing agents</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Very Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Very Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Resistance to organic solvents</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Very Good</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Average</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Very Good</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Tensile Strength</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-12\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\"></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Fair</div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Excellent</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<h4>Cement Plant Filter Bag Testing</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;','<h4>Material Selection</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Polyester (PET).</li>\r\n 	<li>Aramid(Nomex).</li>\r\n 	<li>Acrylic (AC).</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene).</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass.</li>\r\n 	<li>PPS (polyphenylene sulfide).</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 (polyamide fiber).</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4700,'2024-12-03 10:05:51','2024-12-03 10:05:51'),(4712,'Centrifuge Filter Bags','centrifuge-filter-bags','Centrifuges operate on the principle of centrifugal force and a filter cloth to separate solids from liquids. High rotational speed provides high centrifugal force that allows the suspended solid in the feed to settle on the surface of a filter media. Washing processes can be applied at the same rotational speed and in the same centrifuge vessel. Centrifuges are used in discontinuous or batch operations. The use of dedicated our fabrics allows reduction of the residual moisture in the filter cake to minimum values.\r\n<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>performance</td>\r\n<td>PE</td>\r\n<td>nylon</td>\r\n<td>PP</td>\r\n<td>Vinylon</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Acid resistance</td>\r\n<td>strong</td>\r\n<td>poor</td>\r\n<td>good</td>\r\n<td>not acid resistant</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Alkali resistant</td>\r\n<td>weak alkali resistant</td>\r\n<td>good</td>\r\n<td>strong</td>\r\n<td>strong alkali resistant</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Elongation at break</td>\r\n<td>30%-40%</td>\r\n<td>18%-45%</td>\r\n<td>greater than polyester</td>\r\n<td>12%-15%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Responsiveness</td>\r\n<td>very good</td>\r\n<td>recovery rate above 90% at 10% elongation</td>\r\n<td>slightly better than PE</td>\r\n<td>very poor</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Wear resistance</td>\r\n<td>very good</td>\r\n<td>very good</td>\r\n<td>good</td>\r\n<td>preferably</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Heat resistance</td>\r\n<td>170ºC</td>\r\n<td>slight shrinkage at 130ºC</td>\r\n<td>slight shrinkage at 90ºC</td>\r\n<td>shrinkage at 100ºC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Melting point</td>\r\n<td>255-265ºC</td>\r\n<td>210-215ºC</td>\r\n<td>165-170ºC</td>\r\n<td>220ºC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<strong>\r\nDepending on the grade of automation, bulk size and solid discharge, there are different types of centrifuges in use that require a filter media:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Bag centrifuge (top discharge).</li>\r\n 	<li>Peeler centrifuges (vertical and horizontal).</li>\r\n 	<li>Inverting filter centrifuge.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\nTypical applications are in life science, Pharmaceutical (API, insulin, oncology), fine chemicals where high purity and closed filter systems are required. Further applications are in food (starch &amp; tapioca), minerals (base and precious metals, coal, fertilizers and in environmental (FGD, gypsum).\r\n<h3>Fabrication Solutions</h3>\r\nPhilite®’s products for centrifuge filters are matched to the filter machines used, whether they are peeler centrifuges, bag centrifuges or inverting filter centrifuges. Our ready-made solutions are based on optimized designs that have been proven in use over many years. Thanks to our wide range of fabrication capabilities and technologies, we are able to provide customer-specific products for optimal fit and function.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4717\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/filter-fabric-cloth-detail2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"288\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4718\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/filter-fabric-yarn-detail1-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"435\" height=\"290\" />\r\n\r\nOur double layer fabrics technology combines a fine filter fabric (particle retention) and an integrated backing cloth (drainage) in one filter cloth. This fabric is available in a wide range of polymers, such as PP, PET giving our customers an excellent solution based on their chemical and thermal requirements.\r\n\r\n<strong>Our filter bags meet the highest quality requirements and offer decisive advantages:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Low downtime.</li>\r\n 	<li>High product yield.</li>\r\n 	<li>Ease of installation.</li>\r\n 	<li>Excellent cake release</li>\r\n</ul>','Philite® manufactures innovative solutions for all types of centrifuges used in the chemical, pharmaceutical and life science industries.Our products are made to meet the specific needs of these filtration applications.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filter Bag Sectional Shape</strong>: Round Bag.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cartridge Installation</strong>: Flange Mounting.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Density</strong>: Customizable.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Customizable.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtration Grade</strong>: Medium Filter.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filter Bag Environment</strong>: High-Temperature.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Origin</strong>: China.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4713,'2024-12-03 10:09:10','2024-12-03 10:09:10'),(4721,'Dust Extraction Bags','dust-extraction-bags','<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4726\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woodworking-Dust-Collector-02-detail2-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" /> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4727\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Woodworking-Dust-Collector-detail1-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" />\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Dust extraction bags are designed to effectively remove sawdust and debris from your workshop or manufacturing environment, ensuring thorough filtration and clean air output.</li>\r\n 	<li>With motor power options ranging from 2.2kW to 7.5kW, our dust collectors provide powerful suction power to effectively capture dust particles of various sizes. Whether you are dealing with fine sawdust or larger wood chips, our dust collectors ensure a clean and healthy working environment.</li>\r\n 	<li>Our dust collectors are available in two voltage options, 220V and 380V, making them compatible with a wide range of electrical systems. This flexibility allows you to easily integrate our dust collectors into your existing workshop setup without extensive modifications.</li>\r\n 	<li>Made of high-quality materials, our dust collectors are durable and can withstand the rigors of industrial use. The compact size makes them suitable for placement in small spaces, optimizing the floor space efficiency of your workshop.</li>\r\n 	<li>Despite their powerful performance, our dust collectors are lightweight and portable, weighing only 45-100 kg. This makes them easy to move and reposition as needed, allowing you to customize your dust collection setup for maximum efficiency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\r\n<table class=\"has-title hight-light-first-column all magic-10\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-11\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i45.19e27f23RolZN6\"><span class=\"magic-12\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i41.19e27f23RolZN6\">Model</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-13\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Style</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-14\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Motor power</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-15\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Voltage</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-16\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Air <span class=\"magic-17\">volume</span></span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-18\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Cloth bag diameter</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-19\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Dust suction port diameter</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-20\"><span class=\"magic-12\">Overall dimensions</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" r