pan class=\"magic-12\">70.9×27.6×86.6in/180x70x220cm</span></div></td>\r\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"magic-21\">\r\n\r\n<span class=\"magic-12\">About 100kg/</span><span class=\"magic-12\">220 pounds</span>\r\n\r\n</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;','Whether you operate a small woodworking shop or a large manufacturing facility, our industrial woodworking dust collectors provide the reliability, performance, and versatility you need to maintain a clean and safe work environment. Invest in our dust collectors and experience the difference they can make to the efficiency and quality of your woodworking operations.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Strong suction power.</li>\r\n 	<li>Good dust absorption effect.</li>\r\n 	<li>Large capacity.</li>\r\n 	<li>Low noise.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long service life.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to operate.</li>\r\n 	<li>Save time and effort.</li>\r\n 	<li>No dust leakage.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',4722,'2024-12-03 10:13:55','2024-12-03 10:13:55'),(5185,'Filter Bag for Coal Mill','filter-bag-for-coal-mill','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5190\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coal-Filtration-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" />\r\n<h4>Main working conditions and dust collection requirement of coal mill:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"1079\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"384\" height=\"29\">Dust Collection Type</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"695\">Outer-filtering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Treatment Air Capacity</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">5000T/D≈100000m3/h</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Filtration Velocity</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1.2m/min</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Entrance Dust Density</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1000g/Nm3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Emission Concentration Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤30g/Nm3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Inlet &amp; Outlet Pressure Differential</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1700Pa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Working Temperature</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤120<span class=\"font0\">℃</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Regular Filter Bag Size</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Dia. 130X2000-3500mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Regular Service Life Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Special Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Anti-static for anti-explosion</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Commonly used filter bag fabric chosen of coal mill:</h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Polyester Needle Felt With Anti-Static.</li>\r\n 	<li>Acrylic Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Polyester Needle Felt With Anti-Static And Water&amp;Oil Repellent.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 class=\"style-scope ytd-watch-metadata\">Top Filter Bag Manufacturers – Philite®</h3>','<strong>Working Temperature</strong>: ≤150℃\r\n<strong>Main Material</strong>: Polyester needle felt with anti-static, Acrylic needle felt, Polyester needle felt with anti-static and water&amp;oil repellent etc.\r\n<strong>Finish Treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing, Water&amp;Oil Repellent, Anti-static, PTFE Membrane\r\n<strong>Diameter&amp;Length</strong>: Customized\r\n<strong>Capacity</strong>: 2000 pcs per day\r\n<strong>Customization Accepted.</strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5186,'2024-12-06 22:18:24','2024-12-06 22:18:25'),(5192,'Filter Bag for Kiln & Raw Mill','filter-bag-for-kiln-raw-mill','The air pollutants emitted by the kiln cause great harm to the environment, so the technology of using dust filter bags to remove particulate matter from dusty gas to reduce its emission to the atmosphere is becoming more and more important.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5197\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" />\r\n<h4>Main working conditions and dust collection requirement of raw mill:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"1079\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"384\" height=\"29\">Dust Collection Type</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" width=\"695\">Outer-filtering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Treatment Air Capacity</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2500T/D≈480000m3/h, 5000T/D≈960000m3/h</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Filtration Velocity</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1.0m/min</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Entrance Dust Density</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤200g/Nm3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Emission Concentration Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤30g/Nm3</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Inlet &amp; Outlet Pressure Differential</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">≤1500Pa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Working Temperature</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">150<span class=\"font0\">℃</span><span class=\"font1\">, ≤260</span><span class=\"font0\">℃</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Regular Filter Bag Size</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">Dia. 160X6000-8000mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"et3\" height=\"29\">Regular Service Life Requirement</td>\r\n<td class=\"et3\">2-3 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Processing of dust filter bags</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Burning pressure treatment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe one-sided and double-sided needle-punched felt filter materials after burning and pressing treatment have incomparable advantages over ordinary filter bags, which greatly improves the dust-cleaning performance of the filter material.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Antistatic treatment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSome dusts will burn when encountering sparks in a certain concentration state. Therefore, for flammable and explosive dusts, it is advisable to use antistatic treated needle felt filter materials.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>PTFE coating treatment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhen the particle size of the dust is less than 1 micron, or the dust is very viscous, or the humidity of the gas is high, the ordinary filter material cannot be effectively filtered. The film-coated filter material made of polytetrafluoroethylene (Teflon) , with extremely high filtration accuracy, smooth surface, no dust adhesion, dust will not penetrate into the filter material, and achieve surface filtration.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water and oil repellent treatment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWe use fluorocarbon resin and PTFE impregnated oil-proof and waterproof treatment for the needle felt filter material. The filter bag is easier to capture dust for dust-laden wet gas (especially for water-absorbing and deliquescent dust), avoiding and reducing the problem of bag sticking.\r\n<h4>Commonly used filter bag fabric chosen of raw mill:</h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass Woven Fabric With PTFE Membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex (Aramid) Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>FMS Needle Felt.</li>\r\n</ol>','<strong>Working Temperature</strong>: 150℃~260℃\r\n<strong>Main Material</strong>: Nomex(Aramid), P84, FMS needle felt, Fiberglass woven fabric, etc.\r\n<strong>Finish Treatment</strong>: Calendering, Heat setting, Singeing, PTFE impregnation, PTFE membrane\r\n<strong>Diameter&amp;Length</strong>: Customized\r\n<strong>Capacity</strong>: 2000 pcs per day\r\n<strong>Customization Accepted.</strong>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5193,'2024-12-06 22:20:50','2024-12-06 22:21:32'),(5200,'Filter Bags for Asphalt Mixing Plants','filter-bags-for-asphalt-mixing-plants','Filter media in asphalt mixing plants are exposed to extreme environmental conditions and aggressive corrosive gases. Frequent temperature fluctuations and business creation and stops with different fuels and the resulting potential sparks put additional pressure on the filter media.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5201\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"808\" />\r\n\r\nAsphalt concrete mixing equipment have a first dust filter and secondary filter. Usually with only a small mixing factory need equipment dust; large mixing equipment have two-stage filteration for achieving the environmental dust requirements., As general, the first filtration is gravity or centrifugal dry scrubbers, wet dust is often two or dust bag . After wet dust back up to 400mg / m3, bag house dust back up to 50mg / m3. Early asphalt mixing plant is configured to filter out dry cyclone dust. Due to the dry cyclone dust can only remove large particles (&gt; 5 μm) dust, and the dust content of large particles of dust rarely. Massive emissions of less than 5μm fine dust. With the development of improved environmental requirements and dust removal technology, asphalt mixing equipment to achieve only through secondary dust emissions requirements. The secondary dedusting methods are two kinds of wet dust bag, dust to take a different way according to different requirements. First dust collector There is a cyclone dust collector, dust collector and two kinds of gravity. Cyclone simple structure, which is cylindrical dust collecting means, the air flow tangential entry, the dust is separated by centrifugal force. Cyclones can collect more than 5μm particle size of the dust collection efficiency is generally 5% to 85%. Gravity dust is reduced by the expansion tank of gas flow rate, by gravity so that large dust particles fall, trapping particles greater than 40μm in general.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Materials and Performance</h3>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\"><strong>Material</strong></td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance\"><strong>Temperature</strong>\r\n<strong>Resistance</strong></td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Chemical Resistance\"><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong></td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Durability\"><strong>Durability</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Nomex (Aramid)\">Nomex (Aramid)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 200C (392°F)\">Up to 200°C (392°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)\">PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 190C (374°F)\">Up to 190°C (374°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent (acid/alkali resistant)\">Excellent (acid/alkali resistant)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)\">PTFE(Polytetrafluoroethylene)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C (500°F)\">Up to 260°C (500°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Outstanding (chemically inert)\">Outstanding (chemically inert)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very High\">Very High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fiberglass\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C (500°F)\">Up to 260°C (500°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate (not good in acidic/alkaline environments)\">Moderate (not good in acidic/alkaline environments)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"P84 (Polyimide)\">P84 (Polyimide)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C (500°F)\">Up to 260°C (500°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent (acid\">Excellent (acidand hydrolysis resistant)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very High\">Very High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Typical Operating Conditions</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cont. Temperature (°C)</strong>: 100-200°C.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Peak Temperature  (°C)</strong>: Orientation to the maximum peak temperature of the fiber polymers used.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust</strong>: Asphalt, minerals.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust Properties</strong>: Abrasive.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust Source</strong>: Dryer, mixer, rotary kiln.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Harmful Gases</strong>: NOx, SOx Cleaning Process:Pulse jet, reverse air Fuels:Bio gas, fuel oil, heavy oil, liquid gas, natural gas, pulverised lignite.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Choose Philite® Filtration Solutions</h3>\r\nDepends on the composition and operating conditions of dust, Philite® offers technically and economically optimal media solution for dedusting filter your asphalt mixing plant .\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Multiple filter media options</strong>: We offer you a wide range of filter media to customize your filtration solution, each designed to meet specific operational needs and increase efficiency.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Effective filtration for all conditions</strong>: Whether dealing with abrasive, corrosive, hot or explosive dusts, our filter bags ensure optimal performance and safety.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Focus on demanding industries</strong>: We focus on industries that require stringent filtration, and our products are designed to meet the highest demands and challenges.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Enhanced performance and service life</strong>: Experience superior dust filtration with our advanced filter bags, designed to extend the life and efficiency of your filtration system.</li>\r\n</ul>','Filter bags for asphalt mixing plants are typically made from materials such as Nomex (aramid), PPS, or PTFE that can withstand the high temperatures and harsh conditions found in these plants. These filter bags capture particulate matter and prevent it from being released into the air during the asphalt production process.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Nomex (Aramid) needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE(Polytetrafluoroethylene) needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 (Polyimide) needle felt.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5202,'2024-12-06 22:23:51','2024-12-06 22:23:51'),(5207,'Filter Bags for Power Plants','filter-bags-for-power-plants','Filter bags for power plants are typically used in baghouse filtration systems to capture particulate emissions from combustion processes. These filter bags are designed to handle high temperatures and the fine particles produced by the burning of coal, biomass, or other fuels. These filter bags are essential for reducing emissions and maintaining environmental compliance in power generation processes.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5212\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/power-plant-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" />\r\n\r\nThe filtration principle of filter bags in power plants primarily relies on surface filtration and depth filtration mechanisms. These processes help capture particulate matter (PM) and other pollutants generated during combustion.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5213\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dust-collection-filter-bags-01-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"423\" height=\"282\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5214\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dust-collection-filter-bags-02-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"421\" height=\"280\" />\r\n<h3>Materials and Performance</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Filter Bag Material\">Filter Bag Material</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Max\">Max Continuous Temperature</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Max Short- Term Temperature\">Max Short-Term Temperature</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Acid Resistance\">Acid Resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Alkali Resistance\">Alkali Resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Oxidation Resistance\">Oxidation Resistance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)\">PPS (Polyphenylene\r\nSulfide)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"190°C (374°F)\">190°C (374°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"230°C (446°F)\">230°C (446°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fair\">Fair</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fair\">Fair</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Nomex (Aramid)\">Nomex (Aramid)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"204°C (400°F)\">204°C (400°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"240°C (464°F)\">240°C (464°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fair\">Fair</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Poor\">Poor</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE (Teflon)\">PTFE (Teflon)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"250°C (482°F)\">250°C (482°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"280°C (536°F)\">280°C (536°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fiberglass\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"260°℃ (500°F)\">260°℃ (500°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"300°C (572°F)\">300°C (572°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good\">Good</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Poor\">Poor</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fair\">Fair</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"P84\">P84(Polyimide)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"260°C (500°F)\">260°C (500°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"280°C (536°F)\">280°C (536°F)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent\">Excellent</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fair\">Fair</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fair\">Fair</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Notes:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Acid Resistance</strong>: Ranges from poor, fair, good, to excellent.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Alkali Resistance</strong>: Shows how well the material can resist alkaline environments.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Oxidation Resistance</strong>: Indicates how the material performs in oxidative atmospheres, important for handling high-temperature gases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Philite® – Dust Collection Filter Bags Manufacturer</h3>\r\nPhilite® dust collection filter bags achieve 99.9% filtration efficiency, capturing even submicron particles. They significantly reduce particulate matter emissions, ensuring compliance with environmental standards and helping power plants control air pollution.','During the power generation process, especially when burning coal, oil or gas, a large amount of smoke, dust and tiny particles will be generated. If not treated, these pollutants will be directly discharged into the atmosphere, causing serious air pollution and affecting human health and the ecological environment.  The main reasons why power plants use filter bags are to control and reduce particulate matter emissions in exhaust gases, protect the environment, ensure compliance with emission standards, and maintain the operating efficiency of power generation equipment.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Filter Bag Material</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>PPS (Polyphenylene) needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex (Aramid) needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE (Teflon) needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84(Polyimide) needle felt .</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5208,'2024-12-06 22:27:51','2024-12-06 22:27:51'),(5216,'Filter Bags for Waste Incineration','filter-bags-for-waste-incineration','With the acceleration of global urbanization, garbage pollution is serious. Improper garbage disposal may cause serious air, water and soil pollution and occupy a large amount of land. How to solve the garbage problem has attracted great attention from the whole society.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5221\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Waste-Incineration-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" />\r\n<h3>Features of Waste Incineration Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong>: These bags must withstand continuous exposure to temperatures ranging from 200°C to 260°C, and in some cases even higher.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical Resistance</strong>: Flue gases from waste incineration contain acidic and corrosive substances such as sulfur dioxide (SO₂), hydrochloric acid (HCl), and nitrogen oxides (NOₓ).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fine Particle Capture</strong>: Filter bags used for waste incineration need to capture ultrafine particulate matter (PM2.5) to prevent harmful pollutants from being released into the environment.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable and Long Life</strong>: Due to the harsh conditions of waste incineration, filter bags are designed to have a long service life, reducing the need for frequent replacement and maintenance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Materials and Performance</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance\">Temperature Resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Chemical Resistance\">Chemical Resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Strength\">Strength</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)\">PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 190℃- 200C\">Up to 190℃- 200℃</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent to acids, fair to alkalis\">Excellent to acids, fair to alkalis</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"P84 (Polyimide)\">P84 (Polyimide)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C\">Up to 260℃</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good to acids and alkalis\">Good to acids and alkalis</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Very High\">Very High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE (Teflon)\">PTFE (Teflon)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C\">Up to 260℃</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Outstanding to both acids and\">Outstanding to both acids andalkalis</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate\">Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fiberglass\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 260C\">Up to 260℃</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Moderate chemical resistance, can be enhanced with PTFE coating\">Moderate chemical resistance, can be enhanced with PTFE coating</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Nomex (Aramid)\">Nomex (Aramid)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 200℃\">Up to 200℃</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Good chemical resistance, moderate to acids, poor to alkalis\">Good chemical resistance, moderate to acids, poor to alkalis</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Ryton\">Ryton(Polyphenylene Sulfide – PPS)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Up to 190°C\">Up to 190°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Excellent chemical resistance\">Excellent chemical resistance</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High\">High</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Advantages of Philite® Dust Collection Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Meet emission standards: Effectively reduce particulate emissions and meet strict environmental regulations.</li>\r\n 	<li>Improve air quality: Helps prevent toxic substances and pollutants from entering the atmosphere.</li>\r\n 	<li>Energy efficiency: By capturing more particulate matter, waste incineration plants can operate more efficiently.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5222\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PTFE-dust-filter-bags-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"141\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5223\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PPS-filter-bag-factory-02-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"141\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5224\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PPS-dust-filter-bags-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"136\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5225\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PPS-filter-bag-factory-detail6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"135\" />','Filter bags used in waste incineration are designed to handle the high temperatures and corrosive gases produced during the combustion process. Their main function is to capture fine particulate matter, heavy metals, and other harmful substances from the flue gases emitted by waste incinerators, ensuring compliance with environmental regulations and reducing air pollution. High temperature resistant needle felt filter bags are widely used in waste incineration due to their heat resistance.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>PPS (Polyphenylene Sulfide) Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 (Polyimide) Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE (Teflon) Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex (Aramid) Needle Felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>PPS (Ryton) Needle Felt.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5217,'2024-12-06 22:35:26','2024-12-06 22:35:26'),(5227,'High Temperature Filter Bags','high-temperature-filter-bags','High temperature resistant dust bags can withstand high temperature environment up to 280 ℃. The high temperature tolerance of this material makes it an essential filter material for many high temperature industrial processes. For example, high temperature flue gas dust removal in steel, cement, glass and other industries. Our filter bags are suitable for flue gas filtration in chemical, steel, metallurgy, carbon black, power generation, cement, water treatment, waste incineration and other industrial furnaces.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5232\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coal-Filtration-detail1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"288\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5233\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cement-plant-filtration-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"288\" />\r\n<h3>Comparison of High Temperature Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<h4>1. Heat-resistance:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"294\" height=\"29\">Fabric</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">P84</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">FMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Max. operating temperature</td>\r\n<td>260℃</td>\r\n<td>260℃</td>\r\n<td>190℃</td>\r\n<td>204℃</td>\r\n<td>240℃</td>\r\n<td>240℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Instant temperature</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>220℃</td>\r\n<td>220℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>2. Acid and Alkali resistance:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"289\" height=\"29\">Fabric</td>\r\n<td width=\"124\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">P84</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td width=\"143\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">FMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Acid resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Alkali resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>3. Hydrolytic and Oxidation resistance:</h4>\r\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"289\" height=\"29\">Fabric</td>\r\n<td width=\"133\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">P84</td>\r\n<td width=\"110\">PPS</td>\r\n<td width=\"111\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td width=\"121\">FMS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Hydrolytic resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"29\">Oxidation resistance</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>4. Comparison of Prices</h3>\r\nPTFE ＞ P84 ＞ PPS ＞ Aramid ＞ FMS ＞ Fiberglass\r\n<h3>Choose Philite®</h3>\r\n<h3>Our Advantages</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Excellent Filtration Efficiency</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe high temperature resistant dust bag has excellent filtration efficiency and can effectively filter out tiny particles. The filtration efficiency of this material can reach more than 99.9%, which can effectively protect the environment and human health\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Corrosion resistance</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe high temperature resistant dust bag has good corrosion resistance and can withstand the erosion of corrosive substances such as acid and alkali.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long life</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe high temperature resistant dust bag has a long life and can be used for a long time in harsh environments such as high temperature and high pressure.','High temperature filter bags are designed for filtration systems operating in extreme high temperature environments. They are thermally stable, chemically resistant and durable.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Fabric: PTFE, P84, PPS, Aramid, Fiberglass, FMS.</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtration Precision:</strong> ≤30mg/nm<sup>3</sup> (laminating PTFE film, ≤5mg).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Size: </strong>Accept customization.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional Process:</strong> Sewing or hot welding.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5228,'2024-12-06 22:40:07','2024-12-06 22:40:07'),(5236,'Melt Blown Suction Filter Bags','melt-blown-suction-filter-bags','<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Multi-layer structure.</li>\r\n 	<li>Ultra-pure polypropylene microfibers ensure extremely high filtration efficiency.</li>\r\n 	<li>Deep structure gradient filtration, increase the filtration area and dirt holding capacity.</li>\r\n 	<li>Excellent Hydrophobic and lipophilic characteristics ensure fast oil absorption speed and large oil absorption.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Lubricating oil filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Circulating water and boiler condensate filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Degreasing water, electrophoretic paint filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Decolorizer filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Juice clarification, syrup filtration.</li>\r\n</ul>','The high precision oil absorption filter bag is made of polypropylene capillary fiber made by the latest melt—blowing process.\r\nThe special fiber of the product material and its unique deep structure make it have high impurity retention and good oil absorption performance. Our products adopt a three-layer structure design, the filtration efficiency is more than 99%, and the dirt holding capacity is up to 500g.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: PP (polypropylene).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Diameter</strong>: customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length</strong>: customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum operating temperature</strong>: &lt;90°C.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Recommended replacement pressure difference</strong>: &lt;1.2bar.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5237,'2024-12-06 22:41:36','2024-12-06 22:41:36'),(5240,'Needle Felt Filter Bags','needle-felt-filter-bags','Needle felt filter bags are common filter materials, usually used for liquid or gas filtration in industrial fields. They are made of synthetic fibers such as polyester and polypropylene through a needle punching process and have high filtration efficiency and durability. The structural feature of this filter bag is that the fibers are needle-punched into groups during processing to form a three-dimensional network structure, which makes the filter bag have better filtration performance and mechanical strength. They are widely used in chemical industry, food processing, pharmaceutical and other fields, and can be used to remove suspended particles, sediments, bacteria, etc.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5245\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cement-plant-filtration-detail1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"289\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5246\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Pulse-Jet-Filter-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"289\" />\r\n<h3>Materials for Needle Felt Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\r\n<h3>Materials</h3>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Gram Weight\r\n(g/)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Thickness\r\n(mm)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Property\r\nm³/·min</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Breaking Strength\r\n(N/5×20cm)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\">Breaking Elongation(10%)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Operate Temperature\r\n(ºC)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Warp</td>\r\n<td>Weft</td>\r\n<td>Warp</td>\r\n<td>Weft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyester needle felt</td>\r\n<td>500±5%</td>\r\n<td>1.8±10%</td>\r\n<td>12</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1200</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1600</td>\r\n<td>&lt;30</td>\r\n<td>&lt;45</td>\r\n<td>≤130</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyester anti-static needle felt</td>\r\n<td>500±5%</td>\r\n<td>1.8±10%</td>\r\n<td>12</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1000</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1600</td>\r\n<td>&lt;30</td>\r\n<td>&lt;45</td>\r\n<td>≤130</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Medium temperature needled felt</td>\r\n<td>700±5%</td>\r\n<td>2.2±10%</td>\r\n<td>8-12</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1000</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1500</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>≤170</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polypropylene filber needled felt</td>\r\n<td>500±5%</td>\r\n<td>2.1±10%</td>\r\n<td>12</td>\r\n<td>&gt;960</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1060</td>\r\n<td>&lt;35</td>\r\n<td>&lt;55</td>\r\n<td>≤90</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>FMS needle felt</td>\r\n<td>800±5%</td>\r\n<td>2.4-3.0</td>\r\n<td>8-15</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1800</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1800</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>≤260</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Nomex needle felt</td>\r\n<td>500±5%</td>\r\n<td>2.2±10%</td>\r\n<td>17</td>\r\n<td>&gt;800</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1200</td>\r\n<td>&lt;35</td>\r\n<td>&lt;55</td>\r\n<td>≤200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PPS needle felt</td>\r\n<td>500±5%</td>\r\n<td>1.8±10%</td>\r\n<td>15</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1200</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1300</td>\r\n<td>&lt;30</td>\r\n<td>&lt;30</td>\r\n<td>≤190</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>P84 needle felt</td>\r\n<td>850±5%</td>\r\n<td>3.5±10%</td>\r\n<td>8-15</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1800</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1800</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>≤220</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Glass fiber needle felt</td>\r\n<td>900±5%</td>\r\n<td>2.0±10%</td>\r\n<td>8-15</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1800</td>\r\n<td>&gt;1800</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>&lt;10</td>\r\n<td>≤300</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5247\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Needle-Punched-Filter-Felt-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" />\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Mining.</li>\r\n 	<li>Cement industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Metal industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Aluminum and non-ferrous metal industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Ceramic industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Quarrying.</li>\r\n 	<li>Plastic.</li>\r\n 	<li>Milk powder.</li>\r\n 	<li>Flour mill.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Professional Needle Felt Filter Bag Manufacturer – Philite®</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High temperature resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Acid &amp; alkali resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Abrasion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Good raw material.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can be customized.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5248\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/filter-bag-workshop-03-detail4_syy.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"428\" height=\"285\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5249\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Philite®-factory-10-detail5-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"422\" height=\"281\" />','<h4>Optional Materials</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Polypropylene needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Polyester needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>FMS needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>PPS (Polyphenylene Sulphide) Needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 (Polyimide) Needle felt.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene) needle felt.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5241,'2024-12-06 22:50:56','2024-12-06 22:50:57'),(5251,'Non-woven Needle Felt Liquid Filter Bags','non-woven-needle-felt-liquid-filter-bags','<h3>Product Fetures</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Tight structure, no fiber hairiness on the surface after heat treatment.</li>\r\n 	<li>Seamless fusion technology ensures no side leakage and nochemical release.</li>\r\n 	<li>Meet requirements of different working conditions, such as medium and low viscosity fluids.</li>\r\n 	<li>Effectively intercept various solid and soft particles at high flow rate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance Comparison</h3>\r\n<table width=\"1057\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"131\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">Operating Temperature   ℃/℉</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">Instant Temperature℃/℉</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">Abrasive Resistance</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\"> Hydrolytic Stability</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">Acid Resistance Alkali</td>\r\n<td width=\"101\">Alkali Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Oxidation Resistance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polypropylene</td>\r\n<td>80/176</td>\r\n<td>100/212</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Restricted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyester</td>\r\n<td>130/266</td>\r\n<td>150/302</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Nomex</td>\r\n<td>204/399</td>\r\n<td>240/464</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PTFE</td>\r\n<td>250/482</td>\r\n<td>300/572</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Standard Size for Liquid Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"56\">Model</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"82\">Filter Area&nbsp;\r\n\r\n(m²/pc)</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"68\">Volume&nbsp;\r\n\r\n(L)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"93\">Diameter</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"110\">Length</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">cm</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">inch</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">cm</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">inch</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"56\">#1</td>\r\n<td width=\"82\">0.19</td>\r\n<td width=\"68\">7.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">17.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">7</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">40.65</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">16</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"56\">#2</td>\r\n<td width=\"82\">0.41</td>\r\n<td width=\"68\">17.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">17.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">7</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">81.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">32</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"56\">#3</td>\r\n<td width=\"82\">0.05</td>\r\n<td width=\"68\">1.4</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">10.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">20.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">8.25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"56\">#4</td>\r\n<td width=\"82\">0.09</td>\r\n<td width=\"68\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">10.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"50\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"51\">35.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">14</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Membrane pre-security filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Amine filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Electrophoretic paint, plating solution filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Syrup filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Resin, solvent filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Circulating water filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Crude drug filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Lubricating oil filtration.</li>\r\n</ul>','Non-woven needle felt filter bags are kinds of economical filter bags. The product is suitable for low and medium viscosity liquid filtration, has a stable high filtration flow rate, can effectively intercept all kinds of soft and hard impurities, according to different filtration accuracy and filtration flow requirements.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: PE, PP, Aramid, PTFE, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Types of the seam of the bags</strong>: sewn, welded.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5252,'2024-12-06 22:52:28','2024-12-06 22:52:28'),(5257,'PTFE Membrane Filter Bags','ptfe-membrane-filter-bags','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5262\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/PTFE-Membrane-Dust-Filter-Bags-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"722\" />\r\n\r\nWhen traditional filter bags filter dust, the accumulated dust inside them often adheres to the primary layer cake. This is the main reason for the blockage phenomenon and the reduction of dust collector efficiency. The ordinary deep filter material becomes a surface filter through the film coating, and the dust is trapped on the surface of the filter material and cannot enter the inside of the filter material, which makes the ordinary filter material have a qualitative leap. PTFE (polytetrafluoroethylene) membrane is made of dispersed PTFE resin powder and stretched through a series of special processes. It has a fibrillar microporous structure with a porosity of more than 85%. There are 1.4 billion micropores per square centimeter and the pore size ranges from 0.02um to 1.5um. The membrane surface of the membrane filter bag replaces the traditional primary layer cake with a uniform and fine pore size, making the dust penetration rate close to zero. Because PTFE has many unique properties and biaxial stretching, it forms a multi-layer crossed fiber-node microstructure. Make it useful in dust filtration occasions.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5263\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/How-PTFE-Membrane-Filter-Bag-Work-detail2.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"520\" height=\"293\" />\r\n<h3>Main Advantage of PTFE Membrane Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High filtration efficiency</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe PTFE-coated dust filter bag can retain micron-level ultra-fine dust, especially PM2. 5 particles that are harmful to the human body. The efficiency is maintained at a high level and almost zero emission is achieved. At the same time, it can also be used for the recovery of ultra-fine particle products to reduce product consumption, achieve energy saving and emission reduction, and meet the requirements of emission standards.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>The running resistance is stable and easy to clean</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAlthough the resistance of the film-coated filter material is higher than that of the ordinary filter material at the beginning of use, as the operating time increases, the resistance will not increase rapidly with the extension of time, and the cleaning effect is good, the cleaning cycle is long, and the cleaning pressure is low, reducing the friction and friction coefficient between the dust and the filter material.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High air flux and long service life</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nBecause the surface of the film-coated filter material is smooth and water-repellent, the dust is thoroughly cleaned, and a high ventilation rate is always maintained, which better solves the contradiction between filtration and dust removal, thereby improving the service life of the filter bag. Polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) is known as “the king of plastics” for its excellent and unique properties. Under the situation that the world is paying more and more attention to environmental protection and sustainable development, the application of PTFE in bag filter media (bags) can be said to be in the ascendant and has broad application prospects. It is believed that various PTFE-based yarns and textiles, film and emulsion treatment agent and other new products will emerge one after another, laying a more solid foundation for the upgrading of bag filter bag products.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance Parameters</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Material</td>\r\n<td>Working\r\nTemperature</td>\r\n<td>Instant Temperature</td>\r\n<td>Abrasion Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Hydrolysis Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Acid Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Alkali Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Oxidation\r\nResistance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyprolene + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>90℃</td>\r\n<td>110℃</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Acrylic + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>120℃</td>\r\n<td>130℃</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyester + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>130℃</td>\r\n<td>150℃</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Poor</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PPS + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>180℃</td>\r\n<td>200℃</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Aramid + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>204℃</td>\r\n<td>220℃</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>P84 + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>240℃</td>\r\n<td>260℃</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Fiberglass + PTFE</td>\r\n<td>250℃</td>\r\n<td>280℃</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Middle</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Application of PTFE Membrane Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Industrial dust filtration</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nPTFE membrane filter bags can effectively remove pollutants, prevent harmful substances from contaminating the filter medium, protect the normal operation of the filter, and improve the performance of industrial filters.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Liquid filtration</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nPTFE membrane filter bags can effectively remove impurities in water, purify water quality, and meet people’s drinking needs.','PTFE Membrane filter bags have stable chemical corrosion resistance, better water repellency, oil repellency, and air permeability. The dust layer formed by filtration is easy to split, reducing the pressure difference and cleaning more thoroughly.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>We Supply:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Polyester filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>Polypropylene filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>Acrylic filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>PPS filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nomex filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 filter bags with PTFE membrane.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5258,'2024-12-06 22:55:17','2024-12-06 22:55:17'),(5265,'Pulse Jet Filter Bags','pulse-jet-filter-bags','Pulse jet bag filters are a common type of industrial dust collection equipment used to capture and filter airborne particles. It consists of one or more filter bags, each of which is mounted on a bracket and connected to a dust collector or dust collection system. These filter bags are usually made of fine filter material that can effectively capture particles of various sizes.  This type of filter is usually used in industrial environments that require efficient dust collection, such as steel plants, cement plants, chemical plants, etc.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5270\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Pulse-Jet-Filter-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"435\" height=\"435\" /> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5271\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bag-House-Filter-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"427\" />\r\n<h3>Working Principle</h3>\r\nThe working principle of pulse jet bag filter is to remove dust through pulse jet technology. When a certain amount of particulate matter accumulates on the surface of the filter bag, the injection system releases a burst of compressed air or gas to remove the particulate matter from the surface. This cleaning process is carried out along the length of or around the filter bag via a spray device to ensure complete removal.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5273\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Working-Principle-of-Pulse-Jet-Bag-Filter-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"868\" height=\"350\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3>Pulse Jet Filter Bags by Temperature</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Room Temperature Filter Bags</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe room temperature bag is mainly made of polyester, polypropylene, acrylic and other fibers through non-woven and textile technology. It has good air permeability, smooth surface, good dimensional stability, easy to peel off dust and other excellent performance. It is mainly used in dust removal and normal temperature flue gas treatment in industries where dust pollution occurs in general industrial enterprises.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Medium-temperature Filter Bags</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAt present, the common medium-temperature filter material is aramid fiber, PPS series fiber through the immersion, waterproof, anti-oil, anti-corrosion process, so as to achieve the desired effect.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High-temperature Filter Bags</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nHigh-temperature cloth bags are mainly made of high-strength fibers such as P84, expanded glass fiber and ultra-fine glass fiber, which are processed through spinning and non-woven processes. They are characterized by good thermal stability, high filtration efficiency and long service life. Mainly used in dust collectors under various high-temperature flue gas conditions.\r\n<h3>Material Selection</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Working Condition\">Working Condition</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weight (g/m? )\">Weight (g/m² )</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thickness (mm)\">Thickness (mm)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance (°C)\">Temperature Resistance (°C)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air permeability (L/ dm2* \'min)\">Air permeability (L/ dm2*min)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Continu es\">Continues</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Instant\">Instant</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" rowspan=\"4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Room Temperature 0~120C\">Room Temperature 0~120°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester\">Polyester</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"400-600\">400-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.5-2.1\">1.5-2.1</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"130\">130</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"150\">150</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester anti-static\">Polyester anti-static</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"400-600\">400-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.5-2.1\">1.5-2.1</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"130\">130</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"150\">150</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester water &amp; oil proof\">Polyester water &amp; oil proof</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"400-600\">400-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.5-2.1\">1.5-2.1</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"130\">130</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"150\">150</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester PTFE membrane\">Polyester PTFE membrane</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"400-600\">400-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.5-2.1\">1.5-2.1</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"130\">130</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"150\">150</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Medium Temperature 120~150°C\">Medium Temperature 120~150°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Acrylic\">Acrylic</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"500-600\">500-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2-2.5\">2-2.5</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140\">140</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"160\">160</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A9\" rowspan=\"6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"High Temperature 150~280°C\">High Temperature 150~280°C</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PPS\">PPS</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"450-600\">450-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.5-2.2\">1.5-2.2</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"170\">170</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"190\">190</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Aramid\">Aramid</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"450-600\">450-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.8-2.5\">1.8-2.5</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"204\">204</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"240\">240</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G10\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"PTFE\">PTFE</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"600-800\">600-800</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"1.2-1.5\">1.2-1.5</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"240\">240</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"260\">260</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G11\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"50-80\">50-80</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B12\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"P84\">P84</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C12\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"500-600\">500-600</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D12\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2.2-2.4\">2.2-2.4</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E12\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"260\">260</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F12\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"280\">280</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G12\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B13\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fiberglass composite\">Fiberglass composite</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C13\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"850-950\">850-950</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D13\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2.2-2.8\">2.2-2.8</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E13\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"260\">260</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F13\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"300\">300</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G13\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"140-200\">140-200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Fiberglass membrane woven cloth\">Fiberglass membrane woven cloth</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-C14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"750\">750</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-D14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"0.8\">0.8</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-E14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"260\">260</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-F14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"280\">280</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-G14\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"20-50\">20-50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5274\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Material-Selection-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"644\" />\r\n<h3>Choose Philite®</h3>\r\nPhilite® Pulse Jet Filter Bags use the latest technology, and our production capabilities coupled with our full-service approach allow us to provide reliable solutions to every customer, no matter where you are or what industry you are in!','Pulse jet filter bags are made of high-temperature-resistant and corrosion-resistant filter materials, which can effectively capture particles in the air and purify the gas being processed.\r\n\r\n<strong>It is usually made of the following materials:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Polyester material.</li>\r\n 	<li>PTFE membrane treatment.</li>\r\n 	<li>100% PTFE material.</li>\r\n 	<li>PPS material.</li>\r\n 	<li>P84 material.</li>\r\n 	<li>Aramid material.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fiberglass material.</li>\r\n 	<li>Polypropylene material.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5266,'2024-12-06 23:00:41','2024-12-06 23:01:16'),(5277,'Snap Band Filter Bags','snap-band-filter-bags','The snap band is a device used to secure and seal filter bags and is commonly used in equipment such as filters, vacuum cleaners and air purifiers. Its main functions include the following:\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Fixing the filter bag</strong>: The snap band fixes the filter bag to the filter element base or filter bag slot of the equipment to prevent the filter bag from loosening or falling off during operation of the equipment. This ensures that the filter bags work in the correct position and cannot be pulled away by air flow or suction forces.\nSealing performance: Dust filter bag snap bands are usually designed to provide good sealing performance. They ensure a tight fit at the connection points between the filter bag and the equipment, preventing air or dust from bypassing the filter bag and entering the interior of the equipment. This sealing performance is very important for the filtration effect of the equipment.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Prevent air leaks</strong>: In equipment such as vacuum cleaners and air purifiers, if the filter bags are not properly secured, air leaks may occur, which is when air, dust or dirt bypasses the filter bags and enters the interior of the equipment or returns to the indoor air. The purpose of the dust filter bag snap band is to ensure that the air inside the device flows through the filter bag, not around it.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Extended filter bag service life</strong>: By properly fixing the filter bag, the filter bag is prevented from being damaged or worn due to vibration or airflow impact while the equipment is running. This can extend the service life of the filter bag, reduce the frequency of replacement, and reduce maintenance costs.</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<h3>Snap Band Specifications</h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Optional materials</strong>: carbon steel snap band, stainless steel snap band.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Diameter</strong>: can be customized.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: can be customized.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: can be customized.</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<h3>Filte Bag Materials</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Material</td>\n<td>Working\nTemperature</td>\n<td>Instant Temperature</td>\n<td>Abrasion Resistance</td>\n<td>Hydrolysis Resistance</td>\n<td>Acid Resistance</td>\n<td>Alkali Resistance</td>\n<td>Oxidation\nResistance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polyprolene Needle Felt</td>\n<td>90℃</td>\n<td>110℃</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Acrylic Needle Felt</td>\n<td>120℃</td>\n<td>130℃</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polyester Needle Felt</td>\n<td>130℃</td>\n<td>150℃</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Poor</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Fair</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPS Needle Felt</td>\n<td>180℃</td>\n<td>200℃</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Fair</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aramid Needle Felt</td>\n<td>204℃</td>\n<td>220℃</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P84 Needle Felt</td>\n<td>240℃</td>\n<td>260℃</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PTFE Needle felt</td>\n<td>250℃</td>\n<td>280℃</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n<td>Excellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fiberglass Needle Felt</td>\n<td>250℃</td>\n<td>280℃</td>\n<td>Fair</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Middle</td>\n<td>Fair</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Woven Fiberglass Filter Cloth</td>\n<td>260℃</td>\n<td>280℃</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>Good</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Applications</h3>\n&nbsp;		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-content{width:100%}@media (min-width:768px){.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper,.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{display:flex}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:end;flex-direction:row-reverse}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:start;flex-direction:row}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-top .elementor-image-box-img{margin:auto}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-top .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-start}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-middle .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-bottom .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-end}}@media (max-width:767px){.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;margin-bottom:15px}}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-title a{color:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-description{margin:0}</style><figure><img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Life-science-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Life science</h3><p>Fisolution production methods and facilities are integrated to include verifiable traceability for life.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Chemical-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Chemical</h3><p>Polymers, Resin and Terpene derivatives, Naphthalenesulfonate, Precipitated Silica, Colours, Pigments, Fertilizers.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Mineral-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Mineral</h3><p>Alumina red mud management, cement, chalk, coal,concentrates & tailings (copper, gold, iron, silver, zinc, etc) gravel, gypsum, kaolin & clay, lithium, rare earths (cobalt, bismuth, uranium, etc.) titanium dioxide and many more.</p>','The design of the filter bag with snap band to facilitate the replacement and installation of the filter bag while ensuring sealing and filtration effect.\r\n\r\nDust bags are used in a large variety of applications and industries. Especially where dry powder particles need to be filtered from airflow and where particles aren’t allowed to enter the atmosphere. Whether it’s in the food industry or in the chemical,mineral &amp; environmental industry, we offers tailor-made solutions for all kinds of dust collector bags. Philite® offer a comprehensive range of filter bags for dust filtration systems in the milling industry On request, customized sizes are available In addition to the standard sizes. Philite® manufactures filter sleeves in styles to suit most models and types of dust collectors.Bags fabricated to specification from selected needlefelts and woven fabrics. Our vast range of available felts in various weights and surface treatments, combined with local state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities, allow us to offer you the best solution for your individual application.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5278,'2024-12-06 23:04:03','2024-12-06 23:07:33'),(5288,'Woven Fiberglass Filter Bags','woven-fiberglass-filter-bags','<h3>Specifications of Fiberglass Filter Cloths</h3>\r\n<strong>Weight</strong>: 350~900 g/m2\r\n<strong>Thickness</strong>: 0.3~0.9mm\r\n<strong>Air permeability</strong>: can be customized.\r\n<strong>Operating temperature</strong>: 260℃\r\n<strong>Instant: </strong>300℃\r\n<h3>Features</h3>\r\nFiberglass filter cloth has high covering capacity and good air permeability,thus providing higher filtration efficiency,lower filtration resistance.\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;\">Application</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5592\">Pipe Insulation</a>–High Temperature resistence.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5596\">High Temperature Insulation</a>–High Temperature resistence.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5599\">Insulation Enhancement</a>–Our products can be used in the field of insulation enhancement.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5604\">Insulation Rubber Tape</a>–Insulated rubber tape specifically refers to the tape used by electricians to prevent leakage and to provide insulation.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5607\">Screen Cloth</a>–Our products can be used to make screen cloth.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5610\">Aviation Material</a>–Aviation materials are the material guarantee for the development and production of aerospace products, and also the technical foundation for the aerospace products to achieve the desired performance, service life and reliability. It is very reliable to use our fiberglass filter cloth for aviation material.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5613\">Film Material</a>–The core of membrane technology is membranes. In general, the chemical properties and structure of the membrane have a decisive influence on the properties of the membrane separation. Therefore, it is required that the membrane material should have good film forming properties, chemical stability, resistance to acids, alkalis, oxides, and microorganisms.</li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?p=5616\">PTFE High Frequency Substrate</a>–Fiberglass filter cloth is widely used in PTFE high frequency substrate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Type</h3>\r\n<em><strong>According to the weaving method</strong></em><strong>:</strong>\r\n1. Flat Fiberglass Filter Cloth\r\n2.Textured Fiberglass Filter Cloth\r\n\r\n<strong><em>According to the yarn type</em>:</strong>\r\n1. Continuous yarn fiberglass filter cloth\r\n2. Bulk yarns fiberglass filter cloth\r\n<h3>Flat Fiberglass Filter Cloth compared with Textured Fiberglass Filter Cloth</h3>\r\nFlat fiberglass’s wearability, fastness is higher than the textured. While its elasticity, tenderness, glossiness is lower than the textured. Despite the differences, they share the <em>same price</em>.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5293\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/平纹和斜纹对比图-1-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"254\" />\r\n<h3>Continuous yarn filter cloth compared with bulk yarn fiberglass filter cloth</h3>\r\nBulk yarn fiberglass filter cloth is weaved by fluffy yarn, which is more permeable than the continuous yarn. Besides, it improves the de-dust efficiency which can up to more than 99.5% and the filtration speed can up to 0.6-0.8m/min. The price of bulk yarn fiberglass is <em>higher than</em> continuous yarn fiberglass filter cloth.\r\n<h3>Properties of Textured Fiberglass Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Type</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">EWTF450</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">EWTF550</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">EWTF800</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">CWTF450</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">CWTF550</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Weight (g/m2 )</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">450</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">550</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">800</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">450</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">550</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\">Tensile strength (N/25mm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"35\">warp</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＞1750</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＞2200</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＞2400</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">＞1700</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">＞1700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"160\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"35\">weft</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＞1000</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＞1500</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＞2100</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">＞1900</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">＞1200</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Permeability(cm/s)</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">20~55</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">15~35</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">10~30</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">20~40</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">20~40</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Service temperature(℃)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"182\">≤280</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"184\">≤260</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Recommended  air flow(m/min)</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"121\">＜0.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">＜0.7</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"184\">＜0.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"196\">Remark</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"5\" width=\"366\">Description include PSI、 FCA、 RH、 BI 、ST,width range 400-1000mm,filter bag diameter rangeΦ120-300mm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;','Philite® fiberglass woven filter bags is widely used for industrial dust collection because of its high covering capacity , good air permeability and high filtration efficiency. Woven fiberglass is great fabric for RABH filter bag, heat-resistance. What’s more, our products are all produced by DORNIER machine from German.\r\n\r\n<strong>Capacity</strong>:2000 m² per day.\r\n<strong>FAW</strong>: 200-850 gsm and other customized weight.\r\n<strong>Weave</strong>: plain, twill, satin.\r\n\r\n<strong>Optional Choice</strong>: <strong><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?product=pleated-filter-bags\">Pleated Filter Bag (Star Bag)</a></strong>\r\n\r\nThe main advantages and features:\r\n\r\n1. To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors ;\r\n\r\n2. System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance;\r\n\r\n3. Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5289,'2024-12-06 23:12:44','2024-12-08 19:39:23'),(5295,'Dust Collector Filter Bags','dust-collector-filter-bags','Philite® offers a complete line of replacement and custom designed dust collector bags to fit most manufactures’ filter bag housings. Our dust collector filter bags are carefully fabricated and sized to ensure ease of installation and change-out. These Filter bags are designed to be mounted and gasketed firmly into place with a snap band, corded cuff, or clamp to ensure a dust tight seal. Various coatings and finishes can be applied to either side of the dust collector bag to enhance cleaning and efficiencies, as well as prolonging service life. Groundwire, anti-collapse rings and other options can be easily incorporated into the filter bag construction. We can custom fabricate various types of attachments to work with your specific shaker mechanism, whether it’s a loop, eyelet, grommet or other device. The filter bags we supply are specifically refers to a parts for industry filtration. We can produce more than the following products and the feature and size is customizable. Feel free to send us email, With 6 years experience, we will meet and satisfy your need no matter how unusual your requirment is.\r\n<h4>Table of the performance of Filter bag:</h4>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"131\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">Operating Temperature℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">Instant Temperature℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">Abrasive Resistance</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\"> Hydrolytic Stability</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">Acid Resistance Alkali</td>\r\n<td width=\"101\">Alkali Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Inoxidizability</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polypropylene</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">90</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">110</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Homopolymer Acrylic</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">120</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">130</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyester</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">130</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">150</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Poor</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PPS</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">180</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">200</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Metamax</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">190</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">210</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>P84</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">220</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">260</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PTFE</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">250</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">280</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">260</td>\r\n<td align=\"left\">290</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Fair</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5301\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/air-filter-bag-2-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" />','Philite provides the complete range of filter bags for your baghouse and dust collection system in a wide variety of fabrics, finishes, styles and sizes.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Our capacity</strong>: 4000 per day (standard product)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional fabric</strong>: PE (Polyester), PP (Polypropylene), PA (Nylon), Aramid(Nomex), Acrylic, Fiberglass, PPS, PTFE, P84 and etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional process</strong>: Sewing or Hot sealing</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5296,'2024-12-06 23:15:59','2024-12-06 23:15:59'),(5304,'Baghouse Filter Bags','baghouse-filter-bags','Dust collector filter bags are an important component in equipment that captures dust and particulate matter in the air. They are installed in dust collectors to purify the air and prevent dust from being emitted into the environment by filtering particulate matter in the air. Choosing the correct baghouse filter will maximize performance, increase filter life, reduce system downtime and save your money. With so many different types of baghouse filter fabrics and treatments options to choose from, it’s important to know which is the best fit for your specific application.\r\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Working Principle of Baghouse Filter Bags</h3>\r\nThe working principle of the baghouse filter bags is to pass the gas containing particulate matter into the dust collector, and then capture the particulate matter through surface or deep filtration of the filter bag. Generally speaking, particulate matter will be trapped on the surface of the filter bag or on the filter media inside the filter bag when the air flows through the filter bag, while the clean gas is released through the filter bag.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5309\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Baghouse-Filter-Bag-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" />\r\n<h3>Customize Your Baghouse Filter Bags</h3>\r\nPhilite provides our customers with solutions not just the same old filters over and over again, but provides you with a free technical analysis and consultation to ensure you are getting the most out of your dust collector filters. The filter bags we supply are specifically refers to a parts for industry filtration. Philite provide the complete range of filter bags for your bag house and dust collection system in a wide variety of fabrics, finishes, styles and sizes.\r\n<h3>The Performance of Baghouse Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<table width=\"1057\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"131\">Types</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">Operating Temperature   ℃/℉</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">Instant Temperature℃/℉</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\">Abrasive Resistance</td>\r\n<td width=\"117\"> Hydrolytic Stability</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">Acid Resistance Alkali</td>\r\n<td width=\"101\">Alkali Resistance</td>\r\n<td>Oxidation Resistance</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polypropylene</td>\r\n<td>80/176</td>\r\n<td>100/212</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Restricted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Homopolymer Acrylic</td>\r\n<td>140/284</td>\r\n<td>160/320</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polyester</td>\r\n<td>130/266</td>\r\n<td>150/302</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PPS</td>\r\n<td>190/374</td>\r\n<td>220/428</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Nomex</td>\r\n<td>204/399</td>\r\n<td>240/464</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>P84</td>\r\n<td>260/500</td>\r\n<td>280/536</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PTFE</td>\r\n<td>250/482</td>\r\n<td>300/572</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n<td>Excellent</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Fiberglass</td>\r\n<td>240/464</td>\r\n<td>280/536</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Restricted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>FMS</td>\r\n<td>240/464</td>\r\n<td>280/536</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Moderate</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Good</td>\r\n<td>Restricted</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Applications of Baghouse Filter Bags</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Asphalt</strong> – Durable construction required for abrasive, high temp environments. Hotmix or batch plants, whether natural gas, waste oil, fuel oil, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cement – </strong>Filters for all areas of plant: kilns bag houses, silo bin vents, nuisance dust collection, etc. Our filters exceed all EPA emissions standards (NESHAP, CMAT, MACT for portland cement, PM2.5, etc.).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Chemical</strong> – Filter fabrics for acidic or alkali compounds, corrosive or abrasive elements, etc. (lime, calc, fertilizer, plastics, etc.) – Special treatments and fabrics available. We can advise on the best combination for performance and cost.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food Processing</strong> – FDA-approved food-grade fabrics construction available for dust collectors used in food production, transportation, and packaging such as dust collectors on milling equipment, blenders, mixers, granulators, grain elevators, storage silos, and more.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Foundry and Metal Products</strong> – Filters for units used on arc/induction furnaces, casting operations, and precious metal reclamation. Fabrics and coatings for use in high-temperature environments with the need for high-efficiency fume and smoke collection.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Power Generation and Industrial Boilers</strong> – Our filters exceed new EPA emissions regulations for boilers and power generation (Mercury and Air Toxics, Boiler MACT, NESHAPs, etc.). We have much experience working with biomass and coal power production facilities to overcome technical challenges to meet new EPA regulations. Filter fabrics and treatments include PPS, P84, PTFE/Teflon (fabric), fiberglass, and ePTFE membrane.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wood, Sand, and Minerals – </strong>Often requires filters with flame-resistant coatings, or constructed from non-flammable materials.<strong> </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5310\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bag-House-Filter-02-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"432\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5311\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Bag-House-Filter-03-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"431\" height=\"431\" />','Philite continually raises the bar in bag filter technology. Providing a wide range of filter bags for any bag house collector, which improve the performance, efficiency and bottom line of your bag house dust collectors and flue gas bags.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: 4000 per day (standard product).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Optional fabric</strong>: PE (Polyester), PP (Polypropylene), PA (Nylon), Aramid(Nomex), Acrylic, Fiberglass, PPS, PTFE, P84, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Finish Treatment</strong>: Singeing, Calendering, Heat Setting, Anti-static, Water&amp;Oil Repellent, PTFE Membrane, PTFE Impregnation and so on special treatment can be chosen</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Size</strong>: Customized.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Head</strong>: Groove snap, steel strip, endless felt, felt strip, spring ring, etc can be chosen.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Body</strong>: Sewing or Hot sealing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bag Bottom</strong>: Single or double bottom, with reinforcement or without reinforcement.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5305,'2024-12-06 23:19:46','2024-12-06 23:19:46'),(5314,'Woven Dust Collector Bag','woven-dust-collector-bag','Woven dust collector bags are made from woven fabrics including fiberglass, however felts are also used with cake release surfaces and chemical treatments. Felts offer greater flow at comparable efficiencies or higher efficiencies at comparable flows.\r\n<h2>Specifications:</h2>\r\n<table width=\"535\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Weight gsm</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Working temperature ℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Max temperature ℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"226\">Texture</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">350-800</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">260</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">280-300</td>\r\n<td width=\"226\">sloping weave,plain weave, satin, twill</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Advantages:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Good resistance to acid</li>\r\n 	<li>Performs best at high temperature</li>\r\n 	<li>Increase in air flow</li>\r\n 	<li>Decrease in pressure drop</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces maintenance and downtime</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>About the treatment:</h2>\r\nThe key to the optimum performances of the fiber glass woven dust collector bags lie in the application of the finish treatment. Without the finish treatment, the glass filaments in filtration fabrics are broken through abrasion caused by dust particles or chemical attack from the gas stream.  Woven cloth dust collector bag usually adopts laminated and non- laminated treatment. And both have silicone oil treatment and graphitization treatments.\r\n<h2>Application:</h2>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5319\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applicable-Industries-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"209\" height=\"139\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5320\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cement-plant-filtration-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"141\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5321\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coal-Filtration-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"140\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5322\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/gypsum-factory-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"140\" />','Woven dust collector bags are characterized by anti-collapse rings sewn onto the bag body to prevent the bag from collapsing when the flow is reversed. The majority of dust collector bags are 5”, 8” or11.5” diameter and may be as long as 35′-40′ overall. These bags are installed under tension to minimize movement. Sonic horns may also be used to assist dust release.\r\n<strong>Finish</strong>: laminated and non- laminated treatment. And both have silicone oil treatment and graphitization treatments.\r\nFree samples will be provided.\r\n\r\n<strong>Material available: </strong>Polyester/PTFE/P84/FIBERGLASS/NOMEX.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5315,'2024-12-06 23:24:46','2024-12-06 23:24:47'),(5324,'Woven Satin Filter Bag','woven-satin-filter-bag','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5327\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Satin-Weave-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" />\r\n\r\nWoven satin filter bags are made from woven fabrics including fiberglass, however felts are also used with cake release surfaces and chemical treatments. Felts offer greater flow at comparable efficiencies or higher efficiencies at comparable flows.\r\n<h4>Specifications</h4>\r\n<table width=\"535\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">Weight gsm</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">Working temperature ℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Max temperature ℃</td>\r\n<td width=\"226\">Texture</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"72\">350-800</td>\r\n<td width=\"114\">260</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">280-300</td>\r\n<td width=\"226\">sloping weave,plain weave, satin, twill</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h4>Advantages</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Good resistance to acid</li>\r\n 	<li>Performs best at high temperature</li>\r\n 	<li>Increase in air flow</li>\r\n 	<li>Decrease in pressure drop</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces maintenance and downtime</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>About the treatment</h4>\r\nThe key to the optimum performances of the fiber glass woven satin filter bags lie in the application of the finish treatment. Without the finish treatment, the glass filaments in filtration fabrics are broken through abrasion caused by dust particles or chemical attack from the gas stream.  Woven cloth satin filter bag usually adopts <em>laminating or non-non- laminated treatment, silicone oil treatment and graphitization treatments.</em>\r\n<h4>Application</h4>\r\nIt is usually used for reverse air bag house, which is for cement-kiln gas &amp; clinker, cement kiln head,waste incineration,carbon black, metal-aluminum metallurgy etc.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5319\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Applicable-Industries-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5320\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Cement-plant-filtration-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5321\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Coal-Filtration-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5322\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/gypsum-factory-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"150\" />','Woven satin filter bags are characterized by anti-collapse rings sewn onto the bag body to prevent the bag from collapsing when the flow is reversed. The majority of satin bags are 5”, 8” or11.5” diameter and may be as long as 35′-40′ overall. These bags are installed under tension to minimize movement. Sonic horns may also be used to assist dust release.\r\nFinish: laminated and non- laminated treatment. And both have silicone oil treatment and graphitization treatments.\r\nFree samples will be provided.\r\n<h4><a href=\"http://filter.philitee.com/?page_id=1831\">Ask for free sample or trial order, please click here.</a></h4>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5325,'2024-12-06 23:30:10','2024-12-06 23:30:10'),(5329,'Nonwoven Geotextile','nonwoven-geotextile','<h3>Key Features of Nonwoven Geotextile</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Strength &amp; Durability</strong>: Nonwoven geotextiles are strong and resistant to tearing and wear, providing long-term durability in soil stabilization applications.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtration</strong>: They act as filters, allowing water to pass through while preventing soil particles from washing away.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Drainage</strong>: Their porous nature facilitates water flow, making them suitable for drainage projects.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Separation</strong>: Used to separate different layers of materials, preventing mixing (e.g., soil from gravel or aggregate).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Reinforcement</strong>: They help improve the stability of soil and other materials by providing reinforcement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Applications of Nonwoven Geotextile</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resources Engineering</strong>: For constructing water reservoirs, canals, dams, and lining ponds, lakes, and wetlands to prevent seepage and maintain water quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Environmental Engineering</strong>: In landfill liners, wastewater lagoons, and sludge storage ponds to contain contaminants and prevent leakage into the environment.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Mining</strong>: As liners for tailings ponds, heap leach pads, and other mining waste containment structures.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Agriculture</strong>: For irrigation canals, water storage tanks, and ponds to conserve water and prevent evaporation.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Civil Engineering</strong>: In tunnel linings, underground structures, and retaining walls to provide waterproofing and structural support.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Oil and Gas</strong>: As liners for containment structures in oil and gas production, storage, and transportation facilities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5334\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Geotextile-Cloth-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" />\r\n<h3>Low Temperature Materials</h3>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">\r\n<td width=\"197\" height=\"19\"><strong>Base Material</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"415\" height=\"19\"><strong>Application</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"0\">Polyester Felt  (130℉-150℉)</td>\r\n<td>Cement Plant, Metal Industry, Chemical Industry</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Polypropylene Felt (90℉-120℉)</td>\r\n<td>Metal Industry, Chemical Industry</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>High Temperature Materials</h3>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">\r\n<td width=\"197\" height=\"19\"><strong>Base Material</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"362\" height=\"19\"><strong>Application</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"0\" height=\"0\">P84 Felt  (260℉-280℉)</td>\r\n<td>Aphalt Plant, Cement Plant, Coal-fired Boiler</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>PPS (190℉-210℉)</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\">Thermal Power Plant, Coal-fired Boiler</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Aramid Felt (204℉-250℉)</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\" height=\"0\">Asphalt Plant, Cement Plant, Metal Industry</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Special Materials</h3>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">\r\n<td width=\"197\" height=\"19\">Base Material</td>\r\n<td width=\"362\" height=\"19\">Application</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Homopolymer Felt (120℉-140℉)</td>\r\n<td>Waste Incinerators, Asphalt Plant, Coal Mill and Power Plant</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Anti-static (130℉-150℉)</td>\r\n<td>Cement Plant, Flour Plant, Metal Industry,  Chemical Industry</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Dimensions of Non Woven Geotextile Fabric</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"43\">Item</td>\r\n<td width=\"71\">No.</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">2</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">4</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">5</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">6</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">7</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">8</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">9</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">10</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">11</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Unit weight, g/m2</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">150</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">250</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">300</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">350</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">450</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">600</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">800</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Weight tolerance, %</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">-8</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">-8</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">-8</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">-8</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">-7</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">-7</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">-7</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">-7</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">-6</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">-6</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">-6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Thickness, ≥mm</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">1.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">1.7</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">2.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">2.4</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">2.7</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">3</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">3.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">3.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">4.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Break strength, ≥KN/m</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">2.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">4.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">6.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">8</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">9.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">11</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">12.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">14</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">16</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">19</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">25</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">CBR burst strength,≥KN</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">0.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">0.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">0.9</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">1.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">1.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">1.8</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">2.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">2.4</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">2.7</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">3.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">4</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Tear strength, ≥KN</td>\r\n<td width=\"39\">0.08</td>\r\n<td width=\"38\">0.12</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">0.16</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">0.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">0.24</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">0.28</td>\r\n<td width=\"40\">0.33</td>\r\n<td width=\"43\">0.38</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">0.42</td>\r\n<td width=\"44\">0.46</td>\r\n<td width=\"42\">0.6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Width tolerance, %</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"12\" width=\"453\">-0.5</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Break elongation, %</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"12\" width=\"453\">25-100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">EOS O90, mm</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"12\" width=\"453\">0.07-0.2</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"115\">Vertical permeability coefficient, cm/s</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"12\" width=\"453\">K×(10-1-10-3)K=1.0-9.9</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Premium Nonwoven Geotextile in Philite®</h3>\r\nElevate your engineering feats with our state-of-the-art geotextiles, designed to enhance the performance and longevity of your vital infrastructure projects. Ideal for a broad spectrum of applications, our products seamlessly integrate into highway, railway, dam, and reclamation endeavors, ensuring exceptional filtration, separation, drainage, and maintenance solutions. If you don’t know how to buy the right materials in a specific scenario, we can provide you with a reasonable construction plan to ensure that you buy the right materials and reduce waste of money and materials.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5335\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nonwoven-Geotextile-06-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"288\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5336\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nonwoven-Geotextile-08-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"288\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5337\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nonwoven-Geotextile-07-detail4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"289\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-5338\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Nonwoven-Geotextile-10-detail5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"288\" />','Nonwoven geotextiles are synthetic fabrics commonly used in civil engineering and construction projects for a variety of applications. They are made from synthetic fibers that are bonded together through methods like needle punching, heat bonding, or chemical bonding, rather than being woven.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weight/Mass</strong>: 100g/m2-1500g/m2 .</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: Within 8 m (1m-8m as request ).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Length</strong>: 50-100m/roll (as request).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Polyester, Polypropylene, P84, PPS, Aramid Needle Felt.5.Color: Black , white , grey , as your request.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Working Temperature</strong>: 130℉-300℉.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtration Efficiency</strong>: reach to 99.5 %.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Certificate</strong>: CE/ISO9001/ISO14001.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<em>Note: We can design and develop kinds of filter media to satisfy the complex and diverse working conditions.</em>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5330,'2024-12-07 20:02:09','2024-12-07 20:02:09'),(5340,'PP(Polypropylene) spunbond nonwoven fabric','pppolypropylene-spunbond-nonwoven-fabric','PP nonwoven fabric is a kind of fabric that does not require spinning and weaving. It just aligns or randomly stretches spun textile fibers or filaments to form a web structure, which is then reinforced by mechanical, thermal bonding or chemical methods.\r\n\r\nPP nonwoven fabric specifications: 9-220 grams, width 1.6 meters, 2.4 meters.\r\n<h3>PP nonwoven fabric features:</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>High strength, good high temperature resistance (can be used in the environment of 150 ℃ for a long time), aging resistance, UV resistance, high elongation, good stability and breathability, corrosion resistance, sound insulation, anti-scratch, non-toxic.</li>\r\n 	<li>Nonwoven fabrics break through the traditional textile principles, and have the characteristics of short process flow, fast production speed, high output, low cost, wide use, and multiple raw material sources.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3>Main uses of PP non-woven fabric</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Medical and health aspects: such as disposable medical supplies, masks, protective clothing, diapers, sanitary napkins, personal hygiene care products;</li>\r\n 	<li>Packaging materials and lining materials: such as various shopping bags, storage bags, packaging bags, household goods and lining materials;</li>\r\n 	<li>Agricultural covering materials: such as covering films for sun protection, insect protection, cold protection and heat preservation, moisture retention, etc., protective films for planting grasses, and harvest films, etc.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3>PP nonwoven product features</h3>\r\nPP nonwoven fabric is a new type of covering material with good air permeability, moisture absorption and light transmission, and it has the functions of cold insulation, anti-frost and anti-sunlight. And PP nonwoven fabric is light weight, corrosion resistance, long life (4-5 years), easy to use and store. The white nonwoven fabric can coordinate the microclimate of crop growth, especially the relationship between temperature, light and light transmission of open field or greenhouse seedlings in winter; in summer, it can prevent the quick evaporation of water in the seedbed, uneven seedlings, and the burn of seedlings such as vegetables and flowers caused by the sun exposure.\r\n\r\nMain feature:\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Light weight: Polypropylene resin is used as the main production raw material, the proportion is only 0.9, only three-fifths of cotton, fluffy and feel good.</li>\r\n 	<li>Soft: Composed of fine fibers (2-3D), light spot hot melt bonding molding. The finished product is moderately soft and comfortable.</li>\r\n 	<li>Water repellency and breathability: Polypropylene chips do not absorb water, and the moisture content is zero. The finished product has good water repellency. It is composed of 100% fiber with porosity, good air permeability, easy to keep the cloth dry and easy to wash.</li>\r\n 	<li>Non-toxic and non-irritating: The product is produced according to FDA food-grade raw materials, contains no other chemical ingredients, stable performance, non-toxic, non-odor, and does not irritate the skin.</li>\r\n 	<li>Antibacterial and anti-chemical agents: Polypropylene is a chemically blunt substance, which is mothproof, and can isolate the erosion of bacteria and insects in the liquid; antibacterial, alkali corrosion, and finished products do not affect the strength due to erosion.</li>\r\n 	<li>Antibacterial: The product has good water repellency, does not mold, and can isolate the erosion of bacteria and insects in the liquid, and does not mold.</li>\r\n 	<li>Good physical properties: It is made of polypropylene spinning directly into a net for thermal bonding. The strength of the product is better than that of ordinary spun fiber products, the strength is non-directional, and the strength in the vertical and horizontal directions is similar.</li>\r\n</ol>','PP spunbond nonwoven fabrics are widely used in medical, sanitary, industrial, agricultural, filtration, bedding, household products and various composite materials.\r\n\r\nPP nonwoven fabric specifications: 9-220 grams, width 1.6 meters, 2.4 meters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5341,'2024-12-07 20:04:20','2024-12-07 20:04:20'),(5345,'Rayon Staple Spunlace Nonwoven Fabric','rayon-staple-spunlace-nonwoven-fabric','<strong>Bonding And Softening Spunbonds</strong>\r\n\r\nThe combination of spunbond production and spunlacing is predestined for very high production speeds. The technical design of the Fleissner AquaJet drums is especially favorable for optimal dewatering, which is of decisive importance for high production speeds and the resulting centrifugal forces of the water to be removed.\r\n\r\nFleissner, in cooperation with Germany-based Reifenhäuser Reicofil, has successfully optimized spunlacing of lightweight spunbonds directly after spunbond formation. Much higher strengths have been achieved compared to normally calendered spunbonds with volumes or web thicknesses doubled. These nonwovens are characterized by a very soft touch. Together with other renowned European producers of spunbond lines, Fleissner also has developed spunlaced spunbond products.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5346,'2024-12-07 20:05:36','2024-12-07 20:05:36'),(5348,'Spunlace (hydroentanglement) Nonwoven Fabric','spunlace-hydroentanglement-nonwoven-fabric','<h2>Short describtion of the Spunlace(hydroentanglement) Nonwoven Fabric</h2>\r\nSpunlace is a new technology which using high pressure water jet to a fine one or more layers of fiber web, the fibers tangled with each other, so that the web can be reinforced and have a certain strength. Its wide range of sources of fiber raw material, can be polyester, nylon, polypropylene, bamboo fiber, wood pulp fiber, seaweed fiber.\r\n<h2>Weave</h2>\r\nPlain parallel products\r\n\r\nEmbossing parallel products（pearl Embossing parallel products，Fish Embossing parallel products）\r\n\r\n22 mesh parallel products\r\n\r\nSwirl marks products\r\n<h2>Features of spunlace(hydroentanglement) fabric</h2>\r\n1. Flexible entanglement, fiber does not affect the original features, does not damage the fibers\r\n2. Appearance closer than other traditional textile non-woven material\r\n3. High-strength, low fluff\r\n4. High moisture absorption, fast absorbent\r\n5. good ventilation\r\n6. soft, good drape\r\n7. The appearance of the pattern changing\r\n8. without adhesive reinforcement, washable\r\n<h2>Specification</h2>\r\n<table width=\"689\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Product</td>\r\n<td>White Color Non Woven Spunlace Fabric</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Material</td>\r\n<td>PE, cotton, acrylic, aramid, P84</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Color</td>\r\n<td>As per customer’s requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Width</td>\r\n<td>10-350cm or as per customer’s requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Length</td>\r\n<td>As per customer’s requirements</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>GSM</td>\r\n<td>30gsm-130gsm</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Style</td>\r\n<td>Parallel laying plain/ embossed/ mesh</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Technics</td>\r\n<td>Spunlaced</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Application</td>\r\n<td>Wet wipes for household, autos, pets, hospital, restaurant, hotels, industrial used</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Characteristics</td>\r\n<td>Mothproof, Eco-friendly, Non-toxic, Breathable, Anti-Bacteria</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Processing of the spunlace(hydroentanglement) fabric</h2>\r\n1.Precursor web formation\r\n2.Web entanglement\r\n3.Water circulation\r\n4.Web drying\r\n<h2>Applications</h2>\r\nSpunlace Nonwoven is a highly versatile process because it can be used to produce nonwovens with a broad range of end-use properties. These differences are achieved because of a wide range of fibers that are available and because of the broad range of possible parameter adjustments. The versatility of the Spunlace Nonwoven processes is seen as an advantage because this process can be used to combine conventionally formed webs with melt blown, spunbond webs, paper, other textiles and scrims in order to get a combination of properties that cannot be achieved by the use of a single web.\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Bacteria-proof Cloth</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Based on 100% Rayon. The extreme absorption with water and oily stuff are good for your convenience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>For our unique green earth, we adopt the recyclable material for protecting the environment.</li>\r\n 	<li>By special water-processed method, the fluffed cotton cannot easily float away</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to wash, quick dry, making a becteriaproof environment.</li>\r\n 	<li>No Starch, No fluorescence substance, and other chemical medicines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n2.Cleaning Cloth\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Based on 100% Rayon. The extreme absorption with water and oily stuff provides convenience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>For our unique green earth, we adopt the recyclable material for protecting the environment.</li>\r\n 	<li>By special water-processed method, the fluffed cotton cannot easily float away.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy to wash, quick dry, resulting in a bacteria-proof environment.</li>\r\n 	<li>No Starch, No fluorescence substance, and other chemical medicine.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n 	<li>Magic Towel</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Processed by the advanced high-pressure-water method, the magic towel has extreme absorption for water, oil stuff and so on. Definitely, it has no formaldehyde and gluey substances. That’s good for your health and convenience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Easy to carry out for picnic, travel, and even as promotion gifts. One can print their LOGO on the tag for advertisement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"4\">\r\n 	<li>Wet Tissue</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Processed by the advanced high-pressure-water method. The nonwoven spunlace has no Formaldehyde.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>No glue-like substance, tender the soft skin.</li>\r\n 	<li>For the refreshing experience, it is comfortable for body and parents like it.</li>\r\n 	<li>The wet tissue is used for make-up, make-up removal, and other facial applications. In fact, it is convenient all the day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"5\">\r\n 	<li>Make -up Cotton</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Hi-Tech Nonwoven Spunlace which has no any chemical substance, but does have a soft touch and is tender to baby skin.</li>\r\n 	<li>Saving the lotion and make-up cream. Best absorption, No fluffed cotton.</li>\r\n 	<li>Best use for make up, wiping lips-sticker, fingernail polish, glasses, leather, jewels, and so on.6.Car industry</li>\r\n 	<li>Car carpet ,mat series</li>\r\n 	<li>Suitcase decoration materials</li>\r\n 	<li>Car seat lining</li>\r\n</ul>','Filmeida using German machines to produce the Spunlace Nonwoven fabric, and our <a class=\"clickable js-inline-clickable\">daily</a> <a class=\"clickable js-inline-clickable\">production can up to 20000 pcs per day.\r\nWhole import machines can ensure the quality and the capacity, the size and the colours can be customized.</a>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5349,'2024-12-07 20:07:46','2024-12-07 20:07:46'),(5353,'MFL Rocker Arm Filter','mfl-rocker-arm-filter','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5355\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ES-MFL-Rocker-Arm-Filter-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"945\" height=\"498\" />\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The rocker arm bag filter is economical , with high pressure resistance and good sealing performance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fast, safe, simple, efficient, and highly productive.</li>\r\n 	<li>Filter bag support: electro-polished stainless steel porous support filter basket.</li>\r\n 	<li>Unique three-point filter bag fixing method ensures good sealing performance between the filter bag and the filter housing sealing performance.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-quality O-ring seal ensures convenient and reliable operation.</li>\r\n 	<li>Side entry and bottom exit, more thorough sewage discharge, tangential outlet, and ring bolt design.</li>\r\n 	<li>Standard mode is 2-