idth=\"78\">Neight weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"130\">24 kg ( 53 lb )</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">28 kg (62 lb )</td>\r\n<td width=\"134\">12.8 kg ( 28 lb )</td>\r\n<td width=\"135\">13.4 kg (29 lb )</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Typical Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Food and beverage sterilization and filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>High purity water terminal filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fine chemical product filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Wine filling and filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Electronics industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Petroleum, Automotive.</li>\r\n 	<li>Paper making.</li>\r\n 	<li>Pharmaceuticals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Our Factory</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5370\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filter-System-Factory-02-detail2-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"516\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5369\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filter-System-Factory-01-detail3-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"516\" />','<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Suggested flow</strong>: 40m³/h.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filter bag size</strong>: 01:φ180*420; 02:φ180*810 .</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum Temperatur</strong>e: 150℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum operating pressur</strong>e: 1.0 MPa.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Inlet and outlet</strong>: DIN/ANSI/BSP/NPT.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5373,'2024-12-07 20:18:01','2024-12-07 20:18:02'),(5378,'TF Top-inlet Filter','tf-top-inlet-filter','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5380\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ES-TF-Top-inlet-Filter-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"835\" height=\"469\" />\r\n<h3>Product Feature</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The curved head is inserted into the inlet, which reduces the pollution and facilitates cleaning.</li>\r\n 	<li>The top cover is a stainless steel precision casting formed as a whole;</li>\r\n 	<li>Sealing design to avoid leakage from side.</li>\r\n 	<li>There ar