</td>\r\n<td width=\"180\">Rc1/2″</td>\r\n<td width=\"192\">Rc1/2″</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">capacity</td>\r\n<td width=\"180\">28L</td>\r\n<td width=\"192\">17L</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"86\">Neight weight</td>\r\n<td width=\"180\">33 kg</td>\r\n<td width=\"192\">29 kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Typical Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Food and beverage sterilization and filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>High purity water terminal filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fine chemical product filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Wine filling and filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Electronics industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Petroleum, Automotive.</li>\r\n 	<li>Paper making.</li>\r\n 	<li>Pharmaceuticals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Our Factory</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5357\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filter-System-Factory-02-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"516\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5356\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Filter-System-Factory-01-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"516\" />','<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Suggested flow</strong>: 40m³/h.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filter bag size</strong>: 01:φ180*420; 02:φ180*810 .</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum Temperature</strong>: 150℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Maximum operating pressure</strong>: 1.0 MPa.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Inlet and outlet</strong>: DIN/ANSI/BSP/NPT.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5379,'2024-12-07 20:19:42','2024-12-07 20:19:42'),(5382,'DSF Series Brush Self-cleaning Filter','dsf-series-brush-self-cleaning-filter','DS brush-type self-cleaning filter is a fully automatic cleaning filter. A set of brushes is installed in the filter screen. The brushes are driven to rotate by a motor, and an electromagnetic drain valve is installed on the end cover of the filter. When cleaning, the signal from the differential pressure switch is transmitted to the control panel, the control p