width=\"41\">50-2’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">V :V-band clamp</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\">65-2-1/2’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">C: Tri Welded pipe</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\">80-3’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">S : Sanitary thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\">90-3-1/2’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\"> T:Quick installation clamp</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\">100-4’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Typical Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Food and beverage filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-purity water terminal filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Liquor\\ Wine canning filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Biopharmaceuticals.</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>CFA/CFD/CFE/CFF Series Sanitary Lliquid Filter</h3>\r\nCF series filter fully complies with the requirements of sanitation and GMP. It is a high-end liquid filter used in the field of life science. The structure has no hygienic dead angle and is easy to clean; the liquid is drained thoroughly and there is no concern about residual liquid: the polishing accuracy can reach up to 0.3um for filters below12 cores, electrolytic polishing can be performed at the same time as mechanical polishing, completely solving the problem of polishing dead angle. For some very harsh applications, the faceplate of the filter can be made detachable to achieve full-angle cleaning.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cylinder Connection</strong>: Flange (Ring bolt).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Sterilization</strong>: On-line or pressure cooker 121 C/30 min.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Operating Pressure</strong>: 0.6MPa/1.0MPa.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Operating Temperaures</strong>: 150℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pressure Gage</strong>: 1.5s quick installation.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Polishing Type</strong>: Mirror polishing/Electrolytic polishing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Polishing Accuracy</strong>: Mirror polishing; Electrolytic polishing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Vent Valve</strong>: Quick installation,inner aperture 4mm,connected to 8mm pipe.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5411,'2024-12-07 20:33:53','2024-12-07 20:33:53'),(5414,'CFS Series Cartridge Filter','cfs-series-cartridge-filter','<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Ultra high polishing grade, with an inner wall of up to 0.3 μ M; The outer wall reaches 0.4 μ m. Absolute hygiene level polishing, all series can choose electrolytic polishing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Venting Valve and drain valve: the threaded sleeve and the pagoda joint are disengaged,and the connected hose will no longer rotate when deflated and liquid is discharged.</li>\r\n 	<li>Effectively increase the inner diameter of the vent hole and the drain hole, and can be connected to 8mm pipe to increase efficiency:</li>\r\n 	<li>Using a new segmented clamp: 20% higher pressure resistance than ordinary,bear higher pressure.</li>\r\n 	<li>Strong clamp can be used when the pressure requirement is high , perfectly seal PTFE and the maximum pressure can up to 1.0Mpa.</li>\r\n 	<li>The legs of the filter are reinforced threads, not easy to slip and can withstand 100 times of use. And an adjustable screw is installed at the bottom of the support foot, which can adjust the height of the filter for easy use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Schematic Diagram</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5418\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFS-Series-Cartridge-Filter-03-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"929\" height=\"679\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>Model</strong>\r\n<table width=\"642\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"76\"><strong>Model</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"><strong>Length</strong> <strong>o</strong><strong>f</strong>&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>cartrid</strong><strong>ge</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"><strong>A(m/m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"><strong>B(m/m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"84\"><strong>C(m/m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"84\"><strong>D(m/m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"84\"><strong>E(m/m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"64\"><strong>Weight</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"76\">1RS1</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">10″</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">0101.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">79</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">81</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">345</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">205</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">4.5kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"76\">1RS2</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">20″</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">0101.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">79</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">81</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">595</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">205</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">6.0kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"76\">1RS3</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">30″</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">0101.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">79</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">81</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">845</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">205</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">7.5kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Sizing List</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\">ES</td>\r\n<td width=\"48\">CFS</td>\r\n<td width=\"49\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"49\">30</td>\r\n