r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\">40-40’’</td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">TA:Titanium alloy</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">B:BSP Thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\">B- -NBR</td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\">B:Duplex stainless steel</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">N: NPT Thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">V :V-band clamp</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">C: Tri Welded pipe</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\">S : Sanitary thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"40\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"48\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"49\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"106\"> T:Quick installation clamp</td>\r\n<td width=\"41\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"60\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"54\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"92\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Typical Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Electronics.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-purity water terminal filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Food and beverage filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Liquor\\Wine canning filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-purity water terminal filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fine chemical product filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Petroleum,Automobile.</li>\r\n 	<li>Paper making.</li>\r\n 	<li>Pharmacy.</li>\r\n</ul>','<h3>CFS Series Sanitary Liquid Filter</h3>\r\nCFS series is a single-core filter series in the sanitary liquid filter, it is a high-end sanitary filter with small flow rate. The filter design is fully complies with the requirements of sanitation and GMP. It is a high-end liquid filter for life science applications. The structure has no hygienic dead ends and is easy to clean. The liquid is drained thoroughly and there is no concern about residual liquid. Electrolytic polishing can also be selected at the same time as mechanical polishing, and the polishing accuracy can reach up to 0. 3um.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Operating Pressure</strong>: 0.6MPa.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Size of Filter Cartidge</strong>: 10″/120″ /30″.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Operating Temperaures</strong>: 1500℃.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Inlet &amp; Outlet</strong>: DINANSVBSP/NPT.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Polishing Type</strong>: Mirror polishing; Electrolytic polishing.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Polishing Accuracy</strong>: Mirror polishing; Electrolylic polishing.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5416,'2024-12-07 20:39:33','2024-12-07 20:39:33'),(5420,'CFT/CFH Series Cartridge Filter','cft-cfh-series-cartridge-filter','<h3>CFH Series Cartridge Filter</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5422\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFH-Series-Cartridge-Filter-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"435\" />\r\n<h3>CFT Series Cartridge Filter</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5423\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CFT-Series-Cartridge-Filter-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"435\" />\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Standard structural design, using carbon steel and stainless steel materials (304, 316L).</li>\r\n 	<li>Four pressure classes,cover all the industrial applications.</li>\r\n 	<li>Design standards can meet customer requirements.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rugged element mounting for simple prefiltration to sub micron removal.</li>\r\n 	<li>The closed cover of the filter tightly compresses the filter element to ensure reliable sealing of the filter element.</li>\r\n 	<li>Strict international design standards ensure safe operation under all operating conditions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fatal and carcinogenic high-risk liquids can be safely filtered without causing harm to operators.</li>\r\n 	<li>Slip bolt or quick-opening options available to reduce component replacement time.</li>\r\n 	<li>All-welded structure provides flexibility for customer’s modifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3>Typical Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>General Particle Filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Catalyst &amp; Soot Filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Membrane Prefiltration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Seawater filtration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3><strong>Model 01</strong></h3>\r\n<table width=\"658\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"80\"><strong>Model</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"39\"><strong>N1/N2</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"55\"><strong>N3</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"65\"><strong>N4/N5</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"55\"><strong>A(mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"55\"><strong><u>B(m</u></strong><strong>m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"56\"><strong>C(mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"55\"><strong>D(m)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"55\"><strong><u>E(</u></strong> <strong>mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"55\"><strong>F(mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"40\"><strong>G(mm)</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"47\"><strong>Volume</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<t