 width=\"107\">C: Tri Welded pipe</td>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"76\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"78\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"78\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"78\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"80\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"107\">S : Sanitary thread standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<h3>CFT/CFH Series Industrial Filter</h3>\r\nThe CFH series of standard design filters are all welded, robust and certified. 1 to 242 standard filter cartridges can be installed (filter diameter 2.5, port optional).\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pressure Grade</strong>: 0.6MPa, 1MPa, 1.6MPa, 2.5MPa.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Max Operating Temperaures</strong>: 150’C.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Housing Material</strong>: Carbon steel,316L stainless steel,304 stainless steel duplex steel and super duplex steel,</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Internal Material</strong>: Base on customer’s requirements.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Flange Gaskets</strong>: Nirnilie rubber, Viton rubber, EPDM, Fluorinatedethylene propylene.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5415,'2024-12-07 20:43:24','2024-12-07 20:43:24'),(5425,'SK Series Cartridge Filter','sk-series-cartridge-filter','<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Pre-filtration suitable for various applications.</li>\r\n 	<li>Various standard inlet and outlet forms are available for easy installation on the piping system.</li>\r\n 	<li>Mechanically polished perforated baskets make cleaning easier.</li>\r\n 	<li>Filtration accuracy is as low as 25 microns.</li>\r\n 	<li>The handle on the basket is convenient for installation and removal.</li>\r\n 	<li>Design pressure from 6bar-21bar.</li>\r\n 	<li>Filter materials are available in carbon steel, 304 stainless steel, 316 stainless steel and other specific materials.</li>\r\n 	<li>Appropriate sealing rings can be provided according to chemical compatibility and temperature range.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Typical Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Food and beverage sterilisation filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-purity water terminal filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fine chemical product filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Wine canning filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Liquor\\Wine canning filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Electronics.</li>\r\n 	<li>Petroleum, Automobile.</li>\r\n 	<li>Pulp and Paper.</li>\r\n 	<li>Pharmacy.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Schematic Diagram</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5427\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/SK-Series-Cartridge-Filter-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"407\" height=\"497\" />\r\n<h3>Technical Specification</h3>\r\n<table width=\"205\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Inlet and outlet dimensions</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"33\"><strong>L</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"33\"><strong>φ</strong><strong>D</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"33\"><strong>H</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"32\"><strong>H1</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">25</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">220</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">89</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">260</td>\r\n<td width=\"32\">160</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">32</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">220</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">89</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">270</td>\r\n<td width=\"32\">165</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">40</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">280</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">108</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">300</td>\r\n<td width=\"32\">180</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">50</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">280</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">133</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">300</td>\r\n<td width=\"32\">180</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">65</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">330</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">133</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">350</td>\r\n<td width=\"32\">220</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">80</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">340</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">159</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"32\">260</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"74\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">420</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">219</td>\r\n<td width=\"33\">470</td>\r\n<td widt