width=\"118\">S : Sanitary thread standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<h3>Applications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Biopharmaceuticals.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fine chemical industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>Printing and dyeing industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>The food industry.</li>\r\n 	<li>New energy industry.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5440,'2024-12-07 20:57:34','2024-12-07 20:57:34'),(5445,'ES-HPS DF Self-cleaning Filter','es-hps-df-self-cleaning-filter','<strong>The market value brought to you by “knife screen gap control technology”.</strong>\r\n\r\nThe impurities are easily embedded in the gaps of the filter screen when external scraper filters are filtering , and are ground into fine particles and enter the product, which will affect the quality and purity of the product. Based on this, we devoted ourselves to in-depth research, and designed the gap between the scraper and the mesh as an adjustable device of 0-300 microns, finally solved the problems of impurities embedded in the mesh, impurities grinding. etc., and ensured the purity and quality of the filtered products. The filtration accuracy range is 35-2000 microns, and the applicable viscosity is up to 100,000 centipoise.\r\n<h3>High-performance precision filter element-advantages:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Accuracy range 35-2000microns.</li>\r\n 	<li>Precise slit width on the surface, and the deviation is less than 5 microns.</li>\r\n 	<li>Filter housing is 304, 316L, excellent corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>V-shaped gap, not easy to block impurities, long-term stable flow.</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth outer and inner surfaces , easy to scrape off, minimal wear on the scraper.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can filter difficult impurities, such as oil sludge impurities,soft agglomerated impurities, etc.</li>\r\n 	<li>The surface is specially hardened and wear-resistant to prolong the service life.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-strength structure, when the pressure difference rises, the gap does not deform.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span id=\"more-31883\"></span><strong>HPS-DF filter has a number of customization and options to better meet customer requirements:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Jacket design, through the heat transfer oil or steam, to maintain the liquid temperature and Liquidity.</li>\r\n 	<li>Explosion-proof design, Air motor.</li>\r\n 	<li>Food-grade polishing on the inner surface of the filter,easier to clean.</li>\r\n 	<li>Heavy-duty scraper with spring compensation for ultra-high viscosity liquid filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li>Two choices :high-concentration spent liquor is discharged ,and dry-slag is discharged.</li>\r\n 	<li>Modular multi-connection combination meets high flow filtration requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\nPetrochemical, fine chemical, pharmaceutical chemical, oil, paper, resin, etc.\r\nApplicable liquid types : Wax, kerosene, monomer, polymer, citric acid, fermentation broth, chitosan, cosmetics, agarose (gel), silicone resin solution, soap, sorbitol, steroids, corn syrup, wet end aid adhesives, pigments, lubricants, coatings, resins, rubber, ethanol, mixed oils, edible oils, high temperature oils, fruit juices, diesel，etc.\r\n<h3>Technical Specification</h3>\r\n<table width=\"665\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Filter model</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">D F75</td>\r\n<td width=\"160\">D F 88</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">D F138</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Filter area(m²)</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">0.75</td>\r\n<td width=\"160\">0.88</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">1.38</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">volume(L)</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">130</td>\r\n<td width=\"160\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">330</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Inlet and outlet sizeDN100-DN 200</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">DN 50-DN100</td>\r\n<td width=\"160\">DN80-DN 150</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">DN80-DN 150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Size of the sewage discharge&nbsp;\r\n\r\noutlet</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">D N 50</td>\r\n<td width=\"160\">D N 50</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">D N 80</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Motor/air motor drive</td>\r\n<td width=\"161\">0.18kw/0.33hp</td>\r\n<td width=\"160\">0.18kw /0.5hf</td>\r\n<td width=\"159\">0.25kw/0.5hp</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Suitable liquids</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\"><strong>High viscosity liquid (&lt;100000cps), miscellaneous mass &lt;1000PPM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Filtration accuracy</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">20-2000 um</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Standard design pressure rating</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\"><strong>1.0Mpa, higher pressure can be customized</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Maximum design temperature</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\"><strong>0-200°C(depending on seal)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Cleaning differential pressure</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">0.05M pa</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Dropout voltage transmitter</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\"><strong>Differential pressure transmitters or pressure transmitters</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Inlet and outlet connection&nbsp;\r\n\r\nstandards</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">Flange, HG20592-2009 (standard design), HG20615-2009 (compatible with ANSIB16.5)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Filter type material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">Differential pressure transmitters or pressure transmitters</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Housing wetted material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">304/316L/CS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Scraper material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">304/316L</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Housing sealing material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">NBR Butadiene rubber (standard), VITON(FKM) fluorine rubber silicone rubber</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Filter element sealing material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">NBR/EPDM/VITON/ Silicone rubber /FEP coated silicone rubber</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Piston rod seal material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">NBR/PU Polyurethane /VIYON</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Blow down and slagging valve</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">Pneumatic ball valve, protection class IP65</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"185\">Public supply requirement</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"480\">380VAC,0.4-0.6Mpa clean and dry compressed air</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Sizing List</h3>\r\n<table width=\"491\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\">ES</td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-DF75</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">E</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">10</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">D</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\">Ever spring</td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">Housing type</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">material</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">Design pressure</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">Flange standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">inlet&amp;outlet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">DF75</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">E: S30408</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">06:0.6MPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">D:DIN/GB Flange Standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">040:DN40</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">DF88</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">SL:S31603</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">10:1.0MPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">A:ANSI Flange Standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">050:DN50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">DF100</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">C:CARON STEEL</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">16:1.6MPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">J:JIS(Japan)Flange Standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">080:DN80</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">TA:Titanium alloy</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">B:BSP Thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">100:DN100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">B:Duplex stainless steel</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">N: NPT Thread standard&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">V :V-band clamp</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">C: Tri Welded pipe&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">S : Sanitary thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>','<ul>\r\n 	<li>The self-cleaning operation mode of the innovative design of the HPS-DF series filter easily solves the problem of frequent clogging of traditional filters when filtering viscous materials and soft impurities. Material waste, it is very advantageous and more efficient to filter water with poor water quality and viscous materials such as adhesives, resins, polymers, and oils.</li>\r\n 	<li>HPS-DF filter is gradually replacing traditional manual filter in many fields such as vibrating screen, bag filter, basket filter and some recoil filter with its remarkable technical advantages and low operating cost.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5446,'2024-12-07 20:59:13','2024-12-07 20:59:13'),(5448,'ES-HPS-CF Self-cleaning Filter','es-hps-cf-self-cleaning-filter','Traditional filters filter sticky materials and soft impurities, which are prone to frequent clogging. Customers can only choose large filters or perform frequent backwashing, resulting in high investment, heavy workload, and serious material waste. The HPS-CF filter easily solves such problems with advanced self-cleaning operation, always maintaining the cleanliness of the filter element regularly and discharging high concentration impurities, reducing material waste. It has great advantages in filtering water with poor water quality and viscous materials such as adhesives, resins, polymers, and oils, with higher efficiency. The HPS-CF filter has a precision range of 20-500 microns for precise filtration. The product is suitable for filtering water and viscous liquids, with a viscosity of up to 800.000 CP. The HPS-CF high-efficiency scraper self-cleaning filter is designed and manufactured according to the standards of high performance, high quality, and high reliability, achieving world-class quality.\r\n<h3>V-Slot Filter Elements</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5450\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ES-HPS-CF-Self-cleaning-Filter-03-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"336\" height=\"265\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>HPS-CF series filters are equipped with top-qualityV-SLOT Wedge wire screen, which have the following outstanding advantages:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Accuracy range:50-500 microns</li>\r\n 	<li>Precise slit width on the surface, the deviation is less than 5 microns.</li>\r\n 	<li>Filter housing material is 316L, strong corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n 	<li>V-shaped gap, not easy to be stuck by impurities, long-term stable flow.</li>\r\n 	<li>Smooth outer surface , easy to scrape off, minimal wear on the scraper.</li>\r\n 	<li>Can filter difficult impurities, such as: sludge impurities, soft agglomerated impurities,etc.</li>\r\n 	<li>The surface is specially hardened and wear-resistant to prolong the service life.</li>\r\n 	<li>High-strength structure, when the pressure difference rises, the gap does not deform.</li>\r\n 	<li>Resistant to high-strength positive and negative pressure shocks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>ACS series self-cleaning control system</h3>\r\nHPS-CF filter is equipped with an ACS series automatic cleaning control system, which can control the efficient operation . If necessary, DCS remote real-time monitoring can also be realized after customization. The ACS control system has a pressure difference or timing cleaning control function. The pressure difference cleaning is suitable for most applications and is the most efficient cleaning mode. The pressure difference reflects the accumulation of filter cake on the inner surface of the filter element or the clogging of the filter element.\r\nWhen the set pressure difference value is reached, the self-cleaning action is started.The recommended cleaning pressure difference is 0.05MPA,which can be adjusted within the range of 0.01-01MPA according to the working conditions. Scheduled cleaning can be set between 0 ~ 24h, when the pressure difference mode fails , the time mode still works, which can be used as the ultimate safety protection, and the cleaning cycle setting should be close to the average cycle in the filter pressure difference cleaning mode.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5451\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ES-HPS-CF-Self-cleaning-Filter-04-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"199\" />\r\n\r\nThere are two types of differential pressure transmitters for the ACS control system. The differential pressure transmitter can output real-time differential pressure value with the highest sensitivity and reliability, which is convenient for DCS remote real-time monitoring; the special differential pressure switch adopted by RKS has high sensitivity and long-term reliability, and has two differential pressure set points, which can be set The fixed-point accuracy is ±0.005MPA, one is the cleaning differential pressure value (such as 0.05MPA),and the other can be used as an abnormal pressure differential value for alarming (such as 01MPA), which can be connected to DCS for remote monitoring.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5452\" src=\"http://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/ES-HPS-CF-Self-cleaning-Filter-02-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"318\" />\r\n<h3>Master Type</h3>\r\n<table width=\"427\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>Master type</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>HO11</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>H022</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>H034</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>HO75</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>H100</strong></td>\r\n<td width=\"61\"><strong>H136</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"61\">A</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">740</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">970</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">977</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1151</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1146</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1217</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"61\">B</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">219</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">219</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">250</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">500</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">650</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"61\">C</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1390</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1419</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1551</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1725</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1778</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">1914</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"61\">D</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">400</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">200</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">334</td>\r\n<td width=\"61\">400</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\nOil, Water treatment, Pulp and Paper, Petrochemical, Fine chemical, etc.Applicable liquid types : wax, kerosene, diesel oil, monomer, polymer, citric acid, fermentation broth, chitosan, cosmetics.agarose (gel), silicone resin solution, soap, sorbitol, steroid, cereal syrup, chemical additive, adhesives, pigments lubricant, paintresin, rubber, ethanol, mixed oil, edible oil, high temperature oil, fruit juice, etc.\r\n<table width=\"659\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Suitable liquid</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>Water and low viscosity liquid (&lt; 800,000cps)miscellaneous mass &lt;1000PPM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Filtration accuracy</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>50-500um</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Standard design pressure rating</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>1.0MPa,</strong><strong>higher pressure can be customized</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Maximum design temperature</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>0-200℃(</strong><strong>depending on seal</strong><strong>)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Filter area</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>0.11</strong><strong> square meter</strong><strong>-1.36</strong><strong>square meter</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Cleaning differential pressure</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>0.05MPa</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Dropout voltage&nbsp;\r\n\r\ntransmitter</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>Differential pressure transmitter or differential pressure switch</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Motor reducer</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>180W,three-phase,380V, protection class IP55,worm gear reduction bar</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Inlet and outlet connection standards</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>Flange,HG20592-2009(standard design),HG20615-2009(ANSI B16.5 compatible)</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Filter type material</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>V-SLOT slot metal filter element, material 316L</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Housing wetted&nbsp;\r\n\r\nmaterial</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>304、316L、CS</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Housing wetted&nbsp;\r\n\r\nmaterial</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\">304、316L</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Housing sealing&nbsp;\r\n\r\nmaterial</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>NBR butadiene rubber (standard), VITON (FKM) fluororubber</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Blow down valve</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>Pneumatic ball valve, protection class IP65</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Utility provisioning&nbsp;\r\n\r\nrequirements</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"526\"><strong>380VAC,0.4-0.6Mpa clean dry compressed air</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Filter master model</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">011</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">022</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">034</td>\r\n<td width=\"89\">075</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">100</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">136</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Filter area (sqm)</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">0.11</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">0.22</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">0.34</td>\r\n<td width=\"89\">0.75</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">1</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">1.36</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">volume (L)</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">16</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">30</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">50</td>\r\n<td width=\"89\">120</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">195</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">320</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Inlet and outlet dimensions</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">DN40-DN50</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">DN50-DN80</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">DN50-DN100</td>\r\n<td width=\"89\">DN65-DN100</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">DN80-DN125</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">DN100-DN150</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"134\">Blow down port size</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">DN40</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">DN40</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">DN50</td>\r\n<td width=\"89\">DN50</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">DN80</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">DN80</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Sizing List</h3>\r\n<table width=\"491\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\">ES</td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF011</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">E</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">10</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">D</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\">Ever spring</td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">Housing type</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">material</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">Design pressure</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">Flange standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">inlet&amp;outlet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF011&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">E: S30408</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">06:0.6MPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">D:DIN/GB Flange Standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">040:DN40</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF022&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">SL:S31603</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">10:1.0MPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">A:ANSI Flange Standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">050:DN50</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF034&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">C:CARON STEEL</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\">16:1.6MPa</td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">J:JIS(Japan)Flange Standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">080:DN80</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF075&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">TA:Titanium alloy</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">B:BSP Thread standard</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\">100:DN100</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF100&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\">B:Duplex stainless steel</td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">N: NPT Thread standard&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\">HPS-CF136&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">V :V-band clamp</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">C: Tri Welded pipe&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"59\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"81\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"73\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"83\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"77\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"118\">S : Sanitary thread standard</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;','The HPS-CF high-efficiency scraper self-cleaning filter automatically removes particle impurities on the surface of the filter element through mechanical scraping, and can continuously filter online. HPS-CF filters are gradually replacing traditional manual filters in many fields due to their significant technological advantages and low lifecycle costs, such as vibrating screens, bag filters, basket filters, and some backwash self-cleaning filters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5449,'2024-12-07 21:07:30','2024-12-07 21:07:30'),(5956,'Polyester Seamless Cloth','polyester-seamless-cloth','Polyester seamless tube/cloth which is used for reverse air dust filter bag. It usually with 6-8 steel rings in the middle of bag, it is widely used in steel plant. The seamless tube has the advantages of high strength, high filtration precision,\r\n\r\nExtremely large filtration area. The bag tube with diameter range: 65-380mm. The bag length which can reach 12 meters.\r\n<h2>Application:</h2>\r\nSteel plant\r\n<h2>Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>High size stability</li>\r\n 	<li>High strength</li>\r\n 	<li>Extremely large filtration area and lower pressure resistance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>Technical parameter:</h2>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-6119\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Technical-parameter.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"485\" height=\"214\" />','Polyester seamless tube/cloth which is used for reverse air dust filter bag. It usually with 6-8 steel rings in the middle of bag, it is widely used in steel plant.\r\n\r\nThe seamless tube has the advantages of high strength, high filtration precision,\r\n\r\nExtremely large filtration area and low pressure resistance.\r\n\r\n<strong>Capacity:</strong> 100 pcs/day\r\n\r\n<strong>Material:</strong> Polyester seamless tube\r\n\r\n<strong>Seamless tube diameter:</strong> 65-380mm\r\n\r\n<strong>Regular diameter</strong>: φ292，φ203，φ170，φ90，φ70\r\n\r\n<strong>Bag length</strong>: 8-12 meters\r\n\r\n<strong>Application:</strong> Steel plant',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',5957,'2024-12-15 13:16:28','2025-01-26 22:44:55'),(6062,'Cotton Filter Cloth','cotton-filter-cloth','<h3>Advantages of Cotton Filter Cloth</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Absorbency</strong>: Cotton has a high absorbency rate, making it useful in applications where liquid filtration is necessary.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Breathability</strong>: Cotton is breathable, which can be beneficial for applications requiring air filtration.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Softness</strong>: It is soft and gentle, which can be essential when filtering delicate materials or substances.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Biodegradability</strong>: Being a natural fiber, cotton is biodegradable and environmentally friendly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Notes</strong>: Cotton filter cloth is not as durable or resistant to chemicals and extreme temperatures as synthetic materials such as polyester or polypropylene, however. It is typically used in less severe conditions where durability and abrasion resistance are not as important.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Common Application of Cotton Filter Cloth</h3>\r\nCotton filter cloths are widely used in various filtration processes due to their natural fiber properties, strength, and versatility. Some common applications include:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Industrial Filtration</strong>: Cotton filter cloth is commonly used in industries such as mining, chemicals, food processing, and pharmaceuticals for separating solid particles from liquids. The cloth can be used in baghouses, dust collection systems, and filter presses to capture dust, debris, or other particulate matter.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Treatment</strong>: In water purification and sewage treatment, cotton filter cloths are employed to remove suspended solids, algae, and other contaminants from water. Their high absorbency and filtration efficiency make them ideal for this purpose.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Oil &amp; Gas Industry</strong>: Cotton filter cloths are used in the filtration of oils, fuels, and other liquids in the oil and gas sector. They help remove particulate matter and other impurities from lubricants and crude oils.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Food and Beverage Processing</strong>: In the food and beverage industry, cotton filter cloths are used for filtering liquids like juices, oils, syrups, and brewing liquids. They help maintain product quality by ensuring clarity and removing unwanted particles.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Pharmaceutical Applications</strong>: In pharmaceutical manufacturing, cotton filter cloths can be used for the filtration of various liquids, such as solvents, extracts, and other raw materials, to ensure purity and compliance with regulatory standards.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Textile Industry</strong>: In textile manufacturing, cotton filter cloth is used in dyeing and finishing processes to filter impurities from the chemicals used in these operations.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Air Filtration</strong>: Used in ventilation and air-conditioning systems, cotton filter cloths can capture dust, pollen, and other airborne particulates, improving indoor air quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dust Collection</strong>: In factories where heavy dust is produced (such as cement, coal, and wood industries), cotton filter cloths.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<strong>Philite® is a professional filter cloth manufacturer in China, providing high quality cotton filter cloth. The products are widely used in aerospace, chemical industry, petroleum, large-scale power generation equipment, machinery, metallurgy, electrical insulation, construction and other fields. Depending on specific filtration requirements, these cotton cloths can be customized with varying thickness, porosity, and chemical resistance, making them a versatile material for a wide range of industrial applications.</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-6066\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Cotton-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-d1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"243\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-6067\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Cotton-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-d2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"243\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-6068\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Cotton-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-d3_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"243\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-6069\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Cotton-Filter-Cloth-Manufacturer-d4_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"243\" />\r\n<h3>Tips</h3>\r\nBefore you choose the cotton filter cloth, please let us know your temperature, humid, dust diameter, gas chemical properties, dust abrasive, filter’s mechanical parameters and so on,therefore our technical personnel or our professional sales can advice the most suitable filter cloth for you.','Cotton filter cloth is a fabric made from cotton fibers, often used in filtration applications due to its natural, breathable, and absorbent qualities. It is commonly used in industries such as textiles, food and beverage, pharmaceuticals, and chemical processing for filtering solids from liquids or gases. Well-known for its filter media, Philite® cotton filter cloth is an ideal material for industrial use, a wide range of Industrial cotton filter fabric are manufactured consciously for sophisticated and large filtering systems.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: 100% cotton.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Color</strong>: Raw.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 1.00-2.50mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 300-1600 gsm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Width</strong>: 600- 2200mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Elongation Shrinkage</strong>: Warp 3%, Weft 1.5%.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Packag</strong>e: 50-100 meters per roll.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Filtering</strong> : 0.5-100micron.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weave</strong>: Plain, twill, satin.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Recommended Maximum</strong>: 130ºC.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWe welcome customized order and free samples are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',6063,'2025-01-26 20:34:28','2025-01-26 20:34:28'),(6071,'Basalt Filter Cloth','basalt-filter-cloth','<h3>Basalt Fiber Cloth with Excellent Functional Properties</h3><ul><li><strong>High strength</strong>: Basalt fiber cloth has high strength and can meet the needs of a variety of structural materials.</li><li><strong>High temperature resistance</strong>: Basalt fiber cloth has excellent high temperature resistance, short-term temperature resistance can reach more than 1000℃, and can be used for a long time in a temperature environment of 760℃. It is an ideal material to replace asbestos and glass fiber cloth.</li><li><strong>Flame retardant</strong>: Basalt fiber cloth has permanent flame retardancy, is not easy to burn, and does not produce harmful gases during combustion.</li><li><strong>Insulation</strong>: Basalt fiber cloth has good electrical insulation properties and is suitable for electrical insulation.</li><li><strong>Weather resistance</strong>: Basalt fiber cloth can maintain stable performance even in a strong ultraviolet environment.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Types of Basalt Filter Cloth</h3><p>Compared with glass fiber, basalt fiber fabric is a material with higher tensile strength. Although its weaving property is slightly worse than that of carbon fiber, it is still a good alternative due to its low price and environmental protection. The structure of basalt filter cloth fiber fabric mainly depends on its weaving method. Common weaving structures include:</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Plain-Weave-d1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Plain weave</h3><p>It is interwoven with one warp yarn and one weft yarn. The fibers cross more and constrain each other, making the fabric stronger and more wear-resistant.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/twill-weave-d2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Twill weave</h3><p>It is woven by one warp yarn through two weft yarns, which has a three-dimensional sense and is often used for decorative products.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Satin-Weave-d3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Satin weave</h3><p>One warp yarn passes through three or more weft yarns, with a higher density, but the strength is slightly lower than plain weave and twill.</p>		\n		<h3>Technical Parameter of Basalt Filter Cloth</h3><table width=\"502\"><colgroup> <col width=\"72\" /> <col width=\"72\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td width=\"259\">Permanent Flame Retardant</td><td width=\"231\">The limiting oxygen index(Lois)&gt;70</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">High Softening Temperature</td><td width=\"231\">&gt;960ºC</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The Using High Temperature</td><td width=\"231\">&gt;650ºC</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The Using Low Temperature</td><td width=\"231\">&gt;-269ºC</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The High Breaking Tenacity</td><td width=\"231\">3500-4800Mpa(Now above 2500)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The Low Breaking Tenacity</td><td width=\"231\">3.1%(normally between 2%-3.5%)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The High Modulus of Elasticity</td><td width=\"231\"> 1X104kg/mm2</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The Material Density</td><td width=\"231\">2.7g/cm3</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The Low Coefficient of Heat Conduction</td><td width=\"231\">0.035W/m.K</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The High Absorption Coefficient</td><td width=\"231\">&gt;0.95</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The Low Hygroscopicity</td><td width=\"231\">0.001</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">The High Volume Resistivity</td><td width=\"231\">1×1012Ω.m</td></tr><tr><td width=\"259\">Anti Radiation Lead Equivalent</td><td width=\"231\">0.0073mmPb</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Applications</h3><ul><li><strong>Dust Filtration</strong>: Basalt filter cloth is commonly used in dust collection systems, particularly in industries like cement, steel, and power generation, where fine particulate matter needs to be captured efficiently.</li><li><strong>Air and Gas Filtration</strong>: Suitable for air filtration systems, especially in high-temperature environments.</li><li><strong>Liquid Filtration</strong>: Used in certain liquid filtration processes, especially where high resistance to chemicals and temperature is required.</li><li><strong>Industrial Exhaust Systems</strong>: Ideal for filtering flue gases and exhaust from industrial processes.</li></ul>','Basalt filter cloth is an excellent material for filtration applications, known for its high temperature resistance, durability and chemical stability. The fine weave of basalt fiber provides effective filtration, trapping small particles while allowing air or liquid to pass through. It is often used in industrial environments where traditional materials do not perform well. It not only has perfect high temperature resistance, but also can be completely degraded, and is an environmentally friendly industrial material. Philite® focuses on filtration solutions, we are a professional manufacturer of various filtration products.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Basalt Fiber Cloth.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 0.1mm-0.9mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weave</strong>: plain, twill, satin.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Packing</strong>: Roll.</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',6072,'2025-01-26 20:41:39','2025-01-26 20:59:13'),(6095,'Kevlar Filter Cloth','kevlar-filter-cloth','<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-6100\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kevlar-Fiber-Cloth-d1_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"243\" /> <img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-6101\" src=\"https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kevlar-Fiber-Cloth-d2_syy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"243\" />\r\n<h3>Product Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The pore size is uniform and the filtration efficiency reaches 99%.</li>\r\n 	<li>High strength, excellent resistance to sprint, cutting resistance and other physical and\r\nmechanical properties.</li>\r\n 	<li>After special treatment, the filter cloth has a smooth surface and good air\r\npermeability, and the filter cake is easy to peel and dust easily.</li>\r\n 	<li>The long-term working temperature is 330 DEG C, and the instant high temperature\r\ncan reach 500 centigrade.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long service life. Not easily deformed and can be cleaned and used again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Item Name\">Item Name</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Aramid Kevlar Special Filter Cloth\">Aramid/Kevlar Filter Cloth</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weave type\">Weave type</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"2/2 Twill\">2/2 Twill</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weight (g/m2)\">Weight (g/m2)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"480±10\">480±10</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Width(cm)\">Width(cm)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"165; (can be customzied)\">165 (can be customzied)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Treatment\">Treatment</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B5\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Heat-setting+calendering\">Heat-setting+calendering</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air permeability (@127pa)\">Air permeability (@127pa)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B6\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"25-45\">25-45</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Warp Tensile strength (N/m2)\">Warp Tensile strength (N/m2)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B7\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"≥7000\">≥7000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weft Tensile strength(N/m2)\">Weft Tensile strength(N/m2)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B8\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"≥7000\">≥7000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-A9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"0.3-0.5μDust Filtrationefficiency(%)\">0.3-0.5μDust Filtrationefficiency(%)</td>\r\n<td id=\"sjs-B9\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"99%\">99%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Applications</h3>\r\nKevlar filter cloth is an excellent choice for high-temperature, high-mechanical-stress filtration applications that require durability and resistance to extreme conditions. Industries like cement, steel, chemical processing, and power generation particularly benefit from the superior properties of Kevlar.','Kevlar filter fabric is a high-performance filter material recognized for its outstanding strength, heat resistance, and durability, making it an excellent choice for demanding filtration applications, particularly in industries that require high mechanical strength and high temperature resistance.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Anti-Bacteria</li>\r\n 	<li>Anti-Pull</li>\r\n 	<li>Anti-Static</li>\r\n 	<li>Breathable</li>\r\n 	<li>Sustainable</li>\r\n 	<li>Shrink-Resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>Tear-Resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>Flame Retardant</li>\r\n</ul>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'publish',6096,'2025-01-26 21:48:52','2025-01-26 21:50:35');
